<node id="Utilization of Phosphogypsum in Building Products">
  <data key="d0">Utilization of Phosphogypsum in Building Products</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">A 2008 study by Degirmenci N. exploring the use of raw and calcined phosphogypsum in manufacturing construction materials.&lt;SEP&gt;A 2008 study by Degirmenci N. exploring the use of raw and calcined phosphogypsum in manufacturing construction materials.&lt;SEP&gt;A 2008 study by Degirmenci N. exploring the use of raw and calcined phosphogypsum in manufacturing construction materials.</data>
