  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">A 2010 study by Dias N.M.P. et al. examining the radiological consequences of applying phosphogypsum in agriculture.&lt;SEP&gt;A 2010 study by Dias N.M.P. et al. examining the radiological consequences of applying phosphogypsum in agriculture.&lt;SEP&gt;A 2010 study by Dias N.M.P. et al. examining the radiological consequences of applying phosphogypsum in agriculture.</data>
