<node id="Carbon Dioxide Sequestration">
  <data key="d0">Carbon Dioxide Sequestration</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Carbon dioxide sequestration is an environmental process targeted by modified mineral carbonation techniques using phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Carbon dioxide sequestration is an environmental process targeted by modified mineral carbonation techniques using phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Carbon dioxide sequestration is an environmental process targeted by modified mineral carbonation techniques using phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Carbon dioxide sequestration is an environmental process explored through the mineral carbonation of industrial byproduct gypsum.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-054</data>
