</node>
<node id="El Zrelli, R.">
  <data key="d0">El Zrelli, R.</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">El Zrelli, R. is a researcher who co-authored a 2019 study on radiation hazard assessment of industrial wastes in Tunisia.&lt;SEP&gt;El Zrelli, R. is a researcher who conducted natural radioactivity and radiation hazard assessments of industrial wastes in Gabes.&lt;SEP&gt;El Zrelli, R. is a researcher who conducted natural radioactivity and radiation hazard assessments of industrial wastes in Gabes.&lt;SEP&gt;El Zrelli, R. is a co-author of a 2019 study on natural radioactivity and radiation hazard assessment in Gabes, Tunisia.&lt;SEP&gt;El Zrelli, R. is a researcher who conducted natural radioactivity and radiation hazard assessments of industrial wastes in Gabes.&lt;SEP&gt;El Zrelli, R. is a primary author of the research article on natural radioactivity and radiation hazard assessment.&lt;SEP&gt;El Zrelli, R. is a researcher who assessed heavy metal contamination and phosphogypsum foam transport in Tunisia.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-026&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-025&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-026&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-025&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-025&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-026&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-038</data>
