  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Tunisia">
  <data key="d0">Tunisia</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">Tunisia is a North African country situated along the southern Mediterranean Sea, encompassing the Gulf of Gabes and the Sfax-Agareb region. It serves as a major global production hub for phosphogypsum, generating approximately 10.0 million tons annually and accounting for 6.24% of worldwide production and reserves. As the primary geographic origin for the phosphorite ores utilized in this process, Tunisia hosts numerous phosphate fertilizer factories and coastal treatment plants, establishing it as a critical industrial and scientific context for studying this byproduct. Tunisian phosphogypsum samples are extensively characterized for their chemical composition, frequently appearing in analytical data with weight percentages around 42 percent, and are noted for a high "others" column value of 21.18, indicating significant impurities.

Scientific research in Tunisia frequently examines the radionuclide content and chemical properties of phosphogypsum, as documented by studies such as Zrelli et al. (2018), which are frequently referenced in associated research data tables. Investigations include estimating radon-222 exposure levels in treatment facilities and developing experimental rooms using phosphogypsum-based brick mixtures to monitor radon emissions. Additionally, the material is being evaluated for its characterization and valorization in clay bricks. Environmentally, Tunisia is a focal point for assessing the ecological footprint of its phosphate industry. The Gulf of Gabes and surrounding coastal areas have been extensively monitored for industrial pollution and heavy metal contamination, which have documented adverse effects on local marine ecosystems. The Sfax-Agareb region has been the subject of targeted studies on groundwater contamination originating from phosphogypsum stacks and leachate, alongside research into the impacts of phosphogypsum piles on local soil bacteria and wild plant life. Consequently, Tunisia remains a vital region for evaluating the practical and technical challenges of phosphogypsum handling, analyzing the environmental impacts of its storage, developing management solutions, and formulating ecological strategies to mitigate the consequences of phosphate processing.&lt;SEP&gt;Tunisia is a major producer of phosphogypsum, with treatment focuses differing based on local national conditions.&lt;SEP&gt;Tunisia is a country included in the trace element content analysis of phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Tunisia is a main producing country that stockpiles phosphogypsum and partly uses it in cement manufacture.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-026&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-026&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-020&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-028&lt;SEP&gt;doc-34a3ac199714be8fd1cdff8ead90fc92-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-026&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-025&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-024&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-043&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-042&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-276f29345df37143fc224a22d0f6089b-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-70650e5cb032fce744763706d8701e36-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-046&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-037&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-050&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-047&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-038&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c2674917fb6c60e75303effeaa10768e-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7797768798fcd1152bdc10ff73139e35-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-030&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-021&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a5d09b48f57a4e888bb729aaf988c936-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-042&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-044&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-043&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ac8d630b9aa4d874707445e2552a09-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ac8d630b9aa4d874707445e2552a09-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ac8d630b9aa4d874707445e2552a09-chunk-003</data>
