<node id="Building Materials">
  <data key="d0">Building Materials</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Building Materials constitute a fundamental category of construction products designed for structural and functional use within the built environment. They represent the primary global industrial application sector and utilization pathway for phosphogypsum (PG), encompassing its purified, processed, and derivative forms, alongside other industrial ashes. In this context, PG is incorporated as a primary constituent, additive, or raw material to manufacture a diverse range of substances, including cement, bricks, gypsum blocks, boards, cement mortar, cement-stabilized PG, plaster, and cement retarders. This high-volume application supports closed-loop resource utilization, effectively alleviating material shortages, reducing industrial waste, enhancing material properties, and promoting sustainable practices.

Despite the technical viability and resource efficiency of PG-based Building Materials, their commercial deployment encounters notable market constraints. Regional demand limitations and public perception concerns regarding safety and environmental impact frequently hinder widespread adoption. Because these construction products frequently incorporate industrial byproducts, they function as the primary context for rigorous radioactivity and safety evaluations. Manufacturing processes require continuous monitoring to prevent the release of radioactivity into the environment. Comprehensive assessments include Radium Equivalent (Ra-Eq) calculations, radon-222 emanation power analyses, and structural property evaluations. These measures are essential to ensure that final products comply with established safety protocols and regulatory standards before market distribution.&lt;SEP&gt;Building materials represent the primary application field for phosphogypsum utilization in China and globally.&lt;SEP&gt;Building materials are the application domain for phosphogypsum, where impurity levels significantly affect structural properties.&lt;SEP&gt;A traditional application field for phosphogypsum that is no longer considered a long-term solution due to low added value.&lt;SEP&gt;A key utilization product for phosphogypsum, promoted in Hubei, Yichang, and Yunnan provinces.&lt;SEP&gt;A product category where a small percentage of phosphogypsum is currently recycled.&lt;SEP&gt;Construction products that utilize phosphogypsum as a binding material or component.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-001fe856b0d193d82422dc8a5baedc86-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-80bac46661a7d25358c897f5feccea99-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-401b567da916dc34559e0bfe5a5b367b-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-34a3ac199714be8fd1cdff8ead90fc92-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-34a3ac199714be8fd1cdff8ead90fc92-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-34a3ac199714be8fd1cdff8ead90fc92-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-276f29345df37143fc224a22d0f6089b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1adcb38defdd04a271ddba318999ba67-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-70650e5cb032fce744763706d8701e36-chunk-023&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-027&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-030&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-050&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-049&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7797768798fcd1152bdc10ff73139e35-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a5d09b48f57a4e888bb729aaf988c936-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a5d09b48f57a4e888bb729aaf988c936-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a5d09b48f57a4e888bb729aaf988c936-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a5d09b48f57a4e888bb729aaf988c936-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-035&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ac8d630b9aa4d874707445e2552a09-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ac8d630b9aa4d874707445e2552a09-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ac8d630b9aa4d874707445e2552a09-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ac8d630b9aa4d874707445e2552a09-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-afe70f2d82515df80906bf3babd4e4eb-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-160a0fe95f7c82b193c6af751106ab6d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b19ca721a4da4422ee10228d88a4c292-chunk-017</data>
