<node id="PG-Sulfur Polymer Cements">
  <data key="d0">PG-Sulfur Polymer Cements</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">PG-Sulfur Polymer Cements are a novel material prepared by microencapsulating Phosphogypsum into a sulfur polymer matrix.&lt;SEP&gt;PG-Sulfur Polymer Cements are a novel material prepared by microencapsulating Phosphogypsum into a sulfur polymer matrix.&lt;SEP&gt;PG-Sulfur Polymer Cements are a novel material prepared by microencapsulating Phosphogypsum into a sulfur polymer matrix.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-005</data>
