</node>
<node id="Environmental Protection">
  <data key="d0">Environmental Protection</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Environmental Protection serves as a critical framework for managing industrial byproducts, mitigating ecological hazards, and advancing sustainable resource recovery. A significant application of these principles involves the management and utilization of phosphogypsum, which is heavily constrained by environmental protection awareness due to the material's potential radiological and chemical hazards. Overcoming these limitations necessitates targeted government support to facilitate technological and regulatory breakthroughs. Simultaneously, environmental protection objectives are actively realized through the extraction of rare and precious heavy metals from solid wastes, effectively transforming waste streams into valuable resource reserves.

The scope of the field also extends to comprehensive pollution control research and policy development. This is evidenced by academic publications, including a 2022 study that outlines policies and countermeasures for total phosphorus pollution control in the Yangtze River Basin. Collectively, these initiatives demonstrate how Environmental Protection integrates hazard mitigation, circular economy practices, and targeted scientific research to address complex environmental challenges.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a5d09b48f57a4e888bb729aaf988c936-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ac8d630b9aa4d874707445e2552a09-chunk-016</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1791772487</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Chemical Raw Materials">
  <data key="d0">Chemical Raw Materials</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Chemical Raw Materials represent a primary application pathway and major utilization domain for phosphogypsum, a byproduct characterized by its high calcium and sulfur content. This sector serves as a critical field for resource recovery, transforming phosphogypsum into valuable industrial inputs through targeted chemical processing. By leveraging the mineral composition of phosphogypsum, this application domain effectively converts a typically discarded material into essential chemical resources.

The processing of phosphogypsum within this sector yields a range of industrial products, most notably sulfuric acid and potassium sulfate, along with various other chemical compounds. These synthesized materials function as fundamental industrial inputs for diverse manufacturing and production activities. Consequently, the Chemical Raw Materials sector plays a vital role in sustainable resource management by establishing a closed-loop utilization pathway that maximizes the economic and industrial value of phosphogypsum.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-34a3ac199714be8fd1cdff8ead90fc92-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-34a3ac199714be8fd1cdff8ead90fc92-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-34a3ac199714be8fd1cdff8ead90fc92-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1791119751</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Sulfur Polymer Matrix">
  <data key="d0">Sulfur Polymer Matrix</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">The Sulfur Polymer Matrix is a specialized polymer material engineered to function as a secure encapsulating and containment medium. Its primary role involves the microencapsulation of phosphogypsum, effectively isolating the substance within a stable polymeric barrier. This process is specifically designed to manage the material's properties while preparing it for downstream applications and scientific analysis.

The encapsulation serves two distinct purposes. First, it enables the integration of phosphogypsum into the synthesis of specialized polymer cements, facilitating advanced industrial and construction uses. Second, it provides a controlled environment for the physico-chemical and radiological characterization of the phosphogypsum, ensuring accurate assessment of its composition and safety profile. Through these functions, the Sulfur Polymer Matrix supports both the practical utilization and rigorous scientific evaluation of the encapsulated material.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7797768798fcd1152bdc10ff73139e35-chunk-013</data>
