<node id="Two-Step Leaching Method">
  <data key="d0">Two-Step Leaching Method</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Two-Step Leaching Method is a chemical extraction technique developed to concentrate rare earths from phosphogypsum waste.&lt;SEP&gt;Two-Step Leaching Method is a chemical extraction technique developed to concentrate rare earths from phosphogypsum waste.&lt;SEP&gt;Two-step leaching is a hydrometallurgical process used to concentrate rare earths from phosphogypsum waste.&lt;SEP&gt;Two-Step Leaching Method is a chemical extraction technique developed to concentrate rare earths from phosphogypsum waste.&lt;SEP&gt;The Two-Step Leaching Method is a technique used to concentrate rare earths from phosphogypsum waste.</data>
