<node id="α-Calcium Sulfate Hemihydrate">
  <data key="d0">α-Calcium Sulfate Hemihydrate</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">α-Calcium Sulfate Hemihydrate is a synthesized compound prepared from phosphogypsum under controlled aqueous and atmospheric conditions.&lt;SEP&gt;α-Calcium Sulfate Hemihydrate is a synthesized compound prepared from phosphogypsum under controlled aqueous and atmospheric conditions.&lt;SEP&gt;α-Calcium Sulfate Hemihydrate is a synthesized compound prepared from phosphogypsum under controlled aqueous and atmospheric conditions.&lt;SEP&gt;α-Calcium sulfate hemihydrate is a high-value calcium sulfate product synthesized from phosphogypsum using semi-liquid methods.</data>
