<node id="HDPE">
  <data key="d0">HDPE</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">HDPE is a polymer material that incorporates nano-CaSO4 derived from phosphogypsum for industrial applications.&lt;SEP&gt;HDPE is a polymer material that incorporates nano-CaSO4 derived from phosphogypsum for industrial applications.&lt;SEP&gt;HDPE is a polymer material that incorporates nano-CaSO4 derived from phosphogypsum for industrial applications.</data>
