<node id="Loess Stabilization">
  <data key="d0">Loess Stabilization</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Loess Stabilization is a construction technique utilizing cement, waste phosphogypsum, fly ash, and quicklime for self-compacting rammed earth.&lt;SEP&gt;Loess Stabilization is a construction technique utilizing cement, waste phosphogypsum, fly ash, and quicklime for self-compacting rammed earth.&lt;SEP&gt;Loess Stabilization is a construction technique utilizing cement, waste phosphogypsum, fly ash, and quicklime for self-compacting rammed earth.</data>
