<node id="Radioactive Pollution">
  <data key="d0">Radioactive Pollution</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Radioactive Pollution refers to environmental contamination assessed in salt-marsh ecosystems adjacent to phosphogypsum storage systems.&lt;SEP&gt;Radioactive Pollution refers to environmental contamination assessed in salt-marsh ecosystems adjacent to phosphogypsum storage systems.&lt;SEP&gt;Radioactive Pollution refers to environmental contamination assessed in salt-marsh ecosystems adjacent to phosphogypsum storage systems.&lt;SEP&gt;Radioactive Pollution is an environmental risk associated with large-scale land-based phosphogypsum storage.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-032</data>
