  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Goodenough, K.M. is a lead author who provided an overview of Europe's rare earth element resource potential and geodynamic settings.&lt;SEP&gt;Goodenough, K.M. is a lead author who provided an overview of Europe's rare earth element resource potential and geodynamic settings.&lt;SEP&gt;Goodenough, K.M. is a lead author who provided an overview of Europe's rare earth element resource potential and geodynamic settings.</data>
