<node id="Hammas-Nasri, I.">
  <data key="d0">Hammas-Nasri, I.</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Hammas-Nasri, I. is a lead author who developed a two-step leaching method to concentrate rare earths from phosphogypsum waste.&lt;SEP&gt;Hammas-Nasri, I. is a lead author who developed a two-step leaching method to concentrate rare earths from phosphogypsum waste.&lt;SEP&gt;Hammas-Nasri, I. is a lead author of a 2019 study on producing rare earth concentrates using NaCl and Na2CO3 solutions.&lt;SEP&gt;Hammas-Nasri, I. is a lead author who developed a two-step leaching method to concentrate rare earths from phosphogypsum waste.&lt;SEP&gt;Hammas-Nasri, I. is a researcher who investigated rare earth concentration from phosphogypsum waste using a two-step leaching method.</data>
