  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Non-food crop soil is a type of agricultural land suitable for the application of treated phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Non-food crop soil is a type of agricultural land suitable for the application of treated phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Non-food crop soil is a type of agricultural land suitable for the application of treated phosphogypsum.</data>
