<node id="Sodium dodecyl benzene sulfonate">
  <data key="d0">Sodium dodecyl benzene sulfonate</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Sodium dodecyl benzene sulfonate is a surfactant used to modify phosphogypsum for heavy metal adsorption.&lt;SEP&gt;Sodium dodecyl benzene sulfonate is a surfactant used to modify phosphogypsum for heavy metal adsorption.&lt;SEP&gt;Sodium dodecyl benzene sulfonate is a surfactant used to modify phosphogypsum for heavy metal adsorption.</data>
