<node id="SO2">
  <data key="d0">SO2</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">SO2 is a gas produced from the reductive decomposition of phosphogypsum with high-sulfur-concentration coal.&lt;SEP&gt;SO2 is a gas produced from the reductive decomposition of phosphogypsum with high-sulfur-concentration coal.&lt;SEP&gt;SO2 is a gaseous product facilitated by Fe and improved by Ni.&lt;SEP&gt;SO2 is a gas produced from the reductive decomposition of phosphogypsum with high-sulfur-concentration coal.&lt;SEP&gt;SO2 is an air emission listed in the emissions table.&lt;SEP&gt;Sulfur dioxide emissions measured in kilograms for the PBG and PSC process scenarios.&lt;SEP&gt;SO2 is a product generated from the reductive decomposition of phosphogypsum using high-sulfur-concentration coal.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-025&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-025&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-025&lt;SEP&gt;doc-276f29345df37143fc224a22d0f6089b-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-276f29345df37143fc224a22d0f6089b-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-055</data>
