  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Cr(VI) is a heavy metal ion extracted via crystal regulation of gypsum using hydrothermal treatment.&lt;SEP&gt;Cr(VI) is a heavy metal ion extracted via crystal regulation of gypsum using hydrothermal treatment.&lt;SEP&gt;Cr(VI) is a heavy metal ion extracted via crystal regulation of gypsum using hydrothermal treatment.</data>
