<node id="Cemented paste backfill">
  <data key="d0">Cemented paste backfill</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Cemented paste backfill is a construction material prepared using recycled flue gas desulfurisation gypsum and phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Cemented paste backfill is a construction material prepared using recycled flue gas desulfurisation gypsum and phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Cemented paste backfill is a solid waste remediation technology that uses phosphogypsum as an alternative aggregate.&lt;SEP&gt;Cemented paste backfill is a construction material prepared using recycled flue gas desulfurisation gypsum and phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Cemented paste backfill is a construction application utilizing recycled phosphogypsum and demolition waste.&lt;SEP&gt;Cemented paste backfill is an application utilizing phosphogypsum and phosphate tailings in mining or construction.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-025&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-025&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-025&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c2674917fb6c60e75303effeaa10768e-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3fd8439e859e3dd0c96328384e1761f0-chunk-016</data>
