<node id="Calcium Aluminum Silicate Hydroxide">
  <data key="d0">Calcium Aluminum Silicate Hydroxide</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">A solid mineral phase that reacts with water in a hydrolysis reaction to release ions and compounds.&lt;SEP&gt;Calcium Aluminum Silicate Hydroxide is a solid complex compound acting as a reactant in the hydrolysis equation, likely an impurity phase in phosphogypsum.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-028&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-028</data>
