<node id="Salt Marshes">
  <data key="d0">Salt Marshes</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">Salt marshes are coastal ecosystems where phosphogypsum application creates a barrier effect against radionuclide migration.&lt;SEP&gt;Salt marshes are coastal ecosystems where phosphogypsum application creates a barrier effect against radionuclide migration.&lt;SEP&gt;Salt marshes are coastal ecosystems where phosphogypsum application creates a barrier effect against radionuclide migration.&lt;SEP&gt;Salt marshes are coastal ecosystems where the radioactive impact of phosphogypsum piles was evaluated.</data>
