<node id="Plants">
  <data key="d0">Plants</data>
  <data key="d1">creature</data>
  <data key="d2">Plants are terrestrial biological organisms that function as active compartments within soil and environmental systems. They are frequently evaluated for their physiological and ecological responses to soil amended with phosphogypsum, highlighting their role in assessing soil quality and remediation strategies. As integral components of biogeochemical cycles, Plants actively uptake and interact with a wide range of substances from their surrounding environments. This includes the absorption of total phosphorus during its migration and transformation processes, as well as the accumulation of trace elements and various radionuclides, particularly those from the uranium series, directly from soil environments.

Beyond soil uptake, Plants play a significant role in atmospheric and ecological dynamics. They are involved in the volatilization and subsequent leaf accumulation of fluorine, demonstrating their capacity to influence trace gas exchange and elemental cycling. Furthermore, through processes such as leaf shedding and biomass decomposition, Plants contribute to atmospheric dust deposition, thereby linking terrestrial biological activity with broader atmospheric particulate distribution.

In addition to their ecological and environmental functions, Plants serve practical industrial and resource recovery purposes. They are recognized as a viable biological source for the extraction of hydroxyapatite, a calcium phosphate compound with significant applications in materials science and biotechnology. Collectively, these characteristics underscore the multifaceted role of Plants in environmental monitoring, biogeochemical cycling, and sustainable resource extraction.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-025&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-045&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0a5563c80c4fd1f68b4442f73621a281-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-70650e5cb032fce744763706d8701e36-chunk-022&lt;SEP&gt;doc-afe70f2d82515df80906bf3babd4e4eb-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1791900207</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
