<node id="Thermal Treatment">
  <data key="d0">Thermal Treatment</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Thermal Treatment is a high-temperature processing technique primarily utilized for material synthesis and the modification of various mineral and industrial materials. As a widely adopted standard method, it is extensively applied to phosphogypsum and phosphate ores to fundamentally alter their physical, chemical, and structural properties. When directed at phosphogypsum, the heating process induces dehydration, eliminates water of crystallization, removes phosphorus pentoxide (P2O5) and other components, and triggers phase transitions and decomposition. These transformations restructure the material, often evidenced by distinct shifts in observed analytical peaks, and are strategically employed to enhance crystallinity and homogeneity prior to downstream operations such as peeling.

Beyond phosphogypsum processing, Thermal Treatment demonstrates significant versatility in specialized mineral processing and material synthesis workflows. It is strategically deployed to concentrate valuable elements and optimize material composition. For example, when applied to calcined washed beneficiated solids, the process actively promotes the crystallization of calcium fluoride. In rare earth extraction flowsheets, it is typically implemented following washing stages to substantially increase the concentration of rare earth elements within the final concentrate. The technique is also specifically utilized on HAP samples, where a standardized protocol of heating at 400 °C for 30 minutes is applied to modify properties, alter morphology, evaluate morphological stability, and improve structural homogeneity. Despite its broad industrial utility, the implementation of Thermal Treatment is frequently constrained by significant operational bottlenecks, most notably high energy consumption and the release of volatile components during processing.&lt;SEP&gt;Thermal treatment is a processing method applied to phosphogypsum to alter its properties for use in Portland slag cement.&lt;SEP&gt;A process involving heating phosphogypsum to remove impurities, free water, and volatile components for industrial reuse.&lt;SEP&gt;Thermal treatment is a pretreatment process used to remove impurities from phosphogypsum.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-26bca3d4f742299ce2dbcd6381558f89-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-26bca3d4f742299ce2dbcd6381558f89-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-030&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a4d02158bbc770d7c6bd9657b3f3defc-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a4d02158bbc770d7c6bd9657b3f3defc-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a4d02158bbc770d7c6bd9657b3f3defc-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a4d02158bbc770d7c6bd9657b3f3defc-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8c22d31cfad5421c936a23705a3bc6e0-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8c22d31cfad5421c936a23705a3bc6e0-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8c22d31cfad5421c936a23705a3bc6e0-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7797768798fcd1152bdc10ff73139e35-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ac8d630b9aa4d874707445e2552a09-chunk-005</data>
