  <data key="d2">The construction industry drives the increasing demand for building materials, prompting the exploration of phosphogypsum as a sustainable substitute.&lt;SEP&gt;The construction industry drives the increasing demand for building materials, prompting the exploration of phosphogypsum as a sustainable substitute.&lt;SEP&gt;The construction industry drives the increasing demand for building materials, prompting the exploration of phosphogypsum as a sustainable substitute.&lt;SEP&gt;The construction industry is a major consumer of phosphogypsum, utilizing it in materials like plates, hollow blocks, walls, and bricks.&lt;SEP&gt;The construction industry is a key sector for collaboration to utilize phosphogypsum in building materials.</data>
