<node id="Cement Retarder">
  <data key="d0">Cement Retarder</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Cement Retarder is a construction additive and industrial material specifically engineered to control and regulate the setting time, hydration process, and compressive strength of cement and cement mixtures, particularly silicate cement. It functions as a primary utilization route for phosphogypsum, an industrial byproduct that serves as a direct substitute for natural gypsum. The phosphogypsum utilized in its production is typically processed into various forms, including modified, purified, high-purity, semi-hydrated, powder, or block variants, and is frequently subjected to lime neutralization to minimize the influence of impurities.

The manufacturing of Cement Retarder involves established industrial procedures, such as the PCR process, with documented production outputs like 1030.00 kg produced by Company Q. In certain technical documentation and legends, the material is designated by a teal color code. It stands as the largest sub-category and application for phosphogypsum within the construction sector, with reported usage accounting for approximately 30% to 33.7% of total phosphogypsum consumption. Significant deployment and production occur in China, notably across Sichuan and Hubei provinces.

Economically and environmentally, Cement Retarder transforms industrial waste into valuable construction materials, supporting sustainable waste management practices and offering low-cost advantages that help reduce overall production expenses. Despite these benefits, it is sometimes characterized as a traditional industrial product with limited economic returns and faces notable market competition. Overall, it serves as a functional, eco-conscious additive that effectively bridges industrial waste recycling with essential construction requirements, ensuring optimal workability and structural development.&lt;SEP&gt;A primary utilization pathway for phosphogypsum, where it is used to slow the setting time of cement.&lt;SEP&gt;A primary utilization pathway for phosphogypsum, currently facing declining demand due to the real estate slowdown.&lt;SEP&gt;Industrial additive using phosphogypsum, widely utilized across multiple provinces.&lt;SEP&gt;A traditional industrial additive produced from phosphogypsum, representing current utilization methods.&lt;SEP&gt;A utilization pathway for phosphogypsum, represented by orange in the chart.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-401b567da916dc34559e0bfe5a5b367b-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-401b567da916dc34559e0bfe5a5b367b-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-401b567da916dc34559e0bfe5a5b367b-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-021&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-276f29345df37143fc224a22d0f6089b-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-276f29345df37143fc224a22d0f6089b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-276f29345df37143fc224a22d0f6089b-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c2674917fb6c60e75303effeaa10768e-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c2674917fb6c60e75303effeaa10768e-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c2674917fb6c60e75303effeaa10768e-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c2674917fb6c60e75303effeaa10768e-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c2674917fb6c60e75303effeaa10768e-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c2674917fb6c60e75303effeaa10768e-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c2674917fb6c60e75303effeaa10768e-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c2674917fb6c60e75303effeaa10768e-chunk-020&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c2674917fb6c60e75303effeaa10768e-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c2674917fb6c60e75303effeaa10768e-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a5d09b48f57a4e888bb729aaf988c936-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a5d09b48f57a4e888bb729aaf988c936-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a5d09b48f57a4e888bb729aaf988c936-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a5d09b48f57a4e888bb729aaf988c936-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a5d09b48f57a4e888bb729aaf988c936-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ac8d630b9aa4d874707445e2552a09-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ac8d630b9aa4d874707445e2552a09-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ac8d630b9aa4d874707445e2552a09-chunk-022&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ac8d630b9aa4d874707445e2552a09-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-afe70f2d82515df80906bf3babd4e4eb-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-afe70f2d82515df80906bf3babd4e4eb-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-afe70f2d82515df80906bf3babd4e4eb-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-afe70f2d82515df80906bf3babd4e4eb-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-afe70f2d82515df80906bf3babd4e4eb-chunk-00