  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Industrial solid waste refers to large-volume waste materials, such as phosphogypsum, used in carbon neutralization research.&lt;SEP&gt;Industrial solid waste refers to large-volume waste materials, such as phosphogypsum, used in carbon neutralization research.&lt;SEP&gt;Industrial solid waste refers to large-volume waste materials, such as phosphogypsum, used in carbon neutralization research.</data>
