<node id="Tail gas">
  <data key="d0">Tail gas</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Tail gas is an industrial emission stream containing carbon dioxide that can be treated using waste gypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Tail gas is an industrial emission stream containing carbon dioxide that can be treated using waste gypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Tail gas is an industrial emission stream containing carbon dioxide that can be treated using waste gypsum.</data>
