<node id="Carbon Neutralization">
  <data key="d0">Carbon Neutralization</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Carbon neutralization is an environmental strategy focused on balancing carbon emissions through industrial waste utilization.&lt;SEP&gt;Carbon neutralization is an environmental strategy focused on balancing carbon emissions through industrial waste utilization.&lt;SEP&gt;Carbon neutralization is an environmental strategy focused on balancing carbon emissions through industrial waste utilization.</data>
