<node id="Kurkinen, S.">
  <data key="d0">Kurkinen, S.</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Kurkinen, S. is a researcher who investigated the recovery of rare earth elements from phosphogypsum using a resin-in-leach process.&lt;SEP&gt;Kurkinen, S. is a lead author of a 2021 study focused on recovering rare earth elements from phosphogypsum waste.&lt;SEP&gt;Kurkinen, S. is a lead author of a 2021 study focused on recovering rare earth elements from phosphogypsum waste.</data>
