<node id="Kuzmanovic, P.">
  <data key="d0">Kuzmanovic, P.</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Kuzmanovic, P. is a researcher who conducted radiological characterization of phosphogypsum produced in Serbia.&lt;SEP&gt;Kuzmanovic, P. is a lead author of a 2020 study on the radiological characterization of phosphogypsum produced in Serbia.&lt;SEP&gt;Kuzmanovic, P. is a lead author of a 2020 study on the radiological characterization of phosphogypsum produced in Serbia.</data>
