<node id="Li, X.">
  <data key="d0">Li, X.</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Li, X. is a researcher whose academic portfolio primarily centers on the processing, utilization, and environmental management of phosphogypsum. Between 2017 and 2019, Li, X. served as the lead author on multiple studies examining phosphogypsum processing techniques and crystal modification. The research also investigates impurity occurrences within the material and develops advanced removal technologies, including hydrothermal methods for contaminant extraction and fluoride immobilization. A major application focus involves the use of phosphogypsum in cemented paste backfill and green mine backfill systems. These studies rigorously evaluate the durability of such backfill materials and assess the broader environmental effects associated with their deployment.

In addition to these geotechnical and environmental investigations, Li, X. contributed as a co-author to a 2022 publication highlighting the broader reuse potential of phosphogypsum. The researcher’s work extends beyond mining and materials science to include ceramic manufacturing, specifically through co-authored research on fabricating bone china using synthetic bone powder. Collectively, these contributions reflect a sustained commitment to optimizing industrial byproducts, enhancing material performance, and mitigating environmental risks through innovative processing and application strategies.&lt;SEP&gt;Li, X. is a researcher who co-authored a review on impurity occurrences and removal technologies in phosphogypsum.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c2674917fb6c60e75303effeaa10768e-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2760dc2a11fedad02d24741a978cf20d-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a5d09b48f57a4e888bb729aaf988c936-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-034&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-033&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b19ca721a4da4422ee10228d88a4c292-chunk-019</data>
