  <data key="d2">Liu, S. is a researcher who co-authored a 2020 study on the calcination modification of phosphogypsum and its effect on supersulfated cement.&lt;SEP&gt;Liu, S. is a researcher who studied the calcination modification of phosphogypsum and its effect on supersulfated cement hydration.&lt;SEP&gt;Liu, S. is a researcher who co-authored a 2020 study on the calcination modification of phosphogypsum and its effect on supersulfated cement.&lt;SEP&gt;Liu, S. is a lead author of a 2020 study investigating the calcination modification of phosphogypsum and its cement hydration properties.&lt;SEP&gt;Liu, S. is a researcher who co-authored a 2020 study on the calcination modification of phosphogypsum and its effect on supersulfated cement.&lt;SEP&gt;Liu, S. is a lead author of a 2020 study investigating the calcination modification of phosphogypsum and its cement hydration properties.&lt;SEP&gt;A researcher who co-authored a study on the effective recovery of calcium and sulfur resources in FGD gypsum.</data>
