<node id="Chemosphere">
  <data key="d0">Chemosphere</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Chemosphere is a scientific journal dedicated to publishing research in environmental remediation, waste management, advanced chemical processes, and waste valorization. It serves as a comprehensive resource for environmental chemistry, featuring critical reviews and original studies that address complex ecological and chemical challenges.

A significant portion of the journal’s published work centers on phosphogypsum waste. Research disseminated through Chemosphere extensively covers the environmental impacts of phosphogypsum under redox oscillations, in-situ remediation techniques utilizing ground granulated blast furnace slag, and methods for fluoride retention and solidification. Additional studies focus on the leaching of rare earth elements from phosphogypsum, the mobility of natural radionuclides in phosphogypsum disposal areas, and comprehensive assessments of nanominerals and hazardous elements within the material.

Beyond phosphogypsum, Chemosphere has published a diverse array of specialized studies. These include a 2020 investigation into utilizing industrial wastes to mitigate greenhouse gas emissions, research on developing eco-friendly geopolymers from solid wastes, and analyses of the chemical behavior of fluorine and phosphorus during chemical looping gasification. The journal also features a 2021 study on fluorine transfer characteristics, research examining Corynebacterium Pollutisoli SPH6 in waste activated sludge fermentation, and a 2019 pollution evaluation of salt-marshes in Huelva. Collectively, these publications underscore the journal’s broad scope and commitment to advancing sustainable environmental and chemical solutions.&lt;SEP&gt;A 2022 academic journal that published a review on the environmental impact and health risks of phosphogypsum nanoparticles.&lt;SEP&gt;Chemosphere is a scientific journal that published findings on highly-efficient fluoride retention in phosphogypsum solidification.&lt;SEP&gt;Chemosphere is the academic publisher for the 2023 study on cement-free in-situ remediation of phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Chemosphere is a peer-reviewed scientific journal that published a study on the neurological impacts of chronic fluoride exposure.&lt;SEP&gt;Chemosphere is a scientific journal that published research on the dynamics of metals in phosphate mine backfill using sequential extraction.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-020&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-020&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-020&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-022&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-027&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-020&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e290dd6268316238694f70c30a367426-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-031&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-041&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-037&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-027&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a5d09b48f57a4e888bb729aaf988c936-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-030&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-033&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-037&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-029</data>
