<node id="Hydrometallurgy">
  <data key="d0">Hydrometallurgy</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Hydrometallurgy refers to two distinct but closely related concepts in materials science and academic publishing: a foundational metallurgical extraction process and a peer-reviewed scientific journal. As a metallurgical process and field of study, Hydrometallurgy is a chemical extraction technique that utilizes aqueous chemistry to dissolve, separate, and purify metals from complex ore materials and mineral concentrates. It serves as a fundamental approach in extractive metallurgy, particularly for processing rare earth elements and lanthanides, and is frequently combined with gravity separation to achieve comprehensive recovery. The methodology is notably applied to extract valuable metals from industrial byproducts, such as phosphogypsum waste, through techniques like acid leaching. Additionally, Hydrometallurgy encompasses the recovery and recycling of valuable elements like lanthanum, often employing tributyl phosphate as an extractant, and supports urban mining and rare earth reclamation efforts.

As a scientific publication, Hydrometallurgy is a peer-reviewed journal dedicated to disseminating research on metal extraction from aqueous solutions and related hydrometallurgical processes. The journal regularly features investigations into rare earth element recovery, actinoid element separation, mineral dissolution, acid leaching methodologies, resin-in-leach processes, and rare earth recovery via fractional precipitation. It also publishes reviews on hydrometallurgical unit operations for urban mining and rare earth reclamation. Key featured studies include a 2021 publication detailing the recovery of rare earth elements from phosphogypsum waste and a 2019 analysis of the resin-in-leach process. Together, these dual roles highlight Hydrometallurgy's significance in both industrial metal processing and academic research dissemination.&lt;SEP&gt;Hydrometallurgy is a chemical extraction process involving acid digestion of phosphate rocks to produce phosphoric acid.&lt;SEP&gt;A journal publishing process investigations on acid leaching of rare earth elements.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-020&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-023&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-020&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-023&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-26bca3d4f742299ce2dbcd6381558f89-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-26bca3d4f742299ce2dbcd6381558f89-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-26bca3d4f742299ce2dbcd6381558f89-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-26bca3d4f742299ce2dbcd6381558f89-chunk-022&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-020&lt;SEP&gt;doc-401b567da916dc34559e0bfe5a5b367b-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-401b567da916dc34559e0bfe5a5b367b-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-401b567da916dc34559e0bfe5a5b367b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-023&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-020&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1adcb38defdd04a271ddba318999ba67-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-031&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-053&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-023&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-025&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-020&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d18c456289f64c1e16c73a0dfd6595b3-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-66f6434914b6de99019386e4bdcbc57e-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-66f6434914b6de99019386e4bdcbc57e-chunk-024</data>
