<node id="J. Environ. Manag.">
  <data key="d0">J. Environ. Manag.</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">J. Environ. Manag. is a scientific journal that published research on microbial responses to phosphogypsum in composting.&lt;SEP&gt;J. Environ. Manag. contains research on bacterial leaching of critical metal values from Polish copper metallurgical slags.&lt;SEP&gt;A journal publishing research on environmental management, including phosphogypsum impact and brine variation.&lt;SEP&gt;J. Environ. Manag. is a scientific journal publishing research on environmental management and hydroxyapatite applications.</data>
