<node id="J. Clean. Prod.">
  <data key="d0">J. Clean. Prod.</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">The Journal of Cleaner Production, commonly abbreviated as J. Clean. Prod., is a peer-reviewed academic and scientific journal dedicated to advancing research on clean production, environmental technologies, sustainable industrial practices, and circular economy solutions. It serves as a comprehensive platform for studies addressing waste stream management, resource recovery, sustainable manufacturing, and environmental remediation, regularly featuring critical analyses and reviews that support scientific inquiry into industrial sustainability and ecological stewardship.

A central theme of the publication is the valorization, stabilization, and utilization of industrial residues, with extensive coverage dedicated to phosphogypsum. The journal has published numerous studies examining the immobilization, environmental effects, and diverse applications of phosphogypsum, including its use as a road and asphalt material, in construction backfill, and for industrial waste recycling. Research featured in the journal explores specific techniques such as the efficient precipitation of soluble phosphorus impurities, the co-preparation of cement and sulfuric acid, and the immobilization of lime-neutralized phosphogypsum for cement composites, supersulfated cement, and cemented paste backfill. Additional investigations address associated environmental risks, the use of modified quartz sand for phosphate pollution control in backfill, the extraction of rare earth elements, links to fertilizer production, and broader circular economy strategies for resource valorization.

Beyond phosphogypsum, the journal covers a wide array of sustainable material innovations and industrial by-products. Its scope includes research on modifying granulated copper slag, recycling construction and demolition waste, utilizing biochar additives, applying carbon dioxide curing and mineral sequestration for calcium carbonate production, and developing hydroxyapatite composites for efficient pollutant adsorption. The publication also examines practical implementation challenges, such as barriers to smart waste management in China, and features reviews on balancing environmental and economic systems. Through these diverse contributions, J. Clean. Prod. continues to support global scientific efforts toward resource recovery and sustainable industrial development.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-023&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-023&lt;SEP&gt;doc-26bca3d4f742299ce2dbcd6381558f89-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-26bca3d4f742299ce2dbcd6381558f89-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-024&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-023&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-020&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-028&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-024&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-023&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-023&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-051&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-037&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-035&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-050&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-045&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c2674917fb6c60e75303effeaa10768e-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c2674917fb6c60e75303effeaa10768e-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7797768798fcd1152bdc10ff73139e35-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7797768798fcd1152bdc10ff73139e35-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2760dc2a11fedad02d24741a978cf20d-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2760dc2a11fedad02d24741a978cf20d-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-06f299b7e723cda1f0de1a647b02b6b4-chunk-01