<node id="Steel Slag">
  <data key="d0">Steel Slag</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Steel Slag is an industrial byproduct and waste material generated during steel production, recognized for its multifaceted applications in construction and environmental management. As a supplementary material, it is widely utilized as an additive in cement formulations, concrete mixtures, and cement composites. When incorporated into these mixtures, Steel Slag effectively enhances the mechanical properties of the resulting construction materials. In practice, it is frequently combined with other industrial byproducts, including phosphogypsum, granulated blast-furnace slag, and fly ash, to formulate optimized cementitious composites and advanced construction mixtures.

Beyond its structural utility, Steel Slag is actively investigated and deployed for environmental mitigation and remediation purposes, often in conjunction with phosphogypsum and fly ash to address ecological challenges. Additionally, the material is processed to recover rare earth elements and extract value-added products, underscoring its potential as a secondary resource within sustainable and circular industrial frameworks. Collectively, these applications position Steel Slag as a versatile industrial material that bridges construction engineering, environmental sustainability, and resource recovery.&lt;SEP&gt;Steel slag is an industrial byproduct utilized in composite cement formulations alongside phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Steel slag is a byproduct combined with fly ash and phosphogypsum to create solidified road base materials.&lt;SEP&gt;Steel slag is an industrial byproduct used as a main component in a specific CCM formulation.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-26bca3d4f742299ce2dbcd6381558f89-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-024&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-023&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-021&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-029&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-022&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-044&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7797768798fcd1152bdc10ff73139e35-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7797768798fcd1152bdc10ff73139e35-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-011</data>
