<node id="Resin-in-leach process">
  <data key="d0">Resin-in-leach process</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">The resin-in-leach process is a chemical extraction method used to recover rare earth elements from phosphogypsum waste.&lt;SEP&gt;The resin-in-leach process is a hydrometallurgical technique used to extract rare earth elements from phosphogypsum using biodegradable complexing agents.&lt;SEP&gt;The resin-in-leach process is a hydrometallurgical technique used to extract rare earth elements from phosphogypsum using biodegradable complexing agents.</data>
