<node id="Caustic Soda">
  <data key="d0">Caustic Soda</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Caustic soda is a chemical agent used to decompose phosphates from monazite.&lt;SEP&gt;Caustic soda is a chemical reagent used to decompose the phosphates contained in monazite.&lt;SEP&gt;Caustic soda is a chemical agent used to decompose phosphates from monazite.&lt;SEP&gt;Caustic soda is a chemical reagent used to decompose the phosphates contained in monazite.&lt;SEP&gt;Caustic soda is a chemical agent used to decompose phosphates from monazite.&lt;SEP&gt;Caustic soda is a chemical reagent used to decompose the phosphates contained in monazite.</data>
