<node id="Process And Mechanism Of Carbon Dioxide Solidification">
  <data key="d0">Process And Mechanism Of Carbon Dioxide Solidification</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">This figure illustrates the process and mechanism of carbon dioxide solidification as referenced in the text.&lt;SEP&gt;This figure illustrates the process and mechanism of carbon dioxide solidification as referenced in the text.&lt;SEP&gt;This figure illustrates the process and mechanism of carbon dioxide solidification as referenced in the text.</data>
