  <data key="d2">Acids are chemical agents used in the leaching process to extract rare earth elements from PG.&lt;SEP&gt;Acids are chemical agents used in the leaching process to extract rare earth elements from PG.&lt;SEP&gt;Acids are chemical agents used in the leaching process to extract rare earth elements from PG.</data>
