  <data key="d0">Equation (12)</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Equation (12) illustrates the precipitation reaction forming hydrated REE carbonates using carbonate and bicarbonate salts.&lt;SEP&gt;Equation (12) illustrates the precipitation reaction forming hydrated REE carbonates using carbonate and bicarbonate salts.&lt;SEP&gt;Equation (12) illustrates the precipitation reaction forming hydrated REE carbonates using carbonate and bicarbonate salts.</data>
