<node id="High Value-Added Treatment">
  <data key="d0">High Value-Added Treatment</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">High value-added treatment refers to the process of extracting valuable metals from solid wastes to increase their economic utility.&lt;SEP&gt;High value-added treatment refers to the process of extracting valuable metals from solid wastes to increase their economic utility.&lt;SEP&gt;High value-added treatment refers to the process of extracting valuable metals from solid wastes to increase their economic utility.</data>
