  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Alternative sources refer to potential origins for rare earth elements, such as solid wastes like PG, to meet growing global demand.&lt;SEP&gt;Alternative sources refer to potential origins for rare earth elements, such as solid wastes like PG, to meet growing global demand.&lt;SEP&gt;Alternative sources refer to potential origins for rare earth elements, such as solid wastes like PG, to meet growing global demand.</data>
