<node id="Rare Earths">
  <data key="d0">Rare Earths</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Rare earths are a group of critical and valuable chemical elements that are essential to various high-tech and industrial applications. Their recovery and processing are actively pursued through several specialized methods, particularly involving industrial byproducts. For example, rare earths can be effectively leached from phosphogypsum following hydrothermal conversion processes. Additionally, they are targeted for simultaneous separation from wet process phosphoric acid using specific chemical extractants, highlighting ongoing efforts to optimize their extraction from complex mixtures.

Beyond their chemical and industrial properties, rare earths hold significant strategic and economic importance. Their status as critical materials has prompted extensive analysis of their market dynamics and supply chain vulnerabilities. Notably, a 2021 research study specifically modeled potential disruptions to the global supply of rare earths, underscoring the need for diversified sourcing and robust supply chain management. Together, these factors establish rare earths as indispensable resources that require careful scientific and economic oversight.&lt;SEP&gt;Rare earths are valuable elements extracted from phosphogypsum following hydrothermal conversion processes.&lt;SEP&gt;Rare earths are valuable elements concentrated from phosphogypsum waste for potential industrial applications.&lt;SEP&gt;Rare earths are valuable elements targeted for recovery from phosphogypsum through processes like hydrothermal conversion and fractional precipitation.&lt;SEP&gt;Rare earths are valuable elements that can be recovered from phosphogypsum through direct and indirect leaching techniques.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-021&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-021&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-021&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1adcb38defdd04a271ddba318999ba67-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1adcb38defdd04a271ddba318999ba67-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-028&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-041&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-048&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-047</data>
