  <data key="d2">Wet method is a pretreatment technique for phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Wet method is a pretreatment technique for phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Wet method is a pretreatment technique for phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;The wet method is a production process for phosphoric acid based on phosphorite ores.&lt;SEP&gt;The wet method is an industrial process for producing phosphoric acid by dissolving phosphate ore, which generates phosphogypsum as a byproduct.</data>
