<node id="Iron Oxide">
  <data key="d0">Iron Oxide</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Iron oxide is a chemical compound that plays a notable role in phosphate-related materials and industrial processing streams. In its natural state, it serves as a minor mineral component, constituting approximately one percent of the overall composition of phosphorite. During the beneficiation and processing of phosphate ores, iron oxide behaves as a co-occurring compound; its concentration notably increases in the resulting beneficiated concentrates alongside rare earth elements.

Beyond raw ores and processed concentrates, iron oxide is also commonly present as an impurity in phosphogypsum, a byproduct of phosphate manufacturing. In this context, it contributes significantly to the material's complex chemical composition. Together, these characteristics highlight iron oxide's persistent presence across raw phosphate minerals, processed concentrates, and industrial byproducts.&lt;SEP&gt;A conventional absorbent material used for removing pollutants.&lt;SEP&gt;Iron oxide is a mineral that thorium co-precipitates with in sedimentary phosphates.&lt;SEP&gt;Iron oxide is a material recovered from iron-rich chloride waste using calcium carbonate.&lt;SEP&gt;Iron oxide is an impurity present in phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Iron oxide is a minor impurity detected in phosphogypsum before and after treatment, showing no significant changes.&lt;SEP&gt;Iron oxide is an oxide component present in the initial phosphogypsum mixture.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-26bca3d4f742299ce2dbcd6381558f89-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9e17ad262bd9835860df552d7ff475f1-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-027&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a5d09b48f57a4e888bb729aaf988c936-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-28fbd4302bba090e667215c840757ff7-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b19ca721a4da4422ee10228d88a4c292-chunk-022</data>
