<node id="Syngas">
  <data key="d0">Syngas</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Syngas is a gaseous fuel and synthesis gas mixture primarily composed of carbon monoxide (CO) and hydrogen (H2). It serves as the target product generated through the chemical looping gasification (CLG) of low-rank or low-order lignite. In this specialized gasification process, phosphogypsum functions as the oxygen carrier to facilitate the reaction and drive the production of the desired gaseous output.

The resulting syngas is highly valued in CLG applications due to its high selectivity and efficiency. By utilizing phosphogypsum as an oxygen carrier during the lignite chemical looping gasification process, the system optimally yields this CO and H2-rich mixture, establishing syngas as a key energy carrier derived from low-grade coal resources.&lt;SEP&gt;Syngas is a gaseous fuel produced through the chemical looping gasification of lignite using phosphogypsum as an oxygen carrier.&lt;SEP&gt;Syngas is generated through the lignite chemical looping gasification process utilizing phosphogypsum as an oxygen carrier.&lt;SEP&gt;Syngas is produced via the partial oxidation of methane using nickel-calcium phosphate/hydroxyapatite catalysts.&lt;SEP&gt;Syngas is produced through the chemical looping gasification of lignite using PG, utilizing carbon monoxide generated during reduction processes.&lt;SEP&gt;Syngas is a product whose production is facilitated by silicon dioxide participation in chemical looping gasification.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-024&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-024&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-023&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-024&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0a5563c80c4fd1f68b4442f73621a281-chunk-029&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a5d09b48f57a4e888bb729aaf988c936-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b19ca721a4da4422ee10228d88a4c292-chunk-001</data>
