<node id="Pretreatment Stage">
  <data key="d0">Pretreatment Stage</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">The pretreatment stage involves washing and drying phosphogypsum to prepare it for subsequent extraction steps.&lt;SEP&gt;The pretreatment stage involves washing and drying phosphogypsum to prepare it for subsequent extraction steps.&lt;SEP&gt;The pretreatment stage involves washing and drying phosphogypsum to prepare it for subsequent extraction steps.</data>
