  <data key="d2">Equation 13 is a chemical formula summarizing the decomposition of rare earth element phosphates from monazite with caustic soda.&lt;SEP&gt;Equation 13 is a chemical formula summarizing the decomposition of rare earth element phosphates from monazite with caustic soda.&lt;SEP&gt;Equation 13 is a chemical formula summarizing the decomposition of rare earth element phosphates from monazite with caustic soda.&lt;SEP&gt;Equation 13 calculates the theoretical content of soluble P₂O₅ based on quicklime parameters.&lt;SEP&gt;Equation 13 modifies the previous equation to graphically illustrate strain and crystallite size.&lt;SEP&gt;Equation 13 is a mathematical formula referenced in the derivation of Equation 17.</data>
