  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Equilibrium Batch Experiments are laboratory tests performed to evaluate the recovery of rare earth elements with and without ion-exchange resins.&lt;SEP&gt;Equilibrium Batch Experiments are laboratory tests performed to evaluate the recovery of rare earth elements with and without ion-exchange resins.&lt;SEP&gt;Equilibrium Batch Experiments are laboratory tests performed to evaluate the recovery of rare earth elements with and without ion-exchange resins.</data>
