<node id="Sodium Phosphate">
  <data key="d0">Sodium Phosphate</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Sodium Phosphate is a chemical byproduct formed during the decomposition of phosphates from monazite with caustic soda.&lt;SEP&gt;Sodium Phosphate is a chemical byproduct formed during the decomposition of phosphates from monazite with caustic soda.&lt;SEP&gt;Sodium Phosphate is a chemical byproduct formed during the decomposition of phosphates from monazite with caustic soda.&lt;SEP&gt;Sodium Phosphate is a byproduct formed when the phosphate group is released during chemical extraction.</data>
