  <data key="d2">Ammonium is a chemical ion present in the initial chemical equation, likely involved in a precipitation or extraction reaction.&lt;SEP&gt;Ammonium is a chemical ion present in the initial chemical equation, likely involved in a precipitation or extraction reaction.&lt;SEP&gt;Ammonium is a chemical ion present in the initial chemical equation, likely involved in a precipitation or extraction reaction.</data>
