<node id="Carbon Monoxide">
  <data key="d0">Carbon Monoxide</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Carbon Monoxide is a gaseous compound that serves as a primary product formed during the gasification and conversion of lignite, a process notably promoted by released oxygen. In analytical and thermodynamic contexts, it functions as a key gaseous component, frequently measured within the H2/CO ratio and featured prominently in ternary phase diagrams.

Environmentally, Carbon Monoxide is recognized as a pollutant gas that requires effective elimination. To address this, it is targeted for oxidation at room and low temperatures using specialized catalytic systems. Research and applications frequently employ hydroxyapatite-supported catalysts, including gold nanoparticle catalysts and Au/FeO-hydroxyapatite composites, which effectively facilitate the low-temperature oxidation and removal of Carbon Monoxide.&lt;SEP&gt;Carbon Monoxide is generated during the reduction and decomposition of PG and utilized to prepare syngas.&lt;SEP&gt;A hazardous gas generated during the mixing of CPGFM slurry containing yellow phosphorus slag.&lt;SEP&gt;Carbon Monoxide is a gaseous intermediate formed during carbon reduction that acts as a secondary reducing agent.&lt;SEP&gt;A reducing gas generated during the carbon reduction of calcium sulfate, which further participates in the reduction process.&lt;SEP&gt;Gaseous byproduct released during the high-temperature reduction process.&lt;SEP&gt;Carbon monoxide is a gas ($CO$) generated as a byproduct of the carbothermal reduction process.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0a5563c80c4fd1f68b4442f73621a281-chunk-029&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0a5563c80c4fd1f68b4442f73621a281-chunk-021&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0a5563c80c4fd1f68b4442f73621a281-chunk-039&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a5d09b48f57a4e888bb729aaf988c936-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b19ca721a4da4422ee10228d88a4c292-chunk-024&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b19ca721a4da4422ee10228d88a4c292-chunk-023&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b19ca721a4da4422ee10228d88a4c292-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b19ca721a4da4422ee10228d88a4c292-chunk-011</data>
