<node id="Hydrogen">
  <data key="d0">Hydrogen</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Hydrogen is a fundamental chemical element that appears across various industrial and chemical contexts, frequently depicted in molecular diagrams such as those of PTEs. In chemical reactions, the atom count of hydrogen is strictly balanced on both sides of the reaction equation. Beyond its basic chemical identity, hydrogen functions as a gaseous product and is widely recognized as a green and sustainable energy carrier, with ongoing research focused on developing safe and efficient storage technologies for its practical application.

In industrial settings, hydrogen is primarily generated as a key gaseous component of syngas through the gasification of lignite and its volatile components. This production process heavily relies on the reaction between carbon and water vapor, making the output of hydrogen strongly dependent on the concentration of water vapor present during the reaction.

Hydrogen can also be synthesized through specialized catalytic and chemical processes. It serves as the target product in the hydrolysis of hydrazine-borane, a reaction facilitated by rhodium nanoparticles. Additionally, hydrogen generation is achieved using cobalt catalysts supported on hydroxyapatite, highlighting its versatility in advanced chemical synthesis and catalytic systems.&lt;SEP&gt;Hydrogen is a reducing gas used in experimental settings for phosphogypsum decomposition.&lt;SEP&gt;A chemical element represented by a white circle, present as an ion in CPB mixtures.&lt;SEP&gt;Hydrogen is an elemental component with 38 atoms balanced on both sides of the reaction equation.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-029&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-025&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0a5563c80c4fd1f68b4442f73621a281-chunk-029&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0a5563c80c4fd1f68b4442f73621a281-chunk-022&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0a5563c80c4fd1f68b4442f73621a281-chunk-025&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-028&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-041&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4739e42903c95e1fb7e0ecfbca3a12df-chunk-011</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1791749368</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
