<node id="Minerals">
  <data key="d0">Minerals</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Minerals is a scientific, open-access journal dedicated to publishing research across mineralogy, petrology, and economic geology, with a broader emphasis on mineral applications and their practical implementations. Serving as a comprehensive resource for advancements in the geological, mining, and materials sectors, the publication encompasses both theoretical investigations and applied industrial experiments. Its editorial scope extends to sustainable resource management and waste valorization, notably featuring studies on the sustainable reuse of coal mine waste and the industrial utilization of mineral by-products.

The journal has published extensive research on phosphogypsum, covering diverse applications such as goaf filling using hemihydrate phosphogypsum, the use of water-washing pre-treated phosphogypsum for cemented paste backfill, and its integration with black steel slag as a construction additive. Additionally, Minerals has featured an overview on rare earths recovery from phosphogypsum, alongside foundational studies on rare earth carbonates and gypsum precipitation pathways. In the realm of mineral processing and extraction, the journal addresses techniques like collophanite flotation. Further contributions include a 2021 study on synthesizing hydroxyapatite-zeolite from blast furnace slag, as well as research examining the thermal stability of hydroxyapatite, thereby bridging fundamental material science with industrial sustainability.&lt;SEP&gt;Minerals is an academic journal that published research on the utilization of water-washing pre-treated phosphogypsum for cemented paste backfill.&lt;SEP&gt;Minerals are a resource category measured alongside energy in the assessment method.&lt;SEP&gt;Minerals are an impact category contributing to environmental burden from material transport.&lt;SEP&gt;Minerals is an environmental impact category listed in the chart's legend, associated with the color light green.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-020&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-021&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-020&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-021&lt;SEP&gt;doc-26bca3d4f742299ce2dbcd6381558f89-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-020&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-021&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-031&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-042&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-048&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-045&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a4d02158bbc770d7c6bd9657b3f3defc-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a4d02158bbc770d7c6bd9657b3f3defc-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-028&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-035&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0060991ac74a9675ce0293eccdc023cd-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0060991ac74a9675ce0293eccdc023cd-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0060991ac74a9675ce0293eccdc023cd-chunk-008</data>
