  <data key="d2">Electromagnetic field accelerates the destruction of PG crystal lattice and its dissolution.&lt;SEP&gt;Electromagnetic field accelerates the destruction of PG crystal lattice and its dissolution.&lt;SEP&gt;Electromagnetic field accelerates the destruction of PG crystal lattice and its dissolution.</data>
