<node id="Carbon Dioxide Mineralization">
  <data key="d0">Carbon Dioxide Mineralization</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Carbon dioxide mineralization is a chemical process developed using phosphogypsum and aluminium-rich industrial wastes to produce valuable carbonated by-products.&lt;SEP&gt;Carbon dioxide mineralization is a chemical process developed using phosphogypsum and aluminium-rich industrial wastes to produce valuable carbonated by-products.&lt;SEP&gt;Carbon dioxide mineralization is a chemical process developed using phosphogypsum and aluminium-rich industrial wastes to produce valuable carbonated by-products.&lt;SEP&gt;Carbon dioxide mineralization is a process utilizing phosphogypsum and aluminum-rich wastes to produce carbonated by-products.&lt;SEP&gt;Carbon dioxide mineralization is a chemical process used to convert phosphogypsum into valuable carbonated by-products.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-021&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-021&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-021&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-050&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-023</data>
