<node id="Sodium Hydroxide">
  <data key="d0">Sodium Hydroxide</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Sodium Hydroxide is a strong alkaline base and highly versatile chemical compound widely utilized across industrial, materials science, analytical, and resource recovery applications. In phosphogypsum processing and resource recovery, it serves as a critical reactant and alkaline medium for conversion, carbonation, and the preparation of derived compounds. It dissolves the material to facilitate the production of portlandite and sodium sulfate while enriching residues with rare earth elements, frequently acting as a preparatory step prior to citric acid leaching to optimize extraction. This alkaline treatment is actively studied for its impact on phosphogypsum-based cement properties, though it is noted to increase energy demand during conversion. Additionally, it is specifically purchased for pH adjustment during the preparation of phosphogypsum powders and functions as an alkaline additive to control the migration of phosphorus. In analytical chemistry, its strong alkaline properties establish controlled reaction environments, acting as a medium to ensure the complete decomposition of hydrogen ions during nitrogen analysis and being incorporated into sodium tetraphenylboron solutions for accurate potassium quantification.

In advanced materials and construction chemistry, Sodium Hydroxide functions as an essential alkaline activator in geopolymer production and cementitious composites, where it exerts the greatest impact on composite strength. It promotes early hydration reactions to accelerate material formation and enhance structural development, though prolonged exposure to the alkaline solution can initially accelerate hydration product formation before eventually leading to tension and shear failure. The compound also weakens the inhibitory effects of phosphate and fluoride on binder hydration and is consumed as a primary input in PBG technology. It is employed to precisely adjust the pH of synthesis and purification solutions, typically within a range of 5 to 11, including addition to calcium mixtures to facilitate precipitation during precursor preparation and pH adjustment during hydroxyapatite synthesis. In hydrothermal synthesis, its high solubility under elevated conditions effectively dissolves impurities such as quartz. For laboratory standardization, Sodium Hydroxide is dissolved in water to prepare standard solutions at target concentrations, such as 0.1 mol/L and 0.15 mol/L. Through these diverse roles, it demonstrates fundamental importance in quantitative analysis, construction materials, resource recovery, and industrial chemical processing.&lt;SEP&gt;Sodium hydroxide is a chemical reagent used to dissolve samples for total sulfur content analysis.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-26bca3d4f742299ce2dbcd6381558f89-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-26bca3d4f742299ce2dbcd6381558f89-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-026&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e290dd6268316238694f70c30a367426-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e290dd6268316238694f70c30a367426-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-276f29345df37143fc224a22d0f6089b-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-276f29345df37143fc224a22d0f6089b-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-276f29345df37143fc224a22d0f6089b-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1adcb38defdd04a271ddba318999ba67-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1adcb38defdd04a271ddba318999ba67-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-029&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-026&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c4a64a852097fdc910b98ed788503ce4-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6f5dcf59bedaa00614f1acc222b1fb7b-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6f5dcf59bedaa00614f1acc222b1fb7b-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-024&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-023&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3fd8439e859e3dd0c96328384e1761f0-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-60e237a0a1045feedf76d35d654a79bd-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-60e237a0a1045feedf76d35d654a79bd-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b19ca721a4da4422ee10228d88a4c292-chunk-006</data>
