  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">South West Spain is the geographic region where phosphogypsum was applied in agriculture, as documented in occupational dosimetric assessments.&lt;SEP&gt;South West Spain is the geographic region where phosphogypsum was applied in agriculture, as documented in occupational dosimetric assessments.&lt;SEP&gt;A geographic region where phosphogypsum is applied in agriculture, prompting occupational dosimetric assessments.&lt;SEP&gt;South West Spain is the geographic region where phosphogypsum was applied in agriculture, as documented in occupational dosimetric assessments.&lt;SEP&gt;South West Spain is the geographic region where the agricultural application of phosphogypsum was assessed.&lt;SEP&gt;South West Spain is a geographic region where phosphogypsum was applied in agriculture, leading to occupational dosimetric assessments.</data>
