<node id="Soil Amendments">
  <data key="d0">Soil Amendments</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Soil amendments are substances added to phosphogypsum to modify its properties or application in soil.&lt;SEP&gt;Soil amendments are substances added to phosphogypsum to modify its properties or application in soil.&lt;SEP&gt;Soil amendments are agricultural applications for purified phosphogypsum to improve soil quality.&lt;SEP&gt;Soil amendments are substances added to phosphogypsum to modify its properties or application in soil.</data>
