<node id="Phosphorus chemical enterprises">
  <data key="d0">Phosphorus chemical enterprises</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Phosphorus chemical enterprises are industrial entities whose development is restricted by environmental problems from phosphogypsum accumulation.&lt;SEP&gt;Phosphorus chemical enterprises are industrial entities whose development is restricted by environmental problems from phosphogypsum accumulation.&lt;SEP&gt;Phosphorus chemical enterprises are industrial entities whose development is restricted by environmental problems from phosphogypsum accumulation.</data>
