  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Dust generation is reduced in phosphogypsum due to particle agglomeration caused by moisture content.&lt;SEP&gt;Dust generation is reduced in phosphogypsum due to particle agglomeration caused by moisture content.&lt;SEP&gt;Dust generation is reduced in phosphogypsum due to particle agglomeration caused by moisture content.&lt;SEP&gt;Particulate matter shown blowing away from the top of the phosphogypsum stack.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-056</data>
