<node id="Portland Cement">
  <data key="d0">Portland Cement</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Portland cement is a widely utilized traditional binding material and primary construction agent that serves as a standard baseline for research involving supplementary additives. Its setting behavior, mechanical properties, and hydration process are extensively studied, particularly regarding interactions with industrial byproducts such as phosphogypsum (PG), fly ash, and ground granulated blast furnace slag. PG is frequently integrated to adjust setting retardation, control hydration rates, reduce clinkerization temperatures, and substitute natural gypsum, though its specific effects depend heavily on its purity and dosage. Weathered or impure PG typically acts as a set retarder that extends setting times and reduces compressive strength, whereas purified PG at low replacement levels can enhance cement properties and is often used as a direct additive or raw material during manufacture. The initial hydration process is notably influenced by phosphorus from PG, especially when superplasticizers are present.

In practical and experimental applications, Portland cement is commonly combined with these byproducts, although early PG-based filling research has indicated that such combinations can significantly increase overall material costs. Production pathways have evolved to leverage PG through methods like co-production with sulfuric acid and manufacturing processes utilizing calcium carbonate or calcium oxide derived from PG via PSC technology. Despite these sustainable innovations, conventional production still relies on burning natural gas to dry gypsum, contributing to notable environmental impacts. Overall, Portland cement remains central to both conventional construction and innovative sustainable engineering, with PG integration representing a dynamic research focus aimed at optimizing construction materials and promoting eco-efficient building applications through sustainable waste valorization.&lt;SEP&gt;Portland cement is a construction material produced using phosphogypsum as a raw material.&lt;SEP&gt;Portland cement is a construction material that utilizes gypsum to prevent the flash setting of concrete.&lt;SEP&gt;Portland cement is a building material with a 62% calcium oxide content, used as a reference for comparing treated phosphogypsum.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-001fe856b0d193d82422dc8a5baedc86-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-001fe856b0d193d82422dc8a5baedc86-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-001fe856b0d193d82422dc8a5baedc86-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-024&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-027&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-023&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-022&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-024&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-276f29345df37143fc224a22d0f6089b-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-276f29345df37143fc224a22d0f6089b-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-70650e5cb032fce744763706d8701e36-chunk-023&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-027&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-021&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-023&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-025&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-020&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-024&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-98d8b2df45924e721bfa570f652f33e3-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-030&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-035&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-032&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e4a551024f80f822f3f35e38ec278151-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ac8d630b9aa4d874707445e2552a09-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0060991ac74a9675ce0293eccdc023cd-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-28fbd4302bba090e667215c840757ff7-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-28fbd4302bba090e667215c840757ff7-chunk-006</data>
