<node id="Lanthanides">
  <data key="d0">Lanthanides</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Lanthanides are a valuable subset of rare-earth elements that are increasingly targeted for recovery and extraction from various phosphate-related industrial sources and processing streams. As a distinct group of rare-earth elements, they hold significant economic value and are the focus of specialized leaching and purification efforts across the phosphate industry.

These elements are primarily recovered from phosphate rock, which serves as a foundational source material. Beyond raw rock, Lanthanides are specifically targeted for leaching and recovery from phosphogypsum fertilizers, as well as from phosphohemihydrate using nitric acid leaching techniques. Furthermore, the industrial production of phosphoric acid generates process liquors rich in Lanthanides that require dedicated purification. Consequently, modern extraction methodologies systematically recover these elements from phosphoric acid production streams and other phosphate-derived materials, underscoring their importance in resource recovery and industrial byproduct utilization.&lt;SEP&gt;Lanthanides are impurities in phosphogypsum whose removal efficiency is evaluated using analytical techniques.&lt;SEP&gt;Lanthanides are rare earth elements targeted for recovery from phosphate rock through chemical processes.&lt;SEP&gt;Lanthanides are elements that can be leached from phosphogypsum fertilizers using mineral acids.&lt;SEP&gt;Lanthanides are elements that can be leached from phosphohemihydrate using nitric acid.&lt;SEP&gt;Lanthanides are valuable elements extracted from phosphogypsum during the phosphoric acid production process.&lt;SEP&gt;Lanthanides are chemical elements recovered from phosphate rock and phosphogypsum using leaching methods.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-26bca3d4f742299ce2dbcd6381558f89-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-26bca3d4f742299ce2dbcd6381558f89-chunk-022&lt;SEP&gt;doc-401b567da916dc34559e0bfe5a5b367b-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-401b567da916dc34559e0bfe5a5b367b-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-70650e5cb032fce744763706d8701e36-chunk-022&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-041&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-043&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-045&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-66f6434914b6de99019386e4bdcbc57e-chunk-022</data>
