<node id="Life Cycle Analysis">
  <data key="d0">Life Cycle Analysis</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Life cycle analysis is a methodological approach used to compare alternative management methods for phosphogypsum waste.&lt;SEP&gt;Life cycle analysis is a methodological approach used to compare alternative management methods for phosphogypsum waste.&lt;SEP&gt;Life cycle analysis is a methodological approach used to compare alternative management methods for phosphogypsum waste.&lt;SEP&gt;An assessment technique used to evaluate the environmental impact and sustainability of management methods.&lt;SEP&gt;Life Cycle Analysis is an environmental assessment methodology used to compare the ecological footprint of different waste management strategies.&lt;SEP&gt;A decision-making methodology used to assess the environmental footprint and compare alternative management methods for phosphogypsum waste.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-023&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-023&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-023&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-028&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0060991ac74a9675ce0293eccdc023cd-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0060991ac74a9675ce0293eccdc023cd-chunk-000</data>
