<node id="Electrical Resistivity Tomography">
  <data key="d0">Electrical Resistivity Tomography</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Electrical resistivity tomography is a geophysical technique combined with multivariate analysis to assess heavy metal behavior in phosphogypsum deposits.&lt;SEP&gt;Electrical resistivity tomography is a geophysical technique combined with multivariate analysis to assess heavy metal behavior in phosphogypsum deposits.&lt;SEP&gt;Electrical resistivity tomography is a geophysical technique combined with multivariate analysis to assess heavy metal behavior in phosphogypsum deposits.&lt;SEP&gt;Electrical resistivity tomography is a geophysical method combined with geochemistry to examine heavy metal spatial distribution.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-023&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-023&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-023&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-014</data>
