  <data key="d0">Multivariate Analysis</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Multivariate analysis is a statistical technique used alongside electrical resistivity tomography to evaluate heavy metal behavior.&lt;SEP&gt;Multivariate analysis is a statistical technique used alongside electrical resistivity tomography to evaluate heavy metal behavior.&lt;SEP&gt;Multivariate analysis is a statistical technique used alongside electrical resistivity tomography to evaluate heavy metal behavior.</data>
