  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Liu">
  <data key="d0">Liu</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Liu is a researcher whose work spans materials science, environmental engineering, and chemical processing. In the context of phosphogypsum processing, Liu tested various thermal treatment conditions and residence times to optimize impurity conversion. Utilizing the Phreeqc program, Liu determined mineralogical species during the leaching of phosphogypsum and calcium phosphogypsum fly ash mixture (CPGFM), finding that fluorine forms aluminum-fluorine complexes at low pH and precipitates as calcium fluoride under higher pH conditions. Based on these findings, Liu established a recommended formulation for CPGFM in 2009, a study that is frequently cited as a data source in comparative tables. Liu also documented early formulations for goaf stabilization.

Beyond phosphogypsum applications, Liu contributed to materials science by reporting that porous structures are highly desirable due to their high specific surface area and abundant active sites. Liu's research further extended to photocatalysis, where Liu documented the photocatalytic decomposition of methyl orange achieved by hydroxyapatite under UV irradiation. Additionally, Liu studied an amorphous iron(III)-substituted hydroxyapatite compound specifically for the degradation of rhodamine B. Collectively, these contributions demonstrate Liu's extensive research across chemical optimization, environmental remediation, and advanced catalytic materials.&lt;SEP&gt;Liu is a researcher whose 2003 publication describes a hydrothermal synthesis method for hydroxyapatite.&lt;SEP&gt;Liu is a researcher who investigated the effectiveness of water washing in removing impurities from phosphogypsum.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b8bd3776c87a0bcab21842e8e2bb2e06-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0a5563c80c4fd1f68b4442f73621a281-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0a5563c80c4fd1f68b4442f73621a281-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-021&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4739e42903c95e1fb7e0ecfbca3a12df-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ac8d630b9aa4d874707445e2552a09-chunk-006</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
