<node id="Mineral CO2 Sequestration">
  <data key="d0">Mineral CO2 Sequestration</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Mineral CO2 sequestration is a carbon capture technique that utilizes recycled phosphogypsum wastes.&lt;SEP&gt;Mineral CO2 sequestration is a carbon capture technique that utilizes recycled phosphogypsum wastes.&lt;SEP&gt;Mineral CO2 sequestration is an environmental application involving the recycling of phosphogypsum wastes to capture carbon dioxide.&lt;SEP&gt;Mineral CO2 sequestration is an environmental process that utilizes phosphogypsum waste to capture and store carbon dioxide.&lt;SEP&gt;Mineral CO2 sequestration is a carbon capture technique that utilizes recycled phosphogypsum wastes.&lt;SEP&gt;Mineral CO2 Sequestration is a procedure that utilizes phosphogypsum industrial waste to capture and store carbon dioxide.&lt;SEP&gt;Mineral CO2 sequestration is an environmental process where phosphogypsum waste is applied for carbon capture.</data>
