<node id="Journal of Environmental Management">
  <data key="d0">Journal of Environmental Management</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Journal of Environmental Management is a publication venue for research on phosphogypsum recycling and its environmental effects.&lt;SEP&gt;Journal of Environmental Management is a publication venue for research on phosphogypsum recycling and its environmental effects.&lt;SEP&gt;Journal of Environmental Management is a publication venue for research on phosphogypsum recycling and its environmental effects.&lt;SEP&gt;Journal of Environmental Management is a scientific journal that published a 2011 review on heavy metal ion removal from wastewaters.&lt;SEP&gt;A scientific journal that published research on the environmental impact, management, and soil fertility impacts of phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Journal of Environmental Management is the academic publisher for the 2017 study on utilizing phosphogypsum and phosphate tailings.&lt;SEP&gt;An academic journal that published research by H. Tayibi and colleagues.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-024&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-024&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-024&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-040&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7797768798fcd1152bdc10ff73139e35-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-029&lt;SEP&gt;doc-28fbd4302bba090e667215c840757ff7-chunk-007</data>
