<node id="Journal of Hazardous Materials">
  <data key="d0">Journal of Hazardous Materials</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">The Journal of Hazardous Materials is a scientific and academic publication dedicated to advancing research on environmental hazards, waste management, radiological safety, and the ecological impacts of hazardous substances. It functions as a key interdisciplinary resource for studies addressing the transformation, transport, and remediation of hazardous materials in various ecosystems.

The journal’s scope encompasses a wide array of specific investigations, with a notable emphasis on phosphogypsum waste. Published research includes studies on converting phosphogypsum into nanoparticles for environmental applications, utilizing the waste to prepare hydroxyapatite for fluoride removal, and examining phosphogypsum foam alongside radionuclide transport. Radiological safety and risk assessment are also central themes, featuring work on radioactivity contents in dicalcium phosphate, associated health risks, and uranium sorption on octadecyltrimethyl ammonium bromide-modified bentonite.

Beyond waste and radiological studies, the publication covers broader environmental and industrial topics, including groundwater quality, industrial by-products, lanthanide leaching, and phytostabilisation efficiency in contaminated soils. It has also documented specialized agricultural and material science research, such as tomato trace element uptake (with specific coverage in 2014) and graphene oxide nanocomposites, including contributions from researchers like F. Fang. Through this diverse portfolio, the Journal of Hazardous Materials remains a vital platform for disseminating critical findings on hazardous material management and environmental protection.&lt;SEP&gt;An academic journal that published research by M. Rentería-Villalobos and colleagues.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-024&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ce9090f230bcd0bfeefe92db7a576442-chunk-020&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ce9090f230bcd0bfeefe92db7a576442-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ce9090f230bcd0bfeefe92db7a576442-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-024&lt;SEP&gt;doc-983b2c3f393a1de00521565a70363819-chunk-020&lt;SEP&gt;doc-983b2c3f393a1de00521565a70363819-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-983b2c3f393a1de00521565a70363819-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-34a3ac199714be8fd1cdff8ead90fc92-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-024&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1adcb38defdd04a271ddba318999ba67-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-040&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-038&lt;SEP&gt;doc-06f299b7e723cda1f0de1a647b02b6b4-chunk-022&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4739e42903c95e1fb7e0ecfbca3a12df-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-28fbd4302bba090e667215c840757ff7-chunk-007</data>
