<node id="Construction and Building Materials">
  <data key="d0">Construction and Building Materials</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Construction and Building Materials is a journal publishing studies on load-bearing materials prepared from autoclaved phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Construction and Building Materials is a journal publishing studies on load-bearing materials prepared from autoclaved phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Construction and Building Materials is a peer-reviewed journal publishing research on construction materials and engineering.&lt;SEP&gt;Construction and Building Materials is a journal publishing studies on load-bearing materials prepared from autoclaved phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Construction and Building Materials represent an application sector where recycled PG substitutes natural gypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;A scientific journal that published multiple studies on phosphogypsum utilization in bricks, road materials, and load-bearing structures.</data>
