<node id="J. Yang">
  <data key="d0">J. Yang</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">J. Yang is a prominent researcher whose academic contributions center on chemical looping gasification and the sustainable utilization of industrial byproducts. A major focus of their work involves phosphogypsum, which they have investigated for use in preparing load-bearing materials and as a metal-supported oxygen carrier within chemical looping gasification systems. J. Yang has also authored comprehensive reviews on the gasification of lignite to syngas using phosphogypsum, while co-authoring technical studies that analyze the fluidization characteristics, reaction behavior, and thermodynamic principles governing these processes.

Beyond phosphogypsum, J. Yang has served as the lead author on research dedicated to carbide slag, specifically exploring hydrogen-rich syngas generation and calcium-looping methods for carbon dioxide capture. Their publication record also includes co-authored works on carbon monoxide capture and broader phosphogypsum processing techniques. Collectively, J. Yang’s research portfolio highlights a sustained commitment to advancing gasification technologies, optimizing solid oxygen carriers, and developing efficient carbon capture strategies using alternative feedstocks.&lt;SEP&gt;J. Yang is a researcher who contributed to studies on preparing load-bearing materials from phosphogypsum and its use in chemical looping gasification.&lt;SEP&gt;J. Yang is a researcher who presented a 2017 study on reprocessing phosphogypsum for rare-earth element recovery.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-024&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-024&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-027&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-028&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-026&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-021&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-024&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-055</data>
