  <data key="d2">D. Zhang is a researcher who investigated the conversion of waste phosphogypsum into nanoparticles for fluoride removal.&lt;SEP&gt;D. Zhang is a researcher who investigated the conversion of waste phosphogypsum into nanoparticles for fluoride removal.&lt;SEP&gt;D. Zhang is a researcher who investigated the conversion of waste phosphogypsum into nanoparticles for fluoride removal.&lt;SEP&gt;A lead researcher who authored a 2012 study on utilizing waste phosphogypsum to prepare hydroxyapatite nanoparticles for fluoride removal.&lt;SEP&gt;D. Zhang is a researcher who studied the preparation of hydroxyapatite nanoparticles from phosphogypsum for fluoride removal.</data>
