  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Iron-Rich Calcium Sulfoaluminate Cement is prepared using gypsum as a calcium oxide source and incorporates iron into mineral phases.&lt;SEP&gt;Iron-Rich Calcium Sulfoaluminate Cement is prepared using gypsum as a calcium oxide source and incorporates iron into mineral phases.&lt;SEP&gt;Iron-Rich Calcium Sulfoaluminate Cement is prepared using gypsum as a calcium oxide source and incorporates iron into mineral phases.</data>
