<node id="Water Washing Method">
  <data key="d0">Water Washing Method</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">The water washing method is a wet pretreatment technique used to remove adsorbed impurities from phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;The water washing method is a wet pretreatment technique used to remove adsorbed impurities from phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;The water washing method is a wet pretreatment technique used to remove adsorbed impurities from phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Water washing method is a pretreatment process that removes residual acids and impurities from phosphogypsum to enhance performance.&lt;SEP&gt;A purification technique that effectively removes soluble impurities and organic matter but suffers from high investment, energy consumption, and sewage production.&lt;SEP&gt;The water washing method is a physical pretreatment technique that removes impurities based on solubility and density differences.&lt;SEP&gt;A physical impurity removal technique that uses water to dissolve and remove soluble impurities without chemical reagents.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ac8d630b9aa4d874707445e2552a09-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ac8d630b9aa4d874707445e2552a09-chunk-007</data>
