<node id="PG Slurry">
  <data key="d0">PG Slurry</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">PG slurry is the mixture of phosphogypsum and water where flotation methods are applied.&lt;SEP&gt;PG slurry is the mixture of phosphogypsum and water where flotation methods are applied.&lt;SEP&gt;PG slurry is the mixture of phosphogypsum and water where flotation methods are applied.&lt;SEP&gt;PG Slurry is a mixture whose setting time, density, and strength are negatively affected by soluble fluorine content.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-006</data>
