<node id="XRD">
  <data key="d0">XRD</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">X-ray Diffraction (XRD) is a fundamental analytical and crystallographic characterization technique primarily utilized for phase identification, structural analysis, and crystalline assessment of solid materials and powders. By analyzing diffraction patterns, the method provides critical insights into the chemical and crystalline properties of various compounds, enabling the determination of phase composition, phase purity, crystallinity, material homogeneity, crystallographic parameters, and nano-sized structures. The technique also examines peak widening and lattice microstructure, often utilizing diffractometers to systematically evaluate solid products and synthesized specimens.

In materials science and specialized applications, XRD is extensively employed to characterize a wide range of compounds. It evaluates hydroxyapatite (HAP) and its composites, such as 20HPA-HAP, by identifying specific crystal planes, analyzing elementary cell parameters, confirming phase purity, validating standard crystal structures, and detecting structural transformations like amorphous transitions or related phases such as β-tricalcium phosphate (β-TCP). It also determines the crystalline nature of HAP samples and confirms the pure phase of ammonium sulfate. For phosphogypsum waste, XRD detects the presence of elements and compounds in both raw and treated forms, confirms primary phase compositions, verifies mixed powder identification for composite cement preparation, and correlates specific diffraction peaks, such as those corresponding to sodium chloride, with precise weight percentage measurements. Additionally, the technique identifies the ettringite phase in mixes and demonstrates its development during hydration.

Beyond these specific materials, XRD serves as a versatile tool across industrial and research contexts. It examines adsorbents by tracking structural and crystalline changes before and after metal adsorption processes to verify how metal loading impacts the material's framework. The method is also instrumental in characterizing complex solid-state systems, including nickel/phosphogypsum compound oxygen carriers and materials like PGEF, while consistently determining the phase composition and crystallinity of diverse synthesized samples.&lt;SEP&gt;XRD is a mineralogical analysis technique used to identify the crystalline phases in phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;An analytical technique used to identify the main crystalline phases in phosphogypsum and reduction slags.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-80bac46661a7d25358c897f5feccea99-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-80bac46661a7d25358c897f5feccea99-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b8bd3776c87a0bcab21842e8e2bb2e06-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b8bd3776c87a0bcab21842e8e2bb2e06-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9e17ad262bd9835860df552d7ff475f1-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9e17ad262bd9835860df552d7ff475f1-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8a6c42f76034cfa4338bd156b7179fc5-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f1fb5c243f2539cf7be6b6021b63c36f-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f1fb5c243f2539cf7be6b6021b63c36f-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c4a64a852097fdc910b98ed788503ce4-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6f5dcf59bedaa00614f1acc222b1fb7b-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6f5dcf59bedaa00614f1acc222b1fb7b-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2760dc2a11fedad02d24741a978cf20d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2760dc2a11fedad02d24741a978cf20d-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2760dc2a11fedad02d24741a978cf20d-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6825862084b162a4b16cd1037c76e3d7-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6825862084b162a4b16cd1037c76e3d7-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6825862084b162a4b16cd1037c76e3d7-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6825862084b162a4b16cd1037c76e3d7-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-06f299b7e723cda1f0de1a647b02b6b4-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-06f299b7e723cda1f0de1a647b02b6b4-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-06f299b7e723cda1f0de1a647b02b6b4-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-06f299b7e723cda1f0de1a647b02b6b4-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-98d8b2df45924e721bfa570f652f33e3-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4739e42903c95e1fb7e0ecfbca3a12df-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4739e42903c95e1fb7e0ecfbca3a12df-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a52951853fd542b78835b677936c557b-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a52951853fd542b78835b677936c557b-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a52951853fd542b78835b677936c557b-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-28fbd4302bba090e667215c840757ff7-chunk-00