<node id="Sodium Oxide">
  <data key="d0">Sodium Oxide</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Sodium oxide (Na2O) is a chemical compound and component routinely measured within the compositional analysis of phosphogypsum. It is consistently documented in phosphogypsum composition tables, with quantified concentrations typically ranging from 2358.36 to 2372.60 ppm. As a key constituent in these industrial byproducts, its presence is systematically tracked to evaluate material composition and processing outcomes.

In Moroccan phosphogypsum, sodium oxide demonstrates a distinct spatial distribution, becoming highly concentrated specifically within particle size fractions larger than 170 mm. The compound's concentration is also notably affected by industrial processing methods; it decreases significantly in washed beneficiated concentrates, a reduction directly caused by the elimination of sodium sulfate during the washing phase. These characteristics highlight sodium oxide's role as a measurable and process-sensitive component in phosphogypsum management.&lt;SEP&gt;Sodium Oxide is a minor constituent found in both materials, with higher levels in Natural Gypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Sodium Oxide is a minor chemical constituent of phosphogypsum, comprising 0.14 wt%.&lt;SEP&gt;Sodium oxide is a chemical compound present in phosphogypsum with a measured concentration of 0.17 ± 0.01.&lt;SEP&gt;A chemical oxide present at 0.01 wt% in the top section of the phosphogypsum composition table.&lt;SEP&gt;A chemical compound whose mass and molar ratios are utilized in the study's equations.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-26bca3d4f742299ce2dbcd6381558f89-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-26bca3d4f742299ce2dbcd6381558f89-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-26bca3d4f742299ce2dbcd6381558f89-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-042&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e4a551024f80f822f3f35e38ec278151-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d18c456289f64c1e16c73a0dfd6595b3-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0060991ac74a9675ce0293eccdc023cd-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-28fbd4302bba090e667215c840757ff7-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b19ca721a4da4422ee10228d88a4c292-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1792098450</data>
