  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Heuristic synthesis is an educated guess approach used to design new devices by combining multifaceted information and qualified intuition.&lt;SEP&gt;Heuristic synthesis is an educated guess approach used to design new devices by combining multifaceted information and qualified intuition.</data>
