<node id="Intra-soil Mechanical Processing">
  <data key="d0">Intra-soil Mechanical Processing</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Intra-soil mechanical processing is a technique that crushes soil horizons and mixes amendments or waste into the soil mass.&lt;SEP&gt;A technique for processing soil and applying matter simultaneously, studied in long-term field experiments.&lt;SEP&gt;Intra-soil mechanical processing is a technique that crushes soil horizons and mixes amendments or waste into the soil mass.&lt;SEP&gt;A technique for processing soil and applying matter simultaneously, studied in long-term field experiments.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-ce9090f230bcd0bfeefe92db7a576442-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ce9090f230bcd0bfeefe92db7a576442-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-983b2c3f393a1de00521565a70363819-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-983b2c3f393a1de00521565a70363819-chunk-008</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1790950059</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Soil Amendment">
  <data key="d0">Soil Amendment</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Soil Amendment is a material applied to soil to enhance its physical, chemical, and structural properties, typically integrated during intra-soil processing to boost fertility, improve nutrient availability, and stimulate crop growth. Within the specific context of phosphogypsum (PG) waste management, Soil Amendment denotes the targeted application of recycled or treated PG, often modified into alpha semi-hydrated gypsum powder. This agricultural route utilizes PG to correct calcium deficiencies, mitigate soil acidity and salinity, and improve overall soil characteristics, frequently serving as a direct replacement for conventional gypsum.

From an environmental and waste management perspective, Soil Amendment is consistently ranked as the top alternative in life cycle assessments and environmental footprint evaluations, particularly under the egalitarian perspective. It demonstrates the lowest environmental footprint compared to other PG management strategies, such as brick production, and offers a reduced ecological impact relative to conventional gypsum applications. The methodology also incorporates materials savings and systematic tracking of liquid emissions.

Despite its regulatory recognition, including emphasis in the 2021 directive, and favorable evaluations by researchers such as Tsioka and Voudrias, the practical implementation of Soil Amendment using phosphogypsum remains largely experimental in certain regions, including Yunnan Province. Ongoing studies continue to compare its impacts against alternative management routes, reinforcing its status as a promising, low-impact agricultural application for phosphogypsum waste.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-ce9090f230bcd0bfeefe92db7a576442-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-983b2c3f393a1de00521565a70363819-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-028&lt;SEP&gt;doc-276f29345df37143fc224a22d0f6089b-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c2674917fb6c60e75303effeaa10768e-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c2674917fb6c60e75303effeaa10768e-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c2674917fb6c60e75303effeaa10768e-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c2674917fb6c60e75303effeaa10768e-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a5d09b48f57a4e888bb729aaf988c936-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a5d09b48f57a4e888bb729aaf988c936-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a5d09b48f57a4e888bb729aaf988c936-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0060991ac74a9675ce0293eccdc023cd-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0060991ac74a9675ce0293eccdc023cd-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0060991ac74a9675ce0293eccdc023cd-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0060991ac74a9675ce0293eccdc023cd-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0060991ac74a9675ce0293eccdc023cd-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0060991ac74a9675ce0293eccdc023cd-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0060991ac74a9675ce0293eccdc023cd-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0060991ac74a9675ce0293eccdc023cd-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0060991ac74a9675ce0293eccdc023cd-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0060991ac74a9675ce0293eccdc023cd-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0060991ac74a9675ce0293eccdc023cd-chunk-008</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1791876904</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Waste">
  <data key="d0">Waste</data>
  <data key="d1">other</data>
  <data key="d2">Waste is a material applied to the soil alongside amendments and is dispersed during intra-soil processing.&lt;SEP&gt;Waste is a material applied to the soil alongside amendments and is dispersed during intra-soil processing.&lt;SEP&gt;Waste materials, including animal bones and biogenic products, provide a valuable resource route for obtaining hydroxyapatite.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-ce9090f230bcd0bfeefe92db7a576442-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-983b2c3f393a1de00521565a70363819-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0a5563c80c4fd1f68b4442f73621a281-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1791247343</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="BGT* Methodology">
  <data key="d0">BGT* Methodology</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">The BGT* Methodology is a comprehensive framework that integrates mechanical and chemical strategies for advanced soil engineering and management. Mechanically, it provides a systematic approach for synthesizing specialized devices designed for intra-soil mechanical processing. The development and application of these devices have been rigorously validated through both controlled laboratory experiments and practical field settings, ensuring their operational reliability and effectiveness in real-world contexts.

Chemically, the BGT* Methodology functions as an innovative engineering framework aimed at developing techniques to mitigate critical soil degradation issues. It specifically addresses challenges related to soil pH reduction while prioritizing the maintenance and restoration of optimal soil structure. Additionally, it operates as a transcendental remediation and reclamation technology that effectively facilitates the recycling and management of phosphogypsum. By unifying these mechanical processing capabilities with targeted chemical engineering solutions, the BGT* Methodology delivers a holistic approach to sustainable soil rehabilitation, structural integrity, and industrial byproduct utilization.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-ce9090f230bcd0bfeefe92db7a576442-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ce9090f230bcd0bfeefe92db7a576442-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ce9090f230bcd0bfeefe92db7a576442-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ce9090f230bcd0bfeefe92db7a576442-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-983b2c3f393a1de00521565a70363819-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-983b2c3f393a1de00521565a70363819-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-983b2c3f393a1de00521565a70363819-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-983b2c3f393a1de00521565a70363819-chunk-008</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1790949590</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Soil Horizon">
  <data key="d0">Soil Horizon</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">Soil horizon refers to specific soil layers targeted for mechanical processing and amendment application.&lt;SEP&gt;Soil horizon refers to specific soil layers targeted for mechanical processing and amendment application.&lt;SEP&gt;The soil horizon is the depth layer where Phosphogypsum is mixed during soil amendment applications.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-ce9090f230bcd0bfeefe92db7a576442-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-983b2c3f393a1de00521565a70363819-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0060991ac74a9675ce0293eccdc023cd-chunk-010</data>
