  <data key="d1">creature</data>
  <data key="d2">Annual plants are a crop type whose rhizosphere depth makes the 20-50 cm soil layer preferable for processing.&lt;SEP&gt;Annual plants are a crop type whose rhizosphere depth makes the 20-50 cm soil layer preferable for processing.</data>
