<node id="Equation 4">
  <data key="d0">Equation 4</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Equation 4 is a mathematical equation excluded from the macro-ion system due to cadmium's minimal impact on ionic strength.&lt;SEP&gt;Equation 4 is a mathematical equation excluded from the macro-ion system due to cadmium's minimal impact on ionic strength.&lt;SEP&gt;Equation 4 portrays the precipitation step of metal phosphates in the dissolution-precipitation mechanism.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-ce9090f230bcd0bfeefe92db7a576442-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-983b2c3f393a1de00521565a70363819-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0a5563c80c4fd1f68b4442f73621a281-chunk-010</data>
