  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Trace elements are chemical components modeled with separate equations to simplify calculations and improve reliability.&lt;SEP&gt;Trace elements are chemical components modeled with separate equations to simplify calculations and improve reliability.</data>
