<node id="Russia">
  <data key="d0">Russia</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">Russia is a transcontinental country geographically positioned at the top and center-right of standard maps, with its southern regions extending toward the Black Sea. It shares a direct border with Ukraine and encompasses the Krasnodar Krai region, which includes several municipalities such as Belorechensk. A notable study site is situated on the Black Sea coast near Krasnodar.

The nation serves as a hub for various scientific and industrial organizations, acting as the base for NPO Spectron and Kortec Ltd, as well as the location of TomAnalit Ltd. Geologically, Russia is the site of the Kovdor apatite ore deposit. In terms of environmental standards, the country employs Indicative Permissible Concentrations to set a cadmium limit of 2 mg/kg DW. Furthermore, Russia has been identified as a potential usage site or port location for phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Russia is a country with a rapidly expanding phosphorus chemical sector that contributes to global phosphogypsum stockpiling.&lt;SEP&gt;Russia is a country in Asia with an annual phosphogypsum production of 11.0 Mt.&lt;SEP&gt;Russia is a major producer of phosphogypsum, with utilization practices varying according to national conditions.&lt;SEP&gt;Russia has commercialized agricultural applications of phosphogypsum and explores extracting rare earth elements through integrated processing.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-ce9090f230bcd0bfeefe92db7a576442-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ce9090f230bcd0bfeefe92db7a576442-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ce9090f230bcd0bfeefe92db7a576442-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ce9090f230bcd0bfeefe92db7a576442-chunk-023&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ce9090f230bcd0bfeefe92db7a576442-chunk-024&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ce9090f230bcd0bfeefe92db7a576442-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-983b2c3f393a1de00521565a70363819-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-983b2c3f393a1de00521565a70363819-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-983b2c3f393a1de00521565a70363819-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-983b2c3f393a1de00521565a70363819-chunk-024&lt;SEP&gt;doc-983b2c3f393a1de00521565a70363819-chunk-023&lt;SEP&gt;doc-983b2c3f393a1de00521565a70363819-chunk-025&lt;SEP&gt;doc-983b2c3f393a1de00521565a70363819-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-042&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ac8d630b9aa4d874707445e2552a09-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ac8d630b9aa4d874707445e2552a09-chunk-003</data>
