<node id="F">
  <data key="d0">F</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">F, representing the chemical element fluorine, is a notable constituent and soluble impurity identified within phosphogypsum (PG) and purified gypsum products. It is systematically cataloged in geochemical datasets and data tables, where its presence is documented through specified numerical concentration ranges and compositional analyses. In the context of phosphogypsum, the fluorine content is quantified at approximately 0.12%, serving as a key metric in material characterization and quality assessment.

Beyond its static compositional role, F is actively monitored for its dynamic behavior during industrial processing. Specifically, its transformation and migration patterns are rigorously analyzed throughout the CLG process. This tracking is essential for understanding how the element behaves when gypsum is purified or processed, ensuring accurate reporting of its concentration and impurity status across different stages of production. By integrating both its measured concentration ranges and its migratory characteristics, F is comprehensively characterized as both a quantifiable geochemical marker and a process-critical soluble impurity.&lt;SEP&gt;Fluorine is a trace chemical component measured in phosphogypsum samples.&lt;SEP&gt;A chemical element measured in weight percent in the provided analytical data.&lt;SEP&gt;F is a chemical element representing fluorine, measured in the dataset with some values below detection limits.&lt;SEP&gt;F is a chemical element listed in the data table with associated numerical measurements.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-ce9090f230bcd0bfeefe92db7a576442-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-983b2c3f393a1de00521565a70363819-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-401b567da916dc34559e0bfe5a5b367b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-046&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-020&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a5d09b48f57a4e888bb729aaf988c936-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-043&lt;SEP&gt;doc-66f6434914b6de99019386e4bdcbc57e-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-66f6434914b6de99019386e4bdcbc57e-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-66f6434914b6de99019386e4bdcbc57e-chunk-008</data>
