<node id="Hydrochloric Acid">
  <data key="d0">Hydrochloric Acid</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Hydrochloric acid is a strong mineral and inorganic acid utilized across analytical, industrial, and hydrometallurgical applications. In laboratory and analytical settings, it is typically prepared as a 0.01 M solution for titrating carbonate and bicarbonate anions and is frequently employed in small quantities for precise pH adjustments, such as calibrating simulated body fluids to a pH of 7.40, rather than serving as a primary solute. Industrially, it functions as a key reagent in purification procedures, the wet process for phosphoric acid production, and various leaching operations.

A significant focus of modern research involves the use of hydrochloric acid to leach and recover rare earth elements from phosphogypsum and phosphate rocks. It acts as an effective leachant that readily dissolves the gypsum matrix and often demonstrates superior performance compared to sulfuric acid. However, its extraction efficiency is moderated by the solubility limits of calcium sulfate and is generally considered moderate in direct leaching, though it can be enhanced through a two-step process. The long-term operational viability of hydrochloric acid in this context presents conflicting findings: while it proves highly effective under single-pass or optimized conditions, other evaluations suggest it may be infeasible for sustained cyclic leaching. Consequently, its practical success in phosphogypsum processing is highly dependent on specific experimental conditions, process parameters, and the chosen operational mode.

Beyond rare earth extraction, hydrochloric acid serves diverse chemical and experimental roles. It is utilized to dissolve eggshell powder to facilitate calcium hydroxide formation and is employed in leaching experiments to investigate the dissolution behavior of both gypsum and phosphogypsum. In solubility studies, it is frequently tested at concentrations up to 5 M or 6 M, either alone or in combination with calcium chloride and potassium chloride, to evaluate gypsum solubility across varying temperatures. Additionally, it acts as a chemical parameter in the preparation of alpha-hemihydrate gypsum whiskers and is applied during low-temperature calcination of phosphogypsum to manage soluble phosphofluorine. In geotechnical and construction contexts, it functions as an acidic solution that triggers the dissolution of hydration products, thereby reducing the structural strength of filling bodies.&lt;SEP&gt;A chemical reagent specified in the standard for use in gypsum analysis procedures.&lt;SEP&gt;Hydrochloric Acid is a strong mineral acid used to adjust the pH of standard solutions and buffer mixtures.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-ce9090f230bcd0bfeefe92db7a576442-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-983b2c3f393a1de00521565a70363819-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-26bca3d4f742299ce2dbcd6381558f89-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-020&lt;SEP&gt;doc-401b567da916dc34559e0bfe5a5b367b-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-401b567da916dc34559e0bfe5a5b367b-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-401b567da916dc34559e0bfe5a5b367b-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-401b567da916dc34559e0bfe5a5b367b-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-401b567da916dc34559e0bfe5a5b367b-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-401b567da916dc34559e0bfe5a5b367b-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-401b567da916dc34559e0bfe5a5b367b-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1adcb38defdd04a271ddba318999ba67-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1adcb38defdd04a271ddba318999ba67-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-031&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-021&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-023&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f1fb5c243f2539cf7be6b6021b63c36f-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f1fb5c243f2539cf7be6b6021b63c36f-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c4a64a852097fdc910b98ed788503ce4-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-025&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-029&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-030&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ac8d630b9aa4d874707445e2552a09-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ac8d630b9aa4d874707445e2552a09-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-edfc4dcbd74cbf0b294f83f2034b209d-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-66f6434914b6de99019386e4bdcbc57e-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-66f6434914b6de99019386e4bdcbc57e-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-66f6434914b6de99019386e4bdcbc57e-chunk-024&lt;SEP&gt;doc-60e237a0a1045feedf76d35d654a79bd-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-60e237a0a1045feedf76d35d654a79bd-chunk-000</data>
