  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">Phalaborwa is a phosphate rock deposit in South Africa with a cadmium concentration of 4 mg/kg.&lt;SEP&gt;Phalaborwa is a phosphate rock deposit in South Africa with a cadmium concentration of 4 mg/kg.&lt;SEP&gt;Phalaborwa is a location in South Africa where phosphogypsum samples were collected.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-ce9090f230bcd0bfeefe92db7a576442-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-983b2c3f393a1de00521565a70363819-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-28fbd4302bba090e667215c840757ff7-chunk-001</data>
