  <data key="d0">Soil Biogeochemical Barrier</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Soil biogeochemical barrier is a natural phenomenon that prevents heavy metals from penetrating into plants.&lt;SEP&gt;Soil biogeochemical barrier is a natural phenomenon that prevents heavy metals from penetrating into plants.</data>
