  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">Eolian and hydrological pollution is environmental contamination resulting from the open stacking or ponding of phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Eolian and hydrological pollution is environmental contamination resulting from the open stacking or ponding of phosphogypsum.</data>
