  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Soil and landscape reclamation and remediation are new technologies synthesized to reinforce barriers for heavy metal transfer.&lt;SEP&gt;Soil and landscape reclamation and remediation are new technologies synthesized to reinforce barriers for heavy metal transfer.</data>
