  <data key="d2">Ponds are storage locations for utilized phosphogypsum that result in environmental pollution.&lt;SEP&gt;Ponds are storage locations for utilized phosphogypsum that result in environmental pollution.&lt;SEP&gt;Ponds are water bodies into which unused phosphogypsum is discharged.</data>
