<node id="Plant Nutrition">
  <data key="d0">Plant Nutrition</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Plant nutrition is supported by certain microelements and macroelements, though cadmium is harmful to it.&lt;SEP&gt;Plant nutrition is supported by certain microelements and macroelements, though cadmium is harmful to it.&lt;SEP&gt;Plant nutrition refers to the process of providing essential nutrients to plants to achieve high yield and maintain soil fertility.</data>
