  <data key="d0">Ion Associates and Complexes</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Ion associates and complexes bind cadmium ions, affecting their thermodynamic activity and mobility in soil.&lt;SEP&gt;Ion associates and complexes bind cadmium ions, affecting their thermodynamic activity and mobility in soil.</data>
