<node id="Experimental Conditions">
  <data key="d0">Experimental Conditions</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Experimental Conditions refer to the four dosage levels (0, 10, 20, 40 t ha⁻¹) used to test chemical responses.&lt;SEP&gt;Parameters or variables recorded via handwritten markings on the specimen.&lt;SEP&gt;Experimental Conditions refer to the ambient pressure and temperature settings used for the reaction sets.</data>
