  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Sodium ion is an exchangeable cation present in the Haplic Chernozem soil.&lt;SEP&gt;Sodium Ion (Na⁺) is a chemical species whose concentration was measured across the experimental conditions.&lt;SEP&gt;Sodium ion is an exchangeable cation present in the Haplic Chernozem soil.&lt;SEP&gt;Sodium ions released from NaCl accumulation on the surface help attract phosphate ions to form nucleation sites.</data>
