  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">An industrial facility located on the western bank of the river in Belorechensk, associated with phosphogypsum processing.&lt;SEP&gt;A large industrial facility situated on the western bank of the Belorechenskaya River, featuring ponds, stacks, and infrastructure.&lt;SEP&gt;The industrial complex is a facility situated just west of the main urban area, separated by agricultural land and a river valley.&lt;SEP&gt;A larger industrial area located in proximity to the site.&lt;SEP&gt;The Industrial Complex is a large facility in Huelva that produced phosphoric acid and fertilizer from 1965 to 2010.</data>
