  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Gas exchange in the soil–atmosphere system is influenced by CCE.&lt;SEP&gt;Gas exchange in the soil–atmosphere system is influenced by CCE.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-ce9090f230bcd0bfeefe92db7a576442-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-983b2c3f393a1de00521565a70363819-chunk-005</data>
