</node>
<node id="Soil–Atmosphere System">
  <data key="d0">Soil–Atmosphere System</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The soil–atmosphere system is the interface where CCE influences gas exchange and CO2 cycles.&lt;SEP&gt;The soil–atmosphere system is the interface where CCE influences gas exchange and CO2 cycles.</data>
