  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">A 2021 scientific paper detailing amelioration and remediation technology for phosphogypsum utilization.&lt;SEP&gt;A 2021 scientific paper detailing amelioration and remediation technology for phosphogypsum utilization.</data>
