  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">South-European facies is a geographic and soil classification associated with the Rostov Region study site.&lt;SEP&gt;South-European facies is a geographic and soil classification associated with the Rostov Region study site.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-ce9090f230bcd0bfeefe92db7a576442-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-983b2c3f393a1de00521565a70363819-chunk-000</data>
