  <data key="d2">Sulfuric acid technology is an industrial process used for phosphorus fertilizer production at the Belorechensk chemical plant.&lt;SEP&gt;Sulfuric acid technology is an industrial process used for phosphorus fertilizer production at the Belorechensk chemical plant.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-ce9090f230bcd0bfeefe92db7a576442-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-983b2c3f393a1de00521565a70363819-chunk-003</data>
