  <data key="d0">Aluminium Industry Caustic Liquid Waste</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Aluminium Industry Caustic Liquid Waste is a chemical input mixed with phosphogypsum to facilitate dissolution and subsequent carbonation.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-026</data>
