<node id="Deep Anaerobic Layer">
  <data key="d0">Deep Anaerobic Layer</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A deeper soil zone with redox potential below -200 mV where soil organic matter decomposes.&lt;SEP&gt;The deep anaerobic layer is characterized by an Eh below -200 mV and drives the decomposition of soil organic matter.</data>
