<node id="Liquid Phase">
  <data key="d0">Liquid Phase</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">The aqueous reaction phase where CO2 dissolves and hydrolysis occurs.&lt;SEP&gt;Liquid Phase is one of the two components mixed to form the fresh cement paste.&lt;SEP&gt;Liquid Phase is the filtrate separated from the solid phase after reaction termination.&lt;SEP&gt;A molten state formed by eutectic mixtures that encapsulates solid materials and hinders reaction kinetics.</data>
