</node>
<node id="Groundwater">
  <data key="d0">Groundwater</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">Groundwater is a critical subsurface aquifer system and natural environmental medium that encompasses shallow surficial aquifers and functions as a vital ecological resource. As a natural water source, it frequently interacts with solid waste and engineered filling bodies, such as cemented paste backfill (CPGFM) and phosphogypsum storage facilities, inducing the leaching of inorganic pollutants. This hydrogeological contact exposes both the aquifer and the filling structures to acidic conditions, soaking, and contaminant migration, which can compromise the structural stability of CPGFM in mining environments and necessitate careful engineering design.

The geochemical dynamics of groundwater are profoundly shaped by its interaction with phosphogypsum tailings and inadequate leachate control, leading to the redistribution of hazardous substances. Consequently, groundwater is highly susceptible to contamination from hazardous spills, leakages, and the mobilization of toxic elements, including phosphorus, fluorine, heavy metals, and mobile anions. These contaminants frequently form plumes that migrate toward coastal areas, posing significant risks to aquatic ecosystems and human health. To mitigate these pollution risks, groundwater is regularly monitored as a standard component of remedial actions for phosphogypsum tailings ponds.

Radiochemical and hydrochemical analyses reveal distinct contaminant signatures in affected groundwater systems. Notably, radioactive decay processes often cause an enrichment of Uranium-234 relative to Uranium-238, alongside detections of Polonium-210 and Radium-226. The aqueous concentration of Radium-226 is further modulated by factors such as ionic strength and total dissolved solids. These complex interplays between hydrogeological transport and chemical leaching underscore the vulnerability of groundwater as a vital environmental resource and highlight the necessity of stringent management when industrial waste interacts with subsurface water systems.&lt;SEP&gt;Groundwater is an environmental medium into which phosphogypsum impurities can seep, causing pollution.&lt;SEP&gt;Groundwater is a subsurface water source containing dissolved ions and radioactive components.&lt;SEP&gt;Groundwater is the receiving medium for various liquid chemical emissions documented in the inventory.&lt;SEP&gt;Groundwater is an environmental medium susceptible to contamination through the leaching and migration of phosphogypsum pollutants.&lt;SEP&gt;Groundwater is a natural water resource that receives migrating fluorides and phosphorus from soil, posing health risks through drinking water.&lt;SEP&gt;Groundwater is an environmental resource at risk of contamination from leachate generated by phosphogypsum landfills.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-028&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-34a3ac199714be8fd1cdff8ead90fc92-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-34a3ac199714be8fd1cdff8ead90fc92-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-025&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-024&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-034&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-021&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-033&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a5d09b48f57a4e888bb729aaf988c936-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a5d09b48f57a4e888bb729aaf988c936-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-022&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-028&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-023&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ac8d630b9aa4d874707445e2552a09-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0060991ac74a9675ce0293eccdc023cd-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0060991ac74a9675ce0293eccdc023cd-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-afe70f2d82515df80906bf3babd4e4eb-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-afe70f2d82515df80906bf3babd4e4eb-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-28fbd4302bba090e667215c840757ff7-chunk-000</data>
