<node id="Phosphoric acid">
  <data key="d0">Phosphoric acid</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Phosphoric acid is a chemical compound and industrial chemical classified as a weaker acid. It is primarily manufactured by the phosphate fertilizer industry through the reaction of phosphate rock with sulfuric acid. This chemical conversion process generates phosphoric acid as a secondary product while simultaneously producing phosphogypsum as a major industrial byproduct and waste material.

Beyond its role as a primary output, residual phosphoric acid frequently persists within the resulting phosphogypsum waste, where it functions as a chemical impurity existing in both soluble and insoluble forms and contributes to the organic matter content of the material. In specialized applications, phosphoric acid serves as a chemical reagent that is added in precise stoichiometric amounts during the synthesis of nHA particles. Collectively, these characteristics define its dual presence as both a targeted industrial product and a residual component in associated waste streams.&lt;SEP&gt;Phosphoric acid is produced via a wet method, generating phosphogypsum as an industrial byproduct.&lt;SEP&gt;Chemical produced from phosphate rocks, with phosphogypsum obtained as a by-product.&lt;SEP&gt;A fertilizer-grade chemical listed under materials savings with a quantity of -6.2 kg.&lt;SEP&gt;Phosphoric acid is a reactant used in an alkaline medium with phosphogypsum to synthesize nano-hydroxyapatite and ammonium sulfate.&lt;SEP&gt;Phosphoric acid is a key chemical produced for the fertilizer industry, primarily via the wet acid method.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-029&lt;SEP&gt;doc-001fe856b0d193d82422dc8a5baedc86-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e290dd6268316238694f70c30a367426-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1adcb38defdd04a271ddba318999ba67-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6f5dcf59bedaa00614f1acc222b1fb7b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-06f299b7e723cda1f0de1a647b02b6b4-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e4a551024f80f822f3f35e38ec278151-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0060991ac74a9675ce0293eccdc023cd-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-35aef6efc801611130c5dd196fe513df-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-66f6434914b6de99019386e4bdcbc57e-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
