<node id="Stoichiometry">
  <data key="d0">Stoichiometry</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Stoichiometry is the quantitative principle ensuring that the number of atoms for each element remains equal on both sides of the chemical equation.&lt;SEP&gt;Stoichiometry is the atomic ratio composition of apatite, which intrinsically influences its thermal stability.&lt;SEP&gt;Stoichiometry refers to the balanced atomic composition and quantitative relationships in the chemical equation.</data>
