  <data key="d2">Rare earth elements are valuable materials targeted for extraction from phosphogypsum waste through specialized leaching processes.&lt;SEP&gt;Rare earth elements are strategic resources with unique physico-chemical properties used in advanced electronics and lighting.&lt;SEP&gt;Rare earth elements are valuable materials targeted for extraction from phosphogypsum waste through specialized leaching processes.&lt;SEP&gt;Rare earth elements are critical global market materials found in non-negligible amounts within phosphogypsum.</data>
