<node id="Cement clinker">
  <data key="d0">Cement clinker</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Cement clinker is a processed material used to produce cement, characterized by specific chemical and phase compositions.&lt;SEP&gt;A primary component interground with phosphogypsum to produce Portland cement.&lt;SEP&gt;Cement clinker is the primary raw material used in the production of Portland cement.&lt;SEP&gt;Cement clinker strength decreases when mixed with impure phosphogypsum.</data>
