<node id="Citric acid">
  <data key="d0">Citric acid</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Citric acid is a chemical solution used to wash and purify phosphogypsum samples.&lt;SEP&gt;Citric acid is an aqueous solution used to treat phosphogypsum samples to mitigate its negative effects on cement.&lt;SEP&gt;Citric acid is a leaching reagent used to treat phosphogypsum, effectively removing phosphorus and strontium.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-001fe856b0d193d82422dc8a5baedc86-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-001fe856b0d193d82422dc8a5baedc86-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-28fbd4302bba090e667215c840757ff7-chunk-004</data>
