  <data key="d2">Miller is a researcher whose findings on retarding mechanisms in cement hydration are corroborated by the text.&lt;SEP&gt;Miller is a researcher who reported chemical composition values for phosphogypsum process water.&lt;SEP&gt;Miller conducted field studies on operational stacks in central Florida with Sutcliffe.</data>
