  <data key="d2">Chemical composition refers to the percentage breakdown of constituents like P₂O₅, F, organic matter, and Na₂O + K₂O in the phosphogypsum samples.&lt;SEP&gt;A material property that influences the setting duration of cement.&lt;SEP&gt;Chemical composition is a key quality attribute of phosphogypsum that fluctuates and impacts backfill generalizability.&lt;SEP&gt;Chemical Composition refers to the quantitative breakdown of elements like CaO, SiO2, and SO3 in the raw materials.</data>
