<node id="Setting time">
  <data key="d0">Setting time</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Setting time is a physical property tested for in the produced cements.&lt;SEP&gt;Setting time is a key property of cement that is considerably retarded when phosphogypsum is used.&lt;SEP&gt;Setting time refers to the duration required for cementitious materials to transition from a fresh state to a hardened state.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-001fe856b0d193d82422dc8a5baedc86-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-001fe856b0d193d82422dc8a5baedc86-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-017</data>
