<node id="Curing Periods">
  <data key="d0">Curing Periods</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">Curing periods represent the specific time intervals (1, 3, 7, and 28 days) at which compressive strength is measured.&lt;SEP&gt;Specific time intervals (7, 28, 90, and 360 days) used to evaluate strength and durability development.</data>
