  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The crystal lattice is the structural location within phosphogypsum where phosphorus pentoxide is difficult to remove.&lt;SEP&gt;The crystal lattice of phosphogypsum incorporates trace elements, explaining their low concentrations in leachates.</data>
