  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">Israel is a geographic region where phosphate rock contains a rare earth element concentration of 0.01%.&lt;SEP&gt;Israel is a region referenced in early soil science literature regarding phosphogypsum applications and erosion control.</data>
