<node id="Life Cycle Assessment">
  <data key="d0">Life Cycle Assessment</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Life Cycle Assessment is a systematic, comprehensive, and standardized multi-step analytical framework and methodology designed to evaluate the environmental performance, impacts, resource consumption, emissions, and sustainability associated with products, materials, industrial processes, and waste management strategies across all stages of their life cycles. As a structured analytical procedure, it quantifies ecological footprints, predicts long-term environmental consequences, and compares the environmental impacts of alternative management approaches. The methodology extends beyond purely ecological metrics to incorporate economic, social, and techno-economic dimensions, often functioning alongside techno-economic assessments to measure resource efficiency and inventory data.

In practical applications, Life Cycle Assessment serves as a versatile instrument for sustainable decision-making across diverse technological and material contexts. It is routinely employed to analyze the environmental and economic challenges, performance, sensitivity, and transformation of various by-products and waste streams. Notable implementations include evaluating the recovery of rare earth elements from waste fluorescent powders, comparing disposal and utilization methods for Plaster of Paris, and extensively assessing the recycling, valorization, management, and applications of phosphogypsum. Through these diverse use cases, Life Cycle Assessment provides a rigorous, objective foundation for optimizing resource use, minimizing ecological footprints, and guiding environmentally responsible industrial and waste management practices.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-26bca3d4f742299ce2dbcd6381558f89-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-276f29345df37143fc224a22d0f6089b-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-276f29345df37143fc224a22d0f6089b-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-276f29345df37143fc224a22d0f6089b-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-276f29345df37143fc224a22d0f6089b-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-276f29345df37143fc224a22d0f6089b-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-276f29345df37143fc224a22d0f6089b-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-06f299b7e723cda1f0de1a647b02b6b4-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0060991ac74a9675ce0293eccdc023cd-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0060991ac74a9675ce0293eccdc023cd-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0060991ac74a9675ce0293eccdc023cd-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0060991ac74a9675ce0293eccdc023cd-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0060991ac74a9675ce0293eccdc023cd-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0060991ac74a9675ce0293eccdc023cd-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0060991ac74a9675ce0293eccdc023cd-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0060991ac74a9675ce0293eccdc023cd-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0060991ac74a9675ce0293eccdc023cd-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0060991ac74a9675ce0293eccdc023cd-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0060991ac74a9675ce0293eccdc023cd-chunk-015</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1791876031</data>
