<node id="Poland">
  <data key="d0">Poland</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">Poland is a European country that plays a significant role in the industrial and scientific handling of phosphogypsum and related metallurgical processes. The nation produces approximately 1.5 million tons of phosphogypsum annually, accounting for 6.57% of global phosphogypsum production or reserves, and serves as the origin for phosphogypsum samples used in various research initiatives. To manage this industrial byproduct, Poland has established documented practices for phosphogypsum management and radiation monitoring. Furthermore, the country has developed innovative methods for co-producing sulfuric acid and cement using phosphogypsum.

A central focus of these industrial and research efforts is the WIZÓW Chemical Plant, which has been the subject of multiple case studies examining industrial phosphogypsum waste management and rare earth element recovery. Poland’s contributions to this field are further reflected in its significant output of phosphogypsum-related scientific research. Beyond phosphogypsum applications, Poland also serves as a source region for copper metallurgical slags that are processed using bacterial leaching techniques.&lt;SEP&gt;Poland is the country where Maria Curie-Skłodowska University is located.&lt;SEP&gt;Poland is the country where the authors' research institution is based.&lt;SEP&gt;Poland is the country of origin for Hydrolab and Ertec, the suppliers of experimental materials and equipment.&lt;SEP&gt;Poland is the location of the WIZOW chemical plant featured in a phosphogypsum recovery case study.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-26bca3d4f742299ce2dbcd6381558f89-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-401b567da916dc34559e0bfe5a5b367b-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-70650e5cb032fce744763706d8701e36-chunk-020&lt;SEP&gt;doc-70650e5cb032fce744763706d8701e36-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-70650e5cb032fce744763706d8701e36-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-028&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-030&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4739e42903c95e1fb7e0ecfbca3a12df-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d4a38fcc1b0f33a17d23e7a4407a9cf9-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d4a38fcc1b0f33a17d23e7a4407a9cf9-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0060991ac74a9675ce0293eccdc023cd-chunk-014</data>
