  <data key="d0">Jorf Lasfar</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">Jorf Lasfar is a location in Morocco where a phosphoric acid plant is situated.&lt;SEP&gt;A specific site in Morocco where phosphogypsum samples were obtained.&lt;SEP&gt;Jorf Lasfar is a site in Morocco, identified as a phosphogypsum source.&lt;SEP&gt;Jorf Lasfar is a major chemical industry location in Morocco where phosphogypsum waste is rejected without preliminary treatment.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-26bca3d4f742299ce2dbcd6381558f89-chunk-026&lt;SEP&gt;doc-26bca3d4f742299ce2dbcd6381558f89-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-26bca3d4f742299ce2dbcd6381558f89-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-160a0fe95f7c82b193c6af751106ab6d-chunk-005</data>
