<node id="Chem. Eng. J.">
  <data key="d0">Chem. Eng. J.</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The Chemical Engineering Journal, commonly abbreviated as Chem. Eng. J., is a scientific publication dedicated to advancing research in chemical engineering and its practical industrial applications. The journal serves as a comprehensive platform for scholarly work spanning a wide array of technical and environmental topics within the field.

In addition to its broad focus on chemical engineering principles, the journal has published numerous specialized studies addressing specific material applications and environmental remediation techniques. Notable research featured in its issues includes the low-carbon stabilization of contaminated soil, fixed-bed reactor modeling, and the recovery of phosphorus from sewage sludge ash. The publication also extensively covers advanced materials science, particularly the preparation and application of nanocrystalline hydroxyapatite, as well as the adsorption of heavy metals using magnetic hydroxyapatite nanoparticles. Furthermore, the journal has documented targeted environmental engineering solutions, such as a 2007 study detailing zinc removal processes utilizing phosphogypsum. Collectively, these contributions highlight the journal's commitment to disseminating innovative research across both theoretical modeling and applied environmental and materials engineering.&lt;SEP&gt;Chem. Eng. J. is a scientific journal that published research on morphology-controlled fabrication of hydroxyapatite nanostructures.&lt;SEP&gt;Chem. Eng. J. is a scientific journal that published research on cadmium and zinc adsorption using hydroxyapatite.&lt;SEP&gt;Chem. Eng. J. is a scientific journal that published research on MOF-based ion-imprinted polymers for Gd(III) recovery.&lt;SEP&gt;A peer-reviewed scientific journal publishing research on chemical engineering and photocatalyst design.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-26bca3d4f742299ce2dbcd6381558f89-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-26bca3d4f742299ce2dbcd6381558f89-chunk-022&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-022&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-028&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-025&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0a5563c80c4fd1f68b4442f73621a281-chunk-027&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0a5563c80c4fd1f68b4442f73621a281-chunk-030&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-037&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a4d02158bbc770d7c6bd9657b3f3defc-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6f5dcf59bedaa00614f1acc222b1fb7b-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-06f299b7e723cda1f0de1a647b02b6b4-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3fd8439e859e3dd0c96328384e1761f0-chunk-018</data>
