<node id="X-ray Diffraction">
  <data key="d0">X-ray Diffraction</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">X-ray Diffraction is a fundamental analytical and structural characterization technique primarily utilized to investigate the crystalline structure, phase purity, material composition, and microstructural properties of diverse substances. The method operates by measuring X-ray diffraction intensities to generate diffraction patterns that plot signal intensity against the diffraction angle. These patterns are subsequently compared against standard reference patterns to determine crystallographic characteristics, texture, and mineral phases. By interpreting the resulting data, X-ray Diffraction accurately identifies crystalline phases, specific minerals such as α-quartz, and main phase compositions, while calculating critical parameters including lattice and interplanar spacings, overall crystallinity levels, crystallite dimensions, particle size, and material strain. The technique is also specifically employed to study structural properties, peak broadening, and the mineralogical evolution of designed mixes.

X-ray Diffraction is widely applied across a broad spectrum of natural and synthesized matrices, including raw and treated phosphogypsum, phosphogypsum waste, gypsum-brushite mixtures, beneficiated solids, mixed powders, evaporated phosphogypsum leachate, set cement composites, brick samples, eggshells, synthesized hydroxyapatite powders, and ammonium sulfate. It serves as an indispensable tool for evaluating crystalline composition, mineralogical makeup, phase content, and structural evolution, frequently identifying trace element compounds. While highly robust, the technique has a defined sensitivity limitation, with a detection threshold of 10,000 ppm for rare earth elements. To overcome this constraint and achieve deeper characterization, it frequently functions as part of a multi-analytical approach when combined with other analytical methods.

Additionally, X-ray Diffraction serves as a standard representation method for visualizing crystallographic structure data, commonly displayed through 3D stacked line plots. It remains an essential and standard method for assessing structural properties and chemical characteristics across a wide range of materials, providing reliable confirmation of crystalline structures and phase purity in both research and industrial applications.&lt;SEP&gt;X-ray Diffraction is a mineralogical characterization technique used to identify and quantify crystallized phases in the samples.&lt;SEP&gt;X-ray diffraction is an analytical technique used to characterize the mineralogical composition of phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;X-ray diffraction is a diffractogram analysis technique used to determine the primary mineralogical composition of phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;X-ray diffraction is a scientific technique used to generate diffraction patterns for mineral characterization.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-26bca3d4f742299ce2dbcd6381558f89-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-26bca3d4f742299ce2dbcd6381558f89-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-26bca3d4f742299ce2dbcd6381558f89-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-80bac46661a7d25358c897f5feccea99-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-80bac46661a7d25358c897f5feccea99-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b8bd3776c87a0bcab21842e8e2bb2e06-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b8bd3776c87a0bcab21842e8e2bb2e06-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-029&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-34a3ac199714be8fd1cdff8ead90fc92-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8a6c42f76034cfa4338bd156b7179fc5-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8a6c42f76034cfa4338bd156b7179fc5-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-038&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f1fb5c243f2539cf7be6b6021b63c36f-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8c22d31cfad5421c936a23705a3bc6e0-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8c22d31cfad5421c936a23705a3bc6e0-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c4a64a852097fdc910b98ed788503ce4-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c4a64a852097fdc910b98ed788503ce4-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c4a64a852097fdc910b98ed788503ce4-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c4a64a852097fdc910b98ed788503ce4-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c4a64a852097fdc910b98ed788503ce4-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6f5dcf59bedaa00614f1acc222b1fb7b-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6f5dcf59bedaa00614f1acc222b1fb7b-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6f5dcf59bedaa00614f1acc222b1fb7b-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-023&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6825862084b162a4b16cd1037c76e3d7-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2196dee89de9694f28ef4eaa0e85f130-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4739e42903c95e1fb7e0ecfbca3a12df-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a52951853fd542b78835b677936c557b-chunk-01