  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Sodium Sulfates are major components of the Beneficiated Solid that can be eliminated through washing techniques.&lt;SEP&gt;Sodium sulfates are co-generated compounds targeted for recovery and recycling in the integrated processing strategy.</data>
