<node id="European Commission">
  <data key="d0">European Commission</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">European Commission is a regulatory body that classified certain rare earth elements as critical metals.&lt;SEP&gt;Regulatory body that established directives limiting indoor radiation exposure from building materials.&lt;SEP&gt;The European Commission is a regulatory body that established a 1.0 mSv per annum dose criterion and activity concentration index for phosphogypsum bulk application.&lt;SEP&gt;A governing body that issued directives on radiation protection and safety standards.&lt;SEP&gt;A regulatory body whose guidelines influence the environmental assessment and management of phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;The European Commission is a governing body that published directives and handbooks related to environmental safety and life cycle assessment.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-26bca3d4f742299ce2dbcd6381558f89-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-70650e5cb032fce744763706d8701e36-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-70650e5cb032fce744763706d8701e36-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-70650e5cb032fce744763706d8701e36-chunk-021&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-020&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0060991ac74a9675ce0293eccdc023cd-chunk-013</data>
