<node id="Reactor">
  <data key="d0">Reactor</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">A reactor is processing equipment at risk of erosion-corrosion damage from quartz impurities.&lt;SEP&gt;Experimental vessel where microbial fermentation and material decomposition occur.&lt;SEP&gt;Reactor is the experimental vessel where the chemical reactions and phase separations occur.&lt;SEP&gt;The equipment used for synthesis where higher temperature and longer synthesis time were applied.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-26bca3d4f742299ce2dbcd6381558f89-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e290dd6268316238694f70c30a367426-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2760dc2a11fedad02d24741a978cf20d-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d4a38fcc1b0f33a17d23e7a4407a9cf9-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d4a38fcc1b0f33a17d23e7a4407a9cf9-chunk-008</data>
