<node id="Scanning Electron Microscopy">
  <data key="d0">Scanning Electron Microscopy</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Scanning Electron Microscopy is a versatile analytical and imaging technique primarily utilized to examine and visualize the surface morphology, microscopic texture, microstructural characteristics, and surface structure of a wide range of materials and synthesized samples. The method functions by generating high-magnification micrographs and capturing detailed surface scans, which are frequently accompanied by the extraction of technical metadata. Beyond structural visualization, the technique is capable of mapping elemental distributions and specifically identifying rare earth elements within analyzed specimens. In practical applications, samples are often prepared by sputtering them with a thin layer of gold to facilitate accurate morphological studies.

The technique is extensively deployed across research and industrial settings to characterize diverse substances. It is commonly applied to analyze raw and leached phosphogypsum, individual phosphogypsum particles, stacked plate-like crystals with textured and layered surfaces, phosphogypsum-based brick samples, and citric acid-treated phosphogypsum to observe improved microstructure and densification. Scanning Electron Microscopy is also widely used to evaluate synthesized powders and particles, providing critical insights into their physical and chemical properties while determining particle sizes and assessing particle size distribution. Furthermore, it serves as a key characterization tool for synthesized hydroxyapatite, where it assesses morphological features and overall morphology, including dried and calcined hydroxyapatite powders and nanopowders. The method is equally effective for examining the surface structure and morphology of crystals, ceramics, and materials exhibiting specific structural traits such as cylindrical rod-like morphologies. Through these targeted analyses, Scanning Electron Microscopy delivers comprehensive data on the structural, morphological, and compositional attributes of materials across multiple scientific domains.&lt;SEP&gt;Scanning electron microscopy is an analytical technique used to characterize the mineralogical composition of phosphogypsum.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-26bca3d4f742299ce2dbcd6381558f89-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-401b567da916dc34559e0bfe5a5b367b-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-401b567da916dc34559e0bfe5a5b367b-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b8bd3776c87a0bcab21842e8e2bb2e06-chunk-024&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f2534f7a997df3f80305323317b15be9-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f2534f7a997df3f80305323317b15be9-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f2534f7a997df3f80305323317b15be9-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8a6c42f76034cfa4338bd156b7179fc5-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8a6c42f76034cfa4338bd156b7179fc5-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8a6c42f76034cfa4338bd156b7179fc5-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a4d02158bbc770d7c6bd9657b3f3defc-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f1fb5c243f2539cf7be6b6021b63c36f-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f1fb5c243f2539cf7be6b6021b63c36f-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6f5dcf59bedaa00614f1acc222b1fb7b-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6f5dcf59bedaa00614f1acc222b1fb7b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2760dc2a11fedad02d24741a978cf20d-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6825862084b162a4b16cd1037c76e3d7-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6825862084b162a4b16cd1037c76e3d7-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-06f299b7e723cda1f0de1a647b02b6b4-chunk-023&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ac8d630b9aa4d874707445e2552a09-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a52951853fd542b78835b677936c557b-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a52951853fd542b78835b677936c557b-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d4a38fcc1b0f33a17d23e7a4407a9cf9-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d4a38fcc1b0f33a17d23e7a4407a9cf9-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d4a38fcc1b0f33a17d23e7a4407a9cf9-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d4a38fcc1b0f33a17d23e7a4407a9cf9-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-160a0fe95f7c82b193c6af751106ab6d-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-35aef6efc801611130c5dd196fe513df-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-35aef6efc801611130c5dd196fe513df-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-35aef6efc801611130c5dd196fe513df-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-66f6434914b6de99019386e4bdcbc57e-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
