<node id="Energy Dispersive X-ray Spectroscopy">
  <data key="d0">Energy Dispersive X-ray Spectroscopy</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Energy Dispersive X-ray Spectroscopy is an analytical and materials science technique designed to determine the elemental composition of a sample. The method functions by plotting signal intensity against photon energy, a process that enables the precise identification and quantification of the elements present within a given material. As a fundamental tool in materials characterization, it provides critical data regarding the chemical makeup of diverse substances.

The technique is frequently coupled with microscopy systems, particularly scanning electron microscopy, to facilitate advanced spatial analysis. This integration allows researchers to generate detailed elemental maps that visualize the distribution of elements across a sample. In practical applications, Energy Dispersive X-ray Spectroscopy has been extensively utilized to analyze phosphogypsum particles, where it effectively detects specific mineral phases, determines the calcium-to-phosphorus ratio, and characterizes the overall elemental profile of the material.&lt;SEP&gt;Energy Dispersive X-ray Spectroscopy is a technique coupled with the Scanning Electron Microscope to generate elemental maps of the sample.&lt;SEP&gt;Energy Dispersive X-ray Spectroscopy is an analytical technique used to determine the elemental composition of a sample.&lt;SEP&gt;A materials science technique used to determine elemental composition based on energy levels.&lt;SEP&gt;Energy Dispersive X-ray Spectroscopy is a technique used to generate elemental mapping data for analyzing material composition.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-26bca3d4f742299ce2dbcd6381558f89-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-401b567da916dc34559e0bfe5a5b367b-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-401b567da916dc34559e0bfe5a5b367b-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b8bd3776c87a0bcab21842e8e2bb2e06-chunk-024&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f1fb5c243f2539cf7be6b6021b63c36f-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f1fb5c243f2539cf7be6b6021b63c36f-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f1fb5c243f2539cf7be6b6021b63c36f-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-06f299b7e723cda1f0de1a647b02b6b4-chunk-024&lt;SEP&gt;doc-06f299b7e723cda1f0de1a647b02b6b4-chunk-026&lt;SEP&gt;doc-35aef6efc801611130c5dd196fe513df-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-66f6434914b6de99019386e4bdcbc57e-chunk-025</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1792041352</data>
