</node>
<node id="Erbium">
  <data key="d0">Erbium</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">A critical rare earth element categorized by Seredin, found in phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;A chemical element used as a dopant with Ytterbium to lower the crystallization temperature of calcium fluoride.&lt;SEP&gt;Erbium is a rare earth element measured in WBS and TWBS samples.&lt;SEP&gt;Erbium is a rare earth element assessed for recovery efficiency in leaching studies.&lt;SEP&gt;Erbium is a rare earth element that exhibits high leaching selectivity (89.4%) using a 1.0 mol/L citric acid solution.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-26bca3d4f742299ce2dbcd6381558f89-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-26bca3d4f742299ce2dbcd6381558f89-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-26bca3d4f742299ce2dbcd6381558f89-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-023&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-022</data>
