<node id="Sol-Gel Method">
  <data key="d0">Sol-Gel Method</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Sol-Gel Method is a wet-chemical technique used for the fabrication of materials starting from a chemical solution precursor.&lt;SEP&gt;Sol-gel method is a conventional method proposed for producing synthetic nano-hydroxyapatite.&lt;SEP&gt;Sol-gel method is one of the synthesis routes used to prepare hydroxyapatite powders.&lt;SEP&gt;Sol-gel is a chemical technique employed to synthesize hydroxyapatite crystals.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-26bca3d4f742299ce2dbcd6381558f89-chunk-021&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1adcb38defdd04a271ddba318999ba67-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8a6c42f76034cfa4338bd156b7179fc5-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f1fb5c243f2539cf7be6b6021b63c36f-chunk-000</data>
