</node>
<node id="Becquerels Per Kilogram">
  <data key="d0">Becquerels Per Kilogram</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">Becquerels Per Kilogram is the unit of measurement for radioactivity concentration in the Ra-Eq formula.&lt;SEP&gt;Becquerels Per Kilogram is the standard unit used to quantify radioactive activity in environmental samples.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-80bac46661a7d25358c897f5feccea99-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-70650e5cb032fce744763706d8701e36-chunk-024</data>
