  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Phosphoric Acid Production">
  <data key="d0">Phosphoric Acid Production</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Phosphoric Acid Production is an industrial and chemical manufacturing process primarily defined by the conversion of phosphate rock into phosphoric acid. The operation is typically executed through wet, kiln, or thermal methods, and its environmental impacts have been studied using the di-hemihydrate process. A central and defining characteristic of this manufacturing cycle is the generation of phosphogypsum, a solid waste material that consistently serves as the primary byproduct. This phosphogypsum waste is notable for containing radioactive isotopes.

From an operational standpoint, Phosphoric Acid Production functions as a critical industrial unit that provides a direct application site for the seamless implementation of co-production technologies. Beyond its chemical manufacturing role, the process carries substantial environmental and geochemical implications. It actively influences the mobility of toxic elements within surrounding ecosystems and is closely associated with the fractionation of natural radioactivity. Consequently, while the process yields essential chemical compounds, it also generates substantial solid waste with significant environmental and radiological impacts, establishing it as a major industrial activity with notable ecological footprints.&lt;SEP&gt;A production method that influences the chemical content in calcium sulphate from phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;An industrial process that generates phosphogypsum as a byproduct.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-80bac46661a7d25358c897f5feccea99-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-80bac46661a7d25358c897f5feccea99-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-80bac46661a7d25358c897f5feccea99-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-276f29345df37143fc224a22d0f6089b-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-70650e5cb032fce744763706d8701e36-chunk-023&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-035&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-038&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-021&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e4a551024f80f822f3f35e38ec278151-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ac8d630b9aa4d874707445e2552a09-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ac8d630b9aa4d874707445e2552a09-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d18c456289f64c1e16c73a0dfd6595b3-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d18c456289f64c1e16c73a0dfd6595b3-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0060991ac74a9675ce0293eccdc023cd-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0060991ac74a9675ce0293eccdc023cd-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-28fbd4302bba090e667215c840757ff7-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-54b92b2ad16a2528ff6a863329c5d403-chunk-010</data>
