  <data key="d0">Journal of Environmental Radioactivity</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">A scientific journal that published studies on environmental radioactivity, radon emanation, and NORM contamination.&lt;SEP&gt;Journal of Environmental Radioactivity is a scientific journal that published El Afifi and Awwad's work on TE-NORM waste.&lt;SEP&gt;Journal of Environmental Radioactivity is an academic publication featuring research on radionuclide flow, environmental radiochemistry, and phosphogypsum studies.&lt;SEP&gt;Journal of Environmental Radioactivity is an academic journal publishing multiple studies on phosphogypsum radiological impacts.&lt;SEP&gt;Journal of Environmental Radioactivity is a scientific journal that published a 2014 study on radioactive characterization near a phosphogypsum disposal site.</data>
