<node id="Lead-212">
  <data key="d0">Lead-212</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Lead-212 is a daughter radionuclide of Thorium-232, used to determine its activity concentration.&lt;SEP&gt;Lead-212 is a radionuclide present in the standard reference materials used for efficiency determination.&lt;SEP&gt;Lead-212 is a decay product of Thorium-228 measured at 238.6 keV to determine Thorium-228 activity.&lt;SEP&gt;A decay product of Thorium-228, used in its radiometric measurement.&lt;SEP&gt;A radioactive isotope in the decay chain of Thorium-228, measured alongside it.&lt;SEP&gt;Lead-212 is a radioactive isotope associated with Thorium-228 in the dataset.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-80bac46661a7d25358c897f5feccea99-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-70650e5cb032fce744763706d8701e36-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-70650e5cb032fce744763706d8701e36-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-70650e5cb032fce744763706d8701e36-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-70650e5cb032fce744763706d8701e36-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-70650e5cb032fce744763706d8701e36-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1791312327</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Actinium-228">
  <data key="d0">Actinium-228</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Actinium-228 is a daughter radionuclide of Thorium-232, used to determine its activity concentration.&lt;SEP&gt;Actinium-228 is a radionuclide present in the standard reference materials used for efficiency determination.&lt;SEP&gt;A decay product of Radium-228, used in its radiometric measurement.&lt;SEP&gt;A radioactive isotope in the decay chain of Radium-228, measured alongside it.&lt;SEP&gt;Actinium-228 is a daughter radionuclide in the thorium decay chain, often out of equilibrium in phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Actinium-228 is a radionuclide measured in phosphogypsum that contributes to its radioactivity.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-80bac46661a7d25358c897f5feccea99-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-70650e5cb032fce744763706d8701e36-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-70650e5cb032fce744763706d8701e36-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-70650e5cb032fce744763706d8701e36-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-70650e5cb032fce744763706d8701e36-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-28fbd4302bba090e667215c840757ff7-chunk-001</data>
