  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Phosphoric Acid Factories are industrial facilities in SW Spain that process phosphate rock and generate phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Industrial facilities in SW Spain that produce phosphate rock and phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Phosphoric acid factories in SW Spain produce phosphate rock and phosphogypsum, subject to radiological and chemical characterization.&lt;SEP&gt;Phosphoric acid factories are industrial facilities that generate phosphogypsum as a by-product during phosphate rock processing.</data>
