  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Researchers who incorporated modified quartz sand into CPB mixtures to optimize aggregate gradation and promote hydration reactions.&lt;SEP&gt;Shi et al. are researchers who provided chemical composition data for phosphogypsum samples in China.&lt;SEP&gt;Shi et al. are researchers who found that calcium ions from calcium carbonate react with soluble impurities to accelerate condensation.&lt;SEP&gt;Shi et al. is a research group that investigated the reaction of calcium carbonate with soluble impurities to accelerate condensation.&lt;SEP&gt;Shi et al. found that heavy metals from PG and binders are effectively solidified into CPGFM backfill.&lt;SEP&gt;Shi et al. explored incorporating iron tailings and modified quartz sand to hinder phosphorus migration.</data>
