<node id="Application of phosphogypsum in soilization: a review">
  <data key="d0">Application of phosphogypsum in soilization: a review</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">A 2023 publication detailing the use of phosphogypsum in agricultural remediation and soilization.</data>
