<node id="Constr. Build. Mater.">
  <data key="d0">Constr. Build. Mater.</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Construction and Building Materials, widely recognized by its abbreviation Constr. Build. Mater., is a peer-reviewed scientific and academic journal dedicated to advancing research in construction materials, cement manufacturing, concrete properties, and material recycling. Serving as a central platform for both academic and industrial studies, the publication focuses on the development, performance evaluation, and sustainable application of modern building materials. It maintains a strong record of publishing specialized investigations into cementitious systems and industrial by-products, thereby supporting critical advancements in cement chemistry, waste valorization, and construction material engineering.

A significant portion of the journal’s research portfolio is dedicated to the utilization, recycling, and application of phosphogypsum in construction. It has published extensive studies on the preparation, properties, and practical uses of phosphogypsum-based cementitious materials, including detailed analyses of its dehydration behavior, impurity transformations, setting, hardening, and hydration characteristics. The journal also features research on the development of lime-fly ash-phosphogypsum binders, the impact of calcination temperatures on phosphogypsum-based cements, and the influence of phosphorus impurities in calcium sulfoaluminate cement, alongside a prominent 2008 study on its practical applications.

In addition to phosphogypsum research, the journal covers innovative approaches to solidification, stabilization, and composite development in construction. Notable publications include studies on enhancing phosphogypsum stabilization through cemented paste backfill, as well as research on carbon nanotube reinforced cementitious tailings composites and advanced backfill materials. Through these diverse contributions, Construction and Building Materials continues to serve as a vital resource for researchers and practitioners focused on sustainable construction practices and industrial material innovation.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-024&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-023&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-020&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-051&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-037&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-042&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7797768798fcd1152bdc10ff73139e35-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-030&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-034&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-033&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-039&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-035&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ac8d630b9aa4d874707445e2552a09-chunk-019</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1791772086</data>
