<node id="Silica Fume">
  <data key="d0">Silica Fume</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Silica Fume is a silica-rich supplementary cementitious material and mineral additive characterized by a silicon dioxide content exceeding 97%, with commercial sources including Gongyi Baichuan Environmental Protection Engineering Co., Ltd. Primarily utilized as an admixture in concrete and cementitious systems, it is typically incorporated at dosages ranging from 0% to 9%. In self-compacting concrete, it serves as a substitute additive that promotes calcium silicate hydrate formation, thereby enhancing later-age strength development, durability, and weathering resistance. It is also widely adopted in solidification and stabilization processes, as well as in the production of ternary concrete blends combining phosphogypsum and slag to achieve tailored flexural behavior.

Within phosphogypsum-based systems and PGCM formulations, Silica Fume is frequently blended with cement and quicklime. It actively participates in hydration reactions, increasing dissolution rates and strength coefficients while generating internal gels that improve compactness, resist water erosion, and significantly boost antifreeze and frost resistance performance. These properties also contribute to improved later-stage compressive strength. However, the material exhibits complex chemical interactions: its hydration products can be susceptible to decomposition in aqueous environments, which may contribute to crack elongation. Additionally, when reacting with quicklime, Silica Fume increases quicklime consumption and can negatively impact sample length growth. Furthermore, certain particles may remain unreacted during hydration, though they still contribute to gel polymerization and overall matrix compactness. Overall, Silica Fume functions as a multifunctional admixture that substantially modifies the mechanical, durability, and hydration characteristics of advanced cementitious composites.&lt;SEP&gt;Silica fume is a fine powder additive used to improve compressive strength.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-023&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-035&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7797768798fcd1152bdc10ff73139e35-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7797768798fcd1152bdc10ff73139e35-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7797768798fcd1152bdc10ff73139e35-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7797768798fcd1152bdc10ff73139e35-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7797768798fcd1152bdc10ff73139e35-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7797768798fcd1152bdc10ff73139e35-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7797768798fcd1152bdc10ff73139e35-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7797768798fcd1152bdc10ff73139e35-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7797768798fcd1152bdc10ff73139e35-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7797768798fcd1152bdc10ff73139e35-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7797768798fcd1152bdc10ff73139e35-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-007</data>
