  <data key="d2">OPC is a typical solidification and stabilization agent used in PG mixtures.&lt;SEP&gt;Ordinary Portland Cement, a traditional binder whose use in PG-based mixtures faces challenges regarding GHG emissions and durability.&lt;SEP&gt;OPC (Ordinary Portland Cement) is a standard cement type used in mortars, which Plaster Of Paris substitutes in the studied mixtures.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-021</data>
