<node id="Cement Industry">
  <data key="d0">Cement Industry</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The industrial sector targeted for achieving net zero greenhouse gas emissions through mitigation strategies.&lt;SEP&gt;The cement industry is a major sector that utilizes phosphogypsum in the production of various cement types.&lt;SEP&gt;The Cement Industry is the industrial sector targeted by decarbonization goals and a market for the produced Portland cement.&lt;SEP&gt;The cement industry utilizes phosphogypsum as a replacement for natural gypsum in setting regulator applications.&lt;SEP&gt;The cement industry utilizes phosphogypsum to lower clinkerization temperatures and adjust portland cement properties.&lt;SEP&gt;The cement industry is an application domain for products formed from PG, specifically utilizing calcium carbonate.&lt;SEP&gt;An industrial sector that recycles a portion of generated phosphogypsum waste.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-027&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-023&lt;SEP&gt;doc-276f29345df37143fc224a22d0f6089b-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d18c456289f64c1e16c73a0dfd6595b3-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1791791942</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Concrete">
  <data key="d0">Concrete</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Concrete is a composite, cement-based construction material extensively utilized in building applications. A primary focus of modern material science involves modifying its composition by incorporating phosphogypsum, which frequently functions as a partial replacement for traditional cement. Research has actively explored the integration of both standard and thermally treated phosphogypsum, systematically analyzing how varying concentrations of this additive alter the material's fundamental characteristics.

The presence of phosphogypsum significantly influences, and can enhance or modify, concrete's mechanical properties, compressive strength, permeability, and overall structural integrity. In addition to phosphogypsum, the material's workability and mechanical behavior are also studied when subjected to substitutions with alternative compounds such as Plaster of Paris. Through these compositional adjustments, concrete's engineering performance is continuously optimized, demonstrating its adaptability as a versatile building composite.&lt;SEP&gt;Concrete is a construction material investigated for partial cement replacement with phosphogypsum to evaluate performance.&lt;SEP&gt;Concrete is a commercial building material compared against PGEF for cost and weight analysis.&lt;SEP&gt;A construction composite material in which phosphogypsum is explored for potential use and property modification.&lt;SEP&gt;Concrete is a surfacing material that can be used as an alternative to asphalt for the wearing course.&lt;SEP&gt;Concrete is a construction material that utilizes Portland cement and gypsum to prevent flash setting.&lt;SEP&gt;Concrete is a construction material that utilizes recycled phosphogypsum.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-027&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-032&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-022&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-035&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-021&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-025&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-033&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7797768798fcd1152bdc10ff73139e35-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-98d8b2df45924e721bfa570f652f33e3-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ac8d630b9aa4d874707445e2552a09-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0060991ac74a9675ce0293eccdc023cd-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-28fbd4302bba090e667215c840757ff7-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-66f6434914b6de99019386e4bdcbc57e-chunk-018</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
