  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">B. Gracioli is a researcher who investigated the influence of calcination temperature on supersulfated cements using phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;B. Gracioli is a lead author of a 2020 study on the calcination temperature effects of phosphogypsum on cements.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-031</data>
