  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">H. Tayibi is a co-author of a study examining the environmental impact and management of phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;H. Tayibi co-authored a study on the environmental impact and management of phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;A researcher who authored a publication in the Journal of Environmental Management.&lt;SEP&gt;H. Tayibi is a researcher who co-authored studies on the environmental impact and management of phosphogypsum.</data>
