<node id="Construction Demolition Waste">
  <data key="d0">Construction Demolition Waste</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Construction demolition waste is a material recycled alongside phosphogypsum for use in cemented paste backfill.&lt;SEP&gt;Construction demolition waste is a recycled material added to address strength deficiencies.&lt;SEP&gt;Construction demolition waste is a recycled aggregate material combined with phosphogypsum to reduce environmental impact in backfill production.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-029</data>
