<node id="J. Build. Eng.">
  <data key="d0">J. Build. Eng.</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">J. Build. Eng. is the journal that published the research on phosphogypsum valorization in eco-efficient construction.&lt;SEP&gt;J. Build. Eng. is a journal that published research on recycling phosphogypsum for gypsum plaster production.&lt;SEP&gt;A scientific journal that published studies on valorizing phosphogypsum in construction materials.&lt;SEP&gt;J. Build. Eng. is a scientific journal that published research on the solar thermal treatment of phosphogypsum for cement production.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-020&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c2674917fb6c60e75303effeaa10768e-chunk-016</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1791449895</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Zero-Emission Goal">
  <data key="d0">Zero-Emission Goal</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The zero-emission goal is an environmental target that requires addressing gaps in phosphogypsum management.&lt;SEP&gt;Zero-Emission Goal is an environmental target that phosphogypsum management in China has not yet fully reached.&lt;SEP&gt;An environmental target hindered by soil pollution caused by phosphogypsum deposits and stricter legislative requirements.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-000</data>
