  <data key="d2">Y. Wang is a researcher who reviewed the multi-field performance and numerical simulation of cemented paste backfill.&lt;SEP&gt;Y. Wang co-authored a study on synergistic leaching of potassium and phosphorus from potassium feldspar and phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Y. Wang is a researcher who studied surfactant-assisted synthesis of hydroxyapatite particles.&lt;SEP&gt;Y. Wang is a researcher who developed multifunctional melanin-like nanoparticles for bone-targeted chemo-photothermal therapy.&lt;SEP&gt;Y. Wang is a researcher who synthesized phosphate-embedded calcium alginate beads for lead and cadmium sorption.&lt;SEP&gt;A researcher who co-authored reference 55 published in Mater. Lett. in 2006.&lt;SEP&gt;Y. Wang is a researcher who co-authored the study on rod-shaped hydroxyapatite as drug carriers.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-021&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-025&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f2534f7a997df3f80305323317b15be9-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a4d02158bbc770d7c6bd9657b3f3defc-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-06f299b7e723cda1f0de1a647b02b6b4-chunk-022&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a52951853fd542b78835b677936c557b-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3fd8439e859e3dd0c96328384e1761f0-chunk-022</data>
