  <data key="d1">other</data>
  <data key="d2">Polypropylene is a polymer matrix that utilizes phosphogypsum as a reinforcing filler to create composites with specific mechanical and thermal properties.&lt;SEP&gt;Polypropylene is a polymer material listed in the text.</data>
