</node>
<node id="Guizhou">
  <data key="d0">Guizhou</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">Guizhou is a province in China recognized for its significant geological and industrial contributions, particularly in mineral processing and resource management. The region is notably endowed with deposits of refractory collophanite, which are extensively utilized in mineral processing research and associated flotation applications. In addition to its mineral wealth, Guizhou plays a pivotal role in the national phosphogypsum sector, contributing substantially to China's total phosphogypsum production. To address the environmental and industrial implications of this output, the provincial government has actively implemented specific policies and official opinions aimed at promoting the comprehensive utilization of phosphogypsum.

These targeted efforts have yielded remarkable results, with Guizhou achieving a comprehensive utilization rate of 99.22% for phosphogypsum. Consequently, the province has become a focal point for academic and industrial research, frequently featured in studies analyzing the phosphogypsum recycling industry and profiling prominent recycling companies. Furthermore, Guizhou is consistently represented in aggregate data distributions regarding phosphogypsum usage, underscoring its status as a key region for monitoring and advancing sustainable mineral processing and waste recycling practices in China.&lt;SEP&gt;Guizhou is the province containing Guiyang and Guizhou University.&lt;SEP&gt;Guizhou is a Chinese province where PG samples were collected and chemically analyzed.&lt;SEP&gt;Guizhou is a key province targeted for large-scale phosphogypsum projects and demonstration projects.&lt;SEP&gt;Guizhou is a Chinese province where CPGB technology has been adopted by large-scale mines.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-34a3ac199714be8fd1cdff8ead90fc92-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c2674917fb6c60e75303effeaa10768e-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c2674917fb6c60e75303effeaa10768e-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c2674917fb6c60e75303effeaa10768e-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c2674917fb6c60e75303effeaa10768e-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c2674917fb6c60e75303effeaa10768e-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c2674917fb6c60e75303effeaa10768e-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7797768798fcd1152bdc10ff73139e35-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a5d09b48f57a4e888bb729aaf988c936-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a5d09b48f57a4e888bb729aaf988c936-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-001</data>
