<node id="Fig. 9">
  <data key="d0">Fig. 9</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Fig. 9 is a figure label that appears across multiple independent scientific studies, each utilizing the designation to illustrate distinct research findings. In the context of phosphogypsum recycling and cementitious materials, one instance of Fig. 9 outlines the conversion procedure of phosphogypsum using a fluoride solution, positioning it as an alternative gypsum source for building cementitious materials. This same figure context also presents X-ray diffraction analyses of hydrated samples prepared at varying phosphogypsum concentrations, alongside a depiction of the internal damage mechanisms within phosphogypsum cementitious materials when subjected to dry-wet cycle erosion.

In a separate study focusing on resource characterization, Fig. 9 categorizes the occurrence states of rare earth elements within phosphogypsum, distinguishing them into three distinct forms.

Additionally, in research concerning hydroxyapatite synthesis, Fig. 9 displays transmission electron microscopy micrographs that detail the dimensional variations and structural properties of synthesized nanorods. This figure also illustrates rod-like crystals that demonstrate the preferential crystalline growth of hydroxyapatite, complemented by Fourier-transform infrared spectra obtained from hydrothermally synthesized hydroxyapatite samples. Collectively, these varied representations highlight how the generic label Fig. 9 is applied across different experimental frameworks to visualize material conversion processes, elemental distribution, microstructural damage, and nanomaterial synthesis.&lt;SEP&gt;Fig. 9 illustrates the microstructure of dried hydroxyapatite and calcined samples at 600 °C and 900 °C.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-401b567da916dc34559e0bfe5a5b367b-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7797768798fcd1152bdc10ff73139e35-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6f5dcf59bedaa00614f1acc222b1fb7b-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6825862084b162a4b16cd1037c76e3d7-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a52951853fd542b78835b677936c557b-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-35aef6efc801611130c5dd196fe513df-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1792002021</data>
