  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">One of the largest artificial water bodies along the Yangtze River, affected by phosphogypsum leachates.&lt;SEP&gt;A reservoir in southwest China studied for sediment phosphorus distribution and potential release.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-019</data>
