  <data key="d2">A coastal region in Tunisia affected by industrial phosphate waste discharge impacting the marine environment.&lt;SEP&gt;The Gulf of Gabes is a heavily polluted marine region in Tunisia impacted by industrial phosphogypsum dumping and phosphate fertilizer activities.&lt;SEP&gt;A coastal region in Tunisia studied for contaminated sediments and the impacts of pollutants on benthic foraminifera.&lt;SEP&gt;The Gulf of Gabes is a coastal region in Tunisia affected by industrial discharges.&lt;SEP&gt;The Gulf of Gabes is a coastal body of water in Tunisia affected by heavy metal contamination and phosphogypsum foam transport.&lt;SEP&gt;The Gulf of Gabes is a coastal region in Tunisia studied for heavy metal pollution using mollusk species as bioindicators.&lt;SEP&gt;Gulf of Gabes is a coastal water body surrounding the industrial complex of Gabes City where sediment contamination was studied.</data>
