  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Sulfuric acid is the primary chemical agent used to drive the acidulation process in phosphate fertilizer production.&lt;SEP&gt;Sulfuric Acid (H2SO4) is a chemical agent listed in experimental parameters for leaching processes.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-009</data>
