<node id="Stack Area">
  <data key="d0">Stack Area</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">The stack area is the disposal location for PG, affecting its properties and operational efficiency.&lt;SEP&gt;Stack area location is a factor attributed to differences in the chemical composition of phosphogypsum.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-002</data>
