<node id="Detection Limit">
  <data key="d0">Detection Limit</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The detection limit represents the minimum concentration threshold of an instrument, below which element concentrations are recorded as negligible.&lt;SEP&gt;Detection Limit is a threshold value below which a substance cannot be reliably measured, indicated by "&lt;d.l" in the dataset.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-401b567da916dc34559e0bfe5a5b367b-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-66f6434914b6de99019386e4bdcbc57e-chunk-008</data>
