<node id="Phosphate Fertilizer">
  <data key="d0">Phosphate Fertilizer</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">An industrial product manufactured from phosphate rock that generates phosphogypsum as a byproduct.&lt;SEP&gt;Phosphate fertilizer is an agricultural product whose preparation drives the large-scale production of phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;An agricultural product whose long-term application leads to toxic metal(loid) accumulation in soils.&lt;SEP&gt;Phosphate Fertilizer is an agricultural product whose increasing demand drives phosphate rock mining and acid manufacturing.&lt;SEP&gt;Phosphate fertilizer is an agricultural product category represented in the industrial statistics chart.&lt;SEP&gt;A waste management category representing the manufacturing of phosphate fertilizers.&lt;SEP&gt;A pillar industry product in China's agricultural development, whose production generates phosphogypsum as a major byproduct.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-401b567da916dc34559e0bfe5a5b367b-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-023&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a5d09b48f57a4e888bb729aaf988c936-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a5d09b48f57a4e888bb729aaf988c936-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-afe70f2d82515df80906bf3babd4e4eb-chunk-012</data>
