  <data key="d0">Graph</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">A visual data representation containing spectral peaks and annotations used to analyze material composition.&lt;SEP&gt;Graph is the visualization context where data points are clustered and positioned along axes.&lt;SEP&gt;Graph is the visual plot displaying particle size distributions for the Surf and NoSurf samples.&lt;SEP&gt;The graph visually demonstrates the trends in crystallinity and phase formation across different sample treatments.</data>
