  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Abbreviation for Rare Earth Elements, a group of chemical elements of interest for recovery from waste.&lt;SEP&gt;REEs are valuable elements extracted from phosphogypsum as a secondary source through hydrometallurgical procedures.&lt;SEP&gt;REEs are rare earth elements extracted and stripped from synthetic solutions using the optimized ionic liquid process.</data>
