<node id="Stirring Speed">
  <data key="d0">Stirring Speed</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">Stirring Speed indicates the agitation rate during leaching, optimized at 250 r/min.&lt;SEP&gt;Stirring Speed is a controlled experimental parameter set at 250 r/min to influence the leaching process dynamics.&lt;SEP&gt;The agitation rate maintained at 800 revolutions per minute to facilitate mixing during extraction.&lt;SEP&gt;A process parameter set at 800 r/min during the extraction experiments.&lt;SEP&gt;Stirring Speed is the agitation rate maintained at 800 r/min during the stripping experiments.</data>
