  <data key="d2">TBP is a chemical reagent used in the leaching process to extract rare earth elements from PG.&lt;SEP&gt;Tributyl phosphate, an organic solvent used in leaching mixtures.&lt;SEP&gt;TBP is a chemical component of the TBP-TOPO solvent mixture used in the leaching process.&lt;SEP&gt;TBP is a chemical agent used in combination with TOPO to evaluate extraction performance.</data>
