<node id="Ultrasonic Impact">
  <data key="d0">Ultrasonic Impact</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Ultrasonic impact is a physical treatment method applied to facilitate the release of Rare Earth Elements from the gypsum matrix.&lt;SEP&gt;A mechanical treatment applied alongside grinding to enhance rare earth element leaching from phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Ultrasonic impact is a mechanical treatment applied alongside grinding to significantly increase rare earth element recovery.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-401b567da916dc34559e0bfe5a5b367b-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-020&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-021</data>
