<node id="Initial Setting Time">
  <data key="d0">Initial Setting Time</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">The duration required for the cement to begin hardening, measured in minutes.&lt;SEP&gt;Initial setting time is a metric measuring the percentage improvement in mortar setting times corresponding to Phosphogypsum replacement levels.&lt;SEP&gt;Initial setting time is the first phase of gypsum hardening measured in minutes, analyzed against varying gypsum content percentages.&lt;SEP&gt;A measured parameter tracking the time required for gypsum to begin setting.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-b8bd3776c87a0bcab21842e8e2bb2e06-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-038&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ac8d630b9aa4d874707445e2552a09-chunk-021&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ac8d630b9aa4d874707445e2552a09-chunk-020</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1791769011</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Final Setting Time">
  <data key="d0">Final Setting Time</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">The duration required for the cement to fully harden, measured in minutes.&lt;SEP&gt;Final setting time is a metric measuring the percentage improvement in mortar setting times corresponding to Phosphogypsum replacement levels.&lt;SEP&gt;Final setting time is the second phase of gypsum hardening measured in minutes, compared between natural and phosphogypsum sources.&lt;SEP&gt;A measured parameter tracking the time required for gypsum to complete setting.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-b8bd3776c87a0bcab21842e8e2bb2e06-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-038&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ac8d630b9aa4d874707445e2552a09-chunk-021&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ac8d630b9aa4d874707445e2552a09-chunk-020</data>
