<node id="Figure 2">
  <data key="d0">Figure 2</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Figure 2 is not a single unified entity but rather a recurring figure label adapted across multiple independent scientific studies to represent distinct visual data presentations tailored to specific experimental or analytical needs. In materials characterization and analytical chemistry, it frequently presents advanced instrumental data. This includes high-magnification Scanning Electron Microscopy images with particle size distribution insets that highlight morphological differences between s-HAp and BA samples, as well as X-ray diffraction patterns correlated with setting times and weight loss measurements. Additional variations display XRD patterns confirming that Type 1 through Type 6 hydroxyapatite powders are pure crystalline products, alongside XRD patterns of dried and calcined hydroxyapatite samples at varying temperatures. The label also accompanies ATR-FTIR spectroscopy data characterizing the chemical composition of phosphogypsum waste, FTIR spectra of ionic liquids before and after loading with rare earth elements alongside extraction efficiency metrics, and zeta potential mappings of the HAP2/NaCl solution interface as a function of pH.

In nuclear chemistry and industrial processing research, Figure 2 illustrates the partitioning behavior of uranium series radionuclides between phosphogypsum and phosphoric acid phases. It also depicts the relative proportion of total radionuclides in phosphogypsum following leaching with various reagents, and provides a broader visual workflow of the phosphogypsum production process within phosphoric acid manufacturing.

Finally, in structural, engineering, and thermal analyses, Figure 2 presents the linear equation of PGEF alongside an arch axis diagram to offer mathematical and geometric representations of the studied system. It also functions as a schematic diagram and experimental setup or results visualization for the determination of ash fusion temperatures. Collectively, these descriptions demonstrate that Figure 2 serves as a context-dependent label conveying diverse experimental results, analytical spectra, process flows, and mathematical models across independent scientific investigations.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-b8bd3776c87a0bcab21842e8e2bb2e06-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-70650e5cb032fce744763706d8701e36-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a4d02158bbc770d7c6bd9657b3f3defc-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6f5dcf59bedaa00614f1acc222b1fb7b-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2760dc2a11fedad02d24741a978cf20d-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-98d8b2df45924e721bfa570f652f33e3-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4739e42903c95e1fb7e0ecfbca3a12df-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ac8d630b9aa4d874707445e2552a09-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-edfc4dcbd74cbf0b294f83f2034b209d-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d4a38fcc1b0f33a17d23e7a4407a9cf9-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d4a38fcc1b0f33a17d23e7a4407a9cf9-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-28fbd4302bba090e667215c840757ff7-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-35aef6efc801611130c5dd196fe513df-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b19ca721a4da4422ee10228d88a4c292-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b19ca721a4da4422ee10228d88a4c292-chunk-004</data>
