<node id="J. Eur. Ceram. Soc.">
  <data key="d0">J. Eur. Ceram. Soc.</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">A scientific journal that published research on porous hydroxyapatite scaffolds in 2011.&lt;SEP&gt;J. Eur. Ceram. Soc. is a scientific journal publishing work on carbonated hydroxyapatite ceramics.&lt;SEP&gt;J. Eur. Ceram. Soc. is the journal that published the 2006 study on hydrothermal synthesis of hydroxyapatite.&lt;SEP&gt;A scientific journal that published a 2013 study on spray pyrolysis of calcium phosphate solutions.&lt;SEP&gt;Journal of the European Ceramic Society, a peer-reviewed academic journal focusing on ceramic materials.&lt;SEP&gt;J. Eur. Ceram. Soc. is a 2003 academic journal cited in the reference list.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-b8bd3776c87a0bcab21842e8e2bb2e06-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0a5563c80c4fd1f68b4442f73621a281-chunk-030&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0a5563c80c4fd1f68b4442f73621a281-chunk-039&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a4d02158bbc770d7c6bd9657b3f3defc-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d4a38fcc1b0f33a17d23e7a4407a9cf9-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d4a38fcc1b0f33a17d23e7a4407a9cf9-chunk-018</data>
