  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="EDX">
  <data key="d0">EDX</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">EDX is an abbreviation for Energy Dispersive X-ray Spectroscopy, used for elemental analysis.&lt;SEP&gt;Energy Dispersive X-ray Spectroscopy used to determine the elemental composition of BC and HAP-BC.&lt;SEP&gt;EDX is an analytical method used to detect elemental concentrations, particularly oxygen, in the samples.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-b8bd3776c87a0bcab21842e8e2bb2e06-chunk-024&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9e17ad262bd9835860df552d7ff475f1-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3fd8439e859e3dd0c96328384e1761f0-chunk-010</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1791966043</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="RSC Advances">
  <data key="d0">RSC Advances</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">RSC Advances is the academic journal that published the research paper.&lt;SEP&gt;RSC Advances is a journal that published studies on porous zinc–biochar nanocomposites and SiO–biochar nanocomposites.&lt;SEP&gt;RSC Advances is a scientific journal that published research on tailoring mesoporous hydroxyapatite using fatty acids.&lt;SEP&gt;RSC Advances is a scientific journal that published studies on ionic liquid applications and magnetic porous organic polymers.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-b8bd3776c87a0bcab21842e8e2bb2e06-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9e17ad262bd9835860df552d7ff475f1-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a4d02158bbc770d7c6bd9657b3f3defc-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-edfc4dcbd74cbf0b294f83f2034b209d-chunk-014</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1791813629</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Apatite-Forming Ability">
  <data key="d0">Apatite-Forming Ability</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Apatite-Forming Ability is a bioactivity measure indicating the material capacity to induce apatite mineralization.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-b8bd3776c87a0bcab21842e8e2bb2e06-chunk-000</data>
