  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">A metric representing the percentage of reactants converted during the reaction.&lt;SEP&gt;Conversion rate is a quantitative metric indicating that the phosphogypsum conversion rate reached 90.75% during the reaction.</data>
