<node id="CLG Process">
  <data key="d0">CLG Process</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">The CLG process is a reaction procedure where grain growth and phase transformations of materials occur.&lt;SEP&gt;A chemical process involving temperature variations where PG acts as an oxygen carrier, driving the migration and transformation of F and P elements.&lt;SEP&gt;Chemical Looping Gasification, a reaction process for converting lignite into syngas using oxygen carriers.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-009</data>
