<node id="Fig. 11">
  <data key="d0">Fig. 11</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">A figure depicting the migration and transformation pathways of F and P during the CLG process.&lt;SEP&gt;Fig. 11 displays the energy spectra of the three main hydration products generated in the study.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7797768798fcd1152bdc10ff73139e35-chunk-010</data>
