  <data key="d2">A researcher involved in studies on phosphogypsum decomposition, chemical looping gasification, and syngas preparation.&lt;SEP&gt;L. Ma is a researcher who co-authored work focusing on lignite gasification and phosphogypsum-based oxygen carriers.&lt;SEP&gt;L. Ma is a co-author of several studies focusing on phosphogypsum decomposition and chemical looping gasification.&lt;SEP&gt;L. Ma is a researcher who authored multiple studies on phosphogypsum decomposition and reaction mechanisms.</data>
