  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Soft sensor modeling is a technique applied to predict cement clinker quality using timing matching and data decoupling approaches.&lt;SEP&gt;Soft sensor modeling is a computational technique applied to predict cement clinker quality.</data>
