  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Phosphate tailings are industrial waste materials utilized alongside phosphogypsum for cemented paste backfill applications.&lt;SEP&gt;Phosphate tailings are mining byproducts integrated with phosphogypsum to create sustainable cemented paste backfill formulations.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-027&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-029</data>
