  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Ni is a catalyst component that increases the decomposition rate and improves reduction selectivity.&lt;SEP&gt;Nickel is a trace element measured in phosphogypsum and terrestrial materials.&lt;SEP&gt;Ni is a chemical element whose concentration is measured and reported in the geochemical dataset.&lt;SEP&gt;Ni is a chemical element listed in the data table with specified concentration values.</data>
