<node id="Coke">
  <data key="d0">Coke</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Coke is a carbonaceous material that serves as a vital reactant, reducing agent, and fuel source within industrial manufacturing, particularly in PSC technology and cement clinker formation. During the calcination stage of PSC technology, coke is employed alongside phosphogypsum to facilitate its reduction. This chemical process involves coke reacting with calcium sulfate during the primary reaction, a mechanism that is equally fundamental to cement clinker production. As a core component of these operations, coke functions as the primary raw material driving the chemical transformations required for successful output.

Operationally, coke is consumed in high volumes by the PSC process, representing approximately 39% of the technology's total production costs. Its substantial usage necessitates its inclusion in energy consumption tables and PSC scenario tracking systems. However, this intensive reliance on coke as both a fuel and a reactant carries significant environmental implications, as it directly contributes to increased coal consumption and generates notable carbon dioxide emissions throughout the manufacturing lifecycle.&lt;SEP&gt;Coke is a form of carbon used as a reducing agent in phosphogypsum decomposition, later compared against sulfur for energy efficiency.&lt;SEP&gt;Coke is used as a reducing agent in the decomposition of K-feldspar in the presence of PG.&lt;SEP&gt;Coke is a reactant used in the high-temperature reductive decomposition of PG to produce sulfuric acid.&lt;SEP&gt;A type of reducing agent, such as coal or charcoal, added to the mixture to facilitate the reaction.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-028&lt;SEP&gt;doc-276f29345df37143fc224a22d0f6089b-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-276f29345df37143fc224a22d0f6089b-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-276f29345df37143fc224a22d0f6089b-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-276f29345df37143fc224a22d0f6089b-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-276f29345df37143fc224a22d0f6089b-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-276f29345df37143fc224a22d0f6089b-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-276f29345df37143fc224a22d0f6089b-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-029&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-028&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a5d09b48f57a4e888bb729aaf988c936-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b19ca721a4da4422ee10228d88a4c292-chunk-023</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1792098648</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
