  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A process occurring at medium temperatures where solid chemical species are replaced by others.&lt;SEP&gt;A physical transformation between different structural states of a material, such as the conversion of calcium sulfate phases.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-031&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8c22d31cfad5421c936a23705a3bc6e0-chunk-008</data>
