<node id="Water vapors">
  <data key="d0">Water vapors</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Water vapors are used in the chemical looping gasification process to facilitate syngas production.&lt;SEP&gt;Water vapors are introduced into the system and strongly influence the production of hydrogen and methane.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-003</data>
