<node id="Scanning electron microscopy">
  <data key="d0">Scanning electron microscopy</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Scanning electron microscopy is an imaging technique used to characterize PG.&lt;SEP&gt;Scanning electron microscopy is a characterization method used to examine the structure and composition of hydroxyapatite.&lt;SEP&gt;A microscopy technique used to study the morphology of elaborated HAp at different surfactant dosages.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6825862084b162a4b16cd1037c76e3d7-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6825862084b162a4b16cd1037c76e3d7-chunk-002</data>
