</node>
<node id="Oxygen carrier">
  <data key="d0">Oxygen carrier</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">An oxygen carrier is a material used in CLG to transfer oxygen and facilitate syngas production.&lt;SEP&gt;Oxygen carrier is the functional role of PG in facilitating the chemical looping gasification process by supplying oxygen for fuel conversion.&lt;SEP&gt;Oxygen carrier is the functional role of PG in the chemical looping gasification process.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1791090619</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Oxygen resources">
  <data key="d0">Oxygen resources</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Oxygen resources refer to the oxygen contained within PG that is utilized during the process.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1791090726</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Solid phase products">
  <data key="d0">Solid phase products</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Solid phase products are the chemical compounds formed as residues during the chemical looping gasification of lignite using PG.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1791090726</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Low-rank lignite">
  <data key="d0">Low-rank lignite</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Low-rank lignite is the fuel source processed in the chemical looping gasification system to generate syngas.&lt;SEP&gt;Low-rank lignite is a type of fuel used in the chemical looping gasification process, synonymous with low-order lignite.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-005</data>
