<node id="Silicon dioxide">
  <data key="d0">Silicon dioxide</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Silicon dioxide acts as an inert scaffold between calcium sulfate particles and participates in high-temperature reactions to form calcium silicates.&lt;SEP&gt;Chemical constituent of phosphogypsum measured at 3.44% and natural gypsum at 0.61%.</data>
