  <data key="d2">Y. Liu is a researcher who co-authored multiple studies on chemical looping gasification and syngas generation.&lt;SEP&gt;Y. Liu is a researcher who co-authored a study on porous zinc–biochar nanocomposites for Cr(VI) adsorption.&lt;SEP&gt;Researcher who investigated the thermal behavior and mechanical properties of physically crosslinked PVA/Gelatin hydrogels.&lt;SEP&gt;Y. Liu is a researcher who studied the remediation of contaminated soil and groundwater using hydroxyapatite/calcium silicate hydrate.&lt;SEP&gt;Y. Liu is a researcher who studied carbon quantum dots-doped CdS microspheres with enhanced photocatalytic performance.</data>
