<node id="Coal">
  <data key="d0">Coal</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Coal is a fossil fuel and primary solid fuel substrate that functions as a critical energy source and raw material across various industrial and experimental applications. It is explicitly tracked in energy consumption tables and serves as a central component in the PBG and PSC technology processes and scenarios. Within these systems, coal operates in multiple capacities: it acts as a direct energy source, a fundamental raw material, and a primary source of carbon. Furthermore, coal is utilized as a reducing agent in phosphogypsum decomposition processes, highlighting its chemical utility beyond simple combustion.

In addition to its industrial roles, coal serves as a substrate for chemical looping gasification and combustion experiments, supporting advanced research in energy conversion. Despite its widespread utility, the consumption of coal in these PBG and PSC scenarios carries significant environmental consequences. Its use directly contributes to notable ecological impacts, particularly FDP and GWP. Consequently, coal remains a vital carbon-based material bridging energy production, chemical processing, and experimental research, while also necessitating careful management of its associated environmental footprints.&lt;SEP&gt;A type of reducing agent, such as coke or charcoal, added to the mixture to facilitate the reaction.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-026&lt;SEP&gt;doc-276f29345df37143fc224a22d0f6089b-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-276f29345df37143fc224a22d0f6089b-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-276f29345df37143fc224a22d0f6089b-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-276f29345df37143fc224a22d0f6089b-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-276f29345df37143fc224a22d0f6089b-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-276f29345df37143fc224a22d0f6089b-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-028&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b19ca721a4da4422ee10228d88a4c292-chunk-023</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1792098648</data>
