<node id="Hydrothermal Method">
  <data key="d0">Hydrothermal Method</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">The Hydrothermal Method is a versatile chemical synthesis and treatment technique that operates under elevated temperatures and pressures within sealed, aqueous environments, frequently utilizing strong alkaline media. Primarily deployed for advanced materials synthesis and environmental remediation, the process leverages sustained thermal and pressure conditions to drive targeted chemical reactions, modify crystal growth, and neutralize impurities. In environmental applications, it functions as an effective strategy for the simultaneous removal of phosphorus and organic contaminants from phosphogypsum waste, thereby regenerating gypsum resources and modifying its inherent properties. This impurity removal process relies on the thermal activation of mineralizers, though it is recognized for its limited processing capacity and high energy consumption.

In materials science, the Hydrothermal Method is extensively applied to engineer functional compounds, particularly hydroxyapatite and titanium-based nanomaterials. When synthesizing hydroxyapatite from phosphogypsum as a calcium source, the technique facilitates a facile two-step heterogeneous reaction to produce synthetic hydroxyapatite particles. It enables precise control over morphology, crystallinity, phase purity, and metal ion occupancy, yielding stoichiometric, phase-pure, and nanocrystalline forms in various configurations, including powders, bulk structures, microspheres, and crystals grown directly on FTO glass substrates. Depending on the target application, the process can be conducted at relatively lower temperatures to produce uniform nanoparticles, while standard parameters typically range from 80 to 400°C (with documented conditions around 200°C), pressures up to 100 KPa, and alkaline environments (e.g., pH 11 for 15 hours). The method also incorporates structural templates like F127 to fabricate mesoporous rod-shaped hydroxyapatite. By facilitating controlled metal ion occupancy, the technique yields solid solutions with optimal thermal stability, maintaining structural integrity up to 1370°C. Beyond hydroxyapatite, the Hydrothermal Method is utilized to synthesize titanium-based nanomaterials, specifically mesoporous anatase TiO2 nanofibers and titanate nanotubes. Overall, it functions as a highly adaptable aqueous synthesis route that achieves precise structural engineering, high crystallinity, and targeted morphological control across diverse material systems.&lt;SEP&gt;Hydrothermal method is a synthesis technique used to control the morphology of hydroxyapatite crystals.&lt;SEP&gt;Hydrothermal Method is a synthesis technique used to form hydroxyapatite nanostructures and nanocrystals.&lt;SEP&gt;The Hydrothermal Method is a one-step synthesis process used to fabricate porous HA core-shell microspheres over varying durations.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-024&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0a5563c80c4fd1f68b4442f73621a281-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0a5563c80c4fd1f68b4442f73621a281-chunk-039&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9e17ad262bd9835860df552d7ff475f1-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8a6c42f76034cfa4338bd156b7179fc5-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8a6c42f76034cfa4338bd156b7179fc5-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a4d02158bbc770d7c6bd9657b3f3defc-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a4d02158bbc770d7c6bd9657b3f3defc-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f1fb5c243f2539cf7be6b6021b63c36f-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f1fb5c243f2539cf7be6b6021b63c36f-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c4a64a852097fdc910b98ed788503ce4-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c4a64a852097fdc910b98ed788503ce4-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c4a64a852097fdc910b98ed788503ce4-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c4a64a852097fdc910b98ed788503ce4-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6f5dcf59bedaa00614f1acc222b1fb7b-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6f5dcf59bedaa00614f1acc222b1fb7b-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6f5dcf59bedaa00614f1acc222b1fb7b-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2760dc2a11fedad02d24741a978cf20d-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2760dc2a11fedad02d24741a978cf20d-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6825862084b162a4b16cd1037c76e3d7-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-06f299b7e723cda1f0de1a647b02b6b4-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2196dee89de9694f28ef4eaa0e85f130-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-033&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-039&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4739e42903c95e1fb7e0ecfbca3a12df-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a52951853fd542b78835b677936c557b-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-54b92b2ad16a2528ff6a863329c5d403-chunk-004</data>
