<node id="Environmental Pollution">
  <data key="d0">Environmental Pollution</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Environmental pollution is a potential impact considered in the preparation and application of PG-derived materials.&lt;SEP&gt;Environmental pollution is a significant risk associated with the disposal and storage of phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Environmental pollution is an ecological issue addressed by the Circular Economy strategy.&lt;SEP&gt;Environmental pollution encompasses widespread contamination of soil, water, and air. Environmental pollution is caused by industrial byproducts and emissions.&lt;SEP&gt;Environmental pollution is a potential risk controlled by pre-treating PG and incorporating additional cementitious or modified materials.&lt;SEP&gt;Environmental pollution is a negative impact minimized through the integrated mine and chemical plant production mode.&lt;SEP&gt;Environmental pollution is caused by harmful impurities in phosphogypsum, driving the urgency for better resource utilization.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2760dc2a11fedad02d24741a978cf20d-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a5d09b48f57a4e888bb729aaf988c936-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-027&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-026&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ac8d630b9aa4d874707445e2552a09-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1791769988</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Reaction Mechanisms">
  <data key="d0">Reaction Mechanisms</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Reaction mechanisms are a focus of review papers studying the preparation and application of PG materials.&lt;SEP&gt;The proposed chemical pathways representing the dissolution and precipitation steps in the conversion process.&lt;SEP&gt;Reaction Mechanisms describe the step-by-step chemical pathways and transformations occurring during PG dissolution and carbonation.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-010</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1791591530</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
