  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">H2O is water involved in double salt formation and decomposition reactions.&lt;SEP&gt;H2O is the chemical formula representing water.&lt;SEP&gt;Water, a chemical compound mentioned in the introductory equation.</data>
