<node id="Roadbed Materials">
  <data key="d0">Roadbed Materials</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Roadbed Materials are infrastructure components that can utilize phosphogypsum in large-scale applications.&lt;SEP&gt;Roadbed Materials are geotechnical building materials derived from phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;A utilization application for phosphogypsum promoted in Yunnan province as part of its three major engineering projects.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-34a3ac199714be8fd1cdff8ead90fc92-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-afe70f2d82515df80906bf3babd4e4eb-chunk-010</data>
