<node id="Catalyst">
  <data key="d0">Catalyst</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A catalyst is added during the two-step method to reduce the decomposition and oxidation temperatures of phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;A raw material consumed by the PSC process.&lt;SEP&gt;Catalyst refers to the use of hydroxyapatite in chemical reactions to increase reaction rates.&lt;SEP&gt;Catalysts are industrial applications where hydroxyapatite is extensively utilized due to its chemical properties.&lt;SEP&gt;Catalyst is a functional application of hydroxyapatite due to its versatile</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-276f29345df37143fc224a22d0f6089b-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6f5dcf59bedaa00614f1acc222b1fb7b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6825862084b162a4b16cd1037c76e3d7-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3fd8439e859e3dd0c96328384e1761f0-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
