  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Phase Diagrams">
  <data key="d0">Phase Diagrams</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Phase diagrams are analytical tools used to study the reaction mechanisms of phosphogypsum utilization.&lt;SEP&gt;Phase diagrams depict the thermodynamic behavior and composition ratios of the calcium-magnesium-silicon-aluminum oxide systems.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b19ca721a4da4422ee10228d88a4c292-chunk-005</data>
