<node id="Circular Economy">
  <data key="d0">Circular Economy</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The Circular Economy is a comprehensive economic model, sustainable development framework, and industrial strategy designed to replace traditional linear production systems with self-circulating processes that prioritize continuous material use, resource recovery, and recycling. By maintaining product values and maximizing resource efficiency, this framework aims to minimize waste generation, reduce pollution, and lower environmental impact while simultaneously boosting economic efficiency and fostering long-term ecological balance. Widely recognized in academic literature, it serves as a foundational conceptual framework for sustainable resource management and comprehensive waste reduction strategies, integrating directly into production modes to optimize utilization and mitigate ecological harm.

In specialized industrial contexts, particularly within the phosphogypsum recycling sector, the Circular Economy provides a critical framework for evaluating and implementing waste valorization and management strategies. Within this model, phosphogypsum is reclassified from an industrial and mining by-product into a secondary raw material resource. The framework guides targeted market strategies and optimized waste management practices to systematically utilize phosphogypsum, effectively transforming it into economically beneficial materials. It serves as the overarching sustainability context for investigating potential phosphogypsum applications, conducting critical reviews of management practices across global storage sites, and applying Life Cycle Assessment to compare various waste valorization methods. This targeted application not only aligns with broader goals of sustainable resource management and waste valorization but also specifically advances phosphorus management, demonstrating how the Circular Economy drives sustainable development and economic efficiency across specialized industrial operations.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-021&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-276f29345df37143fc224a22d0f6089b-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-026&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-035&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c2674917fb6c60e75303effeaa10768e-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c2674917fb6c60e75303effeaa10768e-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c2674917fb6c60e75303effeaa10768e-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2760dc2a11fedad02d24741a978cf20d-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2760dc2a11fedad02d24741a978cf20d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2760dc2a11fedad02d24741a978cf20d-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2760dc2a11fedad02d24741a978cf20d-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-027&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ac8d630b9aa4d874707445e2552a09-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ac8d630b9aa4d874707445e2552a09-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0060991ac74a9675ce0293eccdc023cd-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0060991ac74a9675ce0293eccdc023cd-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0060991ac74a9675ce0293eccdc023cd-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-66f6434914b6de99019386e4bdcbc57e-chunk-001</data>
