<node id="Natural Gypsum">
  <data key="d0">Natural Gypsum</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Natural Gypsum is a naturally occurring, non-renewable mineral resource that functions as a foundational reference material and traditional raw material across multiple industrial sectors. Historically and currently, it serves as a primary input for the co-production of sulfuric acid and cement, the manufacturing of plaster, wallboard, β-building gypsum powder, various binders, and calcium sulfate whiskers. Additionally, it is widely employed as a standard cement additive, a construction material, and a traditional stabilization agent used alongside other minerals to enhance the physical and mechanical properties of adobe soil.

In research and industrial applications, Natural Gypsum acts as a critical benchmark and baseline for conventional production models. It is systematically used to compare setting times, curing effects, mechanical and compressive strength, dehydration behavior during milling, solubility, and chemical composition. While it is increasingly being substituted by phosphogypsum—an industrial byproduct that requires purification for use in cement retarders and construction—Natural Gypsum maintains a distinct advantage. Due to differences in impurity content, Natural Gypsum exhibits superior physical and chemical characteristics, making it the standard against which phosphogypsum-based products are measured and currently placing phosphogypsum at a competitive disadvantage in regional markets. Furthermore, conventional hemihydrate gypsum production aims to replace it as a standard raw material.

From a resource and environmental perspective, Natural Gypsum reserves are declining, and its extraction and crushing processes are highly resource-intensive. To mitigate ecological impacts and conserve the mineral, recycling technologies have been deployed to significantly reduce fossil resource consumption. The substitution of Natural Gypsum with phosphogypsum in binder and cement manufacturing is actively promoted as a conservation strategy. Environmental assessments also compare Natural Gypsum processing against PCR technology, which generates fewer particulate emissions, underscoring continuous industrial efforts to optimize material efficiency and minimize ecological footprints.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-276f29345df37143fc224a22d0f6089b-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-276f29345df37143fc224a22d0f6089b-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-276f29345df37143fc224a22d0f6089b-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-276f29345df37143fc224a22d0f6089b-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-030&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-029&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-052&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c2674917fb6c60e75303effeaa10768e-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7797768798fcd1152bdc10ff73139e35-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-025&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-030&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a5d09b48f57a4e888bb729aaf988c936-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a5d09b48f57a4e888bb729aaf988c936-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a5d09b48f57a4e888bb729aaf988c936-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a5d09b48f57a4e888bb729aaf988c936-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e4a551024f80f822f3f35e38ec278151-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e4a551024f80f822f3f35e38ec278151-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e4a551024f80f822f3f35e38ec278151-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e4a551024f80f822f3f35e38ec278151-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e4a551024f80f822f3f35e38ec278151-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ac8d630b9aa4d874707445e2552a09-chunk-021&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ac8d630b9aa4d874707445e2552a09-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ac8d630b9aa4d874707445e2552a09-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ac8d630b9aa4d874707445e2552a09-chunk-020&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ac8d630b9aa4d874707445e2552a09-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ac8d630b9aa4d874707445e2552a09-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-afe70f2d82515df80906bf3babd4e4eb-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-afe70f2d82515df80906bf3babd4e4eb-chunk-01