  <data key="d1">other</data>
  <data key="d2">The human body is the biological system that absorbs and accumulates radioactive elements and heavy metals from environmental exposure.&lt;SEP&gt;Human body is exposed to phosphogypsum pollutants through drinking water and food consumption.</data>
