  <data key="d1">other</data>
  <data key="d2">Cells are the fundamental biological units where radioactive elements accumulate after entering the human body.&lt;SEP&gt;Cells are biological entities that can be adsorbed onto the surface of the non-heat-treated powders for biomedical applications.</data>
