  <data key="d0">Phosphogypsum Stockpile</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">The Phosphogypsum stockpile is the central source of particles and heavy metals in the environmental migration diagram.&lt;SEP&gt;Phosphogypsum Stockpile refers to accumulated phosphogypsum waste in China that is targeted for management using cemented paste backfill technology.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-34a3ac199714be8fd1cdff8ead90fc92-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-034</data>
