<node id="Djerba">
  <data key="d0">Djerba</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">An island whose water quality serves as a baseline with normal pH levels, contrasting with the affected Gabes region.&lt;SEP&gt;Djerba is a region compared in a scientific table, characterized by a pH range of 7.7 to 7.9, diverse marine life, and sandy sediment composed of bioclasts.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-34a3ac199714be8fd1cdff8ead90fc92-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-34a3ac199714be8fd1cdff8ead90fc92-chunk-018</data>
