<node id="Human Health">
  <data key="d0">Human Health</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Human Health is a biological aspect facing elevated disease risks due to proximity to phosphogypsum stockpiles.&lt;SEP&gt;Human health is negatively impacted by the environmental effects of phosphogypsum storage.&lt;SEP&gt;Human health is indirectly impacted by the long-term accumulation of heavy metals in crops grown near phosphogypsum stockpiles.&lt;SEP&gt;Human Health is an environmental impact category affected by Phosphogypsum disposal and optimization scenarios.&lt;SEP&gt;Human health is a primary damage category assessing impacts like carcinogens and radiation on human populations.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-34a3ac199714be8fd1cdff8ead90fc92-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-34a3ac199714be8fd1cdff8ead90fc92-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-34a3ac199714be8fd1cdff8ead90fc92-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-276f29345df37143fc224a22d0f6089b-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0060991ac74a9675ce0293eccdc023cd-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1791880957</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Toxicological Effects">
  <data key="d0">Toxicological Effects</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Toxicological Effects represent the study of adverse health impacts and biological hazards caused by phosphogypsum exposure.&lt;SEP&gt;Health impacts on humans resulting from exposure to phosphogypsum.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-34a3ac199714be8fd1cdff8ead90fc92-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-34a3ac199714be8fd1cdff8ead90fc92-chunk-011</data>
