  <data key="d5">1791109993</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Ecological Restoration">
  <data key="d0">Ecological Restoration</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Ecological Restoration is a comprehensive remediation and recycling strategy designed to mitigate environmental damage associated with phosphogypsum storage and generation. This approach repurposes phosphogypsum and phosphogypsum-based materials as a base material for filling operations, particularly in quarry rehabilitation, while simultaneously emphasizing the rejuvenation of compromised ecosystems. By transforming this industrial byproduct into a tool for environmental improvement, the method addresses ongoing phosphogypsum production and actively reduces existing stockpiles, establishing itself as a key application field for recycled phosphogypsum.

The practical implementation of Ecological Restoration employs specific remediation techniques, including soil covering and vegetation planting, to stabilize treated landscapes and foster ecological recovery. However, the strategy presents certain environmental considerations, as the remediation process may still result in elevated radium levels within the treated areas. Currently, this application of phosphogypsum recycling remains in the experimental phase, with ongoing development and field testing notably concentrated in Yunnan Province. As a multifaceted environmental management practice, Ecological Restoration continues to be refined to balance industrial waste reduction with long-term ecosystem rehabilitation.&lt;SEP&gt;Ecological restoration is one of the application directions for phosphogypsum utilization in China alongside building materials and cement retarders.&lt;SEP&gt;Ecological restoration accounts for 14.4% of phosphogypsum utilization.&lt;SEP&gt;A utilization approach involving the remediation of abandoned mining pits, promoted in Yunnan province.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-34a3ac199714be8fd1cdff8ead90fc92-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-34a3ac199714be8fd1cdff8ead90fc92-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-34a3ac199714be8fd1cdff8ead90fc92-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c2674917fb6c60e75303effeaa10768e-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c2674917fb6c60e75303effeaa10768e-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c2674917fb6c60e75303effeaa10768e-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c2674917fb6c60e75303effeaa10768e-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a5d09b48f57a4e888bb729aaf988c936-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ac8d630b9aa4d874707445e2552a09-chunk-022&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ac8d630b9aa4d874707445e2552a09-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-afe70f2d82515df80906bf3babd4e4eb-chunk-010</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1791899884</data>
