  <data key="d2">Gypsum Dihydrate is the main chemical component of phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Gypsum dihydrate is a material whose functionality is negatively impacted by contaminants found in phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;A chemical compound produced alongside hemipelagic gypsum in the wet phosphoric acid process.</data>
