<node id="Mercury">
  <data key="d0">Mercury</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Mercury is a chemical element and heavy metal that also functions as a trace element in geological contexts, notably exhibiting depletion in phosphorites relative to shale. In environmental and industrial settings, it is recognized as a dangerous pollutant and heavy metal contaminant, particularly associated with phosphogypsum stockpiles and stacks. High concentrations of mercury have been documented in Tunisian phosphogypsum, where it is classified as highly contaminating under Quebec standards, and it frequently leaches into groundwater near these stacks. Due to its toxicity, mercury is explicitly monitored in data analysis using units of µg l⁻¹ and is subject to stringent regulatory frameworks.

It holds the strictest regulatory limits among substances listed in water quality standards, with a specific limit of 0.002 mg l⁻¹ and a World Health Organization (WHO) guideline value of 0.001 mg l⁻¹. Beyond its environmental persistence, mercury poses significant health risks, as it is heavily implicated in neuronal damage and neurodegenerative diseases. Consequently, it is often studied alongside other environmental contaminants to assess and mitigate threats to both ecological systems and public safety.&lt;SEP&gt;Mercury is a toxic metal that may be present in phosphogypsum depending on the region.&lt;SEP&gt;A toxic metal element targeted for adsorption using hydroxyapatite-based composites.&lt;SEP&gt;A heavy metal ion targeted for adsorption using a magnetic composite.&lt;SEP&gt;A chemical element measured in phosphogypsum samples for leaching toxicity analysis.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-34a3ac199714be8fd1cdff8ead90fc92-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-025&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-046&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-047&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-036&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a5d09b48f57a4e888bb729aaf988c936-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-06f299b7e723cda1f0de1a647b02b6b4-chunk-022&lt;SEP&gt;doc-06f299b7e723cda1f0de1a647b02b6b4-chunk-023&lt;SEP&gt;doc-afe70f2d82515df80906bf3babd4e4eb-chunk-018</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1791900069</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
