  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Atmospheric environmental impact describes the air pollution effects from phosphogypsum storage, including hydrogen fluoride emissions, radionuclides, nanoparticle heavy metal adsorption, and greenhouse effects.</data>
