  <data key="d0">Water environmental impact</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Water environmental impact describes the aquatic pollution effects from phosphogypsum, including pH changes, heavy metal contamination, phytoplankton habitat disruption, and marine phosphorus cycle imbalance.</data>
