<node id="Agricultural Production">
  <data key="d0">Agricultural Production</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Agricultural production represents a sector utilizing phosphogypsum to produce soil conditioners and various fertilizers like calcium, potassium, and phosphorus fertilizers.&lt;SEP&gt;Agricultural Production is a utilization field for phosphogypsum involving soil amendments and fertilizers.</data>
