<node id="Table 4">
  <data key="d0">Table 4</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Table 4 functions as a generic, context-dependent placeholder label utilized across numerous independent scientific publications rather than representing a single static dataset. Its specific content is entirely determined by the research domain, encompassing a wide array of analytical, experimental, and comparative data. In studies focused on phosphogypsum characterization and utilization, Table 4 serves as a comprehensive repository for chemical, radiological, and physical properties. It documents the primary chemical composition of samples from China and other international regions, alongside heavy metal concentrations in associated solutions. Radiological assessments detail the mass content of trace and selected elements, activity ratios, enrichment factors, and calculated uranium and thorium series radionuclide ratios, while also flagging grain-size-linked anomalies. Structural and mineralogical analyses are presented through X-ray diffraction spectra intensities, d-spacing values, and calculated reticular distances, including mineral phase compositions analyzed via XRD following citric and oxalic acid treatments. The table also outlines rare earth element leaching methodologies, specifying element content, leaching agents, solid-to-liquid ratios, processing time, temperature, and extraction efficiency. Furthermore, it reports the mineral composition and trace element concentrations in parts per million of leached samples measured using LA-ICP-MS. In applied and environmental research, Table 4 compares microbial growth metrics across soil, biofertilizer, and plant root samples, summarizes construction material performance including phosphogypsum-based mortar replacement levels and compressive strength data, and presents Life Cycle Inventory data for phosphogypsum applications in road construction.

In biomedical and materials science contexts, Table 4 shifts focus to hydroxyapatite research. It presents adsorption results of Bovine Serum Albumin and LSZ on rod-shaped hydroxyapatite surfaces, alongside quantitative metrics for synthesized hydroxyapatite powders such as density, specific surface area, roughness changes, average particle size, coefficient of variation, and marginal error. Across all disciplines, Table 4 also frequently encapsulates foundational experimental frameworks, including experimental plans, design criteria, and quality monitoring parameters. Collectively, these varied applications demonstrate that Table 4 is a versatile analytical placeholder adapted to report specialized findings ranging from elemental and radionuclide profiling to microbiological comparisons, construction performance metrics, and surface adsorption studies.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-34a3ac199714be8fd1cdff8ead90fc92-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e290dd6268316238694f70c30a367426-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-70650e5cb032fce744763706d8701e36-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-70650e5cb032fce744763706d8701e36-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-70650e5cb032fce744763706d8701e36-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-020&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-022&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f1fb5c243f2539cf7be6b6021b63c36f-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8c22d31cfad5421c936a23705a3bc6e0-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8c22d31cfad5421c936a23705a3bc6e0-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a52951853fd542b78835b677936c557b-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d4a38fcc1b0f33a17d23e7a4407a9cf9-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d4a38fcc1b0f33a17d23e7a4407a9cf9-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0060991ac74a9675ce0293eccdc023cd-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-28fbd4302bba090e667215c840757ff7-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-160a0fe95f7c82b193c6af751106ab6d-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-66f6434914b6de99019386e4bdcbc57e-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-66f6434914b6de99019386e4bdcbc57e-chunk-013</data>
