<node id="Manganese">
  <data key="d0">Manganese</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Manganese is a transition metal and chemical element that plays significant roles across geological, environmental, and materials science domains. In geological contexts, it occurs as a major element in phosphogypsum, with measured mass fractions ranging from 0.010% to 0.080%, while simultaneously acting as a trace element that is notably depleted in phosphorites relative to average crustal abundances. Environmental regulatory frameworks also monitor its presence, classifying it within water quality standards with a specified concentration limit of 0.05 mg/L and a World Health Organization (WHO) guideline value of 50 mg/L.

In materials chemistry, manganese exhibits distinct behaviors when integrated into hydroxyapatite structures. As a substituent, it can reduce overall material stability by increasing solubility; conversely, when utilized as a supported metal catalyst, it demonstrates improved toluene conversion efficiency compared to alumina-supported variants. Regarding environmental remediation, manganese is frequently targeted for removal as a heavy metal ion using ion-exchange resins such as Dowex 50W-x8. However, treatment efficacy is highly material-dependent, as certain substrates have been observed to exhibit a 0% removal rate for the element under specific conditions.&lt;SEP&gt;Manganese is a heavy metal whose concentration in phosphogypsum solution is monitored against regulatory limits.&lt;SEP&gt;Manganese is a major chemical species analyzed in the phosphogypsum samples.&lt;SEP&gt;Manganese is an element detected in variable concentrations within the phosphogypsum samples.&lt;SEP&gt;Manganese is a trace element measured in phosphogypsum minerals using LA-ICP-MS.&lt;SEP&gt;Manganese is a trace element susceptible to removal via simple water washing.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-34a3ac199714be8fd1cdff8ead90fc92-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-047&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0a5563c80c4fd1f68b4442f73621a281-chunk-020&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0a5563c80c4fd1f68b4442f73621a281-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0a5563c80c4fd1f68b4442f73621a281-chunk-040&lt;SEP&gt;doc-06f299b7e723cda1f0de1a647b02b6b4-chunk-022&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-66f6434914b6de99019386e4bdcbc57e-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-66f6434914b6de99019386e4bdcbc57e-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-66f6434914b6de99019386e4bdcbc57e-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-66f6434914b6de99019386e4bdcbc57e-chunk-013</data>
