  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Phosphogypsum stockpiling is a waste management problem addressed by the environmentally friendly biofertilizer production method.&lt;SEP&gt;Phosphogypsum stockpiling is a disposal method considered in the techno-economic analysis.&lt;SEP&gt;Phosphogypsum stockpiling is a major environmental and management issue that drives the need for resource utilization pathways.</data>
