<node id="Group A1">
  <data key="d0">Group A1</data>
  <data key="d1">other</data>
  <data key="d2">A sample cluster comprising A1_1, A1_2, and A1_3, heavily dominated by Firmicutes and Proteobacteria.&lt;SEP&gt;Group A1 is the left cluster in the Principal Coordinate Analysis plot, containing samples A1_1, A1_2, and A1_3.&lt;SEP&gt;Group A1 is a cluster of data points located on the left side of the graph with negative PCOA1 values.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e290dd6268316238694f70c30a367426-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e290dd6268316238694f70c30a367426-chunk-021&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e290dd6268316238694f70c30a367426-chunk-020</data>
