  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A sample cluster comprising A2_1, A2_2, and A2_3, dominated by Actinobacteria and distinct from Group A1.&lt;SEP&gt;Group A2 is a cluster of data points located on the right side of the graph with positive PCOA1 values.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e290dd6268316238694f70c30a367426-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e290dd6268316238694f70c30a367426-chunk-021</data>
