  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">An equation structure defining a variable on the left-hand side as a fraction of multiplied terms on the right-hand side.&lt;SEP&gt;A structured symbolic representation used to express scientific relationships like the Grashof Number.</data>
