  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">A graphical representation used in the dual-axis line graph to plot data points with vertical error bars.&lt;SEP&gt;Specific chart type mentioned as part of the dual-axis line graph structure.&lt;SEP&gt;Scatter Plot is a two-dimensional graphical representation displaying clustered data points for sample groups.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e290dd6268316238694f70c30a367426-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e290dd6268316238694f70c30a367426-chunk-020&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e290dd6268316238694f70c30a367426-chunk-019</data>
