  <data key="d2">Absorbance is a measurement taken at 665 nm and 649 nm to calculate chlorophyll concentration.&lt;SEP&gt;Absorbance is a potential metric for the Y-Axis in the spectral graph.&lt;SEP&gt;Absorbance is a potential measurement scale for the y-axis intensity in the spectroscopy plot.&lt;SEP&gt;Absorbance is the vertical axis metric ranging from 0.0 to 0.6, quantifying light absorption intensity.&lt;SEP&gt;Absorbance is a quantitative measurement of light absorption, with values noted around 0.2 for a specific peak and close to 0.0 for the baseline.</data>
