<node id="Bovine Serum Albumin">
  <data key="d0">Bovine Serum Albumin</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Bovine Serum Albumin is an acidic protein extensively utilized in materials science and biochemistry as a model system to investigate adsorption and release behaviors. It is particularly recognized for its high specificity in binding to α-oriented hydroxyapatite surfaces, which makes it a standard reference for evaluating the adsorption and release properties of rod-shaped hydroxyapatite particles and nanoparticles. Researchers frequently employ Bovine Serum Albumin to study protein interactions with calcium phosphate and hydroxyapatite surfaces, as well as in composite formulations such as Bovine Serum Albumin-silicon dioxide systems. To verify successful integration within hydroxyapatite composites, the protein is routinely analyzed using Fourier-transform infrared spectroscopy (FTIR).

Beyond its role in surface interaction studies, Bovine Serum Albumin serves a critical functional application in molecular biology. It is commonly added to polymerase chain reaction (PCR) reaction systems to stabilize DNA polymerase activity, ensuring optimal enzyme performance during amplification processes. Collectively, these diverse applications underscore the protein's versatility as both a fundamental biochemical reagent and a standardized probe for evaluating material-surface interactions.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e290dd6268316238694f70c30a367426-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0a5563c80c4fd1f68b4442f73621a281-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f1fb5c243f2539cf7be6b6021b63c36f-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f1fb5c243f2539cf7be6b6021b63c36f-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f1fb5c243f2539cf7be6b6021b63c36f-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f1fb5c243f2539cf7be6b6021b63c36f-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f1fb5c243f2539cf7be6b6021b63c36f-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4739e42903c95e1fb7e0ecfbca3a12df-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4739e42903c95e1fb7e0ecfbca3a12df-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4739e42903c95e1fb7e0ecfbca3a12df-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4739e42903c95e1fb7e0ecfbca3a12df-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1791748306</data>
