  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Organic acids are compounds secreted by Bacillus subtilis that assist in the chemical transformation and absorption of essential plant nutrients.&lt;SEP&gt;Organic acids are eco-friendly leaching agents that are easily degradable, used as alternatives to mineral acids for rare earth extraction.</data>
