  <data key="d2">Rouis is a researcher who provided phosphogypsum data from Tunisia.&lt;SEP&gt;Rouis is a researcher who reported chemical composition values for phosphogypsum process water.&lt;SEP&gt;Rouis is a researcher who co-authored a 1990 publication presenting geochemical concentration data.&lt;SEP&gt;Rouis investigated groundwater contamination below a phosphogypsum stack in Tunisia.&lt;SEP&gt;Rouis is a researcher who co-investigated groundwater contamination below a phosphogypsum stack in Tunisia.</data>
