  <data key="d2">Bensalah is a researcher who provided phosphogypsum data from Tunisia.&lt;SEP&gt;Bensalah is a researcher who reported chemical composition values for phosphogypsum process water.&lt;SEP&gt;Bensalah is a researcher who co-authored a 1990 publication presenting geochemical concentration data.&lt;SEP&gt;Bensalah investigated groundwater contamination below a phosphogypsum stack in Tunisia.&lt;SEP&gt;Bensalah is a researcher who co-investigated groundwater contamination below a phosphogypsum stack in Tunisia.&lt;SEP&gt;A researcher who performed a hydrothermal synthesis method to produce nHA from PG.</data>
