<node id="Thorium-228">
  <data key="d0">Thorium-228</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Thorium-228 is a radioactive isotope and radionuclide belonging to the thorium decay series. In analytical contexts, it has been identified as the radionuclide isotope exhibiting the lowest minimum detectable activity, and its activity concentration is routinely measured and reported in scientific datasets. Within decay chain analyses, Thorium-228 is consistently measured alongside its specific decay products, Lead-212 and Thallium-208.

Environmental and industrial assessments frequently focus on Thorium-228 within phosphogypsum samples, where it is generally present at lower concentrations compared to fly ash or soil. When analyzed across different particle sizes and fractions of phosphogypsum, the isotope demonstrates significant fractionation behavior. Specifically, its activity concentration can reach up to 8.9 times higher in coarse fractions, a distribution pattern attributed to the isotope's strong affinity for organic material.

Beyond concentration measurements, Thorium-228 plays a critical role in isotopic ratio analysis. It is routinely evaluated for its activity ratio relative to Radium-228 across various phosphogypsum fractions and particle sizes. These isotopic activity ratios are utilized to investigate and characterize fractionation mechanisms within phosphogypsum, providing valuable insights into the geochemical behavior and distribution of thorium-series radionuclides in industrial byproducts.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-70650e5cb032fce744763706d8701e36-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-70650e5cb032fce744763706d8701e36-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-70650e5cb032fce744763706d8701e36-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-70650e5cb032fce744763706d8701e36-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-70650e5cb032fce744763706d8701e36-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-70650e5cb032fce744763706d8701e36-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-70650e5cb032fce744763706d8701e36-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-70650e5cb032fce744763706d8701e36-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-70650e5cb032fce744763706d8701e36-chunk-025&lt;SEP&gt;doc-70650e5cb032fce744763706d8701e36-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-70650e5cb032fce744763706d8701e36-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-70650e5cb032fce744763706d8701e36-chunk-017</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1791312774</data>
