<node id="Clay">
  <data key="d0">Clay</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Clay is a natural raw material and soil component characterized by a mineral composition that primarily consists of illite and kaolinite, both of which disintegrate during sintering. As a versatile substance, it serves critical roles across industrial, manufacturing, and environmental sectors. In industrial and manufacturing contexts, clay functions as a key raw material consumed by PSC technology processes and serves as the foundational component for brick manufacturing. It also constitutes 25 wt% of typical bone china formulations.

In construction applications, clay is a conventional material utilized in both brick production and road construction. It is frequently partially substituted or replaced by Phosphogypsum (PG) to optimize production processes. While this substitution yields material savings, quantified as a reduction of one tonne in road construction, it is noted that replacing clay with PG simultaneously increases the overall environmental footprint. Environmentally, clay plays a vital role in waste management and remediation. It is specifically deployed to cover phosphogypsum stacks in Ontario to mitigate radon exhalation. Furthermore, clay-rich materials are extensively studied for their environmental retention capabilities, demonstrating a proven ability to adsorb lead and retain metal ions at the molecular level.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-027&lt;SEP&gt;doc-276f29345df37143fc224a22d0f6089b-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-276f29345df37143fc224a22d0f6089b-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-276f29345df37143fc224a22d0f6089b-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-045&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2760dc2a11fedad02d24741a978cf20d-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0060991ac74a9675ce0293eccdc023cd-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0060991ac74a9675ce0293eccdc023cd-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0060991ac74a9675ce0293eccdc023cd-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0060991ac74a9675ce0293eccdc023cd-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0060991ac74a9675ce0293eccdc023cd-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0060991ac74a9675ce0293eccdc023cd-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0060991ac74a9675ce0293eccdc023cd-chunk-008</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1791877754</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
