<node id="Crystal Structure">
  <data key="d0">Crystal Structure</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The crystal structure of apatite dictates which trace elements can substitute for calcium or phosphate groups.&lt;SEP&gt;The atomic arrangement of gypsum that undergoes transformation during dehydration stages.&lt;SEP&gt;Crystal structure denotes the ordered atomic arrangement of HAp, which is altered by organic modifiers.</data>
