  <data key="d0">Anatase</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">A titanium mineral classified as an accessory component in phosphate rock.&lt;SEP&gt;Anatase is a titanium accessory mineral found in the rock formation.&lt;SEP&gt;Anatase is a mineral compound listed alongside other chemical phases found in the studied samples.&lt;SEP&gt;Anatase is a mineral phase identified in phosphogypsum samples from an abandoned fertilizer industry.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-005</data>
