  <data key="d0">May and Sweeney</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">May and Sweeney are researchers who analyzed the pH and elemental composition of Florida phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;May and Sweeney are researchers who reported that most Ra-226 in phosphogypsum is associated with fine grains.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-005</data>
