<node id="Phosphogypsum Management">
  <data key="d0">Phosphogypsum Management</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The systematic handling and environmental mitigation of phosphogypsum waste, addressed in international symposia and regional studies.&lt;SEP&gt;Phosphogypsum management encompasses the technical and environmental strategies required to mitigate issues associated with phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Phosphogypsum management encompasses the global ecological strategies and guidelines for handling phosphogypsum waste.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-043&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-042&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-001</data>
