<node id="Burnett">
  <data key="d0">Burnett</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Burnett is a researcher who investigated the adsorption of U(VI) onto apatite and the lattice positioning of Ra-226.&lt;SEP&gt;Burnett researched how high ionic strength groundwater enhances Ra-226 leachability and retention.&lt;SEP&gt;Burnett is a researcher from the Florida Institute Oceanography who proposed converting phosphogypsum waste into ammonium sulfate.&lt;SEP&gt;Burnett is a researcher cited in a 1996 study related to the United States.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-009</data>
