<node id="Sulfate Reducing Bacteria">
  <data key="d0">Sulfate Reducing Bacteria</data>
  <data key="d1">creature</data>
  <data key="d2">Sulfate reducing bacteria are microorganisms that mediate redox reactions, indirectly solubilizing Ra-226 from uranium mine sludges under anaerobic conditions.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-015</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
