<node id="Phosphate fertilizer industry">
  <data key="d0">Phosphate fertilizer industry</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The phosphate fertilizer industry is the industrial sector that produces phosphogypsum as a by-product during phosphoric acid manufacturing.&lt;SEP&gt;The phosphate fertilizer industry is a critical global sector that drives the production of phosphoric acid and generates phosphogypsum as a by-product.</data>
