<node id="Atlantic Ocean">
  <data key="d0">Atlantic Ocean</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">The Atlantic Ocean is a body of water where the Djorf Lasfar plant discharges large quantities of phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;The Atlantic Ocean is a marine environment receiving phosphogypsum waste near chemical industry locations in Morocco.&lt;SEP&gt;The Atlantic Ocean is the body of water receiving polluted estuarine waters from the Huelva Estuary.&lt;SEP&gt;The Atlantic Ocean provides a geographical advantage for Morocco to dump PG into the sea.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a5d09b48f57a4e888bb729aaf988c936-chunk-004</data>
