  <data key="d0">GEOCHEM</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">GEOCHEM is a computational software tool used to predict the fate and speciation of chemical elements in simulated soil and leachate systems.&lt;SEP&gt;A computational tool used to perform speciation of major and trace elements and predict ion activities.&lt;SEP&gt;GEOCHEM is a chemical equilibrium model used to speciate leachate solutions in laboratory studies.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-022</data>
