<node id="Luther">
  <data key="d0">Luther</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Luther is a researcher who provided phosphogypsum data and samples originating from Idaho.&lt;SEP&gt;Luther is a researcher who examined solution extracts from batch incubation studies of phosphogypsum and soil mixtures using GEOCHEM.&lt;SEP&gt;A researcher who compared predicted ion activities with theoretical levels using solubility constants.&lt;SEP&gt;A researcher who determined equilibrium concentrations of elements in phosphogypsum pore water to evaluate groundwater contamination potential.&lt;SEP&gt;Luther is a researcher who identified the accumulation of fluoride in topsoil due to specific chemical compounds.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-023&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-014</data>
