<node id="Singh">
  <data key="d0">Singh</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Singh is a researcher whose work primarily focuses on the chemical properties, impurities, and treatment of phosphogypsum, alongside its potential agricultural applications. A significant portion of Singh's research investigates the detrimental effects of soluble phosphorus and fluorine compounds on the hydration and solidification processes of phosphogypsum and gypsum-based materials. Specifically, Singh explained the chemical interactions between soluble phosphorus and calcium ions, demonstrating that soluble phosphorus pentoxide hinders the hydration of hemihydrate phosphogypsum by forming an insoluble calcium phosphate coating. This mechanism was further explored to show how soluble phosphorus delays gypsum solidification and alters its crystal morphology. Additionally, Singh established a harmful influence ranking of various fluorides on the setting time, strength, and overall performance of gypsum and filling bodies.

To address these impurity-related challenges, Singh pioneered the treatment of phosphogypsum using aqueous citric acid solutions. This work involved conducting the first systematic treatment of phosphogypsum with citric acid, followed by comprehensive chemical, physical, and thermal analyses comparing treated and untreated samples. Singh documented that citric acid effectively converts problematic phosphate and fluoride impurities into water-soluble compounds, thereby mitigating their negative impacts. Beyond industrial and chemical processing, Singh also contributed to studies exploring the viability of phosphogypsum as a nutrient source for plant nutrition, highlighting the broader agricultural potential of this byproduct when properly processed.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-028&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ac8d630b9aa4d874707445e2552a09-chunk-008</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1791773146</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
