<node id="Murray">
  <data key="d0">Murray</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Murray is a researcher who used GEOCHEM to predict the fate of fluoride, orthophosphate, and sulfate from phosphogypsum leachate.&lt;SEP&gt;Murray is a researcher who reported chemical composition values for phosphogypsum process water.&lt;SEP&gt;A researcher who, with Lewis, suggested calcareous strata may effectively precipitate fluoride and orthophosphate.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-023</data>
