  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Lewis is a researcher who extended speciation modeling to Radium-226 species, noting inconsistencies due to poor thermodynamic data for mixed-solid species.&lt;SEP&gt;Lewis is a researcher who reported chemical composition values for phosphogypsum process water.&lt;SEP&gt;A researcher who, with Murray, studied the precipitation of fluoride and orthophosphate in calcareous strata.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-023</data>
