<node id="Organic Materials">
  <data key="d0">Organic Materials</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Organic materials adsorb lead, contributing to low solution concentrations.&lt;SEP&gt;Organic materials are residual substances found mixed within phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Organic materials are contaminants in phosphogypsum that degrade product quality and negatively impact gypsum functionality.&lt;SEP&gt;Organic materials are added to gypsum products alongside polymers to improve water resistance.&lt;SEP&gt;Organic materials are impurities found in phosphogypsum.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1adcb38defdd04a271ddba318999ba67-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7797768798fcd1152bdc10ff73139e35-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a5d09b48f57a4e888bb729aaf988c936-chunk-002</data>
