  <data key="d2">Stockpile refers to the storage area for phosphogypsum, whose age affects its chemical characteristics.&lt;SEP&gt;Stockpile is the storage location for the phosphogypsum raw material before processing.&lt;SEP&gt;Stockpile refers to the accumulated storage of phosphogypsum, which has reached 400 million tons in China.</data>
