  <data key="d0">Fe Oxides</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Fe oxides are oxidate minerals with which thorium readily coprecipitates.&lt;SEP&gt;Fe oxides are substances introduced to significantly lower the decomposition temperature of phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Fe oxides are introduced to significantly lower the decomposition temperature of PG, forming a catalytic reaction system.</data>
