<node id="Secular Equilibrium">
  <data key="d0">Secular Equilibrium</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Secular equilibrium is a state where U-238 and Ra-226 activities are approximately equal in Florida phosphate ore.&lt;SEP&gt;A state in naturally occurring decay chains assumed for sufficiently old raw materials.&lt;SEP&gt;Secular equilibrium is a state where the activity concentration of each radionuclide in a decay chain remains constant and equal.&lt;SEP&gt;Secular Equilibrium is a radioactive state where the decay rates of parent and daughter isotopes become equal.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-70650e5cb032fce744763706d8701e36-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-70650e5cb032fce744763706d8701e36-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-70650e5cb032fce744763706d8701e36-chunk-024</data>
