  <data key="d1">other</data>
  <data key="d2">Toxic elements include As, Cd, Cr, Pb, Na, Mn, and Fe, which are solubilized during acidulation.&lt;SEP&gt;Toxic elements are harmful substances immobilized by the dense network structure formed during CPGFM backfill solidification.</data>
