<node id="Quicklime">
  <data key="d0">Quicklime</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Quicklime, chemically equivalent to calcium oxide, is a versatile alkaline additive and binding material widely utilized across industrial and environmental applications, particularly in phosphogypsum-based processing and composite material development. Produced through high-temperature calcination that inherently releases carbon dioxide, its effective calcium content is routinely measured alongside soluble P₂O₅ and fluoride levels. In industrial scenarios such as PCR and PBG, quicklime serves as a fundamental raw material for alkali neutralization, where it reacts with and neutralizes harmful acids and acidic impurities. Due to its substantial consumption and the high energy demands of its production and processing, it constitutes a major factor in the ecological footprint of these operations, accounting for up to 99.9% of their associated environmental burdens.

Within phosphogypsum and hemihydrate phosphogypsum (HPG) applications, quicklime is stored in silos and mixed with water and phosphogypsum to prepare slurries like CPGFM. It functions as a critical chemical modifier, often utilized alongside carbide slag, that removes soluble impurities, promotes the hydration of calcium sulfate hemihydrate, and stabilizes fluorapatite. By reacting with P₂O₅ to form insoluble compounds, it effectively controls phosphorus migration and reduces leaching in backfill applications. As a cementitious composite additive, quicklime significantly enhances mechanical and structural performance, improving compressive strength, specific durability, weathering resistance, antifreeze resistance, and later-age strength.

The functional impact of quicklime on phosphogypsum matrices is driven by water absorption, swelling, and hydration reactions that generate expansion stress and increase sample length. While these interactions effectively boost the material's strength coefficient and durability at optimal dosages, quicklime exhibits a dual nature regarding dimensional stability. Experimental studies typically evaluate dosages between 0% and 3%, with 2% consistently identified as optimal for maximizing freeze resistance, weathering resistance, and overall strength enhancement. However, excessive amounts can trigger pronounced expansion and internal stresses that compromise structural integrity and decrease strength. Consequently, precise dosage control is essential to balance its beneficial binding and protective properties against its expansive potential.&lt;SEP&gt;Quicklime is an alkaline additive used in phosphogypsum cement mortar, with a 2% mass fraction optimizing impermeability and corrosion resistance.&lt;SEP&gt;Quicklime is a traditional material that can be replaced by calcium oxide derived from phosphogypsum.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-276f29345df37143fc224a22d0f6089b-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-276f29345df37143fc224a22d0f6089b-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-276f29345df37143fc224a22d0f6089b-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-276f29345df37143fc224a22d0f6089b-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-276f29345df37143fc224a22d0f6089b-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-276f29345df37143fc224a22d0f6089b-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-276f29345df37143fc224a22d0f6089b-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-276f29345df37143fc224a22d0f6089b-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c2674917fb6c60e75303effeaa10768e-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7797768798fcd1152bdc10ff73139e35-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7797768798fcd1152bdc10ff73139e35-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7797768798fcd1152bdc10ff73139e35-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7797768798fcd1152bdc10ff73139e35-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7797768798fcd1152bdc10ff73139e35-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7797768798fcd1152bdc10ff73139e35-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7797768798fcd1152bdc10ff73139e35-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7797768798fcd1152bdc10ff73139e35-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7797768798fcd1152bdc10ff73139e35-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7797768798fcd1152bdc10ff73139e35-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7797768798fcd1152bdc10ff73139e35-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7797768798fcd1152bdc10ff73139e35-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-021&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-026&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-024&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-023&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ac8d630b9aa4d874707445e2552a09-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ac8d630b9aa4d874707445e2552a09-chunk-008</data>
