<node id="Washing">
  <data key="d0">Washing</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Washing is a physical purification and pre-treatment technique primarily utilized in the processing of phosphogypsum (PG) and various chemical precipitates. As a representative modification method, its core objective is to eliminate impurities, residual chemicals, and water-soluble substances from the target material. The process fundamentally operates through the separation of clear liquid and sediment, effectively purifying the product by leaching out unwanted soluble components.

In practice, Washing is applied across multiple stages of material processing. It serves as an initial processing step for raw materials, a pre-treatment phase that frequently employs ionized water to extract soluble contaminants, and a dedicated purification stage for products following hydrothermal synthesis. Depending on the specific application and desired chemical outcomes, the technique utilizes different aqueous media, including warm water and lime water. Notably, it is recognized as a harmless treatment method, with documented implementations by entities such as Company R for the standard processing of phosphogypsum. By integrating these varied operational parameters, Washing functions as a versatile and essential purification protocol in industrial and laboratory settings.&lt;SEP&gt;Washing is a laboratory-scale purification method. Washing removes impurities from phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Washing is a laboratory-scale purification technology for phosphogypsum that has been scaled for industrial applications.&lt;SEP&gt;Washing is a purification step used to remove soluble impurities and byproducts from synthesized crystals.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-276f29345df37143fc224a22d0f6089b-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1adcb38defdd04a271ddba318999ba67-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1adcb38defdd04a271ddba318999ba67-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-025&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-030&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-057&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c2674917fb6c60e75303effeaa10768e-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c2674917fb6c60e75303effeaa10768e-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a5d09b48f57a4e888bb729aaf988c936-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a5d09b48f57a4e888bb729aaf988c936-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d4a38fcc1b0f33a17d23e7a4407a9cf9-chunk-002</data>
