<node id="Greenhouse Gas Emissions">
  <data key="d0">Greenhouse Gas Emissions</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Greenhouse Gas Emissions are environmental impact metrics that decrease as PSC Technology proportions increase.&lt;SEP&gt;Greenhouse gas emissions are environmental targets reduced through phosphogypsum-based carbon sequestration.&lt;SEP&gt;Greenhouse Gas Emissions are atmospheric emissions mitigated through the environmental application of phosphogypsum for carbon dioxide sequestration.&lt;SEP&gt;Greenhouse Gas Emissions are environmental pollutants whose mitigation is achieved through the CO2 mineral sequestration process.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-276f29345df37143fc224a22d0f6089b-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-025&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-009</data>
