  <data key="d2">2021 is the reference year for phosphogypsum production statistics and provincial distribution data.&lt;SEP&gt;The year in which China's PG disposal and its environmental/economic impacts were assessed.&lt;SEP&gt;2021 is the year when the existing phosphogypsum storage yard at Guizhou Chanheng Group reached maximum capacity.&lt;SEP&gt;2021 is the final year of the four-year data period covered in the chart.&lt;SEP&gt;A year for which production and utilized data are provided.&lt;SEP&gt;2021 is a year represented in a statistical table containing percentage distributions.</data>
