<node id="Phosphorus Chemical Industry">
  <data key="d0">Phosphorus Chemical Industry</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The phosphorus chemical industry is the broader industrial sector that benefits from the sustainable development promoted by PSC technology.&lt;SEP&gt;The phosphorus chemical industry is undergoing an environmentally friendly transition facilitated by phosphogypsum recycling.&lt;SEP&gt;The phosphorus chemical industry is a major industrial sector. The phosphorus chemical industry contributes significantly to total phosphorus emissions.&lt;SEP&gt;An industrial sector identified as a primary source of total phosphorus pollution.&lt;SEP&gt;The phosphorus chemical industry is the sector whose competitiveness is improved through better phosphogypsum utilization.&lt;SEP&gt;The phosphorus chemical industry is the industrial sector driving phosphogypsum production in the Yangtze River Basin.</data>
