  <data key="d0">Electricity</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">An energy source consumed in PBG and PSC technologies, primarily contributing to human health, ecological toxicity, and toxicity potentials.&lt;SEP&gt;Electricity is an energy source listed in the energy consumption table.&lt;SEP&gt;A measured energy consumption metric recorded in kilowatt-hours for the PCR, PBG, and PSC scenarios.&lt;SEP&gt;A raw material consumed by all three processes (PCR, PBG, PSC).&lt;SEP&gt;Electricity is an energy resource tracked in the environmental impact analysis across all three scenarios.</data>
