  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">A researcher cited in previous studies confirming the feasibility of using calcium carbide residue.&lt;SEP&gt;Wu is a researcher who reported that mesoporous hydroxyapatite synthesized with cetyltrimethyl ammonium bromide exhibited the highest BSA loading.&lt;SEP&gt;Wu is a researcher cited regarding the origin of toxic substances in phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Wu is a researcher who documented the stable accompanying minerals found in phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Wu is a researcher who co-created a schematic diagram illustrating the immobilization of toxic metal ions by CPGFM backfill.</data>
