  <data key="d2">Life cycle assessment (LCA) is the methodology used to evaluate the environmental and economic performance of Phosphogypsum treatment pathways.&lt;SEP&gt;Life Cycle Assessment is a standardized methodology for comprehensively analyzing the environmental and economic impacts of waste management strategies.&lt;SEP&gt;Life Cycle Assessment (LCA) is a methodology used to assess the environmental impacts of phosphogypsum use and management.</data>
