<node id="CO2 Sequestration">
  <data key="d0">CO2 Sequestration</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">CO2 sequestration is a novel valorization route explored for Phosphogypsum utilization.&lt;SEP&gt;CO2 sequestration is an environmental application explored for the utilization of phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;CO2 sequestration is the process of capturing and storing carbon dioxide, explored through phosphogypsum modification.&lt;SEP&gt;CO2 sequestration is an application of phosphogypsum that has the lowest volume of scientific literature.&lt;SEP&gt;CO2 Sequestration is an environmental benefit where phosphogypsum by-products react to capture and store carbon dioxide.&lt;SEP&gt;A carbon capture and storage technique applied to modified mineral carbonation of phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;A process targeted by modified mineral carbonation of phosphogypsum to mitigate carbon emissions.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-276f29345df37143fc224a22d0f6089b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1adcb38defdd04a271ddba318999ba67-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-057&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-038&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-afe70f2d82515df80906bf3babd4e4eb-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b19ca721a4da4422ee10228d88a4c292-chunk-017</data>
