<node id="Roads">
  <data key="d0">Roads</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Roads represent a sector where Phosphogypsum is utilized, particularly in road construction applications.&lt;SEP&gt;Roads are infrastructure projects that can benefit from a phosphogypsum layer combined with fine and coarse aggregates.&lt;SEP&gt;Roads represent a field where phosphogypsum application is gradually being explored.&lt;SEP&gt;Roads construction is a primary field for the comprehensive utilization of phosphogypsum.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-276f29345df37143fc224a22d0f6089b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-026&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ac8d630b9aa4d874707445e2552a09-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ac8d630b9aa4d874707445e2552a09-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1791769988</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Road Construction">
  <data key="d0">Road Construction</data>
  <data key="d1">other</data>
  <data key="d2">Road Construction functions as a primary alternative waste management method and application domain for Phosphogypsum (PG) within infrastructure development. Specifically, it serves as a fundamental utilization pathway where treated phosphogypsum, processed to be free of hazardous impurities, replaces conventional clay in secondary road base and subbase construction. This approach represents a promising sector for the large-scale valorization and sustainable management of PG waste, positioning it as a viable application field for PG and other industrial byproducts.

The implementation of phosphogypsum in road construction delivers substantial economic and environmental benefits. By substituting traditional clay, this method reduces the overall environmental footprint, conserves clay resources, and minimizes lorry transportation requirements. Financially, it demonstrates a cost difference of approximately 6.3 percent compared to conventional road works. In comparative environmental impact assessments, such as those evaluated by Tsioka and Voudrias, road construction utilizing phosphogypsum is consistently ranked second in preference among alternative management strategies. Consequently, road construction stands as a highly effective and economically viable application scenario that successfully repurposes industrial waste into essential infrastructure components.&lt;SEP&gt;A utilization pathway for phosphogypsum, represented by yellow in the chart.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-276f29345df37143fc224a22d0f6089b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-276f29345df37143fc224a22d0f6089b-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-030&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0060991ac74a9675ce0293eccdc023cd-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0060991ac74a9675ce0293eccdc023cd-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0060991ac74a9675ce0293eccdc023cd-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0060991ac74a9675ce0293eccdc023cd-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0060991ac74a9675ce0293eccdc023cd-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0060991ac74a9675ce0293eccdc023cd-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0060991ac74a9675ce0293eccdc023cd-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0060991ac74a9675ce0293eccdc023cd-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0060991ac74a9675ce0293eccdc023cd-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0060991ac74a9675ce0293eccdc023cd-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-afe70f2d82515df80906bf3babd4e4eb-chunk-019</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1791900207</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Mine Filling">
  <data key="d0">Mine Filling</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Mine filling is a basic utilization method for Phosphogypsum in mining operations.&lt;SEP&gt;Mine filling is the application field where the complex citric acid leaching method is difficult to implement.&lt;SEP&gt;Mine filling represents 11.6% of phosphogypsum utilization.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-276f29345df37143fc224a22d0f6089b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ac8d630b9aa4d874707445e2552a09-chunk-022</data>
