  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">A manufacturing process that consumes Clay, Natural plaster, Fly ash, Slag powder, Catalyst, Water, Coke, Coal, Natural gas, and Electricity, emits multiple pollutants, and produces Sulphuric acid, Cement, and Steam.</data>
