  <data key="d2">Natural gas is an energy source consumed in the PSC technology process.&lt;SEP&gt;Natural gas is a fossil fuel material listed in the energy consumption table.&lt;SEP&gt;A raw material consumed by the PSC process.&lt;SEP&gt;Natural gas is a fuel source tracked in the PSC scenario.&lt;SEP&gt;Natural gas is burned in a furnace to dry natural gypsum, causing significant environmental impact.</data>
