  <data key="d2">Calcium carbide slag is an industrial alkaline waste recommended as a substitute for quicklime to reduce environmental impacts.&lt;SEP&gt;Calcium carbide slag is an alkaline industrial waste material used as a neutralizing agent for phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Calcium carbide slag serves as a supplementary binder component in Zhao's optimized CPGFM formulation.&lt;SEP&gt;Calcium carbide slag is a solid waste material added to phosphogypsum modification to optimize cement performance and utilize waste.</data>
