<node id="Brick Production">
  <data key="d0">Brick Production</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Brick Production, within the context of industrial waste management, functions as a valorization and alternative management method for phosphogypsum (PG). This process utilizes PG as a raw material alternative, effectively replacing traditional clay and sand in conventional brick manufacturing. Evaluated extensively as a PG waste management strategy, the method yields material savings while simultaneously introducing additional resource consumption and material transport requirements.

When assessed through environmental footprint analyses, Brick Production is ranked third in preference among alternative waste management options. Comparative studies, including those conducted by Tsioka and Voudrias, evaluate the environmental impacts of this PG utilization scenario against conventional manufacturing baselines. The analysis reveals that while Brick Production offers a viable route for industrial PG repurposing, it exhibits a higher overall environmental footprint than standard brick manufacturing methods. Economically, the process demonstrates a cost difference of approximately 2.9 percent when compared to conventional industrial works. Overall, Brick Production serves as a specialized industrial application that repurposes phosphogypsum, balancing resource recovery with measurable environmental and economic trade-offs.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-276f29345df37143fc224a22d0f6089b-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0060991ac74a9675ce0293eccdc023cd-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0060991ac74a9675ce0293eccdc023cd-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0060991ac74a9675ce0293eccdc023cd-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0060991ac74a9675ce0293eccdc023cd-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0060991ac74a9675ce0293eccdc023cd-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0060991ac74a9675ce0293eccdc023cd-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0060991ac74a9675ce0293eccdc023cd-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0060991ac74a9675ce0293eccdc023cd-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0060991ac74a9675ce0293eccdc023cd-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0060991ac74a9675ce0293eccdc023cd-chunk-008</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1791877169</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
