  <data key="d0">1,2-Dichloroethane Oxidation</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">1,2-Dichloroethane oxidation is a chemical reaction catalyzed by cobalt supported on hydroxyapatite, benefiting from high active species dispersion.</data>
