<node id="Huang">
  <data key="d0">Huang</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Huang concluded that surface hydroxyls and the basicity of hydroxyapatite significantly benefit nitrous oxide decomposition.&lt;SEP&gt;Huang is a researcher who conducted studies on hydroxyapatite-supported gold for carbon monoxide elimination processes.&lt;SEP&gt;Huang is a researcher who emphasized the critical need to produce potash fertilizer from K-feldspar to reduce soluble potassium consumption.&lt;SEP&gt;Huang is a co-author of a reference on phosphogypsum valorization processes.&lt;SEP&gt;Huang is a researcher who provided heavy metal concentration data for Chinese phosphogypsum solution.&lt;SEP&gt;Huang soaked phosphogypsum in 4% citric acid solution, observing increased compressive strength and improved microstructural densification.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-0a5563c80c4fd1f68b4442f73621a281-chunk-020&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0a5563c80c4fd1f68b4442f73621a281-chunk-021&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-029&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ac8d630b9aa4d874707445e2552a09-chunk-008</data>
