<node id="Eggshells">
  <data key="d0">Eggshells</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Eggshells are biogenic waste products utilized as a source for hydroxyapatite extraction.&lt;SEP&gt;Biogenic product derived from waste, utilized as a source for hydroxyapatite extraction.&lt;SEP&gt;Eggshells are animal waste sources successfully used to derive hydroxyapatite.&lt;SEP&gt;Eggshells are natural sources from which hydroxyapatite crystals can be obtained.&lt;SEP&gt;Eggshells serve as a natural source for deriving calcium phosphate materials.&lt;SEP&gt;Eggshells serve as a precursor material primarily composed of calcite, utilized in hydroxyapatite synthesis.&lt;SEP&gt;Eggshells are natural calcium-rich waste materials utilized as starting precursors for hydroxyapatite synthesis.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-0a5563c80c4fd1f68b4442f73621a281-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0a5563c80c4fd1f68b4442f73621a281-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0a5563c80c4fd1f68b4442f73621a281-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1adcb38defdd04a271ddba318999ba67-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1adcb38defdd04a271ddba318999ba67-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c4a64a852097fdc910b98ed788503ce4-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c4a64a852097fdc910b98ed788503ce4-chunk-003</data>
