<node id="Titanium Dioxide">
  <data key="d0">Titanium Dioxide</data>
  <data key="d1">other</data>
  <data key="d2">Titanium Dioxide is a widely utilized chemical compound primarily recognized for its function as a photocatalyst. It is highly valued for its robust chemical stability and excellent catalytic activity, although it possesses a relatively weak adsorption capacity for certain organic contaminants. In advanced material engineering, Titanium Dioxide is frequently combined with hydroxyapatite to form nanocomposites specifically designed to enhance photocatalytic performance. This composite pairing significantly improves both bactericidal efficacy and overall photocatalytic activity. Additionally, when hydroxyapatite is doped with zinc, Titanium Dioxide is used as a comparative catalyst, exhibiting a UV-vis absorption spectrum that closely mirrors that of the doped hydroxyapatite.

Beyond its engineered applications, Titanium Dioxide is also a documented minor chemical constituent within phosphogypsum. It is routinely measured and recorded in phosphogypsum composition tables as a standard component of the material's chemical makeup. Quantitative analyses indicate that Titanium Dioxide comprises approximately 0.4 wt% of phosphogypsum, with specific concentration measurements consistently reported at 0.01 ± 0.0004. These data points confirm its consistent presence as a minor but measurable element in the compound's industrial and geological profiles.&lt;SEP&gt;Titanium Dioxide is a standard material used for calibrating Ti measurements.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-0a5563c80c4fd1f68b4442f73621a281-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0a5563c80c4fd1f68b4442f73621a281-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0a5563c80c4fd1f68b4442f73621a281-chunk-032&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0a5563c80c4fd1f68b4442f73621a281-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-042&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d18c456289f64c1e16c73a0dfd6595b3-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0060991ac74a9675ce0293eccdc023cd-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-66f6434914b6de99019386e4bdcbc57e-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1792039255</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
