<node id="Hu">
  <data key="d0">Hu</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Hu is a researcher who investigated the dark photocatalytic activity of titanium-doped hydroxyapatite and oxygen radical generation.&lt;SEP&gt;Hu is a researcher who investigated phosphogypsum modification processes, finding that autoclaving treatment yields superior cement retarder properties.</data>
