  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Kandori et al. are researchers who conducted studies on hydroxyapatite particles and heat treatment temperatures.&lt;SEP&gt;Kandori et al. are researchers who studied the relationship between protein adsorption and HAp particle morphology.</data>
