<node id="Dissolution-Precipitation">
  <data key="d0">Dissolution-Precipitation</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Dissolution-precipitation is a metal adsorption mechanism where hydroxyapatite dissolves to release phosphate ions that precipitate metal cations.&lt;SEP&gt;Dissolution-precipitation is a sorption mechanism where hydroxyapatite dissolves and forms a new lead-phosphate material.&lt;SEP&gt;Dissolution-precipitation is an alternative sorption mechanism that is not the primary pathway for cation removal on hydroxyapatite.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-0a5563c80c4fd1f68b4442f73621a281-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0a5563c80c4fd1f68b4442f73621a281-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0a5563c80c4fd1f68b4442f73621a281-chunk-012</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1791247343</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Ion Exchange">
  <data key="d0">Ion Exchange</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Ion exchange is a sorption mechanism where divalent metal ions substitute calcium ions in the hydroxyapatite lattice.&lt;SEP&gt;A method applied to remove heavy metals from the environment, noted for potential drawbacks.&lt;SEP&gt;Ion exchange is the primary mechanism by which phosphogypsum removes heavy metal ions from industrial wastewater.&lt;SEP&gt;A separation technique utilized in the purification process of rare earth elements.&lt;SEP&gt;Ion exchange is a mechanism where toxic heavy metal ions replace calcium ions within the hydration products of the backfill.&lt;SEP&gt;Ion exchange between hydroxyl and fluoride ions is the primary mechanism for fluorine immobilization by polymeric aluminum chloride.&lt;SEP&gt;A retention mechanism involving the exchange of ions between the solid and liquid phases.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-0a5563c80c4fd1f68b4442f73621a281-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9e17ad262bd9835860df552d7ff475f1-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-026&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-022&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-024&lt;SEP&gt;doc-66f6434914b6de99019386e4bdcbc57e-chunk-014</data>
