  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Smičiklas et al. are researchers who explained the influence of pH on ion exchange and dissolution-precipitation mechanisms.&lt;SEP&gt;Smičiklas et al. are researchers who explained how pH levels relative to the point of zero charge enhance electrostatic attraction for cation immobilization.</data>
