  <data key="d0">Molar Ratio Ca/P</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">The Molar Ratio Ca/P is a critical parameter in hydroxyapatite synthesis that influences adsorption efficiency based on the acido-basicity of the target molecule.</data>
