  <data key="d0">Water Pollution</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Water pollution is an environmental contamination issue addressed by hydroxyapatite applications for liquid phase contaminant removal.&lt;SEP&gt;Contamination of aquatic systems caused by heavy metals and fluorides leaching from phosphogypsum reservoirs.</data>
