  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Apatites are a mineral group with the general formula Me10(XO4)6Y2 that crystallize in the hexagonal system.&lt;SEP&gt;Apatites are a group of natural calcium phosphate minerals with a general stoichiometry close to Ca10(PO4)6Y2.</data>
