<node id="Wastewater Treatment">
  <data key="d0">Wastewater Treatment</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Environmental remediation process where hydroxyapatite functions as an adsorbent.&lt;SEP&gt;Wastewater treatment is an environmental application utilizing hydroxyapatite to remove heavy metal ions from aqueous solutions.&lt;SEP&gt;Wastewater treatment is an application area where hydroxyapatite serves as a viable and cost-effective adsorbent for removing contaminants.&lt;SEP&gt;Wastewater Treatment is an application area where nano-hydroxyapatite particles are utilized as adsorbents for heavy metal removal.&lt;SEP&gt;Wastewater Treatment is a proposed application for the powders involving the removal of heavy metal ions from waste water.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-0a5563c80c4fd1f68b4442f73621a281-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0a5563c80c4fd1f68b4442f73621a281-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0a5563c80c4fd1f68b4442f73621a281-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1adcb38defdd04a271ddba318999ba67-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8a6c42f76034cfa4338bd156b7179fc5-chunk-007</data>
