  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Environmental remediation process where hydroxyapatite functions as an adsorbent.&lt;SEP&gt;Soil treatment is an environmental application utilizing hydroxyapatite for the long-term containment of soil pollutants.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-0a5563c80c4fd1f68b4442f73621a281-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0a5563c80c4fd1f68b4442f73621a281-chunk-009</data>
