<node id="Calcium Deficient Hydroxyapatite">
  <data key="d0">Calcium Deficient Hydroxyapatite</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">A non-stoichiometric variant of hydroxyapatite with a Ca/P ratio less than 1.67 and a modified chemical formula.&lt;SEP&gt;Calcium Deficient Hydroxyapatite is a modified catalyst variant that effectively decomposes chlorinated organic compounds while capturing chlorine species.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-0a5563c80c4fd1f68b4442f73621a281-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0a5563c80c4fd1f68b4442f73621a281-chunk-016</data>
