  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Acid-base properties are fundamental characteristics of apatite-type solids influenced by the crystal structure of hydroxyapatite.&lt;SEP&gt;Acid-base properties of hydroxyapatite contribute to its catalytic activity in biodiesel production.</data>
