<node id="Kumar">
  <data key="d0">Kumar</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Kumar demonstrated that well-dispersed silver oxide on apatite carriers yields optimal DeNOx activity among tested catalysts.&lt;SEP&gt;Researcher who noted that hollow blocks could potentially substitute traditional hollow concrete blocks and clay bricks.&lt;SEP&gt;Kumar is a researcher who produced bricks using calcined phosphogypsum, lime, and fly ash.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-0a5563c80c4fd1f68b4442f73621a281-chunk-021&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-001</data>
