<node id="Lin">
  <data key="d0">Lin</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Lin confirmed the benefits of hydroxyapatite basicity for nitrous oxide decomposition, showing RhOx/Hap exhibited the highest activity.&lt;SEP&gt;Lin is a researcher who utilized X-ray absorption spectroscopy to study uranium speciation in phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;A researcher who prepared the polyaniline/HPA/ZrO2/epoxy composite coating for marine metal protection.&lt;SEP&gt;Lin is a researcher who developed an efficient method for preparing alpha-hemihydrate gypsum whiskers using phosphogypsum under optimized parameters.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-0a5563c80c4fd1f68b4442f73621a281-chunk-021&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-06f299b7e723cda1f0de1a647b02b6b4-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ac8d630b9aa4d874707445e2552a09-chunk-013</data>
