  <data key="d2">Carbonated Hydroxyapatite is a chemically modified ceramic variant with controlled composition for processing.&lt;SEP&gt;Carbonated hydroxyapatite is a highly crystalline variant of hydroxyapatite synthesized into nanorods.&lt;SEP&gt;Proposed structure indicated by the presence of CO3 2- groups in the sample.&lt;SEP&gt;A modified form of hydroxyapatite evaluated using FTIR and XRD techniques and synthesized via wet methods.&lt;SEP&gt;Carbonated hydroxyapatite is a modified form of hydroxyapatite with enhanced properties, often synthesized using hydrothermal methods.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-0a5563c80c4fd1f68b4442f73621a281-chunk-030&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a4d02158bbc770d7c6bd9657b3f3defc-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2760dc2a11fedad02d24741a978cf20d-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2760dc2a11fedad02d24741a978cf20d-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-54b92b2ad16a2528ff6a863329c5d403-chunk-007</data>
