<node id="Hydrothermal Treatment">
  <data key="d0">Hydrothermal Treatment</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">A preparation technique used to synthesize nanocrystals hydroxyapatite/TiO compound.&lt;SEP&gt;Hydrothermal treatment is a chemical-processing route used to synthesize hydroxyapatite superstructures.&lt;SEP&gt;Synthesis process conducted at 120 °C for 12 hours to produce HAp powder.&lt;SEP&gt;Hydrothermal treatment is a synthesis process conducted at 120°C for 12 hours to produce the hydroxyapatite sample.&lt;SEP&gt;Hydrothermal Treatment is a synthesis process conducted at 120 °C for 12 hours to produce the rod-shaped HAp.&lt;SEP&gt;A synthesis technique involving high temperature and pressure in aqueous solutions, used for producing hydroxyapatite nanoparticles.&lt;SEP&gt;Hydrothermal treatment is the high-temperature process applied in the autoclave to synthesize the microspheres.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-0a5563c80c4fd1f68b4442f73621a281-chunk-024&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f2534f7a997df3f80305323317b15be9-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f1fb5c243f2539cf7be6b6021b63c36f-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f1fb5c243f2539cf7be6b6021b63c36f-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f1fb5c243f2539cf7be6b6021b63c36f-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f1fb5c243f2539cf7be6b6021b63c36f-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-54b92b2ad16a2528ff6a863329c5d403-chunk-001</data>
