<node id="Mousa et al.">
  <data key="d0">Mousa et al.</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Mousa et al. are researchers who demonstrated the preparation of hydroxyapatite from phosphogypsum waste for heavy metal sorption.&lt;SEP&gt;Mousa et al. used phosphogypsum to prepare hydroxyapatite nanoparticles via thermal activation.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-0a5563c80c4fd1f68b4442f73621a281-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-026</data>
