  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Diammonium phosphate is a phosphate-containing material compared to hydroxyapatite for metal immobilization.&lt;SEP&gt;Diammonium Phosphate is a specific ammonium phosphate fertilizer product derived from phosphoric acid.&lt;SEP&gt;Diammonium phosphate is a fertilizer compound whose production was assessed in a life cycle study.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-0a5563c80c4fd1f68b4442f73621a281-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1adcb38defdd04a271ddba318999ba67-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0060991ac74a9675ce0293eccdc023cd-chunk-016</data>
