  <data key="d2">Desulfurization is a process for removing sulfur compounds from fuels, utilizing hydroxyapatite-supported catalysts.&lt;SEP&gt;Desulfurization is a purification method applied to wet process phosphoric acid alongside ammonization.&lt;SEP&gt;Desulfurization is the targeted chemical process aimed at removing sulfur from phosphogypsum through high-temperature reduction.</data>
