  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Thermochim. Acta is a scientific journal publishing research on the thermal decomposition of hexahydrated nickel iron citrate.&lt;SEP&gt;Thermochim. Acta is a journal that published a two-step approach to phosphogypsum decomposition.&lt;SEP&gt;Thermochim. Acta is a scientific journal that published research on the thermal behavior of phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;A scientific journal that published a 2001 study on the temperature effects on hydroxyapatite properties.&lt;SEP&gt;A scientific journal focusing on thermochimical research.&lt;SEP&gt;A scientific journal publishing thermogravimetric analysis of reactions involving gypsum and phosphogypsum.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-f2534f7a997df3f80305323317b15be9-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-051&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-042&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a4d02158bbc770d7c6bd9657b3f3defc-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-35aef6efc801611130c5dd196fe513df-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b19ca721a4da4422ee10228d88a4c292-chunk-020</data>
