  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Fig. S1 is a supplementary figure illustrating the empty center axis observed after calcination.&lt;SEP&gt;Fig. S1 shows the carbonated HA phases obtained under different STMP concentrations.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-f2534f7a997df3f80305323317b15be9-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-54b92b2ad16a2528ff6a863329c5d403-chunk-003</data>
