<node id="Solution A">
  <data key="d0">Solution A</data>
  <data key="d1">other</data>
  <data key="d2">Solution A is a precursor mixture formed by dissolving trisodium citrate dihydrate and calcium nitrate tetrahydrate in deionized water.&lt;SEP&gt;Solution A is formed by dissolving Ct in deionized water and stirring for 12 hours.&lt;SEP&gt;Solution A is a mixture of PG waste and water prepared through agitation.</data>
