  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Fourier transform infra-red spectroscopy is used to obtain spectra in the range of 400-4000 cm⁻¹.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-f2534f7a997df3f80305323317b15be9-chunk-001</data>
