  <data key="d2">FEI is the manufacturer of the Nova NanoSEM 430 microscope located in the Netherlands.&lt;SEP&gt;An Oregon, USA-based organization that manufactures the TECNAI G2 20 S-TWIN transmission electron microscope.</data>
