  <data key="d2">PANalytical is the manufacturer of the X'Pert PRO diffractometer used for XRD analysis.&lt;SEP&gt;PANalytical is the manufacturer of the X'Pert PRO diffractometer used for X-ray diffraction analysis.</data>
