  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Bruker is the manufacturer of the vector 33 instrument used for FT-IR spectroscopy.&lt;SEP&gt;A German manufacturer of the X-ray diffractometer and Fourier transform infrared spectrometer.&lt;SEP&gt;Bruker is the manufacturer of the equipment used for structural characterization methods like XRD.&lt;SEP&gt;A German organization that manufactures the Bruker AXS D8 ADVANCE diffractometer and EQUINOX 55 spectrometer.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-f2534f7a997df3f80305323317b15be9-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6f5dcf59bedaa00614f1acc222b1fb7b-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6f5dcf59bedaa00614f1acc222b1fb7b-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6825862084b162a4b16cd1037c76e3d7-chunk-002</data>
