  <data key="d0">Rare-earth Elements</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Rare-earth elements are valuable impurities found within the chemical structure of phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Rare-earth elements are valuable minerals often found in industrial residues, with research focused on their extraction and valorization.&lt;SEP&gt;Chemical elements such as gadolinium, ytterbium, thulium, and europium used to co-dop hydroxyapatite for magnetic and optical applications.</data>
