  <data key="d0">Nanohydroxyapatite</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Nanohydroxyapatite is a bioceramic material synthesized from phosphogypsum and explored as an alternative phosphorus fertilizer.&lt;SEP&gt;Nanohydroxyapatite is a nanomaterial evaluated as an alternative phosphorus fertilizer in agricultural applications.&lt;SEP&gt;Nanohydroxyapatite is a synthesized material derived from phosphogypsum, explored as a phosphorus source in agriculture.&lt;SEP&gt;Nanohydroxyapatite is a synthesized material derived from phosphogypsum for agricultural and biomedical applications.</data>
