<node id="Thermal Process">
  <data key="d0">Thermal Process</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">The Thermal process is an industrial method for producing high-purity phosphoric acid, though it requires high energy costs.&lt;SEP&gt;The thermal process is an industrial method used to produce high-purity phosphoric acid for high-grade chemicals.&lt;SEP&gt;The thermal process uses yellow phosphorus as a raw material and produces anhydrous gypsum type II with minimal impurities, suitable for medical-grade products.&lt;SEP&gt;A phosphoric acid production method compared against the wet di-hemihydrate process.&lt;SEP&gt;The thermal process is a heating procedure that induces mass loss and chemical decomposition.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-1adcb38defdd04a271ddba318999ba67-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ac8d630b9aa4d874707445e2552a09-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0060991ac74a9675ce0293eccdc023cd-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b19ca721a4da4422ee10228d88a4c292-chunk-022</data>
