<node id="Ammonium Hydrogen Phosphate">
  <data key="d0">Ammonium Hydrogen Phosphate</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Ammonium hydrogen phosphate is a chemical reagent added during the precipitation reaction stage.&lt;SEP&gt;Ammonium Hydrogen Phosphate acts as the phosphorus precursor, adjusted to pH 12 with ammonia before mixing.&lt;SEP&gt;Ammonium Hydrogen Phosphate is a chemical reactant used in precipitation and microwave synthesis methods.&lt;SEP&gt;Ammonium hydrogen phosphate is a chemical starting material used in the synthesis of hydroxyapatite powder.</data>
