  <data key="d0">Filtrate</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Filtrate is the liquid solution separated during filtration, processed to recover ammonium sulfate.&lt;SEP&gt;Filtrate is the liquid stream that proceeds to the next stage after initial filtering.&lt;SEP&gt;Filtrate is the liquid remaining after filtering the mixture at the end of each sorption experiment.&lt;SEP&gt;Filtrate is the resulting liquid from the purification process, examined to evaluate impurity removal efficiencies.</data>
