  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Water used to mix with PG to obtain a homogenous slurry.&lt;SEP&gt;Tap water is commonly used in the actual preparation of CPGFM, differing from experimental deionized water.&lt;SEP&gt;Tap water is a solvent used throughout all steps of the preparation process.&lt;SEP&gt;Tap water serves as the solvent used to mix with phosphogypsum during the initial preparation step.</data>
