  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">A solution used to adjust the pH to 11 during the synthesis process.&lt;SEP&gt;An agent used for pH adjustment during the NoSurf synthesis route.&lt;SEP&gt;Ammonia Solution is used to adjust the pH of the ammonium hydrogen phosphate solution to 12.&lt;SEP&gt;Ammonia solution is used to adjust and maintain the pH of the synthesis solution at 10 during precipitation.&lt;SEP&gt;Ammonia solution is used to adjust the pH of the reaction mixture to approximately 11.0.&lt;SEP&gt;Ammonia solution is used to adjust the reaction pH to 11 during the synthesis process.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-1adcb38defdd04a271ddba318999ba67-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8a6c42f76034cfa4338bd156b7179fc5-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8a6c42f76034cfa4338bd156b7179fc5-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f1fb5c243f2539cf7be6b6021b63c36f-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-06f299b7e723cda1f0de1a647b02b6b4-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-35aef6efc801611130c5dd196fe513df-chunk-001</data>
