<node id="Calcium Chloride">
  <data key="d0">Calcium Chloride</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Calcium chloride is a versatile chemical compound and calcium salt utilized across various industrial, materials science, and biomedical applications. Industrially, it is obtained as a compound separated from the raffinate of the hydrochloric acid wet process for phosphoric acid production. It also emerges as a byproduct during the conversion of phosphogypsum using chloride mediums or when gypsum reacts with chloride reagents.

In materials science and chemical synthesis, calcium chloride serves as a critical calcium source and precursor. It is dissolved in water to initiate nanocomposite synthesis and employed in hydrothermal deposition processes for hydroxyapatite (HA/HAP) production. Furthermore, its concentration directly influences the phase and morphology of calcium carbonate during synthesis. In biomedical research, it functions as a calcium salt added to simulated body fluids to accurately mimic physiological calcium levels.

For chemical testing and parameter investigation, calcium chloride is utilized as a solid salt component in solutions, such as at a concentration of 2.50 mmol L⁻¹. It is also frequently mixed with hydrochloric acid, up to a concentration of 2 M, to study gypsum solubility parameters and is incorporated into various experimental test mixtures.&lt;SEP&gt;Calcium chloride is an alternative calcium source compared to waste PG.&lt;SEP&gt;Calcium chloride is a starting material used in the hydrothermal synthesis of hydroxyapatite.&lt;SEP&gt;An oxidizing agent recommended to inhibit the generation of reducing hazardous gases in CPGFM.&lt;SEP&gt;Calcium Chloride is a chemical reactant used in precipitation and reflux synthesis procedures.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-1adcb38defdd04a271ddba318999ba67-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9e17ad262bd9835860df552d7ff475f1-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8a6c42f76034cfa4338bd156b7179fc5-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a4d02158bbc770d7c6bd9657b3f3defc-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f1fb5c243f2539cf7be6b6021b63c36f-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f1fb5c243f2539cf7be6b6021b63c36f-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-027&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-029&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-030&lt;SEP&gt;doc-06f299b7e723cda1f0de1a647b02b6b4-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2196dee89de9694f28ef4eaa0e85f130-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d4a38fcc1b0f33a17d23e7a4407a9cf9-chunk-002</data>
