<node id="Freundlich Constant">
  <data key="d0">Freundlich Constant</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Freundlich Constant (K_F) is a parameter derived from the Freundlich isotherm model.&lt;SEP&gt;The Freundlich constant is an indicator of adsorption capacity in the Freundlich adsorption isotherm model.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-9e17ad262bd9835860df552d7ff475f1-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9e17ad262bd9835860df552d7ff475f1-chunk-009</data>
