<node id="Equilibrium">
  <data key="d0">Equilibrium</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Equilibrium is the state at which the amount of adsorbate adsorbed per unit mass is measured.&lt;SEP&gt;Equilibrium shifts under lower pH conditions, promoting the dissolution of phases.&lt;SEP&gt;The state reached after 40 minutes of contact time where extraction efficiency no longer increases with duration.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-9e17ad262bd9835860df552d7ff475f1-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-042&lt;SEP&gt;doc-edfc4dcbd74cbf0b294f83f2034b209d-chunk-006</data>
