  <data key="d0">Freundlich Isotherm</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Freundlich Isotherm is a mathematical model used to describe multilayer adsorption processes.&lt;SEP&gt;A mathematical model used to describe multilayer adsorption and calculate adsorption constants for HAP-BC.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-9e17ad262bd9835860df552d7ff475f1-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9e17ad262bd9835860df552d7ff475f1-chunk-010</data>
