  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">Volume adsorbed is the vertical axis metric in the gas adsorption-desorption isotherm, measured in cm³·g⁻¹.&lt;SEP&gt;A measured quantity representing the amount of gas adsorbed by the material.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-9e17ad262bd9835860df552d7ff475f1-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9e17ad262bd9835860df552d7ff475f1-chunk-016</data>
