  <data key="d2">Adsorption rate is the speed at which heavy metals are adsorbed onto material surfaces over time.&lt;SEP&gt;Adsorption Rate measures the speed at which heavy metal ions are uptake by BC and HAP-BC during the initial contact period.</data>
