  <data key="d2">Kinetic parameters are quantitative values including rate constants and equilibrium capacities derived from model fitting.&lt;SEP&gt;Kinetic Parameters are mathematical values derived from pseudo-first-order and pseudo-second-order models to describe adsorption behavior.</data>
