<node id="Pore Size Distribution">
  <data key="d0">Pore Size Distribution</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A characterization metric showing peaks at specific diameters for BC and HAP-BC.&lt;SEP&gt;Pore size distribution represents the range of pore widths in the powders, measured in nanometers and shown to widen towards higher widths after heat treatment.&lt;SEP&gt;Pore size distribution is a material property determined using nitrogen adsorption-desorption isotherm plots.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-9e17ad262bd9835860df552d7ff475f1-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8a6c42f76034cfa4338bd156b7179fc5-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-54b92b2ad16a2528ff6a863329c5d403-chunk-011</data>
