  <data key="d2">A researcher who examined the removal capacities of mixed heavy metals using hollow HAP.&lt;SEP&gt;Jiang is a researcher cited for data related to China.&lt;SEP&gt;Jiang is a researcher whose 2024 study explains the chemical forms and effects of fluorine in Phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;A researcher who developed the modified hemihydrate phosphogypsum cementitious material and studied the effects of quicklime and aging time.&lt;SEP&gt;Jiang is a researcher who documented the neurological and chronic poisoning effects of environmental fluorine exposure.&lt;SEP&gt;Jiang is a researcher who calculated the theoretical amount of quicklime required to eliminate soluble P₂O₅ and fluoride ions.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-9e17ad262bd9835860df552d7ff475f1-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-021&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-023</data>
