  <data key="d2">A researcher who reported adsorption capacities using cross-linked chitosan with epichlorohydrin.&lt;SEP&gt;Chen is a researcher cited regarding the effect of fluorine on setting time.&lt;SEP&gt;Chen is a researcher who analyzed the impact of ageing time and recycled waste on material strength.&lt;SEP&gt;Chen is a researcher who used rotary acid leaching and column leaching tests to study leaching behavior and fluoride immobilization.&lt;SEP&gt;Chen is a researcher who studied fluorine concentration variations and leaching characteristics in composite backfill materials.&lt;SEP&gt;Chen is a researcher who co-created a schematic diagram illustrating the immobilization of toxic metal ions by CPGFM backfill.&lt;SEP&gt;Chen is a researcher who enhanced the mechanical properties of alpha-hemihydrate gypsum by incorporating fluorine and aluminum compounds.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-9e17ad262bd9835860df552d7ff475f1-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-021&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-023&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ac8d630b9aa4d874707445e2552a09-chunk-013</data>
