<node id="Wet Acid Method">
  <data key="d0">Wet Acid Method</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">The wet acid method is an industrial process for producing phosphoric acid that generates phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;The wet acid method is a chemical process used in the production of phosphoric acid, which generates phosphogypsum as a byproduct.&lt;SEP&gt;The wet acid method is a chemical process used to produce phosphoric acid from phosphate rock using sulfuric acid.</data>
