<node id="Trace Metals">
  <data key="d0">Trace Metals</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Trace metals are chemical elements found in phosphogypsum, studied for their bioavailability and environmental impact.&lt;SEP&gt;Metallic elements analyzed for their levels, toxicity, and speciation in environmental samples.&lt;SEP&gt;Trace metals include cadmium, copper, zinc, and lead. Trace metals bioaccumulate and pollute water, soil, and plants.&lt;SEP&gt;Trace Metals like cadmium, copper, zinc, and lead bioaccumulate and pollute water, soil, and plants.&lt;SEP&gt;Trace Metals are impurities found in phosphogypsum, including cadmium, zinc, copper, and chromium.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-70650e5cb032fce744763706d8701e36-chunk-020&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-053&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a5d09b48f57a4e888bb729aaf988c936-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a5d09b48f57a4e888bb729aaf988c936-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0060991ac74a9675ce0293eccdc023cd-chunk-000</data>
