  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Radiological characterization involves measuring radioactive isotopes and exhalation rates to assess environmental safety.&lt;SEP&gt;Radiological Characterization is a process used to assess and treat contaminated phosphogypsum waste.&lt;SEP&gt;Radiological characterization is a methodological approach used to assess the radioactive content and hazards of phosphate materials and phosphogypsum.</data>
