<node id="Interstitial Incorporation">
  <data key="d0">Interstitial Incorporation</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Interstitial incorporation is a mechanism where foreign ions are accommodated at interstitial positions within the crystal lattice.&lt;SEP&gt;Interstitial incorporation is a mechanism by which foreign ions are incorporated into phosphogypsum.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-70650e5cb032fce744763706d8701e36-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-70650e5cb032fce744763706d8701e36-chunk-018</data>
