  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">The Syrian-Tunisian phosphorite blend is a raw material source used to produce PGA phosphogypsum samples.&lt;SEP&gt;Syrian-Tunisian Phosphorite Blend is the raw material source used to produce the PGA phosphogypsum sample.&lt;SEP&gt;A geological blend of Syrian and Tunisian phosphorite used to produce PGA.&lt;SEP&gt;A raw material blend used to derive the Phosphogypsum PGA fraction.</data>
