  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Organic Material is a contaminant found in the F04 and F05 fractions of the phosphogypsum samples, comprising approximately 3% of those fractions.&lt;SEP&gt;Substances in coarse phosphogypsum fractions that selectively bind radionuclides.&lt;SEP&gt;Organic material is a substance onto which lead can adsorb in the environment.</data>
