  <data key="d2">Sieve analysis is the granulometric procedure used to divide dried phosphogypsum into fractions of different grain sizes.&lt;SEP&gt;Sieve Analysis is a laboratory method used to determine the particle size distribution of the phosphogypsum samples.&lt;SEP&gt;Sieve analysis is a method used to evaluate grain size distribution, with results graphically represented in Fig. 1.</data>
