  <data key="d0">Rutherford</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Rutherford is a researcher cited for studies on phosphogypsum fractionation.&lt;SEP&gt;A researcher cited in the footnotes for contributing data or findings related to the study.&lt;SEP&gt;Rutherford is a researcher cited for detecting quartz and other mineral phases in phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Rutherford explained how Cerium compounds stabilize the hemihydrate sulfate structure and slow dihydrate recrystallization.&lt;SEP&gt;Rutherford is a researcher who studied the complexation of U(VI) with clay minerals.&lt;SEP&gt;Rutherford is a researcher whose work is used to estimate fluoride, copper, cadmium, zinc, and chromium leaching.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-70650e5cb032fce744763706d8701e36-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0060991ac74a9675ce0293eccdc023cd-chunk-005</data>
