<node id="Thallium-208">
  <data key="d0">Thallium-208</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">A decay product of Thorium-228, used in its radiometric measurement.&lt;SEP&gt;A radioactive isotope in the decay chain of Thorium-228, measured alongside it.&lt;SEP&gt;Thallium-208 is a radioactive isotope associated with Thorium-228 in the dataset.&lt;SEP&gt;Thallium-208 is a radionuclide measured in phosphogypsum that contributes to its radioactivity.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-70650e5cb032fce744763706d8701e36-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-70650e5cb032fce744763706d8701e36-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-70650e5cb032fce744763706d8701e36-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-28fbd4302bba090e667215c840757ff7-chunk-001</data>
