  <data key="d0">Thorium-234</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Thorium-234 is a thorium series isotope whose photon emission lines could not be used due to lack of radioactive equilibrium.&lt;SEP&gt;Thorium-234 (234Th) is a radioactive isotope monitored in phosphogypsum and its derived compounds.</data>
