<node id="Eq. (5)">
  <data key="d0">Eq. (5)</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Eq. (5) is a working formula used to calculate the activity concentration of Radium-226 by correcting for interference from Uranium-235.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-70650e5cb032fce744763706d8701e36-chunk-005</data>
