</node>
<node id="Equation 7">
  <data key="d0">Equation 7</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Equation 7 represents the simplified uranium decay chain sequence used as an indicator of radioactive equilibrium.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-70650e5cb032fce744763706d8701e36-chunk-013</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1791313927</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Equation 8">
  <data key="d0">Equation 8</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Equation 8 expresses the mathematical condition for secular equilibrium where activity concentrations of decay chain isotopes are equal.&lt;SEP&gt;A mathematical formula used to calculate the Applied Bias Photon-to-Current Efficiency percentage based on photocurrent density and applied potential.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-70650e5cb032fce744763706d8701e36-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3fd8439e859e3dd0c96328384e1761f0-chunk-013</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1791967780</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Thorium Series">
  <data key="d0">Thorium Series</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The thorium series is a radioactive decay chain containing isotopes like thorium-228 and radium-228.&lt;SEP&gt;The Thorium Series is a radioactive decay series that includes Thorium-228 and Radium-228.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-70650e5cb032fce744763706d8701e36-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-70650e5cb032fce744763706d8701e36-chunk-014</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1791313927</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Distribution Ratio">
  <data key="d0">Distribution Ratio</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Distribution ratio indicates how a radionuclide partitions between phases based on its chemical form and affinity.&lt;SEP&gt;Distribution ratio is a calculated metric representing the ratio of rare earth ion concentrations between the ionic liquid and aqueous phases at equilibrium.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-70650e5cb032fce744763706d8701e36-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-edfc4dcbd74cbf0b294f83f2034b209d-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1791813325</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Reaction Mixture">
  <data key="d0">Reaction Mixture</data>
  <data key="d1">other</data>
  <data key="d2">The reaction mixture contains isotopes in various chemical forms that determine their partitioning during processing.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-70650e5cb032fce744763706d8701e36-chunk-013</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1791313927</data>
