  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Isotopic pairs refer to combinations of radionuclides used for gamma-ray spectrometry analysis due to their long half-lives.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-70650e5cb032fce744763706d8701e36-chunk-013</data>
