<node id="Lead Sulfate">
  <data key="d0">Lead Sulfate</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Lead sulfate forms isomorphous crystals with radium sulfate, contributing to foreign phase formation.&lt;SEP&gt;Lead sulfate is an insoluble compound formed when lead precipitates with sulfates.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-70650e5cb032fce744763706d8701e36-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-012</data>
