<node id="Distribution Coefficient">
  <data key="d0">Distribution Coefficient</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Distribution coefficient is a quantitative measure indicating the generally low efficiency of radium retention between gypsum and aqueous phase.&lt;SEP&gt;The distribution coefficient describes how a substance partitions between two phases, such as solid and liquid.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-70650e5cb032fce744763706d8701e36-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-edfc4dcbd74cbf0b294f83f2034b209d-chunk-015</data>
