  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Rutherford et al. 1996 is a scientific reference that provides the formal definition and mathematical equation for the Enrichment Factor.&lt;SEP&gt;Rutherford et al. 1996 is a scientific publication cited for reporting fine fraction enrichment with Radium-226.&lt;SEP&gt;Rutherford et al. 1996 is a scientific reference discussing radium retention in gypsum through coprecipitation with calcium sulfate.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-70650e5cb032fce744763706d8701e36-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-70650e5cb032fce744763706d8701e36-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-70650e5cb032fce744763706d8701e36-chunk-010</data>
