  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Yao et al. are researchers who previously demonstrated hydroxyapatite nanostructure formation using CTAB via the wet precipitation route.&lt;SEP&gt;Yao et al. explained that chemical combination for immobilization is related to the amount of hydration products.</data>
