<node id="Rod-like Micelles">
  <data key="d0">Rod-like Micelles</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Rod-like Micelles are supramolecular structures formed by CTAB above its critical micelle concentration that guide crystal growth.&lt;SEP&gt;Structures formed by CTAB and phosphate anion mixtures that serve as templates for crystal growth.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-8a6c42f76034cfa4338bd156b7179fc5-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2196dee89de9694f28ef4eaa0e85f130-chunk-003</data>
