</node>
<node id="Micelles">
  <data key="d0">Micelles</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Micelles are structures formed in solution where hydroxyapatite crystals precipitate in the form of rods.&lt;SEP&gt;Self-assembled surfactant structures that function as positively charged nano-reactors during HAp synthesis.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-8a6c42f76034cfa4338bd156b7179fc5-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3fd8439e859e3dd0c96328384e1761f0-chunk-004</data>
