<node id="Scherrer Constant">
  <data key="d0">Scherrer Constant</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">A dimensionless shape factor approximated as 0.9 for spherical crystals with cubic symmetry.&lt;SEP&gt;Scherrer Constant is a parameter (usually 0.89) used in the Scherrer equation to estimate crystallite size.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-8a6c42f76034cfa4338bd156b7179fc5-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3fd8439e859e3dd0c96328384e1761f0-chunk-007</data>
