<node id="Wavelength">
  <data key="d0">Wavelength</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">The wavelength of the X-ray source used during the diffraction experiment.&lt;SEP&gt;Wavelength ($\lambda$) is a parameter used in Scherrer's equation for crystallite size calculation.&lt;SEP&gt;The horizontal axis measurement ranging from 208 nm to 238 nm used to identify elemental peaks.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-8a6c42f76034cfa4338bd156b7179fc5-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a52951853fd542b78835b677936c557b-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-66f6434914b6de99019386e4bdcbc57e-chunk-027</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1792040883</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
