<node id="Miller Indices">
  <data key="d0">Miller Indices</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Numerical notations used to identify specific crystal planes corresponding to diffraction peaks.&lt;SEP&gt;Miller indices are crystallographic notations used to label specific diffraction peaks in XRD analysis.&lt;SEP&gt;A notation system (hkl) used to label specific diffraction peaks across all data traces.&lt;SEP&gt;Miller Indices (hkl) are used to identify specific peaks in the diffraction pattern.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-8a6c42f76034cfa4338bd156b7179fc5-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c4a64a852097fdc910b98ed788503ce4-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c4a64a852097fdc910b98ed788503ce4-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2196dee89de9694f28ef4eaa0e85f130-chunk-006</data>
