  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A specific crystal plane labeled in the NoSurf-900C diffraction pattern around 31-32 degrees.&lt;SEP&gt;Miller Index 112 identifies a peak just to the left of the tallest peak in the 31-32 degree cluster.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-8a6c42f76034cfa4338bd156b7179fc5-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2196dee89de9694f28ef4eaa0e85f130-chunk-006</data>
