  <data key="d2">The tallest and most intense crystal plane labeled in the NoSurf-900C diffraction pattern around 32 degrees.&lt;SEP&gt;Miller Index 211 identifies the tallest peak in a dense cluster between 31 and 32 degrees 2Theta.</data>
