<node id="Li et al.">
  <data key="d0">Li et al.</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Li et al. is a research group whose work primarily focuses on the characterization, processing, and application of phosphogypsum and related cementitious composite materials. Their investigations into the chemical and mineralogical properties of phosphogypsum include analyzing samples from Guiyang, where they identified a high sulfur trioxide concentration of 56.68%, and determining that gypsum, ettringite, and alpha-SiO2 are the primary minerals in phosphogypsum slag cement. The group has also examined the physical processing of phosphogypsum, specifically exploring how milling time affects particle size distribution and the resulting properties of building gypsum.

In material synthesis and optimization, Li et al. have developed and refined cementitious composites incorporating phosphogypsum. They optimized the formulation and mechanical strength of phosphogypsum-slag cementitious materials and investigated how fluoride content influences the porosity and mechanical performance of cemented paste fill. Their research further addresses chemical stability by studying fluorine immobilization in CPGFM backfill using both soluble and insoluble fluoride sources. Additionally, the group has contributed to mining engineering by documenting the use of phosphogypsum as a filling material for mined-out voids. Beyond phosphogypsum applications, Li et al. have also conducted broader material synthesis research, such as synthesizing HA particles using CTAB and reporting rod elongation at higher temperatures.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-8a6c42f76034cfa4338bd156b7179fc5-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-020&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a5d09b48f57a4e888bb729aaf988c936-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-022&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ac8d630b9aa4d874707445e2552a09-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1791773649</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
