<node id="Li">
  <data key="d0">Li</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Li is a researcher whose work primarily focuses on the application of phosphogypsum in cementitious materials and environmental remediation. In studies involving calcium aluminate cement, Li reported that the addition of phosphogypsum reduces cement clinker requirements and promotes phase elimination. Through X-ray diffraction analysis of hydrated samples at varying phosphogypsum concentrations, Li identified the primary minerals present in phosphogypsum slag cement. Furthermore, Li concluded that incorporating phosphogypsum with cementitious materials significantly immobilizes soluble fluorine, while also investigating fluorine re-release phenomena in CPGFM filling slurry.

Beyond cement chemistry, Li provided heavy metal concentration data for Chinese phosphogypsum solutions and explored the hydrothermal method for removing organic matter and phosphorus. Li also examined the durability of filling bodies under chemical erosion, acidic environments, and salt solutions. Li co-authored publications in the International Journal of Inorganic Materials, and Li’s 2021 research has been cited as a data source in comparative tables.&lt;SEP&gt;Li studied lime neutralization and concluded it effectively removes soluble phosphorus but has limited effects on soluble fluorine and eutectic phosphorus impurities.&lt;SEP&gt;Li is a researcher who studied the effects of calcium carbide slag dosing, reaction temperature, and time on phosphogypsum modification.&lt;SEP&gt;A trace element measured in parts per million in the provided analytical data.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2196dee89de9694f28ef4eaa0e85f130-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-021&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-023&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ac8d630b9aa4d874707445e2552a09-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ac8d630b9aa4d874707445e2552a09-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-66f6434914b6de99019386e4bdcbc57e-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1792041500</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
