  <data key="d0">Potgieter</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Potgieter found that cement containing PG exhibited lower compressive strengths at early ages compared to natural gypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Potgieter is a researcher who explored phosphogypsum decomposition reacting with various forms of carbon in 1999.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-028</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
