<node id="Zhou">
  <data key="d0">Zhou</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Zhou is a researcher who reported that brick compressive strength improves as phosphogypsum content increases up to 75%.&lt;SEP&gt;Zhou reported that PG addition negatively affected the compressive strength of magnesium potassium phosphate cement.&lt;SEP&gt;Zhou is a researcher who observed compressive strength in mortar studies.&lt;SEP&gt;A researcher who documented microstructural changes in the filling body under varying soluble phosphorus concentrations.&lt;SEP&gt;Zhou is a researcher who investigated the influence of underground environments on phosphorus leaching through drying-wetting cycles.&lt;SEP&gt;Zhou is a researcher whose 2007 work investigates hydrogen bonding between proteins and hydroxyapatite.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-021&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4739e42903c95e1fb7e0ecfbca3a12df-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
