  <data key="d2">A scientific journal publishing multiple studies on the mechanical, thermal, and structural properties of phosphogypsum-based composites.&lt;SEP&gt;Construct Build Mater is a scientific journal that published research on non-sintering cement using phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;A scientific journal that publishes multiple studies on the recycling and application of phosphogypsum in construction materials.&lt;SEP&gt;Construct Build Mater is a peer-reviewed academic journal publishing research on construction and building materials.&lt;SEP&gt;Academic journal publishing multiple studies on mechanical properties, hydration mechanisms, and concrete preparation using phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;A journal publishing multiple studies on geopolymer and concrete properties by various authors.</data>
