<node id="Rice Husk Ash">
  <data key="d0">Rice Husk Ash</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Rice husk ash is a supplementary material mixed with phosphogypsum and cement to enhance brick properties.&lt;SEP&gt;An additive used in brick formulations alongside PG and cement to enhance mechanical strength.&lt;SEP&gt;Rice husk ash is combined with industrial waste terracotta or red pottery and phosphogypsum to improve material performance.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7797768798fcd1152bdc10ff73139e35-chunk-001</data>
