<node id="Chemical Admixtures">
  <data key="d0">Chemical Admixtures</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Chemical admixtures are substances utilized to remedy the decrease in concrete workability caused by PG incorporation.&lt;SEP&gt;Chemical admixtures are additives used to modify the setting time, fluidity, and mechanical properties of phosphorus gypsum-based mortar.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-022&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ac8d630b9aa4d874707445e2552a09-chunk-020</data>
