<node id="Binder">
  <data key="d0">Binder</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">The binder is a concrete component analyzed via SEM to observe microstructural interfaces.&lt;SEP&gt;The binder is the binding component in concrete whose volume decreases when PG concentration exceeds 10%, reducing compressive strength.&lt;SEP&gt;Binder is a component added during the mixing process to form cemented backfill slurry.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-022&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-023&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-033&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-041</data>
