</node>
<node id="Building Blocks">
  <data key="d0">Building Blocks</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Building blocks are manufactured using phosphogypsum, quicklime, and sand, offering viable alternatives to traditional concrete or clay bricks.</data>
