<node id="Sichuan">
  <data key="d0">Sichuan</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">Sichuan is a prominent Chinese province that plays a multifaceted and critical role in the management, utilization, and recycling of phosphogypsum (PG). As a major contributor to China's total PG production, the province serves as a designated storage location for this industrial byproduct and is prominently represented in aggregate data distributions regarding PG usage. Its significance extends to academic and industrial research, where it has been consistently included in studies investigating prominent companies engaged in PG recycling and analyzing the broader PG recycling industry. Furthermore, Sichuan has been a focal point for scientific investigation, with PG samples collected and chemically analyzed within its borders, and a patent for a phosphogypsum cementitious material proportioning test method having been filed in the region.

From an industrial and technological standpoint, Sichuan is actively targeted for the implementation of large-scale and demonstration PG projects. Large-scale mines operating within the province have successfully adopted CPGB technology, underscoring the region's commitment to advancing sustainable practices and innovative applications for phosphogypsum management. Through these combined efforts in research, technological adoption, and project development, Sichuan stands as a key hub for phosphogypsum innovation and recycling in China.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c2674917fb6c60e75303effeaa10768e-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c2674917fb6c60e75303effeaa10768e-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c2674917fb6c60e75303effeaa10768e-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c2674917fb6c60e75303effeaa10768e-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a5d09b48f57a4e888bb729aaf988c936-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a5d09b48f57a4e888bb729aaf988c936-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-035&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1791722395</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
