<node id="Wear Resistance">
  <data key="d0">Wear Resistance</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Wear Resistance is a durability characteristic of mortar that changes with varying Plaster Of Paris content.&lt;SEP&gt;Wear resistance is a property reduced when phosphogypsum is added to self-leveling mortar.</data>
