<node id="Sieving">
  <data key="d0">Sieving</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Sieving is a physical separation technique used in the purification and processing of Phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Sieving is a sample preparation step that reduces the phosphogypsum particle size to less than 63 micrometers.&lt;SEP&gt;Sieving is a physical preparation step that fractionates the dried phosphogypsum to a particle size of less than 63 µm.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-025&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d18c456289f64c1e16c73a0dfd6595b3-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d18c456289f64c1e16c73a0dfd6595b3-chunk-003</data>
