<node id="Wallboard">
  <data key="d0">Wallboard</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Wallboard is a construction material that can be produced using phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Wallboard is a building material that can incorporate high proportions of Phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Wallboard is a construction material that can utilize phosphogypsum as a substitute for natural gypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Wallboard is a construction material manufactured with PG replacing natural gypsum.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-025&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-026&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-030&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-029</data>
