  <data key="d0">Reaction Mechanism</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Reaction mechanism refers to the chemical processes of Phosphogypsum hydration that require further study.&lt;SEP&gt;Reaction mechanism refers to the underlying chemical processes that remain unaffected by uneven material mixing.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-025&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b19ca721a4da4422ee10228d88a4c292-chunk-015</data>
