  <data key="d0">Water Contamination</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Water contamination is an environmental issue caused by Phosphogypsum accumulation.&lt;SEP&gt;Water Contamination is an environmental risk associated with large-scale land-based phosphogypsum storage.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-025&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-032</data>
