<node id="Soil Contamination">
  <data key="d0">Soil Contamination</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Soil contamination is an ecological problem resulting from Phosphogypsum stockpiling.&lt;SEP&gt;An environmental impact caused by radioactive elements in phosphogypsum, which affects plant growth.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-025&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ac8d630b9aa4d874707445e2552a09-chunk-006</data>
