  <data key="d0">Land Occupation</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Land occupation refers to the spatial footprint and land use issues caused by Phosphogypsum stockpiles.&lt;SEP&gt;Land Occupation is an activity measured in the LCI data for PG disposal.&lt;SEP&gt;The significant consumption of arable and ecological land due to the accumulation of phosphogypsum stockpiles.</data>
