  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">Recycling rate represents the proportion of Phosphogypsum that is reused, which requires new applications to increase.&lt;SEP&gt;Recycling rate refers to the 55.44% proportion of phosphogypsum successfully recycled by the surveyed companies in 2020.</data>
