  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Valorization processes refer to industrial methods for reusing Phosphogypsum, currently limited by modest product demand.&lt;SEP&gt;Valorization Processes are industrial procedures that utilize phosphate gypsum in relatively small quantities.</data>
