<node id="Zhou et al.">
  <data key="d0">Zhou et al.</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Researchers who presented the Two-step Hydration Process and conducted studies on brick properties.&lt;SEP&gt;Zhou et al. highlighted the lack of combined processes for sequential calcium sulfate whisker synthesis and rare earth element extraction.&lt;SEP&gt;Researchers who investigated PG pretreated with water washing for cemented backfilling.&lt;SEP&gt;Zhou et al. are researchers who classified the three primary chemical forms of phosphorus in phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Zhou et al. studied the correlation between soluble phosphorus content and the strength of cemented paste fill material.&lt;SEP&gt;Zhou et al. are researchers who revealed that water washing treatment improves material strength by removing impurities.&lt;SEP&gt;Zhou et al. is a research group that determined the optimal concentration and washing cycles for citric acid treatment.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-022&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c2674917fb6c60e75303effeaa10768e-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-004</data>
