</node>
<node id="Canovas">
  <data key="d0">Canovas</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Canovas is a researcher cited for revealing the presence of fluorite in phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Canovas suggested that REEs are incorporated into a residual phase like monazite or insoluble compounds in phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Canovas documented the commercial implementation and radionuclide migration characteristics of the Merseburg ammonocarbonation process.&lt;SEP&gt;A researcher who reviewed phosphogypsum valorization methods and recommended Life Cycle Analysis for secondary pollution assessment.&lt;SEP&gt;Canovas is a researcher who reviewed Phosphogypsum application in agriculture.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-027&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0060991ac74a9675ce0293eccdc023cd-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0060991ac74a9675ce0293eccdc023cd-chunk-005</data>
