  <data key="d0">Dumping PG in the Sea</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Dumping PG in the Sea is the practice of discharging phosphogypsum waste into marine environments, leading to contamination and pH changes.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-017</data>
