  <data key="d0">Iberian Pyrite Belt</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">The Iberian Pyrite Belt is a mining region in Spain whose historical activities contribute to the pollution of the Huelva Estuary.&lt;SEP&gt;The Iberian Pyrite Belt is a geographic region known for acid mine drainage affecting the Tinto and Odiel rivers.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-048</data>
