  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Ismail is a researcher who improved rare earth element leaching efficiency using a two-step hydrochloric acid extraction process.&lt;SEP&gt;Ismail denotes a researcher who investigated a two-step extraction process using hydrochloric acid to increase rare earth element extraction levels.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-021&lt;SEP&gt;doc-66f6434914b6de99019386e4bdcbc57e-chunk-019</data>
