  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">K-Feldspar is a mineral whose decomposition temperature is decreased by PG, facilitating potassium release.&lt;SEP&gt;K-feldspar is a mineral source from which potassium is recovered via thermal decomposition.</data>
