  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Tributyl Phosphate is an organic solvent used in liquid-liquid extraction and leaching processes.&lt;SEP&gt;Tributyl Phosphate is an organic extractant used in combination with TOPO for radionuclide extraction.&lt;SEP&gt;Tributyl Phosphate is a major extractant and modifier used in hydrometallurgy to improve removal efficiency and mass transfer.</data>
