<node id="Chem. Geol.">
  <data key="d0">Chem. Geol.</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Chem. Geol. is the journal that published the 1990 review on the aqueous geochemistry of rare-earth elements and yttrium.&lt;SEP&gt;Chem. Geol. is a scientific journal publishing research on geochemical reactions and solubility.&lt;SEP&gt;Chem. Geol. is the academic journal publishing the 1971 research on quartz solubility.</data>
