<node id="Santos Basin">
  <data key="d0">Santos Basin</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">The Santos Basin in Brazil is a geographic region where stockpiled phosphogypsum waste has been characterized.&lt;SEP&gt;Santos Basin is a marine sediment region analyzed for correlations between rare earth elements and industrial activities.&lt;SEP&gt;Santos Basin is a geographic region where sediment distributions of uranium, thorium, and rare earth elements were correlated with industrial activities.&lt;SEP&gt;Santos Basin is a marine sediment basin where uranium, thorium, and rare earth element distributions were correlated with industrial activities.</data>
