  <data key="d0">Ion-Exchange Resin</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Ion-Exchange Resin is a technique used to recover leached rare earth elements during phosphogypsum recrystallization, though it generates calcium sulfate waste.</data>
