<node id="Genkin et al.">
  <data key="d0">Genkin et al.</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Genkin et al. described a recrystallization method that removed over 98 percent of rare earth elements using calcium nitrate in an acidic medium.</data>
