<node id="Radiological Impact">
  <data key="d0">Radiological Impact</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Radiological impact refers to the assessment of radiation exposure risks from natural radioactivity in phosphogypsum piles.&lt;SEP&gt;Radiological impact refers to the environmental and health consequences associated with the application of phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Radiological Impact is an environmental and health consideration regarding the natural radioactivity present in phosphogypsum and phosphate materials.&lt;SEP&gt;A potential health and environmental risk from radioactive elements in phosphogypsum.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-038&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c2674917fb6c60e75303effeaa10768e-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-030&lt;SEP&gt;doc-160a0fe95f7c82b193c6af751106ab6d-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
