</node>
<node id="Environmental Science and Pollution Research">
  <data key="d0">Environmental Science and Pollution Research</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Environmental Science and Pollution Research is an academic journal featuring research on phosphate rock and phosphogypsum characterization.&lt;SEP&gt;A scientific journal where F. Wang published research on modified orange peel adsorbents.&lt;SEP&gt;Environmental Science and Pollution Research is the academic publisher for the 2023 study on cement substitution in phosphogypsum backfill.&lt;SEP&gt;A scientific journal featuring studies on phosphogypsum characterization and hydroxyapatite synthesis for lead removal.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-038&lt;SEP&gt;doc-06f299b7e723cda1f0de1a647b02b6b4-chunk-022&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-029&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3fd8439e859e3dd0c96328384e1761f0-chunk-017</data>
