  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The regional industrial sector focused on recycling phosphogypsum, shaped by geographical and policy factors.&lt;SEP&gt;The PG Recycling Industry encompasses the production, recycling, and marketing phases of phosphogypsum and its derivatives.&lt;SEP&gt;The PG recycling industry is the central subject of the study, encompassing production, recycling, and marketing phases.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c2674917fb6c60e75303effeaa10768e-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c2674917fb6c60e75303effeaa10768e-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c2674917fb6c60e75303effeaa10768e-chunk-010</data>
