  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1791450501</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Industrial Policies">
  <data key="d0">Industrial Policies</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Industrial policies are regulatory drivers that influence the development and compulsory consumption requirements of the phosphogypsum recycling industry.&lt;SEP&gt;Industrial policies refer to government strategies and guidelines aimed at directing and supporting the development of specific industries, including identified obstacles and proposed solutions for PG recycling.&lt;SEP&gt;Government measures introduced to promote PG recycling, which currently lack coordination and specific guidelines.&lt;SEP&gt;Industrial policies encompass mandatory, economic, and promotional measures that influence the PG recycling sector.&lt;SEP&gt;Industrial Policies serve as a regulatory driver involving government coordination, funding, and tax incentives affecting PG recycling.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c2674917fb6c60e75303effeaa10768e-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c2674917fb6c60e75303effeaa10768e-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c2674917fb6c60e75303effeaa10768e-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c2674917fb6c60e75303effeaa10768e-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c2674917fb6c60e75303effeaa10768e-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1791450501</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Geographical Location">
  <data key="d0">Geographical Location</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A fundamental factor shaping the developmental trajectory and potential of regional PG recycling industries.&lt;SEP&gt;Geographical location is a factor influencing the development and market outlook of the phosphogypsum recycling industry.&lt;SEP&gt;Geographical location represents the regional factors that impact the feasibility and development of the industry.&lt;SEP&gt;Geographical Location acts as an environmental driver highlighting regional advantages, transportation costs, and local development plans.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c2674917fb6c60e75303effeaa10768e-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c2674917fb6c60e75303effeaa10768e-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c2674917fb6c60e75303effeaa10768e-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c2674917fb6c60e75303effeaa10768e-chunk-006</data>
