  <data key="d0">Tax Preferential Policies</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Tax preferential policies are financial incentives that currently provide inadequate support for PG-based products.&lt;SEP&gt;Tax Preferential Policies are government incentives that currently lack adequate support for PG-based products but are targeted for updates.</data>
