  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Shi, Y. is a co-author of a 2022 paper on phosphogypsum reuse.&lt;SEP&gt;Shi, Y. is a researcher who co-authored a 2020 study on the pollution status and control strategies for three phosphorus pollution in the upper Yangtze River Basin.&lt;SEP&gt;Shi, Y. is a researcher who co-authored multiple studies on phosphogypsum immobilization and cemented paste backfill published between 2017 and 2023.&lt;SEP&gt;Shi, Y. is a researcher who co-authored multiple studies on the properties and applications of cemented phosphogypsum backfill.&lt;SEP&gt;Shi, Y. is a prolific researcher who authored multiple studies on phosphogypsum backfill, pollution control, and pretreatment methods.&lt;SEP&gt;A researcher who co-authored multiple studies on phosphogypsum-based backfill and toxic gas release.</data>
