<node id="Company K">
  <data key="d0">Company K</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Company K is a Guizhou-based enterprise dedicated to researching and advancing the utilization of phosphogypsum in polymer materials.&lt;SEP&gt;Company K is an independent PG recycling company located in Guizhou Province, specializing in applying PG to polymer materials and municipal infrastructure.&lt;SEP&gt;Company K specializes in PG recycling and produces polymer materials and drainage pipes.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c2674917fb6c60e75303effeaa10768e-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c2674917fb6c60e75303effeaa10768e-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c2674917fb6c60e75303effeaa10768e-chunk-005</data>
