<node id="Company M">
  <data key="d0">Company M</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Company M is a Yunnan-based enterprise that partners with Company K to promote phosphogypsum adoption and explores phosphogypsum use in arts and crafts.&lt;SEP&gt;Company M is an inter-regional cooperative company located in Yunnan Province, collaborating with Company K on PG recycling and product development.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c2674917fb6c60e75303effeaa10768e-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c2674917fb6c60e75303effeaa10768e-chunk-005</data>
