<node id="Company J">
  <data key="d0">Company J</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Company J is a Guizhou-based enterprise operating an unfaced plasterboard production line and utilizing phosphogypsum for damming materials.&lt;SEP&gt;Company J is a large-scale integrated phosphogypsum production and recycling company in Guizhou Province that utilizes phosphogypsum for underground filling and fertilizer production.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c2674917fb6c60e75303effeaa10768e-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c2674917fb6c60e75303effeaa10768e-chunk-003</data>
