  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Company A is a small-scale integrated phosphogypsum production and recycling company in Sichuan Province focused on conventional cement retarders and construction materials.&lt;SEP&gt;Company A is a PG production and recycling company located in Mianyang, Sichuan.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c2674917fb6c60e75303effeaa10768e-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c2674917fb6c60e75303effeaa10768e-chunk-010</data>
