  <data key="d0">Company H</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Company H is a Hubei-based enterprise conducting demonstration trials for phosphogypsum road paving materials.&lt;SEP&gt;Company H is an independent phosphogypsum recycling company focused on technological research and development within the recycling supply chain.&lt;SEP&gt;Company H is an independent PG recycling company located in Hubei Province, focusing on enhancing PG use in construction materials.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c2674917fb6c60e75303effeaa10768e-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c2674917fb6c60e75303effeaa10768e-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c2674917fb6c60e75303effeaa10768e-chunk-003</data>
