<node id="Underground Filling">
  <data key="d0">Underground Filling</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Underground filling is a method utilizing recycled phosphogypsum, applied in Guizhou Province.&lt;SEP&gt;Underground filling is a recycling method that utilizes phosphogypsum to extend mine lifespans, avert geological hazards, and address environmental contamination.&lt;SEP&gt;Underground filling is an engineering application, color-coded olive green in the legend.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c2674917fb6c60e75303effeaa10768e-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c2674917fb6c60e75303effeaa10768e-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c2674917fb6c60e75303effeaa10768e-chunk-020</data>
