</node>
<node id="Yellow Phosphorus Slag">
  <data key="d0">Yellow Phosphorus Slag</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Yellow phosphorus slag is a main ingredient combined with phosphogypsum and siliceous materials to create underground filling materials.&lt;SEP&gt;Yellow phosphorus slag is an industrial byproduct studied for its application in resource recovery and environmental remediation.&lt;SEP&gt;Yellow phosphorus slag is a raw material used as a binder component in cemented paste fill material formulations.&lt;SEP&gt;An industrial byproduct used as a binder in CPGFM slurry that reacts with acidic substances to generate hazardous gases.&lt;SEP&gt;Yellow phosphorus slag is an industrial by-product used as a filler in cementitious materials.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c2674917fb6c60e75303effeaa10768e-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c2674917fb6c60e75303effeaa10768e-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-160a0fe95f7c82b193c6af751106ab6d-chunk-017</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1791938112</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
