  <data key="d0">Integrated PG Production &amp; Recycling Companies</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Integrated PG production &amp; recycling companies combine phosphogypsum production with recycling operations to meet compulsory consumption requirements.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c2674917fb6c60e75303effeaa10768e-chunk-004</data>
