  <data key="d0">Independent PG Recycling Companies</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Independent PG recycling companies are autonomous enterprises established to focus on technological research and innovation in phosphogypsum recycling.&lt;SEP&gt;Standalone enterprises that have emerged to specialize in phosphogypsum recycling.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c2674917fb6c60e75303effeaa10768e-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c2674917fb6c60e75303effeaa10768e-chunk-007</data>
