<node id="Auxiliary Materials">
  <data key="d0">Auxiliary Materials</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Auxiliary materials are additives (5-10%) incorporated into phosphogypsum powder to adjust pH for polymer compatibility.&lt;SEP&gt;Auxiliary materials are additives incorporated into phosphogypsum powder to adjust pH to a neutral level for polymer compatibility.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c2674917fb6c60e75303effeaa10768e-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c2674917fb6c60e75303effeaa10768e-chunk-003</data>
