  <data key="d0">Municipal Infrastructure Construction</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Municipal infrastructure construction is a primary application domain for polymer materials containing phosphogypsum, encompassing products like manhole covers and drainage pipes.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c2674917fb6c60e75303effeaa10768e-chunk-004</data>
