  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Government body that stipulated a 70% refund for PG-based products starting in 2019.&lt;SEP&gt;The ministry issued policies in 2019 regarding value-added tax incentives for comprehensive resource utilization.</data>
