  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">Deyang City is a location in Sichuan Province hosting phosphogypsum-related companies.&lt;SEP&gt;City in Sichuan Province that introduced an incentive plan for PG recycling companies.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c2674917fb6c60e75303effeaa10768e-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c2674917fb6c60e75303effeaa10768e-chunk-002</data>
