<node id="Guizhou Provincial People's Government">
  <data key="d0">Guizhou Provincial People's Government</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The Guizhou Provincial People's Government introduced mandatory policies linking PG production to phosphoric acid output.&lt;SEP&gt;Local government that issued the 2018 initiative for PG-based product utilization.&lt;SEP&gt;The Guizhou Provincial People's Government issued official opinions in 2018 to promote the comprehensive utilization of phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;A regional authority that issued guidelines in 2018 to reduce phosphogypsum stockpiles by at least 10% annually starting in 2019.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c2674917fb6c60e75303effeaa10768e-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c2674917fb6c60e75303effeaa10768e-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c2674917fb6c60e75303effeaa10768e-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a5d09b48f57a4e888bb729aaf988c936-chunk-009</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1791611692</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
