<node id="Yichang City">
  <data key="d0">Yichang City</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">Yichang City is a city in Hubei Province with developed water transportation, concentrating phosphogypsum companies.&lt;SEP&gt;City in Hubei Province strategically positioned at the Yangtze River confluence, hosting the PG recycling industry.&lt;SEP&gt;A city that issued multiple guidance documents and established incentive mechanisms for phosphogypsum comprehensive utilization between 2019 and 2020.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c2674917fb6c60e75303effeaa10768e-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c2674917fb6c60e75303effeaa10768e-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-afe70f2d82515df80906bf3babd4e4eb-chunk-010</data>
