  <data key="d0">S. Ibrahim</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Lead author of a 2017 study on determining alendronate sodium in tablets using spectroscopy.&lt;SEP&gt;S. Ibrahim co-authored a research article on determining alendronate sodium in tablets using infrared spectroscopy.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a4d02158bbc770d7c6bd9657b3f3defc-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a4d02158bbc770d7c6bd9657b3f3defc-chunk-015</data>
