  <data key="d0">Attenuated Total Reflectance Fourier Transform Infrared Spectroscopy</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">An analytical spectroscopy method used to determine alendronate sodium content in pharmaceutical tablets.&lt;SEP&gt;A spectroscopic technique utilized to analyze chemical compounds in tablets.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a4d02158bbc770d7c6bd9657b3f3defc-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a4d02158bbc770d7c6bd9657b3f3defc-chunk-015</data>
