  <data key="d0">PVA-peeled HAP</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">A hydroxyapatite material variant analyzed via infrared spectroscopy, exhibiting specific spectral peaks.&lt;SEP&gt;A synthesized material sample showing significant C-H stretches and distinct phosphate peaks in spectroscopic analysis.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a4d02158bbc770d7c6bd9657b3f3defc-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a4d02158bbc770d7c6bd9657b3f3defc-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a4d02158bbc770d7c6bd9657b3f3defc-chunk-007</data>
