  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Sigma-Aldrich is a supplier of chemicals such as Calcium Chloride and Ammonium Dihydrogen Phosphate.&lt;SEP&gt;A chemical supplier that provided NTA, Fluoromount, alendronate sodium, and FTO glass.&lt;SEP&gt;Sigma-Aldrich is the supplier that provided key chemical reagents and surfactants for the study.&lt;SEP&gt;Sigma-Aldrich is the supplier from which potassium dihydrogen phosphate, sodium hydroxide, and Brij-93 were obtained.&lt;SEP&gt;A supplier of P123 surfactant used in the experiment.</data>
