<node id="FE-SEM">
  <data key="d0">FE-SEM</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">FE-SEM is an imaging technique used to capture hierarchical structures of HAP particles.&lt;SEP&gt;FE-SEM is a microscopy technique used to image AL-treated HAP microparticles and verify morphological stability.&lt;SEP&gt;FE-SEM is a microscopy technique used to capture images of the HAP powders and observe morphological changes.&lt;SEP&gt;Field emission scanning electron microscopy is employed to observe the morphological and microstructural characteristics of the microspheres.&lt;SEP&gt;A characterization technique used to observe the morphological and microstructural evolutions of the microspheres.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a4d02158bbc770d7c6bd9657b3f3defc-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a4d02158bbc770d7c6bd9657b3f3defc-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a4d02158bbc770d7c6bd9657b3f3defc-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-54b92b2ad16a2528ff6a863329c5d403-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-54b92b2ad16a2528ff6a863329c5d403-chunk-003</data>
