<node id="Bioceramics">
  <data key="d0">Bioceramics</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Bioceramics are biocompatible ceramic materials used in medical and dental applications, with hydroxyapatite being a primary example.&lt;SEP&gt;Bioceramics represent a class of biomaterials that have evolved to serve various medical applications, including drug delivery.&lt;SEP&gt;Bioceramics are biocompatible materials, such as calcium phosphate, used in medical and scientific contexts.&lt;SEP&gt;Bioceramics are biocompatible materials used in medical implants and tissue engineering, as discussed in Hench and Wilson's work.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a4d02158bbc770d7c6bd9657b3f3defc-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f1fb5c243f2539cf7be6b6021b63c36f-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d4a38fcc1b0f33a17d23e7a4407a9cf9-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d4a38fcc1b0f33a17d23e7a4407a9cf9-chunk-017</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1791854126</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Sol-Gel Synthesis">
  <data key="d0">Sol-Gel Synthesis</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Sol-Gel Synthesis is a wet-chemical technique and chemical-processing route primarily utilized for the fabrication and synthesis of hydroxyapatite materials. Operating as a low-temperature process, this method is specifically designed to produce nanostructured hydroxyapatite, encompassing nano crystalline powders and nanorods. A key advantage of this approach is its capacity to yield thermally stable materials with precisely controlled morphological features.

The effectiveness and structural characteristics of the resulting nano hydroxyapatite are heavily influenced by various process parameters and the specific selection of phosphorus precursors employed during the reaction. In addition to material fabrication, Sol-Gel Synthesis serves as a foundational chemical process that facilitates the subsequent synthesis and characterization of these advanced nanostructured hydroxyapatite systems.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a4d02158bbc770d7c6bd9657b3f3defc-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f1fb5c243f2539cf7be6b6021b63c36f-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c4a64a852097fdc910b98ed788503ce4-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6f5dcf59bedaa00614f1acc222b1fb7b-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6825862084b162a4b16cd1037c76e3d7-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2196dee89de9694f28ef4eaa0e85f130-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3fd8439e859e3dd0c96328384e1761f0-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3fd8439e859e3dd0c96328384e1761f0-chunk-021</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1791966043</data>
