  <data key="d2">Acta Biomater. is a scientific journal that published a review on synthesis methods for nanosized hydroxyapatite.&lt;SEP&gt;Acta Biomater. is a scientific journal that published research on carbon dot and 3D printed hydroxyapatite scaffolds.&lt;SEP&gt;Acta Biomater. is a scientific journal featuring research on biomaterials, including hydroxyapatite for tissue engineering.&lt;SEP&gt;Acta Biomater. is a scientific journal publishing research on biomaterials science.&lt;SEP&gt;Acta Biomater. is the journal that published the 2011 study on nanoscale hydroxyapatite particles.</data>
