  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">A metallic substrate used in biomedical applications, coated with nano-hydroxyapatite.&lt;SEP&gt;Zirconium alloy is a metallic substrate coated with micro/nano hierarchical nano-hydroxyapatite for osteogenic activity.</data>
