  <data key="d0">Plate-like Structures</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Plate-like Structures are the irregular morphological features formed at 120 °C.&lt;SEP&gt;Plate-like structures are morphological formations in the s-HAp sample created by the agglomeration of spherical particles.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a4d02158bbc770d7c6bd9657b3f3defc-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2760dc2a11fedad02d24741a978cf20d-chunk-002</data>
