  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">FTO is the substrate material on which the HAP layer is initially deposited before the peeling process.&lt;SEP&gt;FTO is a metal substrate used for the hydrothermal deposition and growth of hierarchical Hydroxyapatite structures.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a4d02158bbc770d7c6bd9657b3f3defc-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a4d02158bbc770d7c6bd9657b3f3defc-chunk-008</data>
