  <data key="d2">A carbon-hydrogen bond responsible for characteristic stretching vibrations observed in the 2800-3000 cm⁻¹ range.&lt;SEP&gt;The C-H bond is a primary peak in the C 1s spectra, corresponding to adventitious carbon or surface contamination.</data>
