  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">An industrial byproduct utilized as a raw material for synthesizing hydroxyapatite-zeolite composites.&lt;SEP&gt;Blast furnace slag is a material used to partially replace clinker during the production of composite cement.&lt;SEP&gt;Blast furnace slag is an industrial byproduct utilized in construction materials and for environmental remediation.&lt;SEP&gt;Blast furnace slag is an industrial solid waste high in silica, alumina, and magnesium oxide added to meet slag wool composition requirements.&lt;SEP&gt;A solid waste containing iron oxides that influence the pH value and viscosity of slag.&lt;SEP&gt;Blast furnace slag is investigated as a raw material for slag fiber production through modification processes.</data>
