  <data key="d2">Disodium Hydrogen Phosphate Dihydrate is a phosphate salt component of the simulated body fluid formulation.&lt;SEP&gt;Disodium hydrogen phosphate dihydrate is a reagent used to prepare simulated body fluid.&lt;SEP&gt;Solid salt component in the chemical solution with a concentration of 1.00 mmol L⁻¹.</data>
