<node id="TG">
  <data key="d0">TG</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">TG refers to thermogravimetric analysis used to study the thermal behavior and weight loss of HAp-protein samples.&lt;SEP&gt;Thermogravimetry, a method used to determine the amount of adsorbed material.&lt;SEP&gt;TG is a continuous thermal analysis method represented by a continuous line in the sample curves.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-f1fb5c243f2539cf7be6b6021b63c36f-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f1fb5c243f2539cf7be6b6021b63c36f-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4739e42903c95e1fb7e0ecfbca3a12df-chunk-005</data>
