<node id="TEM">
  <data key="d0">TEM</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Transmission Electron Microscopy (TEM) is a high-resolution imaging and analytical characterization technique utilized to investigate the physical, structural, and morphological properties of various materials. Often employed alongside Scanning Electron Microscopy (SEM), TEM provides detailed visual data that enables researchers to examine synthesized samples, including nanoparticles and nanopowders. The technique is particularly valued for its capacity to measure precise nanorod dimensions, determine average particle size and diameter, and assess overall sample morphology.

In the specific context of hydroxyapatite (HAp) and its nanorod variants, TEM serves as a critical tool for revealing internal structural details and confirming distinct crystalline characteristics. By analyzing these synthesized compounds, the technique successfully verifies the hexagonal crystalline structure and the P63/m space group of the hydroxyapatite particles. Through these applications, TEM facilitates a comprehensive understanding of the material properties and physical architecture of the studied samples.&lt;SEP&gt;Transmission electron microscopy is applied to analyze the detailed internal microstructure of the synthesized materials.&lt;SEP&gt;A characterization technique used to investigate the phase and structure transformation of the microspheres.&lt;SEP&gt;TEM is a microscopy technique used to observe the rod-like microstructure of dried hydroxyapatite particles.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-f1fb5c243f2539cf7be6b6021b63c36f-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c4a64a852097fdc910b98ed788503ce4-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6f5dcf59bedaa00614f1acc222b1fb7b-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6f5dcf59bedaa00614f1acc222b1fb7b-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6825862084b162a4b16cd1037c76e3d7-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6825862084b162a4b16cd1037c76e3d7-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d4a38fcc1b0f33a17d23e7a4407a9cf9-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d4a38fcc1b0f33a17d23e7a4407a9cf9-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-54b92b2ad16a2528ff6a863329c5d403-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-54b92b2ad16a2528ff6a863329c5d403-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-35aef6efc801611130c5dd196fe513df-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1792002021</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
