  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Nitrogen Adsorption/Desorption Isotherm is a measurement technique used to evaluate the pore size distribution and mesoporous characteristics of the HAp sample.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-f1fb5c243f2539cf7be6b6021b63c36f-chunk-005</data>
