  <data key="d2">Lysozyme (LSZ) is a protein whose adsorption and loading amount on HAp were measured using UV and TG results.&lt;SEP&gt;Lysozyme (LSZ) is a positively charged protein compared to BSA regarding drug release characteristics from Hydroxyapatite.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-f1fb5c243f2539cf7be6b6021b63c36f-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3fd8439e859e3dd0c96328384e1761f0-chunk-001</data>
