  <data key="d2">Combined thermal analysis technique performed to study sample stability under controlled heating.&lt;SEP&gt;TG-DSC is an analytical technique used to investigate the thermal decomposition process of phosphogypsum ingredients at different molar ratios.&lt;SEP&gt;TG-DSC is a thermal analysis method used to evaluate the thermal behavior of PGI samples.</data>
