<node id="Sustained Release">
  <data key="d0">Sustained Release</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A slow, prolonged release of proteins from carriers over several days.&lt;SEP&gt;Sustained release is a delivery mechanism enabled by the complex pore channels in the microspheres.</data>
