  <data key="d2">A visual representation combining thermogravimetric and differential thermal data showing temperature-dependent material behavior.&lt;SEP&gt;A graphical representation displaying three curves that track thermal events and temperature changes in phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;The Thermal Analysis Graph is a combined plot displaying Thermogravimetry, Differential Thermal Analysis, and Derivative Thermogravimetry data for the 1HAP-BSA sample.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-8c22d31cfad5421c936a23705a3bc6e0-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8c22d31cfad5421c936a23705a3bc6e0-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4739e42903c95e1fb7e0ecfbca3a12df-chunk-008</data>
