  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">1300°C is a high temperature point where Curve 1 shows a sharp drop on the thermal analysis graph.&lt;SEP&gt;A temperature point indicating a significant change for Curve 1 in the thermal analysis graph.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-8c22d31cfad5421c936a23705a3bc6e0-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8c22d31cfad5421c936a23705a3bc6e0-chunk-008</data>
