<node id="Calcium Sulfate I">
  <data key="d0">Calcium Sulfate I</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Calcium sulfate I is the final high-temperature phase formed during the endothermic transformation of calcium sulfate II.</data>
