  <data key="d0">Calcium Silicate Hydrate Gel</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Calcium silicate hydrate gel is a primary hydration product that bonds to phosphogypsum particles to form an adhesive layer.&lt;SEP&gt;Calcium Silicate Hydrate Gel is a hydration product in PGCM that enhances interfacial adhesion and mechanical properties.&lt;SEP&gt;Calcium silicate hydrate gel is a flocculent hydration product formed during the curing of filling materials.</data>
