  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Sihan Chen is a researcher and co-author of the study on phosphogypsum-based cementitious materials.&lt;SEP&gt;Sihan Chen is a researcher who contributed to validation and software.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-7797768798fcd1152bdc10ff73139e35-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7797768798fcd1152bdc10ff73139e35-chunk-000</data>
