  <data key="d0">Dewen Kong</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Dewen Kong is a researcher and co-author of the study on phosphogypsum-based cementitious materials.&lt;SEP&gt;Dewen Kong is a researcher who contributed to writing, review &amp; editing, and funding acquisition.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-7797768798fcd1152bdc10ff73139e35-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7797768798fcd1152bdc10ff73139e35-chunk-000</data>
