<node id="Cementitious Material">
  <data key="d0">Cementitious Material</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Cementitious material is a grey, rough, and textured binding agent extensively utilized in construction, mining, and environmental engineering. It typically functions as a composite mixture composed of cement, fly ash, waste materials, and lime. As a foundational construction binding agent, it is frequently modified or supplemented with various additives to optimize its performance for specialized applications.

The material exhibits distinct chemical and physical properties that govern its behavior during curing and long-term deployment. Its hydration process and setting time are notably influenced by phosphorus adsorption and fluorine interaction at the material's surface. These chemical dynamics are particularly relevant when the substance is engineered for environmental remediation, as its surface reactivity directly impacts its capacity to manage hazardous elements.

In practical applications, cementitious material is routinely mixed with phosphogypsum, processed aggregates, and water to produce filling slurries that solidify within mined-out voids. This specific formulation is designed to immobilize soluble fluorine and substantially reduce leaching concentrations, making it highly effective for pollutant immobilization. Furthermore, the substance is utilized to cast precast structural blocks, serving as a durable and reliable component in both testing facilities and large-scale infrastructure projects.&lt;SEP&gt;Cementitious material refers to binding substances used in construction, often engineered from industrial solid wastes like phosphogypsum.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-7797768798fcd1152bdc10ff73139e35-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a5d09b48f57a4e888bb729aaf988c936-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a5d09b48f57a4e888bb729aaf988c936-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-98d8b2df45924e721bfa570f652f33e3-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-021&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-020&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ac8d630b9aa4d874707445e2552a09-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-afe70f2d82515df80906bf3babd4e4eb-chunk-014</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1791899036</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
