  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">CaSO is the abbreviation for calcium sulfate dihydrate crystal, identified as a main hydration product.&lt;SEP&gt;CaSO is a compound in phosphogypsum whose dissolution and hydration are prevented by calcium phosphate formation.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-7797768798fcd1152bdc10ff73139e35-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-004</data>
