  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Panel (b) is a microscopic SEM image highlighting a crack path within the material.&lt;SEP&gt;Panel (b) is a magnified view of a specific region from Panel (a) revealing atomic lattice details.&lt;SEP&gt;Panel (b) is the second section of the EDS figure, providing a detailed zoomed-in view of a specific impurity phase.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-7797768798fcd1152bdc10ff73139e35-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-54b92b2ad16a2528ff6a863329c5d403-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-66f6434914b6de99019386e4bdcbc57e-chunk-025</data>
