<node id="Crystal Size">
  <data key="d0">Crystal Size</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">Crystal size is a physical parameter estimated for hydroxyapatite powders and documented in experimental results.&lt;SEP&gt;Crystal size is a quantitative measurement of hydroxyapatite crystallite dimensions, which increases with longer synthesis times.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c4a64a852097fdc910b98ed788503ce4-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c4a64a852097fdc910b98ed788503ce4-chunk-003</data>
