<node id="Brij-93">
  <data key="d0">Brij-93</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Brij-93 is a nonionic surfactant applied in this study to control the size and morphology of hydroxyapatite crystals.&lt;SEP&gt;Brij-93 is a nonionic surfactant containing polar polyoxyethylene groups and hydrophobic polyethylene chains, applied in this study.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-6f5dcf59bedaa00614f1acc222b1fb7b-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6825862084b162a4b16cd1037c76e3d7-chunk-001</data>
