  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">X-ray diffraction is a characterization technique used to investigate the structure and composition of synthesized hydroxyapatite.&lt;SEP&gt;X-Ray Diffraction (XRD) is a characterization technique employed to identify the crystal phases of the synthesized products.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-6f5dcf59bedaa00614f1acc222b1fb7b-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2196dee89de9694f28ef4eaa0e85f130-chunk-001</data>
