<node id="Biosensor">
  <data key="d0">Biosensor</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Biosensor denotes the application of hydroxyapatite in detecting biological substances.&lt;SEP&gt;Biosensors are detection devices developed using hydroxyapatite-based materials for identifying substances like hydrogen peroxide, phenolic compounds, and cyanide.&lt;SEP&gt;Biosensors are biomedical devices that incorporate hydroxyapatite for detection and sensing applications.&lt;SEP&gt;Biosensor is a diagnostic device that detects biological or chemical substances, often utilizing hydroxyapatite as a support material.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-6f5dcf59bedaa00614f1acc222b1fb7b-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6f5dcf59bedaa00614f1acc222b1fb7b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6825862084b162a4b16cd1037c76e3d7-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6825862084b162a4b16cd1037c76e3d7-chunk-008</data>
