  <data key="d2">Hydrogen peroxide is a chemical compound detected using a screen-printed biosensor based on prussian blue modified hydroxyapatite.&lt;SEP&gt;Hydrogen peroxide is a chemical oxidizing agent used in the whitening process of phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Hydrogen Peroxide is a chemical compound detected by a screen-printed biosensor based on prussian blue modified hydroxyapatite.</data>
