</node>
<node id="Sol-gel process">
  <data key="d0">Sol-gel process</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Sol-gel process is a wet-chemical synthesis method for hydroxyapatite that can yield uncontrolled particle sizes.&lt;SEP&gt;Sol-gel process is a synthesis technique for hydroxyapatite that may produce non-stoichiometric products.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-6f5dcf59bedaa00614f1acc222b1fb7b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6825862084b162a4b16cd1037c76e3d7-chunk-001</data>
