<node id="Chemical Reaction Equation">
  <data key="d0">Chemical Reaction Equation</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Chemical Reaction Equation provides the standardized scientific notation for the thermal dehydration process.&lt;SEP&gt;A mathematical representation of the reaction between calcium sulfate hemihydrate and potassium dihydrogen phosphate to form various products.&lt;SEP&gt;The Chemical Reaction Equation details the conversion of phosphogypsum with phosphoric acid and other reagents.&lt;SEP&gt;The chemical reaction equation is a mathematical representation illustrating the ion exchange and extraction process involving rare earth elements and ionic liquids.&lt;SEP&gt;A balanced equation describing the synthesis of Hydroxyapatite from Phosphogypsum and Potassium Dihydrogen Phosphate.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-031&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6825862084b162a4b16cd1037c76e3d7-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-06f299b7e723cda1f0de1a647b02b6b4-chunk-024&lt;SEP&gt;doc-edfc4dcbd74cbf0b294f83f2034b209d-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3fd8439e859e3dd0c96328384e1761f0-chunk-024</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1791967780</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Ammonium Carbonate">
  <data key="d0">Ammonium Carbonate</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Ammonium Carbonate is a chemical reagent used to convert gypsum into ammonium sulfate and calcium carbonate.&lt;SEP&gt;Ammonium carbonate is a chemical agent used by El-Gamal for removing radium-226 from phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Ammonium carbonate is an alkaline solution used for stripping, showing lower efficiency than sodium carbonate.&lt;SEP&gt;Ammonium Carbonate is a chemical solution utilized for pretreatment, stripping, and sequential chemical treatment to enhance radionuclide removal efficiency.&lt;SEP&gt;Ammonium carbonate is a chemical reactant used in the carbonation process to convert phosphogypsum into calcium carbonate and ammonium sulfate.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d18c456289f64c1e16c73a0dfd6595b3-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d18c456289f64c1e16c73a0dfd6595b3-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d18c456289f64c1e16c73a0dfd6595b3-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-edfc4dcbd74cbf0b294f83f2034b209d-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1791811483</data>
