</node>
<node id="Merseburg Process">
  <data key="d0">Merseburg Process</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">The Merseburg Process is a chemical conversion method that transforms gypsum and ammonium carbonate into ammonium sulfate and calcium carbonate.&lt;SEP&gt;The Merseburg Process is an industrial method evaluated for its benefits in decarbonization and waste minimization.</data>
