  <data key="d5">1791610304</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Filling Slurry">
  <data key="d0">Filling Slurry</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Filling slurry is a pipeline-transported mixture. Filling slurry deposits into voids and solidifies into a structural filler.&lt;SEP&gt;Filling Slurry is a mixture of PG, cementitious material, and water that solidifies to fill mined-out voids.&lt;SEP&gt;Filling Slurry is the mixture into which stabilized fluorine is re-released when pH increases after adding the binder.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a5d09b48f57a4e888bb729aaf988c936-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a5d09b48f57a4e888bb729aaf988c936-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-022</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1791720004</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Gypsum Building Material">
  <data key="d0">Gypsum Building Material</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Gypsum building material is a construction product. Gypsum building material is technologically advanced and derived from phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;A utilization route for phosphogypsum to produce construction materials like gypsum boards.&lt;SEP&gt;Gypsum building material is the second-largest application of phosphogypsum, representing 30.1% of total usage.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a5d09b48f57a4e888bb729aaf988c936-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a5d09b48f57a4e888bb729aaf988c936-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ac8d630b9aa4d874707445e2552a09-chunk-022</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1791772783</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Mining Backfill">
  <data key="d0">Mining Backfill</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Mining backfill is a utilization route. Mining backfill utilizes phosphogypsum as a filling material for mine voids.&lt;SEP&gt;A filling material route that uses phosphogypsum to fill mined-out areas.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a5d09b48f57a4e888bb729aaf988c936-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a5d09b48f57a4e888bb729aaf988c936-chunk-015</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1791610710</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Fluidized Calcination">
  <data key="d0">Fluidized Calcination</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Fluidized calcination is an innovative technology. Fluidized calcination is developed for phosphogypsum resource utilization.&lt;SEP&gt;Fluidized calcination is a thermal processing technique used to convert phosphogypsum into building gypsum.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a5d09b48f57a4e888bb729aaf988c936-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a5d09b48f57a4e888bb729aaf988c936-chunk-014</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1791610710</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Two-Stage Fluidized Bed">
  <data key="d0">Two-Stage Fluidized Bed</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Two-stage fluidized bed is industrial equipment. Two-stage fluidized bed decomposes phosphogypsum for acid production.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a5d09b48f57a4e888bb729aaf988c936-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1791610710</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Environmental Protection Policy">
  <data key="d0">Environmental Protection Policy</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Environmental protection policy is a regulatory driver. Environmental protection policy drives technological advancements in phosphogypsum resource utilization.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a5d09b48f57a4e888bb729aaf988c936-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1791610710</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Processed Aggregates">
  <data key="d0">Processed Aggregates</data>
  <data key="d1">other</data>
  <data key="d2">Processed aggregates are an alternative raw material mixed with cementitious material and water to create filling slurry.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a5d09b48f57a4e888bb729aaf988c936-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1791610710</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Acid Production">
  <data key="d0">Acid Production</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Acid production is a chemical process. Acid production is achieved through the decomposition of PG in two-stage fluidized beds.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a5d09b48f57a4e888bb729aaf988c936-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1791610710</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Synergistic Approach">
  <data key="d0">Synergistic Approach</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Synergistic approach is a comprehensive strategy. Synergistic approach combines multiple treatment modes for optimal PG industry development.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a5d09b48f57a4e888bb729aaf988c936-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1791610710</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Stockpiling Pressure">
  <data key="d0">Stockpiling Pressure</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Stockpiling pressure is an environmental and logistical challenge. Stockpiling pressure drives technological advancements in PG resource utilization.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a5d09b48f57a4e888bb729aaf988c936-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1791610710</data>
