</node>
<node id="General Office of the State Council">
  <data key="d0">General Office of the State Council</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The General Office of the State Council launched a pilot program for waste-free cities emphasizing phosphogypsum management.&lt;SEP&gt;Chinese government body that issued the Zero-Waste City pilot work plan.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a5d09b48f57a4e888bb729aaf988c936-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-afe70f2d82515df80906bf3babd4e4eb-chunk-009</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1791900207</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Ministry of Ecology and Environment">
  <data key="d0">Ministry of Ecology and Environment</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The Ministry of Ecology and Environment issued regulations and special investigation actions targeting phosphogypsum tailings ponds.&lt;SEP&gt;A government body that issued multiple policies to control phosphorus pollution and enhance tailings reservoir management.&lt;SEP&gt;Government ministry enforcing environmental standards and promoting phosphogypsum utilization.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a5d09b48f57a4e888bb729aaf988c936-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-afe70f2d82515df80906bf3babd4e4eb-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-afe70f2d82515df80906bf3babd4e4eb-chunk-002</data>
