<node id="Wu River">
  <data key="d0">Wu River</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">The Wu River experiences severe eutrophication. The Wu River receives elevated phosphorus and fluorine levels from inadequate leachate control.&lt;SEP&gt;The Wu River is an aquatic ecosystem threatened by contamination from industrial leakage.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a5d09b48f57a4e888bb729aaf988c936-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a5d09b48f57a4e888bb729aaf988c936-chunk-003</data>
