<node id="Cobalt Ions">
  <data key="d0">Cobalt Ions</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Cobalt ions are toxic heavy metal pollutants in aqueous solutions that cause chronic organ damage and are targeted for removal by the developed adsorbent.&lt;SEP&gt;Heavy metal ions present in wastewater that are targeted for removal by the adsorbents.&lt;SEP&gt;Heavy metal ions targeted for removal from wastewater using the HPA-HAP composite.&lt;SEP&gt;Metal ions (Co²⁺) whose adsorption capacity onto the material is measured and compared against cadmium ions.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-06f299b7e723cda1f0de1a647b02b6b4-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-06f299b7e723cda1f0de1a647b02b6b4-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-06f299b7e723cda1f0de1a647b02b6b4-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-06f299b7e723cda1f0de1a647b02b6b4-chunk-025</data>
