<node id="Cobalt Ion">
  <data key="d0">Cobalt Ion</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">A heavy metal ion compared against cadmium ions, showing lower adsorption capacity and removal efficiency under similar conditions.&lt;SEP&gt;A heavy metal cation (Co²⁺) targeted for removal from aqueous solutions.&lt;SEP&gt;A heavy metal ion (Co²⁺) that interacts with oxygen atoms but forms weaker bonds and shows lower adsorption capacity than cadmium ions.&lt;SEP&gt;Cobalt Ion is a heavy metal ion targeted for removal from wastewater, exhibiting slightly lower adsorption capacity compared to cadmium ions.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-06f299b7e723cda1f0de1a647b02b6b4-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-06f299b7e723cda1f0de1a647b02b6b4-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-06f299b7e723cda1f0de1a647b02b6b4-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-06f299b7e723cda1f0de1a647b02b6b4-chunk-015</data>
