<node id="Reaction Conditions">
  <data key="d0">Reaction Conditions</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Reaction Conditions specify the temperature and time parameters ranging from 60 to 150 °C for 12 to 24 hours applied during synthesis.&lt;SEP&gt;Reaction conditions encompass parameters like residence time, temperature, and C/S molar ratio that affect slag properties and desulfurization rates.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-2196dee89de9694f28ef4eaa0e85f130-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b19ca721a4da4422ee10228d88a4c292-chunk-009</data>
