<node id="Phosphate Anion">
  <data key="d0">Phosphate Anion</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">A tetrahedral anion that interacts with CTAB through charge and structure complementarity.&lt;SEP&gt;Phosphate anion refers to the negatively charged phosphate species that interacts complementarily with surfactant cations.&lt;SEP&gt;The phosphate anion is the negatively charged component that forms a salt with the quaternary ammonium cation.</data>
