  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Heat Transfer is the physical process of thermal energy exchange, closely linked to fluid dynamics in phosphogypsum applications.&lt;SEP&gt;A discipline of physics dealing with the generation, use, conversion, and exchange of thermal energy.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-98d8b2df45924e721bfa570f652f33e3-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-98d8b2df45924e721bfa570f652f33e3-chunk-007</data>
