  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The mechanical behavior of PGEF under vertical axial force, which was found to be satisfactory.&lt;SEP&gt;Stress Performance is a physical property of the Phosphogypsum Embedded Filler that was evaluated and found to be satisfied.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-98d8b2df45924e721bfa570f652f33e3-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-98d8b2df45924e721bfa570f652f33e3-chunk-001</data>
