<node id="Schematic Diagram">
  <data key="d0">Schematic Diagram</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">A technical drawing on the right side illustrating the geometric and mechanical analysis of the filler block.&lt;SEP&gt;A visual representation illustrating the chemical process and inputs involving phosphogypsum, fluoride, and cementitious materials.&lt;SEP&gt;The schematic diagram illustrates chemical reactions and phase transformations during phosphogypsum processing.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-98d8b2df45924e721bfa570f652f33e3-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-040&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b19ca721a4da4422ee10228d88a4c292-chunk-022</data>
