  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">HJ/T 300-2007 is a standard method for identifying leaching toxicity of organic and inorganic substances in solid waste.&lt;SEP&gt;HJ/T 300-2007 is a Chinese standard detailing the acetic acid buffer solution method for extracting leaching toxicity from solid waste.</data>
