  <data key="d0">HJ 557-2010</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">HJ 557-2010 is a standard method for assessing the risk of leaching inorganic pollutants from solid waste.&lt;SEP&gt;HJ 557-2010 is a Chinese standard detailing the horizontal vibration method for extracting leaching toxicity from solid waste.&lt;SEP&gt;HJ 557-2010 is a Chinese national standard specifying the horizontal shaking method for leaching toxicity testing of solid waste.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-032&lt;SEP&gt;doc-afe70f2d82515df80906bf3babd4e4eb-chunk-003</data>
