  <data key="d0">Interstitial and Attached Water</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Interstitial and attached water is a component of PG that contains numerous impurities.&lt;SEP&gt;Interstitial and attached water within phosphogypsum crystals contain numerous impurities.</data>
