<node id="Insoluble Phosphorus">
  <data key="d0">Insoluble Phosphorus</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Insoluble phosphorus is a chemical form of phosphorus found within phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Insoluble phosphorus is a phosphate impurity whose influence on the mechanical performance of cemented paste fill material is not noticeable.&lt;SEP&gt;Insoluble phosphorus precipitates as eutectic crystals or calcium salts during hydration, hindering further reactions.&lt;SEP&gt;Insoluble phosphorus is one of the three forms in which impurity phosphorus exists in phosphogypsum.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ac8d630b9aa4d874707445e2552a09-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ac8d630b9aa4d874707445e2552a09-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1791770526</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Eutectic Phosphorus">
  <data key="d0">Eutectic Phosphorus</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Eutectic phosphorus is one of the three primary chemical forms of phosphorus present in phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Eutectic phosphorus releases soluble phosphorus during hydration, leading to loose structures and decreased pH in leachates.&lt;SEP&gt;A type of phosphorus impurity that remains after water washing and hinders the hydration of phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Eutectic phosphorus is one of the three forms in which impurity phosphorus exists in phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Eutectic phosphorus is a form of phosphorus in phosphogypsum that precipitates as crystals during hydration.&lt;SEP&gt;Eutectic Phosphorus is a complex chemical form of phosphorus present in phosphogypsum.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ac8d630b9aa4d874707445e2552a09-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ac8d630b9aa4d874707445e2552a09-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ac8d630b9aa4d874707445e2552a09-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-afe70f2d82515df80906bf3babd4e4eb-chunk-004</data>
