  <data key="d0">Jiang et al.</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Jiang et al. are researchers who studied the unconfined compressive strength decay of HPG at different stacking heights.&lt;SEP&gt;Jiang et al. found that soluble phosphorus reacts with calcium ions to form insoluble substances, hindering hydration.&lt;SEP&gt;Jiang et al. determined equilibrium fluoride concentrations under closed dynamic and static leaching conditions.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-022&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-011</data>
