<node id="Slaked Lime">
  <data key="d0">Slaked Lime</data>
  <data key="d1">other</data>
  <data key="d2">Slaked lime is a modified material that reacts with phosphogypsum impurities to alter microstructure and strength characteristics.&lt;SEP&gt;Slaked lime is a chemical additive used to enhance the hydration mechanism of high purity phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Slaked lime is a chemical compound mentioned in the context of CPGFM composition.&lt;SEP&gt;Slaked lime is an alkaline additive used to control phosphorus migration.&lt;SEP&gt;An alternative name for calcium hydroxide, used as a base in the chemical reactions.&lt;SEP&gt;Slaked lime is an alternative name for calcium hydroxide, used as an industrial alkali and in mortars.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-023&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4739e42903c95e1fb7e0ecfbca3a12df-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-28fbd4302bba090e667215c840757ff7-chunk-006</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1791917129</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Cement Hydration Reaction">
  <data key="d0">Cement Hydration Reaction</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Cement hydration reaction is a chemical process accelerated by temperature, impacting the early and later strength of the composite.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-014</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1791720004</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Mixing Time">
  <data key="d0">Mixing Time</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Mixing time is a processing parameter that influences crystal growth consistency and contact strength up to an optimal limit.&lt;SEP&gt;Mixing Time is the duration of agitation during the treatment process, which influences the reduction of soluble phosphorus.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-020</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1791720277</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Mine">
  <data key="d0">Mine</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">Mine is the practical application site where slurry performance and mixing time effects require monitoring.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-014</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1791720277</data>
