  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Alkali treatment is a control measure utilizing alkaline additives to immobilize pollutants.&lt;SEP&gt;Alkali treatment manages phosphate pollution but has limited effectiveness for fluorine immobilization.</data>
