<node id="Mine Water">
  <data key="d0">Mine Water</data>
  <data key="d1">other</data>
  <data key="d2">Mine water is an environmental factor with a generally lower pH than acid or alkaline solutions, affecting the filling body.&lt;SEP&gt;Mine water is a fluid that can leach or soak pollutants from materials, facilitating their entry into groundwater.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-023</data>
