  <data key="d0">Liquid Limit</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">Liquid limit is a physical property of the adobe soil, measured at 56.41%.&lt;SEP&gt;The liquid limit of the soil determines the required amount of mixing water for the specimens.&lt;SEP&gt;A soil property measured at 56.41 percent, indicating the water content at which soil transitions to a liquid state.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e4a551024f80f822f3f35e38ec278151-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e4a551024f80f822f3f35e38ec278151-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e4a551024f80f822f3f35e38ec278151-chunk-005</data>
