<node id="Plasticity Index">
  <data key="d0">Plasticity Index</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">Plasticity index is a physical property of the adobe soil, measured at 20.70%.&lt;SEP&gt;A soil property measured at 20.70 percent, representing the range of water content over which the soil remains plastic.&lt;SEP&gt;A measure of the plasticity range of a soil material, determined through Atterberg limits testing.&lt;SEP&gt;A key parameter reflecting resistance to water erosion, significantly improved by SM addition.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e4a551024f80f822f3f35e38ec278151-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e4a551024f80f822f3f35e38ec278151-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-160a0fe95f7c82b193c6af751106ab6d-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-160a0fe95f7c82b193c6af751106ab6d-chunk-004</data>
