<node id="Journal of Thermal Analysis and Calorimetry">
  <data key="d0">Journal of Thermal Analysis and Calorimetry</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Journal of Thermal Analysis and Calorimetry is a peer-reviewed publication featuring research on thermal stability and sintering of hydroxyapatite.&lt;SEP&gt;A scientific journal that published a reference on the thermal stability and sintering behavior of hydroxyapatite nanopowders.&lt;SEP&gt;Journal of Thermal Analysis and Calorimetry is the publication venue for the 2015 study on bovine serum albumin-silicon dioxide thermal properties.&lt;SEP&gt;Journal of Thermal Analysis and Calorimetry is an academic journal that published research on the environmental sustainability of renewable phosphogypsum.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4739e42903c95e1fb7e0ecfbca3a12df-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4739e42903c95e1fb7e0ecfbca3a12df-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4739e42903c95e1fb7e0ecfbca3a12df-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-afe70f2d82515df80906bf3babd4e4eb-chunk-014</data>
