<node id="Thermogravimetry">
  <data key="d0">Thermogravimetry</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Thermogravimetry is a thermal analysis technique used to track mass losses and stability of hydroxyapatite during heating.&lt;SEP&gt;Thermogravimetry is a technique used to track the remaining mass percentage of a sample during heating.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4739e42903c95e1fb7e0ecfbca3a12df-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4739e42903c95e1fb7e0ecfbca3a12df-chunk-004</data>
