<node id="Particle Shape">
  <data key="d0">Particle Shape</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Particle shape is a physical characteristic of phosphogypsum that is influenced by the ball-milling process parameters.&lt;SEP&gt;Particle shape refers to the lamellar or needle-like morphology of hydroxyapatite nanoparticles, which affects measurement accuracy across different methods.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-b0ac8d630b9aa4d874707445e2552a09-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d4a38fcc1b0f33a17d23e7a4407a9cf9-chunk-010</data>
