<node id="Roasting">
  <data key="d0">Roasting</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Roasting is a thermal processing method used to prepare β-hemihydrate gypsum from phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Roasting is the thermal process at 800 °C that converts RE oxalate into RE oxide.&lt;SEP&gt;Roasting is a physicochemical pre-treatment technique applied to increase rare earth element concentration in phosphogypsum prior to extraction.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-b0ac8d630b9aa4d874707445e2552a09-chunk-020&lt;SEP&gt;doc-edfc4dcbd74cbf0b294f83f2034b209d-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-66f6434914b6de99019386e4bdcbc57e-chunk-018</data>
