  <data key="d0">Alpha-hemihydrate Gypsum</data>
  <data key="d1">other</data>
  <data key="d2">Alpha-hemihydrate gypsum is a high-strength gypsum form with excellent fluidity, suitable for reinforcement and self-leveling mortar applications.</data>
