<node id="Beta-hemihydrate Gypsum">
  <data key="d0">Beta-hemihydrate Gypsum</data>
  <data key="d1">other</data>
  <data key="d2">Beta-hemihydrate gypsum is a lower-strength gypsum form with poor fluidity, commonly used in building materials and caulking.</data>
