  <data key="d0">Purity</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">A quality metric of phosphogypsum that increases after impurity removal processes.&lt;SEP&gt;Purity is a quality metric for phosphogypsum that can reach up to 99.12% through roughing reverse flotation and positive flotation processes.&lt;SEP&gt;Purity is a key metric in the preparation of alpha-hemihydrate gypsum whiskers, reaching 100% under optimized conditions.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-b0ac8d630b9aa4d874707445e2552a09-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ac8d630b9aa4d874707445e2552a09-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ac8d630b9aa4d874707445e2552a09-chunk-007</data>
