  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The Egyptian Nuclear Materials Authority collaborated on the research and development of the leaching procedure.&lt;SEP&gt;The Egyptian Nuclear Materials Authority operates a pilot plant for phosphoric acid purification where solid waste treatment was studied.</data>
