<node id="Extraction Complex">
  <data key="d0">Extraction Complex</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">The extraction complex is the resulting chemical product formed when rare earth elements coordinate with nitrates and ionic liquid cations to balance charge.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-edfc4dcbd74cbf0b294f83f2034b209d-chunk-016</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1791813824</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Ion Exchange Process">
  <data key="d0">Ion Exchange Process</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">The ion exchange process is a chemical mechanism describing how metal ions bind with nitrates and extractants to form extractable complexes.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-edfc4dcbd74cbf0b294f83f2034b209d-chunk-016</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1791813824</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Lanthanum Nitrate Complex">
  <data key="d0">Lanthanum Nitrate Complex</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">A chemical species represented as La(NO3)2 with a 5- charge, likely intended to be La(NO3)5^2-, that participates in the reaction.&lt;SEP&gt;The lanthanum nitrate complex (La(NO₃)₂⁵⁻) is a reactant in the second chemical equation representing an ion exchange process.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-edfc4dcbd74cbf0b294f83f2034b209d-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-edfc4dcbd74cbf0b294f83f2034b209d-chunk-017</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1791813824</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Lanthanum Extraction Complex">
  <data key="d0">Lanthanum Extraction Complex</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">The lanthanum extraction complex ([P₆₆₆₁₄]₂[La(NO₃)₅]) is the product formed from the reaction of the lanthanum nitrate complex with the ionic liquid.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-edfc4dcbd74cbf0b294f83f2034b209d-chunk-016</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1791813824</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Second Chemical Equation">
  <data key="d0">Second Chemical Equation</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">The second chemical equation illustrates a specific ion exchange reaction involving lanthanum and a phosphonium salt.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-edfc4dcbd74cbf0b294f83f2034b209d-chunk-016</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1791813824</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
