  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Size-Strain Plot is a graphical technique used to determine crystallite size and microstrain in materials.&lt;SEP&gt;Size-Strain Plot is a graphical method utilized to analyze size and strain parameters in the synthesized material.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a52951853fd542b78835b677936c557b-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a52951853fd542b78835b677936c557b-chunk-013</data>
