  <data key="d2">HAp Nanoparticles are synthesized hydroxyapatite nanomaterials characterized in the study.&lt;SEP&gt;Synthesized hydroxyapatite nanoparticles analyzed using the SSP technique and Halder-Wagner method.&lt;SEP&gt;HAp Nanoparticles are synthesized hydroxyapatite particles analyzed in the study.&lt;SEP&gt;HAp nanoparticles are small particulate forms of hydroxyapatite whose growth is influenced by modifiers.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a52951853fd542b78835b677936c557b-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a52951853fd542b78835b677936c557b-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a52951853fd542b78835b677936c557b-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a52951853fd542b78835b677936c557b-chunk-010</data>
