<node id="Palmitic Acid">
  <data key="d0">Palmitic Acid</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Palmitic Acid is an organic modifier acting as a surfactant to limit crystal growth and size distribution.&lt;SEP&gt;An organic modifier added to the reaction system during synthesis.&lt;SEP&gt;Palmitic Acid is a chemical compound used to modify HAp nanoparticles, resulting in the Palmitic Acid_Hap sample.&lt;SEP&gt;Palmitic acid is an organic modifier that acts as a surfactant to restrict size distribution and growth of HAp nanoparticles.&lt;SEP&gt;Palmitic Acid acts as a surfactant that restricts the size distribution and growth of Hydroxyapatite nanostructures.&lt;SEP&gt;Palmitic Acid is an organic modifier utilized to modify the crystalline structure of hydroxyapatite during synthesis.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a52951853fd542b78835b677936c557b-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a52951853fd542b78835b677936c557b-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a52951853fd542b78835b677936c557b-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a52951853fd542b78835b677936c557b-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a52951853fd542b78835b677936c557b-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a52951853fd542b78835b677936c557b-chunk-011</data>
