<node id="Gaussian Function">
  <data key="d0">Gaussian Function</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Gaussian Function is a mathematical model defining the strain-induced component of peak widening.&lt;SEP&gt;A mathematical function used to model peak broadening in XRD analysis.&lt;SEP&gt;A mathematical function used in the SSP technique to model strain widening.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a52951853fd542b78835b677936c557b-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a52951853fd542b78835b677936c557b-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a52951853fd542b78835b677936c557b-chunk-007</data>
