  <data key="d0">Equation 21</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">A mathematical formula used to linearize peak broadening data for estimating crystallite dimension and strain.&lt;SEP&gt;Equation 21 is the mathematical formula for calculating wSO3 using gravimetric mass data.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a52951853fd542b78835b677936c557b-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-60e237a0a1045feedf76d35d654a79bd-chunk-012</data>
