</node>
<node id="Equation 22">
  <data key="d0">Equation 22</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">A mathematical formula defining the normalized peak broadening parameter based on diffraction angle and wavelength.&lt;SEP&gt;Equation 22 is the mathematical formula for calculating wSO3 using a secondary method with a correction factor.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a52951853fd542b78835b677936c557b-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-60e237a0a1045feedf76d35d654a79bd-chunk-012</data>
