  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">The UV-Vis Spectrophotometer is an instrument used to estimate the optical band gap of HAp.&lt;SEP&gt;A UV-Vis spectrophotometer is an instrument used to estimate the optical band gap of hydrothermally produced HAp at ambient temperature.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a52951853fd542b78835b677936c557b-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a52951853fd542b78835b677936c557b-chunk-010</data>
