<node id="Optical Band Gap">
  <data key="d0">Optical Band Gap</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Optical Band Gap is an optical property of HAp estimated using the Tauc Plot Technique.&lt;SEP&gt;The optical band gap is a material property representing the energy difference between the valence and conduction bands, measured in electron volts.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a52951853fd542b78835b677936c557b-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a52951853fd542b78835b677936c557b-chunk-010</data>
