  <data key="d0">Surface Morphology</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Surface morphology refers to the physical shape and structural characteristics of the synthesized HAp material.&lt;SEP&gt;The physical texture and topography of the phosphogypsum sample, characterized by rough, granular, and porous features.</data>
