  <data key="d0">Absorption Frequency</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">Absorption Frequency is a property estimated using the Tauc Plot Technique to determine the optical band gap.&lt;SEP&gt;Absorption frequency is a spectral parameter estimated using the Tauc plot technique.</data>
