  <data key="d0">Hooke's Law</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Hooke's Law is a physical principle illustrating a linear connection between stress and strain.&lt;SEP&gt;Hooke's Law illustrates a linear connection between stress and strain in crystals.</data>
