  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Equation 24 is a mathematical formula representing the Sahadat-Scherrer Model for calculating crystallite size.&lt;SEP&gt;Equation 24 is the mathematical formula for calculating the mass fraction of a hydrated compound.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a52951853fd542b78835b677936c557b-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-60e237a0a1045feedf76d35d654a79bd-chunk-012</data>
