<node id="Nanopowder XRD Processor Demo">
  <data key="d0">Nanopowder XRD Processor Demo</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">The Nanopowder XRD Processor Demo is a web application used to analyze XRD peak profiles and calculate crystallite metrics.&lt;SEP&gt;A software tool used to calculate the average crystallite size of the nanopowder samples.&lt;SEP&gt;Nanopowder XRD Processor Demo is a software tool used to obtain crystallite size distribution data.&lt;SEP&gt;The Nanopowder XRD Processor Demo is a web application used to convert XRD and SSA results into particle size data.&lt;SEP&gt;A software demonstration tool for X-ray diffraction analysis of nanopowders, referenced in the bibliography.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-d4a38fcc1b0f33a17d23e7a4407a9cf9-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d4a38fcc1b0f33a17d23e7a4407a9cf9-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d4a38fcc1b0f33a17d23e7a4407a9cf9-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d4a38fcc1b0f33a17d23e7a4407a9cf9-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d4a38fcc1b0f33a17d23e7a4407a9cf9-chunk-005</data>
