<node id="MSS2 Reactor">
  <data key="d0">MSS2 Reactor</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">MSS2 Reactor is a closed vessel reactor capable of rapid, uniform heating under high pressure and temperature for microwave hydrothermal synthesis.&lt;SEP&gt;A reactor used for synthesizing hydroxyapatite nanopowders, featuring a load and unload system.&lt;SEP&gt;The MSS2 Reactor is an advanced vessel used to scale up hydroxyapatite production with larger feedstock volumes.&lt;SEP&gt;MSS2 Reactor is a synthesis apparatus where hydroxyapatite particles undergo dissolution and recrystallization.&lt;SEP&gt;The MSS2 Reactor is a large-scale reaction vessel with a 350 mL volume and 3 kW capacity used for synthesizing hydroxyapatite nanoparticles.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-d4a38fcc1b0f33a17d23e7a4407a9cf9-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d4a38fcc1b0f33a17d23e7a4407a9cf9-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d4a38fcc1b0f33a17d23e7a4407a9cf9-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d4a38fcc1b0f33a17d23e7a4407a9cf9-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d4a38fcc1b0f33a17d23e7a4407a9cf9-chunk-004</data>
