  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">CML 2 Baseline 2000 is an alternative impact assessment method used to address specific environmental impacts.&lt;SEP&gt;CML 2 Baseline 2000 is an alternative impact assessment method used to compare results with Ecoindicator 99.&lt;SEP&gt;An impact assessment method employed alongside Ecoindicator 99 to compare environmental results.&lt;SEP&gt;CML 2 Baseline 2000 is an impact assessment method applied to evaluate substances causing acidification and eutrophication impacts.</data>
