  <data key="d0">Individualist Perspective</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The Individualist Perspective represents the market viewpoint used to complement the study analysis.&lt;SEP&gt;The individualist perspective is an analytical framework used to determine the lowest grading or footprint for stack disposal.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-0060991ac74a9675ce0293eccdc023cd-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0060991ac74a9675ce0293eccdc023cd-chunk-002</data>
