<node id="Egalitarian Perspective">
  <data key="d0">Egalitarian Perspective</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The Egalitarian Perspective represents the citizen group viewpoint used as the main analytical lens for the study.&lt;SEP&gt;The egalitarian perspective is the main perspective used for weighting damage categories in the assessment method.&lt;SEP&gt;Egalitarian perspective is an evaluation framework applied during the comparative analysis of management methods.&lt;SEP&gt;The egalitarian perspective is an analytical framework used to generate final scores and rankings for the four PG waste management methods.&lt;SEP&gt;Egalitarian Perspective is a worldview used to calculate total scores for ranking PG waste management methods.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-0060991ac74a9675ce0293eccdc023cd-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0060991ac74a9675ce0293eccdc023cd-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0060991ac74a9675ce0293eccdc023cd-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0060991ac74a9675ce0293eccdc023cd-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0060991ac74a9675ce0293eccdc023cd-chunk-004</data>
