  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The Hierarchist Perspective represents the government viewpoint used to complement the study analysis.&lt;SEP&gt;The hierarchist perspective is an analytical framework used alongside others to rank the four PG waste management methods.</data>
