  <data key="d2">Radiation is an impact category under human health evaluated by the assessment method.&lt;SEP&gt;Radiation is an environmental impact category associated with Phosphogypsum disposal.&lt;SEP&gt;Radiation is an environmental impact category listed in the chart's legend, associated with the color grey.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-0060991ac74a9675ce0293eccdc023cd-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0060991ac74a9675ce0293eccdc023cd-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0060991ac74a9675ce0293eccdc023cd-chunk-004</data>
