<node id="Respiratory Inorganics">
  <data key="d0">Respiratory Inorganics</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Respiratory inorganics are pollutants emitted during material transport that contribute to environmental burden.&lt;SEP&gt;Respiratory Inorganics is a dominant impact category reduced through conventional gypsum and phosphoric acid savings.&lt;SEP&gt;Respiratory inorganics is an impact category associated with materials transport and clay savings.&lt;SEP&gt;Respiratory Inorganics is an environmental impact category listed in the chart's legend, associated with the color yellow.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-0060991ac74a9675ce0293eccdc023cd-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0060991ac74a9675ce0293eccdc023cd-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0060991ac74a9675ce0293eccdc023cd-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0060991ac74a9675ce0293eccdc023cd-chunk-008</data>
