<node id="Embankment">
  <data key="d0">Embankment</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Civil engineering structure where raw or stabilized phosphogypsum is utilized.&lt;SEP&gt;Embankment is a structural application where raw PG is evaluated for direct or stabilized use.&lt;SEP&gt;Embankment refers to a construction layer that utilizes various PG-based mixtures for foundational support.&lt;SEP&gt;A construction structure built using phosphogypsum-soil solidified material, whose settlement is predicted based on height.&lt;SEP&gt;Embankments are structural earthworks where the stabilized mix formulation is evaluated and applied.&lt;SEP&gt;An application category for material mixtures E0 through E3.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-160a0fe95f7c82b193c6af751106ab6d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-160a0fe95f7c82b193c6af751106ab6d-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-160a0fe95f7c82b193c6af751106ab6d-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-160a0fe95f7c82b193c6af751106ab6d-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-160a0fe95f7c82b193c6af751106ab6d-chunk-020&lt;SEP&gt;doc-160a0fe95f7c82b193c6af751106ab6d-chunk-007</data>
