<node id="Soil Material">
  <data key="d0">Soil Material</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Soil Material is a conventional geotechnical component mixed with raw phosphogypsum to evaluate compatibility and application limits.&lt;SEP&gt;Soil Material is a raw component mixed with phosphogypsum to create geotechnical formulations.&lt;SEP&gt;A soil sample collected near Jorf Lasfer, Morocco, primarily composed of silicates, aluminosilicates, and limestones.&lt;SEP&gt;An additive mixed with phosphogypsum to improve texture, reduce fine particle percentage, and enhance resistance to water erosion.</data>
