<node id="Methylene Blue Value">
  <data key="d0">Methylene Blue Value</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">Methylene Blue Value is a geotechnical parameter measured in g/100g to assess soil properties.&lt;SEP&gt;A monitoring parameter highlighted as significantly improved with SM content addition.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-160a0fe95f7c82b193c6af751106ab6d-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-160a0fe95f7c82b193c6af751106ab6d-chunk-011</data>
