  <data key="d2">A chemical additive kept at a fixed dosage to improve the pH and properties of the third mix formulation.&lt;SEP&gt;HRB is a chemical additive maintained at a fixed dosage of 7 wt% in the mix formulations.&lt;SEP&gt;Road binder additive tested as an alternative to lime, yielding insignificant mechanical improvements.&lt;SEP&gt;A component of the CM-PG-SM-HRB mix used in the experimental formulation.&lt;SEP&gt;A material component listed for use in capping and pavement layers.</data>
