<node id="E1 Mix">
  <data key="d0">E1 Mix</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">A designed mixture of phosphogypsum and soil material that remains highly sensitive to fragmentation under stress.&lt;SEP&gt;First experimental formulation tested, showing improved pH and mechanical properties compared to raw PG.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-160a0fe95f7c82b193c6af751106ab6d-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-160a0fe95f7c82b193c6af751106ab6d-chunk-010</data>
