<node id="E3 Mix">
  <data key="d0">E3 Mix</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">A designed mixture of phosphogypsum and soil material that reaches a stable particle size distribution under stress.&lt;SEP&gt;Third experimental formulation tested, exhibiting improved properties but less optimal than E2 Mix.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-160a0fe95f7c82b193c6af751106ab6d-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-160a0fe95f7c82b193c6af751106ab6d-chunk-010</data>
