  <data key="d0">CM</data>
  <data key="d1">other</data>
  <data key="d2">Cement additive incorporated into P12 Mix to markedly enhance stiffness and compressive strength.&lt;SEP&gt;CM is a chemical component added to mixes to enhance stiffness and mechanical properties.&lt;SEP&gt;A component added to the mix that facilitates the development of the ettringite phase.&lt;SEP&gt;A material component listed for use in capping and pavement layers.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-160a0fe95f7c82b193c6af751106ab6d-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-160a0fe95f7c82b193c6af751106ab6d-chunk-020&lt;SEP&gt;doc-160a0fe95f7c82b193c6af751106ab6d-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-160a0fe95f7c82b193c6af751106ab6d-chunk-012</data>
