<node id="CM/PG Ratio">
  <data key="d0">CM/PG Ratio</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">CM/PG ratio is a mix parameter adjusted to 0.4 and 0.5 to improve the pH of the mixes.&lt;SEP&gt;The incorporation ratio of CM to PG, which influences stiffness and mechanical performance.&lt;SEP&gt;CM/PG Ratio is the proportion of CM to PG in a mix, with optimal performance observed between 0.17 and 0.45.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-160a0fe95f7c82b193c6af751106ab6d-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-160a0fe95f7c82b193c6af751106ab6d-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-160a0fe95f7c82b193c6af751106ab6d-chunk-012</data>
