<node id="EDX Analysis">
  <data key="d0">EDX Analysis</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">EDX Analysis is an analytical method used to obtain elemental data for the prepared samples.&lt;SEP&gt;EDX Analysis is an analytical technique used to measure the atomic composition and elemental weight percentages of the samples.&lt;SEP&gt;Analytical technique used to confirm the presence of oxygen vacancies.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-3fd8439e859e3dd0c96328384e1761f0-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3fd8439e859e3dd0c96328384e1761f0-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3fd8439e859e3dd0c96328384e1761f0-chunk-011</data>
