  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">PPG-derived HAp refers to Hydroxyapatite synthesized using PPG-containing precursors, resulting in nanorods of varying lengths depending on the surfactant.&lt;SEP&gt;Hydroxyapatite synthesized from PPG precursors via hydrothermal synthesis.&lt;SEP&gt;PPG-derived HAp refers to hydroxyapatite samples synthesized using polypropylene glycol, analyzed for optical properties.</data>
