  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The Ca-O bond is a chemical linkage in HAp identified by a prominent peak at 347.3 eV in the Ca 2p spectra.&lt;SEP&gt;The Ca-O bond is a primary chemical component identified in the high-resolution O 1s XPS spectra of HAp.</data>
