<node id="HAp-P123-9">
  <data key="d0">HAp-P123-9</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">HAp-P123-9 is a specific variant of PPG-derived HAp synthesized with 9 wt% P123 surfactant.&lt;SEP&gt;Synthesized hydroxyapatite sample forming shorter nanorods with a significant disappearance of flaky structures at 9 wt% P123 concentration.&lt;SEP&gt;HAp-P123-9 is a prepared hydroxyapatite sample modified with P123 surfactant at a high concentration.&lt;SEP&gt;HAp-P123-9 is a synthesized sample modified with P123 surfactant at a specific concentration.&lt;SEP&gt;A hydroxyapatite sample modified with P123 surfactant featuring nanorods that provide distinct electron transport pathways.&lt;SEP&gt;A hydroxyapatite sample modified with P123 surfactant, exhibiting lower oxygen concentration and intermediate carrier density.&lt;SEP&gt;A specific variant of the HAp-P123 sample evaluated for photocurrent density.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-3fd8439e859e3dd0c96328384e1761f0-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3fd8439e859e3dd0c96328384e1761f0-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3fd8439e859e3dd0c96328384e1761f0-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3fd8439e859e3dd0c96328384e1761f0-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3fd8439e859e3dd0c96328384e1761f0-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3fd8439e859e3dd0c96328384e1761f0-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3fd8439e859e3dd0c96328384e1761f0-chunk-013</data>
