  <data key="d0">Heterojunction Photocatalyst</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Heterojunction Photocatalyst is a comparative photocatalyst structure mentioned to highlight the superior charge transfer efficiency of the 1D/2D homojunction.</data>
