  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Micelle refers to the self-assembled surfactant structures that provide nucleation sites and influence crystal growth kinetics.&lt;SEP&gt;Self-assembled molecular structure formed by surfactants in water.</data>
