  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Double-Step Hydrothermal Processing is a specialized synthesis technique for forming hydroxyapatite with controlled morphology.&lt;SEP&gt;Double-step hydrothermal processing is a synthesis technique used to study the effect of urea on hydroxyapatite formation.</data>
