<node id="Debye-Scherrer Equation">
  <data key="d0">Debye-Scherrer Equation</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">The Debye-Scherrer equation is a mathematical formula used to calculate crystallite size and crystallinity from diffraction peak broadening.&lt;SEP&gt;Debye-Scherrer Equation is a theoretical framework compared with the Scherrer Equation for crystal analysis.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-54b92b2ad16a2528ff6a863329c5d403-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-54b92b2ad16a2528ff6a863329c5d403-chunk-008</data>
