  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">ACP is an amorphous phase that coexists with HA and forms solid microspheres with low specific surface area at 1 h hydrothermal time.&lt;SEP&gt;ACP is an amorphous calcium phosphate intermediate phase that transforms into hydroxyapatite during the reaction.</data>
