  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Ion migration is promoted by surface dissolution, leading to the nucleation and growth of HA crystals.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-54b92b2ad16a2528ff6a863329c5d403-chunk-005</data>
