<node id="Nitrogen Gas">
  <data key="d0">Nitrogen Gas</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Nitrogen Gas is a high-purity gas employed as both sweep gas and shield gas during TG analysis and reduction experiments.&lt;SEP&gt;Nitrogen Gas functions as a protective flushing atmosphere to prevent oxidation during the high-temperature smelting process.&lt;SEP&gt;A protective flushing gas used to maintain a controlled atmosphere during the smelting process.</data>
