<node id="Glassy Phase">
  <data key="d0">Glassy Phase</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Glassy Phase is a slag structure characterized by the absence of notable diffraction peaks, indicating suitability for slag wool production.&lt;SEP&gt;Glassy phase is a non-crystalline structural state of slag formed at high temperatures, indicating suitability for slag wool preparation.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-b19ca721a4da4422ee10228d88a4c292-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b19ca721a4da4422ee10228d88a4c292-chunk-008</data>
