  <data key="d8">Phosphogypsum undergoes pyrolysis to decompose into calcium sulfate and extract sulfur-containing compounds.&lt;SEP&gt;Phosphogypsum undergoes pyrolysis to decompose into calcium sulfate and extract sulfur-containing compounds.&lt;SEP&gt;Phosphogypsum undergoes pyrolysis to decompose into calcium sulfate and extract sulfur-containing compounds.</data>
