<edge source="Phosphogypsum" target="Acid Leaching">
  <data key="d7">5.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Acid leaching is applied to the processing of phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Acid leaching is the primary method used to extract rare earth elements from phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Phosphogypsum serves as the primary raw material processed during the acid leaching stage.&lt;SEP&gt;Acid leaching is applied to phosphogypsum to extract valuable components like rare earth elements.&lt;SEP&gt;Acid leaching methods are employed to recover rare earth elements from phosphogypsum.</data>
  <data key="d9">application,extraction,hydrometallurgy,process input,processing,raw material</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-029&lt;SEP&gt;doc-401b567da916dc34559e0bfe5a5b367b-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1adcb38defdd04a271ddba318999ba67-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-031&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-008</data>
