<edge source="Phosphogypsum" target="Carbon Dioxide">
  <data key="d7">7.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Carbon dioxide capture is enhanced using hydrolysate derived from phosphogypsum decomposition products.&lt;SEP&gt;Carbon dioxide capture is enhanced using hydrolysate derived from phosphogypsum decomposition products.&lt;SEP&gt;Carbon dioxide is captured from phosphogypsum decomposition slag to synthesize calcium carbonate.&lt;SEP&gt;Carbon dioxide capture is enhanced using hydrolysate derived from phosphogypsum decomposition products.&lt;SEP&gt;Phosphogypsum acts as a carbon dioxide sink via carbonation reactions.&lt;SEP&gt;Phosphogypsum sequesters carbon dioxide to mitigate greenhouse gas emissions.&lt;SEP&gt;Phosphogypsum reacts with carbon dioxide in a low-cost carbonation process to produce stable calcium carbonate.</data>
