<edge source="Phosphogypsum" target="Table 1">
  <data key="d7">11.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Table 1, in relation to phosphogypsum, presents a comprehensive analytical dataset detailing the material's chemical properties and behavior. The table documents the chemical composition and constituent percentages of various phosphogypsum samples, with specific focus on the concentrations of major elements and impurities. It facilitates geographical comparisons by presenting and contrasting the chemical makeup of phosphogypsum from Morocco with samples sourced from Hubei, Yunnan, and Guizhou provinces.

Beyond static compositional profiling, the table also examines dynamic chemical effects by presenting analytical data on macro-ion content across different phosphogypsum dosages. Furthermore, it displays the chemical analysis results of the nitrate leach liquid obtained from phosphogypsum. Together, these entries provide a multifaceted overview that covers elemental distribution, regional variations, dosage-dependent ion release, and leachate characteristics.&lt;SEP&gt;Table 1 documents the major and trace element composition of Phosphogypsum samples.&lt;SEP&gt;Table 1 provides quantitative concentration data for various elements detected in the phosphogypsum samples.&lt;SEP&gt;Table 1 presents the chemical compositions of phosphogypsum.</data>
  <data key="d9">chemical analysis,chemical composition,composition,compositional summary,data analysis,data presentation,data source,documents,dosage tracking,dose response,elemental concentration,experimental variable,regional comparison,summarizes</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-ce9090f230bcd0bfeefe92db7a576442-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ce9090f230bcd0bfeefe92db7a576442-chunk-022&lt;SEP&gt;doc-983b2c3f393a1de00521565a70363819-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-edfc4dcbd74cbf0b294f83f2034b209d-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-afe70f2d82515df80906bf3babd4e4eb-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-66f6434914b6de99019386e4bdcbc57e-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-66f6434914b6de99019386e4bdcbc57e-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b19ca721a4da4422ee10228d88a4c292-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d11">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d12">1792099337</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
