  <data key="d8">Phosphogypsum is a byproduct generated during fertilizer production.&lt;SEP&gt;Fertilizer production generates phosphogypsum as a by-product that becomes enriched with radionuclides.&lt;SEP&gt;Fertilizer production generates phosphogypsum as a byproduct.&lt;SEP&gt;Phosphogypsum is generated as a byproduct of fertilizer production.&lt;SEP&gt;Phosphogypsum production rates directly follow fertilizer production rates.&lt;SEP&gt;Phosphogypsum is generated as a byproduct of fertilizer and phosphoric acid production.&lt;SEP&gt;Fertilizer Production generates phosphogypsum waste as a byproduct.</data>
