<edge source="Phosphogypsum" target="Rare earth elements">
  <data key="d7">4.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Phosphogypsum serves as a potential source for recovering valuable rare earth elements.&lt;SEP&gt;Phosphogypsum is identified as a promising secondary resource for recovering rare earth elements.&lt;SEP&gt;Phosphogypsum serves as a potential source for recovering valuable rare earth elements.&lt;SEP&gt;Phosphogypsum contains non-negligible concentrations of rare earth elements.</data>
