  <data key="d7">3.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Phosphogypsum is used as a component in supersulfated cement, with its hydration properties being studied.&lt;SEP&gt;Modified phosphogypsum directly influences the hydration properties and performance of supersulfated cement.&lt;SEP&gt;Phosphogypsum is used as a component in supersulfated cement, with its hydration properties being studied.</data>
