<edge source="Phosphogypsum" target="Russia">
  <data key="d7">5.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Phosphogypsum is transported to or utilized at sites in Russia.&lt;SEP&gt;Russia is identified as a potential usage site or port for phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Russia is among the countries with a rapidly expanding phosphorus chemical sector that generates substantial phosphogypsum waste.&lt;SEP&gt;Russia produces 11.0 Mt of phosphogypsum annually.&lt;SEP&gt;Russia has commercialized agricultural applications of phosphogypsum and explores rare earth element extraction.</data>
