<edge source="Phosphogypsum" target="Citric Acid">
  <data key="d7">11.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Citric Acid and Phosphogypsum are connected through an industrial purification and pre-treatment process. In this application, phosphogypsum is soaked or immersed in an aqueous citric acid solution, followed by a washing step. This treatment serves multiple chemical and functional purposes. Chemically, citric acid converts inhibitory impurities into soluble forms and transforms calcium sulfate within the material into gypsum.

From a purification standpoint, the citric acid treatment effectively leaches and removes various contaminants and residual impurities, notably reducing levels of phosphorus pentoxide and fluorine. It is also highly effective at mitigating radioactivity; as a leaching reagent, it reduces the relative proportion of radionuclides in phosphogypsum by 22%, ultimately yielding the lowest radionuclide content among comparable treatments. Additionally, citric acid is evaluated as a weak acid leaching agent specifically for the recovery of rare earth elements from phosphogypsum.

The practical outcome of this citric acid pre-treatment is a significant enhancement in the material's utility. By purifying the phosphogypsum and removing harmful contaminants and radionuclides, the treated material demonstrates improved performance when utilized in cemented paste backfill applications.</data>
  <data key="d9">chemical transformation,chemical treatment,extraction research,impurity removal,leaching,leaching agent,leaching reagent,lowest concentration,pre-treatment method,purification treatment,reduction,soaking,treatment,treats</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-001fe856b0d193d82422dc8a5baedc86-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-001fe856b0d193d82422dc8a5baedc86-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-26bca3d4f742299ce2dbcd6381558f89-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-032&lt;SEP&gt;doc-28fbd4302bba090e667215c840757ff7-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-28fbd4302bba090e667215c840757ff7-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-28fbd4302bba090e667215c840757ff7-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-28fbd4302bba090e667215c840757ff7-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-28fbd4302bba090e667215c840757ff7-chunk-009</data>
  <data key="d11">unknown_source</data>
