<edge source="Phosphogypsum" target="Wet Process">
  <data key="d7">13.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Phosphogypsum, Wet Process is a relation that defines how phosphogypsum is generated as a major byproduct during the wet process treatment of phosphate rock. This industrial procedure is primarily utilized for the production of phosphoric acid and phosphate fertilizers. Throughout the chemical reactions involved in the wet process, acids are generated that directly influence the impurity profile of the resulting phosphogypsum. Consequently, phosphogypsum emerges as a significant solid, chemical, and industrial byproduct that is produced alongside phosphoric acid.

The specific variant or type of wet process employed plays a critical role in determining the major elemental composition of the phosphogypsum produced. Overall, the wet process serves as the definitive industrial pathway responsible for the creation of phosphogypsum, linking phosphate rock processing directly to fertilizer and acid manufacturing while dictating the material's chemical characteristics and impurity levels.&lt;SEP&gt;The wet process generates phosphogypsum as a solid byproduct.&lt;SEP&gt;The Wet Process generates phosphogypsum as a chemical by-product during phosphoric acid production.&lt;SEP&gt;The type of wet process employed affects the chemical composition of phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;The Wet Process generates phosphogypsum as a major byproduct during phosphoric acid production.</data>
  <data key="d9">acid formation,by-product generation,byproduct,byproduct generation,chemical process,compositional influence,industrial byproduct,industrial output,industrial process,manufacturing,manufacturing method,manufacturing output,production,production method</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-26bca3d4f742299ce2dbcd6381558f89-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-401b567da916dc34559e0bfe5a5b367b-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-70650e5cb032fce744763706d8701e36-chunk-026&lt;SEP&gt;doc-70650e5cb032fce744763706d8701e36-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6f5dcf59bedaa00614f1acc222b1fb7b-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2760dc2a11fedad02d24741a978cf20d-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-edfc4dcbd74cbf0b294f83f2034b209d-chunk-001</data>
