<edge source="Phosphogypsum" target="X-ray Diffraction">
  <data key="d7">19.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The relation between Phosphogypsum and X-ray Diffraction centers on the analytical application of X-ray diffraction techniques to characterize the material, structural, and mineralogical properties of phosphogypsum. Primarily employed in research and industrial contexts, this method is utilized to determine the crystalline structure, phase content, and overall structural attributes of the material. Powder X-ray diffraction is specifically applied to identify mineral species and crystalline phases within both raw and treated phosphogypsum samples. Additionally, the technique assesses the purity of phosphogypsum, offering critical insights into its chemical and physical composition.

Beyond standard solid samples, X-ray diffraction has been extended to analyze evaporated phosphogypsum leachate residues, demonstrating its versatility in handling liquid-derived materials. The method is also applied to characterize complex mixtures, such as those containing phosphogypsum combined with gypsum and brushite. To achieve a comprehensive and in-depth characterization of phosphogypsum mineralogy, X-ray diffraction is frequently integrated with complementary analytical techniques. Together, these applications underscore the essential role of X-ray diffraction in evaluating the structural, crystalline, and compositional attributes of phosphogypsum and its associated derivatives.&lt;SEP&gt;X-ray diffraction is utilized to analyze the crystal structure and identify the pure gypsum phase in phosphogypsum waste.&lt;SEP&gt;Phosphogypsum samples were characterized for mineralogical composition using X-ray Diffraction.&lt;SEP&gt;X-ray diffraction analysis is utilized to determine the primary mineralogical composition of phosphogypsum.</data>
  <data key="d9">analysis,analysis technique,analytical application,analytical characterization,analytical method,analytical target,analytical technique,analyzed by,analyzed using,analyzes,characterization,composition exploration,crystalline analysis,material study,methodology,mineral composition analysis,mineral identification,mineralogical analysis,mineralogical characterization,mineralogical examination,mineralogy study,phase identification,structural analysis,structural determination</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-26bca3d4f742299ce2dbcd6381558f89-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-34a3ac199714be8fd1cdff8ead90fc92-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8a6c42f76034cfa4338bd156b7179fc5-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8a6c42f76034cfa4338bd156b7179fc5-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8c22d31cfad5421c936a23705a3bc6e0-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8c22d31cfad5421c936a23705a3bc6e0-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6f5dcf59bedaa00614f1acc222b1fb7b-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6f5dcf59bedaa00614f1acc222b1fb7b-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-023&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a52951853fd542b78835b677936c557b-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-28fbd4302bba090e667215c840757ff7-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-28fbd4302bba090e667215c840757ff7-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-35aef6efc801611130c5dd196fe513df-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-66f6434914b6de99019386e4bdcbc57e-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-66f6434914b6de99019386e4bdcbc57e-chunk-002</data>
