<edge source="Phosphogypsum" target="Cement Industry">
  <data key="d7">3.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The cement industry utilizes phosphogypsum as a raw material for production.&lt;SEP&gt;The cement industry utilizes phosphogypsum as a replacement for natural gypsum in setting regulator applications.&lt;SEP&gt;The cement industry uses phosphogypsum to reduce clinkerization temperature and adjust cement retarders.</data>
  <data key="d9">industrial application,process optimization,raw material substitution,utilization</data>
