<edge source="Phosphogypsum" target="Phosphate Ore">
  <data key="d7">6.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Phosphogypsum is generated as a waste byproduct during phosphate ore processing.&lt;SEP&gt;Phosphate ore is the raw material that determines the color and chemical composition of Phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;The chemical characteristics of phosphogypsum depend on the nature of the phosphate ore.&lt;SEP&gt;Phosphate ore serves as the raw material source, with its compositional variations transferring into phosphogypsum during processing.&lt;SEP&gt;The nature of phosphate ore directly influences the chemical composition of phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Phosphogypsum is derived from the treatment of phosphate ore.</data>
