<edge source="Phosphogypsum" target="Density">
  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Phosphogypsum incorporation reduces the density of construction materials.&lt;SEP&gt;Density is a key physical parameter measured to characterize phosphogypsum for industrial applications.</data>
