<edge source="Phosphogypsum" target="Groundwater">
  <data key="d7">7.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Groundwater dynamically interacts with dumped phosphogypsum, facilitating the redistribution of PTEs.&lt;SEP&gt;Phosphogypsum pollutants leach into and damage groundwater quality.&lt;SEP&gt;Phosphogypsum stacks and stockpiles cause significant degradation and contaminant plumes in groundwater.&lt;SEP&gt;Phosphogypsum stacks pose a potential risk of contaminating underlying groundwater.&lt;SEP&gt;Hazardous spills and leaching from phosphogypsum stockpiles frequently pollute groundwater systems.&lt;SEP&gt;Pollutants carried by phosphogypsum may enter groundwater through leaching.&lt;SEP&gt;Impurities from phosphogypsum can seep into groundwater, causing environmental pollution.</data>
  <data key="d9">contamination,contamination risk,damage,environmental impact,interaction,leaching,pollution,pollution pathway</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-34a3ac199714be8fd1cdff8ead90fc92-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-024&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-033&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-023&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ac8d630b9aa4d874707445e2552a09-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d11">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d12">1791775051</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
