<edge source="Phosphogypsum" target="Life Cycle Assessment">
  <data key="d7">11.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Life Cycle Assessment, Phosphogypsum denotes the systematic application of life cycle assessment methodologies to analyze the environmental, economic, and social dimensions of phosphogypsum. This analytical framework is primarily employed to evaluate the environmental footprint, inventory, and overall sustainability of various phosphogypsum processes, including its treatment, utilization, valorization, and transformation. By quantifying resource consumption and emissions across these stages, the assessment provides a comprehensive baseline for understanding the material's ecological burden.

In addition to technical and environmental metrics, the approach extends to assessing the broader challenges and management strategies associated with phosphogypsum. It is routinely used to calculate environmental footprints, compare alternative waste management methods, and guide sustainable decision-making for industrial applications. Through this integrated evaluation, Life Cycle Assessment, Phosphogypsum serves as a vital tool for optimizing resource recovery, mitigating environmental risks, and balancing ecological, economic, and social considerations in the handling of this industrial byproduct.</data>
  <data key="d9">analysis,application,comparative study,environmental analysis,environmental assessment,environmental evaluation,environmental footprint,environmental impact,evaluation,evaluation framework,evaluation methodology,subject,sustainability,sustainability assessment,techno-economic analysis,waste management</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-276f29345df37143fc224a22d0f6089b-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0060991ac74a9675ce0293eccdc023cd-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0060991ac74a9675ce0293eccdc023cd-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0060991ac74a9675ce0293eccdc023cd-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0060991ac74a9675ce0293eccdc023cd-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0060991ac74a9675ce0293eccdc023cd-chunk-016</data>
  <data key="d11">unknown_source</data>
