<edge source="Phosphogypsum" target="Hemihydrate Gypsum">
  <data key="d7">7.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Phosphogypsum is processed through efficient precipitation to regenerate hemihydrate gypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Hemihydrate gypsum is synthesized through the recycling and purification of phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Phosphogypsum is recycled to produce hemihydrate gypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Phosphogypsum is processed to produce hemihydrate gypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Pretreated phosphogypsum serves as the raw material for manufacturing hemihydrate gypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Phosphogypsum is processed into hemihydrate gypsum, requiring strict impurity and content control.&lt;SEP&gt;Hemihydrate gypsum is a crystalline form related to phosphogypsum processing and dehydration methods.</data>
