<edge source="Phosphogypsum" target="Circular Economy">
  <data key="d7">10.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The Circular Economy and Phosphogypsum relation centers on the application of circular economy principles to the sustainable management, recycling, and valorization of phosphogypsum. Rather than treating phosphogypsum as mere industrial waste, this framework repositions it as a valuable resource that can be continuously reused and transformed. Circular economy guidelines actively drive the sustainable utilization and recycling of phosphogypsum, directly supporting broader sustainable development objectives. By prioritizing the conversion of this byproduct into functional materials, the approach significantly reduces industrial waste accumulation and promotes effective, long-term waste management strategies.

Across the phosphogypsum recycling industry, these circular economy principles serve as the foundational blueprint for operational and strategic planning. The industry explicitly aims to achieve circular economy targets by implementing sustainable waste management practices that maximize resource recovery. Furthermore, these principles provide comprehensive guidance for managing and recycling phosphogypsum stored at facilities worldwide, ensuring consistent environmental and economic standards across global storage sites. Ultimately, integrating circular economy frameworks into phosphogypsum handling represents a critical pathway for closing industrial material loops, minimizing ecological footprints, and advancing sustainable resource cycles.&lt;SEP&gt;Potential phosphogypsum applications are investigated within the context of the circular economy.&lt;SEP&gt;Circular economy principles require phosphogypsum to be reprocessed or valorized to decrease environmental footprint.</data>
  <data key="d9">application context,framework,resource management,resource recovery,resource valorization,sustainability,sustainability framework,sustainability support,sustainable development,sustainable framework,sustainable management,utilization framework,waste management,waste reduction</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-021&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-026&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-035&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c2674917fb6c60e75303effeaa10768e-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c2674917fb6c60e75303effeaa10768e-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ac8d630b9aa4d874707445e2552a09-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0060991ac74a9675ce0293eccdc023cd-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-66f6434914b6de99019386e4bdcbc57e-chunk-001</data>
