<edge source="Phosphogypsum" target="Ecological Restoration">
  <data key="d7">4.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Ecological restoration methods are explored to mitigate environmental damage from phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Phosphogypsum is utilized to fill quarries for ecological restoration purposes.&lt;SEP&gt;Ecological restoration is a comprehensive method used to address phosphogypsum generation and reduce existing stockpiles.&lt;SEP&gt;Ecological restoration accounts for 14.4% of phosphogypsum utilization.</data>
