<edge source="Phosphogypsum" target="Yangtze River Basin">
  <data key="d7">4.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Phosphogypsum is widely distributed across the Yangtze River Basin due to local phosphate rock resources.&lt;SEP&gt;The Yangtze River Basin is a highly concentrated region for phosphogypsum generation in China.&lt;SEP&gt;Phosphogypsum production is primarily concentrated in the Yangtze River Basin.&lt;SEP&gt;Phosphogypsum byproducts are primarily distributed across the Yangtze River Basin in China.</data>
  <data key="d9">geographic concentration,geographic distribution,production concentration,resource correlation</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-34a3ac199714be8fd1cdff8ead90fc92-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-afe70f2d82515df80906bf3babd4e4eb-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-afe70f2d82515df80906bf3babd4e4eb-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-afe70f2d82515df80906bf3babd4e4eb-chunk-000</data>
