  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Phosphogypsum" target="Guizhou Province">
  <data key="d7">10.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Guizhou Province and phosphogypsum are closely linked, as the province stands as a major producer and primary mining area for phosphogypsum within China. It serves as a key regional focus for tracking production and utilization metrics, and is a designated location where phosphogypsum samples are collected and radioactivity levels are systematically evaluated. The phosphogypsum generated in this region is characterized by consistently low silicon dioxide concentrations.

Despite facing limited local market capacity, Guizhou Province achieves high comprehensive utilization rates for phosphogypsum, largely driven by government encouragement policies and enterprise demonstrations. Due to geographical constraints, the material is primarily utilized for mine backfilling and ecological restoration, with phosphogypsum filling technology being widely adopted across the province.</data>
  <data key="d9">chemical composition,data tracking,geographic adoption,geographic source,location,mine backfilling,policy support,production concentration,production location,radioactivity evaluation,regional focus,regional performance,regional production,resource concentration,sample source,utilization focus,utilization rate</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-34a3ac199714be8fd1cdff8ead90fc92-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-34a3ac199714be8fd1cdff8ead90fc92-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a5d09b48f57a4e888bb729aaf988c936-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ac8d630b9aa4d874707445e2552a09-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-afe70f2d82515df80906bf3babd4e4eb-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-afe70f2d82515df80906bf3babd4e4eb-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-afe70f2d82515df80906bf3babd4e4eb-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-afe70f2d82515df80906bf3babd4e4eb-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-afe70f2d82515df80906bf3babd4e4eb-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-afe70f2d82515df80906bf3babd4e4eb-chunk-011</data>
