  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Sichuan Province has significantly improved its phosphogypsum utilization rate following the introduction of comprehensive utilization policies.</data>
  <data key="d9">policy implementation,utilization rate</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-34a3ac199714be8fd1cdff8ead90fc92-chunk-002</data>
