<edge source="Phosphogypsum" target="Barium">
  <data key="d7">7.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Phosphogypsum contains barium as a chemical constituent.&lt;SEP&gt;Barium is a measured chemical constituent in Phosphogypsum samples.&lt;SEP&gt;Barium is present within phosphogypsum byproducts.&lt;SEP&gt;Barium distribution was analyzed as part of the heterogeneous composition of phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Barium is a trace element found within phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Barium concentration showed a slight decrease in leached samples and is categorized as having low mobility.&lt;SEP&gt;Barium is present in phosphogypsum with significant concentration but poor solubility.</data>
  <data key="d9">chemical composition,chemical presence,composition,concentration,concentration analysis,constituent,contains,distribution,mobility classification,presence,trace elements</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-043&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-045&lt;SEP&gt;doc-70650e5cb032fce744763706d8701e36-chunk-023&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-051&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-021&lt;SEP&gt;doc-66f6434914b6de99019386e4bdcbc57e-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-66f6434914b6de99019386e4bdcbc57e-chunk-014</data>
  <data key="d11">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d12">1792041760</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Phosphogypsum" target="Strontium">
  <data key="d7">11.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The relation between phosphogypsum and strontium characterizes strontium as a chemical constituent, trace element, and metallic impurity found within phosphogypsum byproducts. This strontium originates from the phosphate rocks utilized in phosphogypsum production and is present at a relative proportion of approximately 0.49 wt%. 

Due to the heterogeneous composition of phosphogypsum, the spatial distribution and concentration of strontium are routinely analyzed as part of comprehensive trace element assessments. Additionally, the environmental mobility of strontium within phosphogypsum is actively studied, with particular focus placed on its leaching characteristics under conditions that simulate acid rain exposure.&lt;SEP&gt;Strontium is retained in the phosphogypsum matrix and requires strong chemical dissolution for release.&lt;SEP&gt;Strontium is categorized as having intermediate mobility within the phosphogypsum matrix.&lt;SEP&gt;Strontium is present in phosphogypsum with significant concentration but poor solubility.</data>
  <data key="d9">chemical component,chemical composition,chemical dissolution,chemical presence,composition,concentration,contains,distribution,leaching,measured concentration,mobility classification,presence,retention,trace element,trace element analysis,trace elements</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-043&lt;SEP&gt;doc-70650e5cb032fce744763706d8701e36-chunk-023&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-026&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-051&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-021&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d18c456289f64c1e16c73a0dfd6595b3-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-28fbd4302bba090e667215c840757ff7-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-66f6434914b6de99019386e4bdcbc57e-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-66f6434914b6de99019386e4bdcbc57e-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-66f6434914b6de99019386e4bdcbc57e-chunk-013</data>
