<edge source="Phosphogypsum" target="Soil Amendment">
  <data key="d7">16.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The (Phosphogypsum, Soil Amendment) relationship describes the direct application of phosphogypsum waste to agricultural land to enhance soil quality and manage industrial byproducts. As a soil amendment, phosphogypsum is utilized to correct calcium deficiencies, mitigate soil acidity and salinity, and improve overall physio-chemical properties and nutrient levels. In many agricultural contexts, it serves as a functional replacement for conventional gypsum. By addressing these chemical imbalances, the material acts as an effective agronomic tool for revitalizing farmland and optimizing crop cultivation conditions.

Beyond its direct agronomic benefits, this application functions as a prominent alternative waste management strategy for phosphogypsum. Investigations into phosphogypsum handling have identified soil amendment as one of four primary alternative management methods, consistently ranking it as the top approach for waste disposal. This preference is largely driven by its ability to provide a practical and sustainable solution while maintaining a significantly lower environmental footprint compared to other techniques. Ultimately, the (Phosphogypsum, Soil Amendment) practice effectively bridges agricultural improvement with industrial waste reduction, establishing it as a key and prioritized strategy in modern land management.</data>
  <data key="d9">agricultural application,alternative management,alternative method,application,application method,application practice,environmental benefit,environmental performance,environmental ranking,investigation,management,material substitution,material usage,ranking,soil improvement,soil treatment,utilization,utilization route,waste management,waste utilization</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-028&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a5d09b48f57a4e888bb729aaf988c936-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a5d09b48f57a4e888bb729aaf988c936-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a5d09b48f57a4e888bb729aaf988c936-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0060991ac74a9675ce0293eccdc023cd-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0060991ac74a9675ce0293eccdc023cd-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0060991ac74a9675ce0293eccdc023cd-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0060991ac74a9675ce0293eccdc023cd-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0060991ac74a9675ce0293eccdc023cd-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0060991ac74a9675ce0293eccdc023cd-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0060991ac74a9675ce0293eccdc023cd-chunk-000</data>
