</edge>
<edge source="Phosphogypsum" target="Setting Time">
  <data key="d7">3.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Phosphogypsum prolongs the initial and final setting time of cement proportionally to its content.&lt;SEP&gt;Increasing phosphogypsum content proportionally extends the setting time of cement.&lt;SEP&gt;Phosphogypsum is compared against natural gypsum to evaluate differences in initial and final setting times.</data>
  <data key="d9">comparative analysis,material evaluation,material interaction,prolongation,property alteration,retardation</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-020&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ac8d630b9aa4d874707445e2552a09-chunk-020</data>
