  <data key="d8">Ettringite is detected in cement paste matrices as a result of hydration chain reactions involving Phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Ettringite is a mineral phase identified within the phosphogypsum sample.&lt;SEP&gt;Phosphogypsum reacts to temporarily form ettringite during the hydration regulation process.&lt;SEP&gt;At low phosphorus levels, ettringite surrounds phosphogypsum particles in the hardened material.</data>
