<edge source="Phosphogypsum" target="India">
  <data key="d7">4.0</data>
  <data key="d8">India manufactures gypsum board, blocks, bricks, and cement using phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;India accounts for 6.35% of the global distribution of phosphogypsum production or reserves.&lt;SEP&gt;India utilizes phosphogypsum for producing cement, bricks, and fertilizer.&lt;SEP&gt;India is listed as the origin for phosphogypsum samples.</data>
  <data key="d9">construction application,global distribution,industrial production,origin,production share,sample source,utilization</data>
