  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Adding Phosphogypsum to concrete batches increases gypsum content, which converts to higher anhydrite levels in autoclaved aerated concrete.&lt;SEP&gt;Untreated phosphogypsum is utilized as a primary raw material for preparing autoclaved aerated concrete.</data>
