<edge source="Phosphogypsum" target="Environmental Impact">
  <data key="d7">6.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The environmental impact of Phosphogypsum accumulation drives the development of recycling strategies and new material applications.&lt;SEP&gt;Widespread phosphogypsum utilization can lessen the construction industry's harmful environmental impact.&lt;SEP&gt;The management and stocking of phosphogypsum significantly influence environmental impact.&lt;SEP&gt;Phosphogypsum stockpiles cause significant environmental impacts, including pollution and ecosystem damage.&lt;SEP&gt;Environmental impact is a primary concern driving research into the disposal, management, and sustainable utilization of phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;The comprehensive utilization of phosphogypsum aims to mitigate its negative environmental impact.</data>
  <data key="d9">causes,ecological consequence,ecological effect,ecology,management consequence,management focus,mitigation,pollution,recycling driver,sustainability,waste management</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-025&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-026&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c8cdabf609cc047d173d4ff8dbb5187-chunk-037&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ac8d630b9aa4d874707445e2552a09-chunk-017</data>
  <data key="d11">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d12">1791775069</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Phosphogypsum" target="Washing">
  <data key="d7">5.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Washing is one of several methods available to purify Phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Washing is a pre-treatment method applied to phosphogypsum to eliminate water-soluble substances and improve functional features.&lt;SEP&gt;Phosphogypsum undergoes washing as the first step in the extraction workflow.&lt;SEP&gt;Washing is a laboratory-scale purification method applied to phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Washing is a laboratory-scale purification technology for phosphogypsum that has been scaled for industrial applications.</data>
  <data key="d9">industrial application,process sequence,purification,purification method,purification technology,treated by</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-e1871f90fba8192d1aa537b2a9f4555c-chunk-025&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-030&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-057&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a5d09b48f57a4e888bb729aaf988c936-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a5d09b48f57a4e888bb729aaf988c936-chunk-008</data>
