<edge source="Phosphogypsum" target="Road Construction">
  <data key="d7">13.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The (Phosphogypsum, Road Construction) relation details the utilization of phosphogypsum waste as a construction material within road infrastructure development. Specifically, treated phosphogypsum that is free of hazardous impurities serves as a raw material and direct substitute for conventional clay in pavement projects. It is employed across various structural components, functioning as a supplement to traditional clay mixtures, replacing clay in secondary road base layers, and acting as a subbase material.

From a waste management perspective, road construction is recognized as a prominent alternative method for phosphogypsum disposal and reuse. In comparative studies evaluating four distinct management strategies, this application is consistently ranked as the second most preferred or second-ranked option. It is widely regarded as a promising approach capable of absorbing large quantities of phosphogypsum waste. Economically, the integration of phosphogypsum into road construction demonstrates favorable financial metrics, notably delivering a positive Net Present Value and a reduced Payback Period, thereby reinforcing its viability as both an environmental management solution and a cost-effective construction practice.</data>
  <data key="d9">alternative management,alternative method,application,economic benefit,environmental performance,industrial application,infrastructure application,investigation,large-scale management,management,material replacement,material substitution,material usage,ranking,usage,utilization,waste management,waste utilization</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-030&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0060991ac74a9675ce0293eccdc023cd-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0060991ac74a9675ce0293eccdc023cd-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0060991ac74a9675ce0293eccdc023cd-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0060991ac74a9675ce0293eccdc023cd-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0060991ac74a9675ce0293eccdc023cd-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0060991ac74a9675ce0293eccdc023cd-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0060991ac74a9675ce0293eccdc023cd-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0060991ac74a9675ce0293eccdc023cd-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d11">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d12">1791881083</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
