<edge source="Phosphogypsum" target="Impurities">
  <data key="d7">5.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Phosphogypsum contains lower levels of impurities, including silicon, aluminum, sodium, iron, magnesium, strontium, potassium, and fluorine.&lt;SEP&gt;Phosphogypsum contains impurities that decompose during thermal treatment, causing secondary mass loss.&lt;SEP&gt;Phosphogypsum contains impurities that require removal during processing.&lt;SEP&gt;Impurities are leached from phosphogypsum alongside rare earth elements.&lt;SEP&gt;Phosphogypsum contains impurities that are removed during the cleaning process.</data>
