<edge source="Phosphogypsum" target="Thermogravimetric Analysis">
  <data key="d7">10.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The relation (Phosphogypsum, Thermogravimetric Analysis) describes the application of thermogravimetric analysis to investigate the thermal properties and decomposition behavior of phosphogypsum. This analytical technique is primarily employed to monitor and quantify mass changes, weight loss, and mass percentage as the material undergoes heating or thermal treatment. Specifically, the method is utilized to identify and measure distinct mass loss stages, including dehydration processes, that occur during the thermal decomposition of phosphogypsum.

Beyond general thermal behavior characterization, thermogravimetric analysis is also applied to examine specific chemical interactions under controlled conditions, such as the reaction between phosphogypsum and carbon within an inert atmosphere. Overall, this technique serves as a critical tool for tracking compositional changes, evaluating thermal stability, and mapping the decomposition pathways of phosphogypsum throughout its heating process.</data>
  <data key="d9">analytical method,analyzed using,application,characterization,experimental method,mass loss,mass loss measurement,mass measurement,mass tracking,material analysis,measurement,reacts with,substrate,thermal analysis,thermal characterization,thermal study</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-8c22d31cfad5421c936a23705a3bc6e0-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8c22d31cfad5421c936a23705a3bc6e0-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8c22d31cfad5421c936a23705a3bc6e0-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8c22d31cfad5421c936a23705a3bc6e0-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8c22d31cfad5421c936a23705a3bc6e0-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8c22d31cfad5421c936a23705a3bc6e0-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb86340ba0851c06e97600104fca25c9-chunk-023&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b19ca721a4da4422ee10228d88a4c292-chunk-020&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b19ca721a4da4422ee10228d88a4c292-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b19ca721a4da4422ee10228d88a4c292-chunk-021</data>
  <data key="d11">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d12">1792099485</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Phosphogypsum" target="Infrared Spectroscopy">
