  <data key="d8">Infrared spectroscopy was applied to characterize water molecules and sulphate groupings in phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Infrared spectroscopy records the infrared spectra of phosphogypsum to interpret its chemical changes.&lt;SEP&gt;Infrared spectroscopy was used to record the spectra of phosphogypsum before and after thermal treatment.&lt;SEP&gt;Infrared spectroscopy characterizes the water of crystallization and sulphate groupings in phosphogypsum.</data>
