<edge source="Gypsum" target="Calcium Sulfate Dihydrate">
  <data key="d7">13.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Calcium sulfate dihydrate, commonly referred to as gypsum, is a chemical compound formally classified under this mineral name. The two terms are chemically consistent and interchangeable, with gypsum serving as the widely recognized common name for the compound. In its high-purity form, gypsum consists of more than 95 weight percent calcium sulfate dihydrate. This substance is frequently encountered as the primary crystalline component of phosphogypsum and may also be identified as gypsum or a related precipitate depending on the specific chemical context.

Beyond its general chemical identity, calcium sulfate dihydrate represents a specific crystalline form of gypsum that has been the subject of targeted research, particularly regarding its solubility characteristics in nitric acid. The relationship between the two terms is strictly definitional, as calcium sulfate dihydrate is the precise chemical designation for the mineral gypsum, encompassing its various natural and industrial occurrences.&lt;SEP&gt;Gypsum is chemically composed of Calcium Sulfate Dihydrate.&lt;SEP&gt;Calcium sulfate dihydrate is the chemical name for the mineral gypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Calcium Sulfate Dihydrate is commonly known as Gypsum or Phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Gypsum is chemically identified as calcium sulfate dihydrate.&lt;SEP&gt;Calcium sulfate dihydrate is commonly known as gypsum.</data>
  <data key="d9">alias,chemical classification,chemical composition,chemical formula,chemical identity,chemical synonym,chemical synonymy,common name,composition,crystalline form,identification,material identity,mineral composition,mineralogy,synonym</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-401b567da916dc34559e0bfe5a5b367b-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-401b567da916dc34559e0bfe5a5b367b-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-401b567da916dc34559e0bfe5a5b367b-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b8bd3776c87a0bcab21842e8e2bb2e06-chunk-022&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a4d02158bbc770d7c6bd9657b3f3defc-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f1fb5c243f2539cf7be6b6021b63c36f-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8c22d31cfad5421c936a23705a3bc6e0-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6f5dcf59bedaa00614f1acc222b1fb7b-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2196dee89de9694f28ef4eaa0e85f130-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0060991ac74a9675ce0293eccdc023cd-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3fd8439e859e3dd0c96328384e1761f0-chunk-024&lt;SEP&gt;doc-54b92b2ad16a2528ff6a863329c5d403-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b19ca721a4da4422ee10228d88a4c292-chunk-024</data>
  <data key="d11">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d12">1792099325</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
