  <data key="d8">Sulfuric acid is coproduced alongside cement during phosphogypsum utilization.&lt;SEP&gt;Sulfuric acid is coproduced alongside cement during phosphogypsum utilization.&lt;SEP&gt;Sulfuric acid is coproduced alongside cement during phosphogypsum utilization.&lt;SEP&gt;Thermally treated phosphogypsum is recommended as a raw material for manufacturing sulfuric acid.</data>
