<edge source="Rare Earth Elements" target="Cycle Leaching">
  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Cycle leaching is systematically investigated to enhance the release and concentration of soluble rare earth elements.&lt;SEP&gt;Cycle leaching is a targeted method designed to extract rare earth elements from the phosphogypsum matrix.</data>
