<edge source="Rare Earth Elements" target="Gravity Separation">
  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Gravity separation is suggested to recover undissolved rare earth element inclusions from phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Gravity separation isolates rare earth element mineral inclusions from the gypsum matrix based on physical property differences.</data>
