<edge source="Rare Earth Elements" target="Fluorapatite">
  <data key="d7">3.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Fluorapatite is the primary mineral source from which all rare earth elements in the system originate.&lt;SEP&gt;Fluorapatite serves as the primary source containing 100% of the target Rare Earth Elements.&lt;SEP&gt;Fluorapatite contains up to 1% rare earth elements by mass.</data>
  <data key="d9">composition,elemental content,mineral composition,mineral origin,source</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-401b567da916dc34559e0bfe5a5b367b-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-401b567da916dc34559e0bfe5a5b367b-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-008</data>
