<edge source="Fly Ash" target="Lime">
  <data key="d7">7.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Fly ash and lime are used together as additives to stabilize phosphogypsum for road applications.&lt;SEP&gt;Fly ash and lime are used together as additives to stabilize phosphogypsum for road applications.&lt;SEP&gt;Fly ash and lime are used together as additives to stabilize phosphogypsum for road applications.&lt;SEP&gt;Fly ash and lime are combined with phosphogypsum to create mixtures suitable for backfilling and embankments.&lt;SEP&gt;Fly ash is stabilized with lime to enhance mixture properties before phosphogypsum modification.&lt;SEP&gt;Fly ash and lime are combined as additives to stabilize phosphogypsum and enhance the strength of construction materials.&lt;SEP&gt;Lime and fly ash react with silica and alumina pozzolans to form strong cementitious bonds.</data>
