<edge source="Phosphoric Acid" target="Wet Process">
  <data key="d7">12.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The Wet Process (Phosphoric Acid) is the prevailing industrial and commercial method utilized for the production of phosphoric acid. This established technique primarily functions by converting phosphate rock into phosphoric acid, serving as the standard approach in modern chemical manufacturing.

The process is specifically engineered to manufacture phosphoric acid as its main desired product, culminating in the generation of crude phosphoric acid. As the dominant industrial method currently in use, the Wet Process remains the primary commercial pathway for producing this essential chemical compound.&lt;SEP&gt;The wet process is the chemical method used to manufacture phosphoric acid.&lt;SEP&gt;The Wet Process produces phosphoric acid through a reaction between phosphate rock and sulfuric acid.&lt;SEP&gt;Phosphoric acid is produced through the wet process utilizing phosphate rock.&lt;SEP&gt;The Wet Process is the primary method used to produce phosphoric acid from apatite ore.</data>
  <data key="d9">chemical method,chemical output,chemical reaction,industrial process,industrial production,manufacturing,methodology,output,primary output,produces,product,product generation,production,production method,technology</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-26bca3d4f742299ce2dbcd6381558f89-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-027&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1adcb38defdd04a271ddba318999ba67-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-70650e5cb032fce744763706d8701e36-chunk-026&lt;SEP&gt;doc-70650e5cb032fce744763706d8701e36-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-058&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c4b1b446b8362051476593a7c1a0d7c-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6f5dcf59bedaa00614f1acc222b1fb7b-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2760dc2a11fedad02d24741a978cf20d-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a5d09b48f57a4e888bb729aaf988c936-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-edfc4dcbd74cbf0b294f83f2034b209d-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d11">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d12">1791814886</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
