  <data key="d8">Mussel shells are biogenic waste products utilized as a source for hydroxyapatite extraction.&lt;SEP&gt;Mussel shells function as a biogenic waste product utilized for hydroxyapatite extraction.&lt;SEP&gt;Hydroxyapatite can be successfully extracted from mussel shells as a natural bioresource.</data>
