<edge source="Hydroxyapatite" target="Environmental Remediation">
  <data key="d7">6.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Hydroxyapatite proves beneficial in environmental remediation for removing contaminants from gas, liquid, and solid phases.&lt;SEP&gt;Hydroxyapatite is applied in Environmental Remediation technologies to remove pollutants via adsorption.&lt;SEP&gt;Hydroxyapatite is applied in environmental remediation to reduce pollution, though its efficiency depends on sorption capacity.&lt;SEP&gt;Hydroxyapatite is applied in environmental remediation to treat contaminated wastewater and soil.&lt;SEP&gt;Hydroxyapatite is utilized as a photocatalyst in environmental remediation procedures to degrade pollutants.&lt;SEP&gt;Hydroxyapatite is a highly promising material for environmental remediation applications.</data>
  <data key="d9">application,application domain,contaminant removal,ecological application,multifunctional use,photocatalyst use,pollutant removal,waste treatment</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-0a5563c80c4fd1f68b4442f73621a281-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0a5563c80c4fd1f68b4442f73621a281-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0a5563c80c4fd1f68b4442f73621a281-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0a5563c80c4fd1f68b4442f73621a281-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0a5563c80c4fd1f68b4442f73621a281-chunk-023&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0a5563c80c4fd1f68b4442f73621a281-chunk-016</data>
