<edge source="Hydroxyapatite" target="Ion-Exchange">
  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Hydroxyapatite possesses ion-exchange capability, enabling it to remove hazardous ionic impurities and recover metals.&lt;SEP&gt;Hydroxyapatite primarily removes cations like cadmium and zinc through an ion-exchange mechanism.</data>
