<edge source="Hydroxyapatite" target="Heavy Metals">
  <data key="d7">4.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Hydroxyapatite is used to immobilize heavy metals in wastewater and soil environments.&lt;SEP&gt;Hydroxyapatite immobilizes heavy metals through efficient sorption processes.&lt;SEP&gt;Hydroxyapatite is utilized as an adsorbent to remove heavy metals from aqueous solutions.&lt;SEP&gt;Hydroxyapatite-based adsorbents are designed to sequester heavy metals from the environment.</data>
  <data key="d9">adsorption,immobilization,pollutant immobilization,remediation target,removal,sequestration,sorption</data>
