<edge source="Hydroxyapatite" target="Heterogeneous Catalysis">
  <data key="d7">5.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Hydroxyapatite has been previously studied in heterogeneous catalysis, though this review focuses on environmental applications.&lt;SEP&gt;Hydroxyapatite is utilized in Heterogeneous Catalysis where its acid-base properties drive reaction performance.&lt;SEP&gt;Heterogeneous Catalysis relies on hydroxyapatite's acid-base properties to drive reaction activity and selectivity.&lt;SEP&gt;Hydroxyapatite nanocomposites are applied in heterogeneous catalysis for degrading antibiotics.&lt;SEP&gt;Hydroxyapatite is extensively studied and applied as a catalyst or catalyst support in heterogeneous catalysis.</data>
  <data key="d9">application,application domain,application field,catalytic performance,functional use,photocatalysis,prior research,related field</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-0a5563c80c4fd1f68b4442f73621a281-chunk-027&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0a5563c80c4fd1f68b4442f73621a281-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0a5563c80c4fd1f68b4442f73621a281-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0a5563c80c4fd1f68b4442f73621a281-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-06f299b7e723cda1f0de1a647b02b6b4-chunk-018</data>
