<edge source="Hydroxyapatite" target="Zinc">
  <data key="d7">5.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Hydroxyapatite effectively removes zinc ions from contaminated solutions.&lt;SEP&gt;Hydroxyapatite removes zinc ions primarily through an ion exchange mechanism.&lt;SEP&gt;Hydroxyapatite immobilizes zinc from solution, with removal efficiency decreasing at low pH levels.&lt;SEP&gt;Doping hydroxyapatite with zinc produces absorption features in the UV-vis region similar to pure titanium dioxide.&lt;SEP&gt;Zinc is used to dope hydroxyapatite nanoparticles to enable controlled protein release.</data>
  <data key="d9">UV-vis absorption,doping,heavy metal,immobilization,ion exchange,material modification,removal,removal target,sorption</data>
