<edge source="Hydroxyapatite" target="Heat Treatment">
  <data key="d7">4.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Heat Treatment modifies hydroxyapatite to enhance its protein sorption capabilities.&lt;SEP&gt;Heat treatment is applied to hydroxyapatite powders to increase crystallinity and reduce surface area.&lt;SEP&gt;Heat treatment is evaluated for its effect on HA crystal morphology, size, and other properties.&lt;SEP&gt;Heat treatment at 900°C reduces the surface area and increases the crystallite size and crystallinity degree of hydroxyapatite powders.</data>
