<edge source="Hydroxyapatite" target="Hydrothermal Method">
  <data key="d7">11.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The Hydrothermal Method, Hydroxyapatite relation describes a synthesis process where the hydrothermal technique is employed to produce hydroxyapatite. This method serves as both a primary procedure and an alternative route, depending on the specific material requirements and target form. By operating under carefully regulated conditions, it enables precise control over the structural properties, morphology, and crystal growth of the resulting material. The process is particularly effective for generating hydroxyapatite powders and nanocrystalline hydroxyapatite that exhibit high crystallinity and strict stoichiometry.

Furthermore, the technique facilitates the fabrication of hydroxyapatite solid solutions by ensuring a uniform and controlled distribution of metal ions within the crystal lattice. Its adaptability extends to various precursor materials, notably allowing for the preparation of nanocrystalline hydroxyapatite from phosphogypsum. Through these capabilities, the hydrothermal synthesis pathway provides a highly controlled and efficient means of tailoring the physicochemical characteristics of hydroxyapatite for specialized applications.&lt;SEP&gt;Hydroxyapatite nanoparticles are synthesized using a low-temperature hydrothermal method.&lt;SEP&gt;The hydrothermal method is used to synthesize hydroxyapatite with controlled morphology.&lt;SEP&gt;The hydrothermal method is used to synthesize hydroxyapatite nanocrystals and modify their morphology.</data>
  <data key="d9">alternative route,application,methodology,morphology control,nanostructure formation,production,synthesis,synthesis method,synthesis technique</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-0a5563c80c4fd1f68b4442f73621a281-chunk-039&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8a6c42f76034cfa4338bd156b7179fc5-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8a6c42f76034cfa4338bd156b7179fc5-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c4a64a852097fdc910b98ed788503ce4-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c4a64a852097fdc910b98ed788503ce4-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6f5dcf59bedaa00614f1acc222b1fb7b-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6f5dcf59bedaa00614f1acc222b1fb7b-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-06f299b7e723cda1f0de1a647b02b6b4-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2196dee89de9694f28ef4eaa0e85f130-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4739e42903c95e1fb7e0ecfbca3a12df-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a52951853fd542b78835b677936c557b-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d11">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d12">1791836159</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
