<edge source="Hydroxyapatite" target="CTAB">
  <data key="d7">7.0</data>
  <data key="d8">CTAB acts as a surfactant to regulate the formation of hydroxyapatite crystals.&lt;SEP&gt;CTAB controls the crystallization process of HAp by forming a tetrahedral cation that complements phosphate anion structure.&lt;SEP&gt;CTAB acts as a template to regulate the synthesis of Hydroxyapatite.&lt;SEP&gt;CTAB acts as a template to regulate the nucleation and crystal growth of hydroxyapatite.&lt;SEP&gt;CTAB adsorbs onto the surface of hydroxyapatite to modify crystal growth and orientation.&lt;SEP&gt;CTAB is employed as a surfactant during synthesis but is subsequently washed away, leaving no detectable impurities in the final Hydroxyapatite.&lt;SEP&gt;CTAB is used as a surfactant to modify hydroxyapatite samples.</data>
  <data key="d9">adsorption,crystallization control,growth regulation,impurity removal,regulation,sample preparation,surface modification,surfactant,surfactant modification,synthesis additive,templating</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-f2534f7a997df3f80305323317b15be9-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f2534f7a997df3f80305323317b15be9-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2196dee89de9694f28ef4eaa0e85f130-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2196dee89de9694f28ef4eaa0e85f130-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3fd8439e859e3dd0c96328384e1761f0-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3fd8439e859e3dd0c96328384e1761f0-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3fd8439e859e3dd0c96328384e1761f0-chunk-011</data>
  <data key="d11">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d12">1791967784</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Hydroxyapatite" target="Hydrothermal Process">
  <data key="d7">5.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The hydrothermal process provides the high temperature and pressure environment required to synthesize HAp particles.&lt;SEP&gt;The Hydrothermal Process is used to synthesize Hydroxyapatite, with temperature variations directly influencing its morphology and particle size.&lt;SEP&gt;Hydrothermal Process is a method used to synthesize hydroxyapatite by controlling reaction parameters.&lt;SEP&gt;Hydroxyapatite was successfully synthesized using the hydrothermal process.&lt;SEP&gt;The hydrothermal process is frequently used to prepare nanocrystalline Hydroxyapatite with controlled size and morphology.</data>
  <data key="d9">application,controlled morphology,experimental condition,synthesis,synthesis method,synthesis technique,temperature dependence</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-f2534f7a997df3f80305323317b15be9-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a4d02158bbc770d7c6bd9657b3f3defc-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a4d02158bbc770d7c6bd9657b3f3defc-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a52951853fd542b78835b677936c557b-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3fd8439e859e3dd0c96328384e1761f0-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d11">unknown_source</data>
