<edge source="Fluoride" target="Soil">
  <data key="d7">3.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Soil accumulates fluorides from atmospheric deposition and industrial activities, leading to high surface concentrations.&lt;SEP&gt;Fluoride accumulates in soil and undergoes leaching migration, with stronger leaching enhancing mobility.&lt;SEP&gt;Fluorides accumulate in and migrate through soil, increasing exposure risk.</data>
