<edge source="Cadmium Ion" target="Hydroxo Complex">
  <data key="d7">6.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The Cadmium Ion prematurely binds to form the Hydroxo Complex in the soil solution.&lt;SEP&gt;Cadmium ions associate to form hydroxo complexes, influencing their activity in soil solution.&lt;SEP&gt;Cadmium ions associate with hydroxo complexes, which drive biogeochemical passivation and reduce cadmium activity.&lt;SEP&gt;The Cadmium Ion prematurely binds to form the Hydroxo Complex in the soil solution.&lt;SEP&gt;Cadmium ions associate to form hydroxo complexes, influencing their activity in soil solution.&lt;SEP&gt;Cadmium ions associate with hydroxo complexes, which drive biogeochemical passivation and reduce cadmium activity.</data>
