  <data key="d8">Uranium-238 is the parent nuclide of Lead-210, with an activity ratio less than unity in the waste samples.&lt;SEP&gt;Uranium-238 acts as the parent isotope to Lead-210 in the radioactive decay chain.&lt;SEP&gt;Lead-210 is a long-lived radioactive decay product of the uranium-238 decay chain.</data>
