  <data key="d8">Positively charged HAp particles attract negatively charged BSA, enhancing adsorption and avoiding burst release.&lt;SEP&gt;BSA adsorbs onto the positively charged C sites of HAp due to electrostatic attraction.&lt;SEP&gt;BSA molecules are adsorbed onto the surface and pores of HAp.</data>
  <data key="d9">adsorption,electrostatic attraction,electrostatic interaction,loading</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-f1fb5c243f2539cf7be6b6021b63c36f-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f1fb5c243f2539cf7be6b6021b63c36f-chunk-007</data>
