<edge source="Grashof Number" target="Fluid Dynamics">
  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The Grashof Number is a fundamental dimensionless parameter used within the field of fluid dynamics.&lt;SEP&gt;Fluid dynamics utilizes the Grashof Number to analyze flow characteristics.</data>
  <data key="d9">application,dimensionless parameter,domain,scientific field</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-98d8b2df45924e721bfa570f652f33e3-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-98d8b2df45924e721bfa570f652f33e3-chunk-007</data>
