  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Grashof Number" target="Natural Convection">
  <data key="d7">3.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The Grashof number is used alongside the Prandtl number to calculate the Rayleigh number for convection analysis.&lt;SEP&gt;The Grashof Number determines the onset and characteristics of natural convection.&lt;SEP&gt;The Grashof Number characterizes natural convection in phosphogypsum processing.</data>
  <data key="d9">application,calculation parameter,characterization,dimensionless number,flow prediction,physical phenomenon</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-98d8b2df45924e721bfa570f652f33e3-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-98d8b2df45924e721bfa570f652f33e3-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-98d8b2df45924e721bfa570f652f33e3-chunk-001</data>
